window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS=(window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1901,"title":"Chapter 1901 Triggered Memories","paragraphs":["'Huang Xiao Li? What is she doing here? No... more importantly, why is her family alive?!' Yuan stared at Huang Xiao Li as she chatted with her family, a bright smile on her face.","\"Xiao Yang? What's the matter? Why did you suddenly stop moving? Do you see a bandit again?\" Elder Sun asked when she noticed his weird behavior.","\"Please give me a moment.\"","Without elaborating further, Yuan left Elder Sun's side and approached Huang Xiao Li and her family.","Huang Xiao Li and her family stopped when he suddenly stood in their path.","\"How can we help you?\" Huang Xiao Li's father, Huang Chen, stepped forward and asked.","Yuan swallowed nervously and spoke, \"You don't recognize me?\"","He turned to look at Huang Xiao Li, who also wore a puzzled expression on her face, almost as if this was their first time meeting each other.","'Did Tian Yang never meet them in this world?' Yuan pondered this possibility.","'Maybe they don't recognize me because of my short hair...'","Yuan looked behind him to see Elder Sun staring at him.","'What will happen if I reveal myself as Tian Yang here?'","Suddenly, Huang Xiao Li's body trembled, and her expression changed.","\"T-Tian Yang?\" she muttered in a low voice.","Yuan's eyes widened as he snapped to look at Huang Xiao Li, who appeared to be confused by something.","Huang Xiao Li held her head, wincing as if experiencing a headache. She staggered slightly, struggling to steady herself.","\"Xiao Li?! What's wrong?!\" Her family's voices rose in alarm, their expressions tightening with concern.","Huang Xiao Li didn't answer. A moment later, she slowly turned to face them, her eyes wide with horror.","\"W-What? Father? Mother? Brother...?\" Her voice trembled. \"W-Why are you here? I thought you were dead... These memories—what is happening to me?!\"","A sharp pain seized her, and she collapsed to her knees, a piercing scream escaping her lips.","At the same moment, her family members also stiffened, their eyes clouding over. At first, they merely looked dazed, but within seconds, confusion twisted their faces, mirroring her torment.","\"What's going on?! I swear we were trying to escape that sea demon when it—!\" Huang Chen exclaimed.","\"What the hell is going on...?\" Yuan could only stand there and watch with a dumbfounded look on his face.","Suddenly, the ground trembled, a faint vibration that quickly intensified into a violent quake. The very air seemed to shudder as deep fissures split across the earth. Above, the sky itself began to crack, jagged lines spreading like shattered glass, as if the fabric of reality was beginning to unravel.","\"What is happening?!\" Elder Sun rushed to his side and asked while the other onlookers went into a frenzy.","\"I don't—\"","In the midst of Yuan's speech, his words faltered as an unsettling silence fell over the world. The once-present sounds vanished in an instant, leaving only an eerie stillness. Even more unnerving, everyone around him stood frozen in place—motionless, as if time itself had come to a standstill.","\"This is...\" Yuan recognized this phenomenon, as he'd experienced something similar three years ago.","Sure enough, a moment later, the Sect Leader of the Immortal Monastery appeared before him like a ghost with a deep frown on his face.","\"It's you again! What the hell did you do to mess with my world like this?!\" The Sect Leader questioned him in anger.","After snapping out of his daze, Yuan said, \"I don't know. They started freaking out when they saw me, and then the world started shaking.\"","The Sect Leader turned to look at Huang Xiao Li and her family before approaching them. He placed a finger on their forehead and began reading their memories.","\"I see what happened here,\" he mumbled a moment later.","\"What happened?\" Yuan asked.","The Sect Leader pointed at him and angrily responded, \"Your face—that's what happened!\"","\"My face? What are you talking about?\" Yuan pretended to be ignorant.","The Sect Leader scratched his head in annoyance and said, \"There's too much to explain. I don't feel like telling you.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and said, \"Then answer this question. Is this world just an illusion of the past, or is this a real world?\"","The Sect Leader also narrowed his eyes and responded, \"That question will cost you a million points.\"","\"Put it on my tab,\" Yuan answered without delay.","The Sect Leader looked around them and, after a moment of silence, spoke, \"This is a real world. The people here are also real.\"","\"I know I brought this up myself, but how is that even possible?\"","\"This is all I am willing to answer for now. If you want to know more, ask me again once you become a Core Disciple and earn more points.\"","\"I will rewind this world's time by one minute... to before you met them. This time, stay away from them—unless you wish to bring ruin upon this world and everyone within it.\"","With those ominous words, the Sect Leader raised his hands, tracing intricate gestures in the air. A strange force rippled through reality, and, just as he had declared, the world responded.","The flow of time reversed. People who had been frozen in place now moved once more, but instead of moving forward, they were going backward, as if the world itself was being rewritten.","\"I will not warn you again. If you trigger their memories again, I won't hesitate to toss you out of this world myself,\" said the Sect Leader before unpausing the time and disappearing at the same time.","\"Xiao Yang? What's the matter? Why did you suddenly stop moving? Do you see a bandit again?\" Elder Sun repeated what she said a minute ago.","Yuan didn't respond and stood there in silence to digest what had just happened. A few moments later, he spoke in a low voice, \"Sorry, it's nothing... I thought I saw someone I knew.\"","\"Is that so? Then let's get going.\"","Yuan nodded and followed her outside the city, passing Huang Xiao Li and her family without even glancing at them, treating them as if they were strangers."]},{"number":1902,"title":"Chapter 1902 A Real World","paragraphs":["'Shit... what the hell is happening? This world is actually real, and so are the people in it? If triggering Huang Xiao Li's memories of Tian Yang caused that world-ending phenomenon, why are Elder Sun and the other disciples fine?' Yuan pondered as he rode on the flying treasure with Elder Sun.","Although the Sect Leader didn't go into details, he'd actually revealed a lot through his speech, most of them being subtle hints.","'At first, neither Huang Xiao Li nor her family recognized me, and it didn't seem like they were pretending, either. However, shortly after seeing me, they regained their memories of me. From this, I can assume that the people of this world don't know Tian Yang until they meet him, which triggers memories of him.'","'This begs the question... why is this happening? Why did they not have memories of Tian Yang until they saw me? Are their memories of Tian Yang being suppressed? For what reason?'","\"You know...\" Elder Sun suddenly started speaking, snapping Yuan out of his thoughts, \"I noticed who you were staring at, and I recognized that young lady. She's from our sect, isn't she? Did something happen between you and her? A lover's quarrel, perhaps?\" Yuan wasn't too surprised that Elder Sun recognized Huang Xiao Li. After all, Huang Xiao Li was a talented disciple from a wealthy family, and Elder Sun recognized most disciples in the sect by spending most of her time in the Hunting Grounds, where most disciples go to train.","\"Really? She's a disciple of our sect? I really didn't know. I looked at her because I thought she was pretty,\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"She's not bad, but I'm prettier,\" Elder Sun suddenly said, boasting about her own appearance.","Her conceited response left Yuan speechless for a moment.","\"I never thought you to be that kind of individual, Elder Sun, but are you, by any chance, jealous that your own disciple is looking at another woman?\" Yuan joked.","Elder Sun quickly sneered, \"Who'd be jealous of you? You can look at all the women you want.\"","They arrived at the Northern Stronghold shortly after, where they continued their search for Tian Yang. Despite being very confident that Tian Yang didn't exist in this world, Yuan decided to keep silent and follow Elder Sun around.","After searching through the entire Northern Stronghold without finding Tian Yang, they moved on to the Eastern Stronghold. \"Looks like only the Central Stronghold is left,\" Elder Sun sighed as they left the Eastern Stronghold empty-handed.","\"What if Tian Yang isn't actually in the Desolate Continent?\" Yuan suddenly brought this time.","\"Then we've wasted our time here, and we'll immediately return to the sect,\" Elder Sun calmly said.","\"Isn't it a waste to come all the way out here without achieving anything? I don't want this trip to be a waste of time,\" Yuan said.","\"Then what do you have in mind?\" Elder Sun asked.","Yuan smiled and said, \"How about I train here a little?\"","Elder Sun frowned and replied, \"Training? At your level? You're just a Spirit Grandmaster. Meanwhile, the weakest magical beast in the Desolate Continent is at the level of Spirit Lord.\"","\"It's only just one realm of difference. I can handle it. Moreover, you're here with me, Elder Sun. I'm sure my life won't be in danger with you here.\"","\"Are you even hearing yourself? Just one realm of difference? If anyone else were here to hear that, they'd be incredibly offended by that statement.\" Elder Sun shook her head at Yuan.","She continued before Yuan could respond, \"But you're right. Since I am here, you won't be in danger. Alright, I'll let you experience the difference between a Spirit Grandmaster and a Spirit Lord since that will be the quickest way to make you give up.\"","\"Thank you, Elder Sun.\"","A few days later, Elder Sun left the Central Stronghold with a disappointed look on her face.","\"I guess Tian Yang isn't in the Desolate Continent. While there's a chance he might be here, outside the strongholds, it'd be like trying to find a needle in a haystack. We don't have the time for that.\"","Elder Sun then brought Yuan back to the Southern Stronghold, where the magical beasts are between the level of Spirit Lord and Spirit King.","After looking around, Elder Sun found a first-level Spirit Lord magical beast and allowed Yuan to fight it.","'He'll probably give up after he realizes the difference between Spirit Grandmaster and Spirit Lord,' Elder Sun thought to herself as she watched Yuan approach the magical beast.","While Elder Sun was confident in Yuan's talents, she didn't believe Yuan could fight magical beasts an entire realm above his cultivation.","\"No matter how talented he is, there's—\"","Before Elder Sun could even finish her sentence, Yuan had defeated the magical beast in a single strike.","Elder Sun's eyes widened with shock, and her jaw dropped to the ground.","'Heavens! He killed a Spirit Lord magical beast just like that?! He even went for its weak spot! How did he even know its weak spot? Has he fought that type of magical beast before?' After killing the magical beast, Yuan tossed its corpse inside his spatial ring. \"Let's immediately go to the next one, Elder Sun,\" Yuan returned to her side, acting like he'd only accomplished something ordinary.","'I spent 10 million points to come here. I am not going back until I completely fill my spatial rings with points!' Yuan thought to himself.","\"O-Okay...\" Elder Sun nodded in a dazed manner.","Over the next several days, Yuan constantly hunted magical beasts between the first and fourth levels of Spirit Lord.","\"Are you satisfied yet?\" Elder Sun asked him.","\"Of course not. We're just getting started. I want to be able to hunt Spirit Kings by the end of the month,\" he declared.","\"Wha—?! Spirit King?! That's impossible!\"","In response, Yuan retrieved a monster core he'd collected during the hunt and swallowed it right in front of Elder Sun's face, bewildering her greatly.","\"What the fuck are you doing, you crazy bastard!\" she cried out loud."]},{"number":1903,"title":"Chapter 1903 Black Sky","paragraphs":["\"What the fuck are you doing, you crazy bastard!\" When Yuan tossed the monster core into his mouth, Elder Sun reacted instinctively. In a flash, her hand shot out, seizing him by the throat with a firm grip. With her other hand, she forced her fingers into his mouth, desperately trying to retrieve the monster core before it could be swallowed.","\"?!\"","Yuan was taken aback when Elder Sun suddenly shoved her fingers into his mouth, but it was already too late—the monster core had long since melted and been absorbed. All she managed to do was wiggle her slender fingers around awkwardly, accomplishing nothing but an increasingly uncomfortable situation for both of them.","\"Damn it! Where's the monster core?! Don't tell me you swallowed it already! Hurry up and spit it back out before you die a violent death!\" Elder Sun eventually released Yuan, her fingers soaked in his saliva afterward.","\"Please calm down, Elder Sun. I'll be fine,\" Yuan said after taking a deep breath.","\"Fine?! You just swallowed a monster core directly! Nobody can be fine after that!\"","Yuan calmly smiled and said, \"I have a unique physique that allows me to consume monster cores safely. Take a look at my cultivation again.\"","When Elder Sun looked at Yuan's cultivation, she was shocked to find that it'd risen by a level.","\"What in heaven's name...?\" Elder Sun swallowed nervously, having trouble believing her eyes.","Then she recalled his heaven-defying cultivation speed.","\"Is this how you've managed to increase your cultivation so quickly? It finally makes sense!\" \"Here, let me do it again in case you're still having doubts,\" Yuan spoke as he tossed another monster core into his mouth.","Elder Sun's heart jumped, despite knowing that he would be fine.","\"Okay, I get it. Stop doing it in front of me. It's bad for the heart,\" she sighed.","After consuming all of the monster cores he'd collected, Yuan entered the peak of Spirit Grandmaster.","\"Still don't think I'll be able to hunt Spirit Kings by the end of the month?\" Yuan asked her with a cheeky smile.","\"...\"","Elder Sun was speechless.","Yuan continued hunting magical beasts shortly after.","A few more days later, Yuan reached the 2nd level of Spirit Lord.","\"Even though your cultivation is increasing rapidly, it's not good to increase your cultivation too much in a short time, especially when you've not grasped the essence of that level. It will affect your foundation and future advancements. There's a reason why people don't consume too many treasures at once even when they can,\" Elder Sun lectured him.","\"Don't worry, I'll be fine. I know my limit.\"","Despite saying that, Yuan wondered if his cultivation would still be limited to Spirit King until he upgraded it.","'Since the physique is already limited, there's a good chance I won't even make it to Spirit King. If that's the case, I probably won't be able to upgrade it even if I know the method...' Yuan thought inwardly.","Time continued to pass.","In the blink of an eye, it was already the end of the month, and just as Yuan had declared, he'd started hunting magical beasts at the level of Spirit King.","Once he began hunting Spirit King magical beasts, his cultivation started to increase faster, and just a week later, he'd reached the peak of Spirit Lord.","'I'm just a step away from Spirit King. Let's see if I'll be able to enter Spirit King with this weakened physique...' Yuan wondered as he consumed the monster core in his grasp.","A moment later, his cultivation entered the first level of Spirit King without any issue.","\"You really managed to go from Spirit Grandmaster to Spirit King in just a month... Is there even a limit to your physique?\" Elder Sun suddenly asked.","\"Yes, there are limits to my physique. For example, I can't consume anything that's far beyond my level. I probably won't be able to break through Spirit King until I evolve my physique, either.\"","Elder Sun looked at him with raised eyebrows.","\"How can you tell? You speak as if you've reached the peak of Spirit King before.\"","\"Just a feeling, I guess.\"","Yuan responded as he looked at the sky.","\"Any particular reason as to why you're looking at the sky? You've been doing it constantly recently,\" Elder Sun asked in a puzzled tone.","\"No, but I have a bad feeling something is going to happen soon...\" \"What are you? A prophesier?\"","Just as Elder Sun finished her sentence, a massive black wall burst forth from the very edge of the continent, rising like a massive tide. It expanded rapidly, stretching across the horizon until it completely engulfed the Desolate Continent, sealing it within an ominous shroud.","\"Wh-What the hell?!\" Elder Sun looked at the darkened sky with a bewildered look on her face.","'So it's finally here... the Immortal Ensnaring Vault...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","\"That's... the Immortal Ensnaring Vault!\"","To Yuan's surprise, Elder Sun recognized the barrier that sealed the entire continent.","\"Are the Nine Immortal Clans on the Desolate Continent? But why is it being deployed here?\" she muttered.","\"Immortal Ensnaring Vault? What's that? You know about that black veil covering the sky?\" Yuan asked her.","She nodded. \"It's a treasure owned by the Immortal Spring Clan. Once activated, it will trap everything inside, even Immortals.\" \"So we're trapped? For how long?\"","\"Who knows? It can be kept activated for as long as the Immortal Spring Clan can keep supplying it with spiritual energy, but it won't be cheap. If they poured all of their resources into it, they can probably keep it active for several years.\"","\"What?! So we can be trapped in here for several years?!\" Yuan exclaimed, acting like he didn't know it'd be deactivated in half a year.","\"Not at all. I'm just saying it's possible. Whatever their reason for activating it is, I doubt the Nine Immortal Clans will need too long to accomplish their goal. Also, I have a way to leave, so you don't have to worry about being trapped for too long,\" Elder Sun spoke with confidence, leaving Yuan speechless.","'She knows too much about the Nine Immortal Clans to not be affiliated with them... Just what is her background?' Yuan wondered."]},{"number":1904,"title":"Chapter 1904 Leaving the Desolate Continent","paragraphs":["\"How long do you plan on training here?\" Elder Sun asked Yuan when he continued shortly after the Immortal Ensnaring Vault was activated.","\"Since we can't leave, I will train until the Immortal Ensnaring Vault is deactivated. I'm sure the Sect Leader won't punish us for returning late, as we have no control over our situation.\"","Elder Sun nodded and said, \"Alright, but if the Immortal Ensnaring Vault isn't gone by the end of the year, I'll take us out of here, even if it might inconvenience the Nine Immortal Clans.\"","Thus, Yuan continued his training in the Desolate Continent.","A few weeks later, Elder Sun suddenly asked him, \"I've been wondering, but why are you storing all of the magical beasts?\"","\"To sell them.\"","\"For money? Are you in need of money?\" Elder Sun asked, misunderstanding his intentions.","\"It's not money, but it's something like that.\"","\"I don't understand.\" Elder Sun shook her head, but she didn't try to question any further.","Time passed quickly, and in the blink of an eye, three months had gone by since the Immortal Ensnaring Vault's activation.","Yuan had reached the peak of Spirit King, and he was only one monster core away from the next realm.","Once he acquired the monster core, Yuan wasted no time consuming it. Although he didn't expect any results, he still wanted to confirm it.","However, to his surprise, the limit that had prevented him from breaking through the peak of Spirit King before evolving his physique was not present, and he'd entered the first level of Spirt Emperor without any issues.","'What the hell? I don't need to evolve my physique to increase my cultivation?' Yuan was quite surprised by the results.","However, if he thought about it, while it may seem like a good thing that he didn't need to evolve his physique, it was actually a bad thing. After all, if the physique was weaker than the original, then there was a good chance it didn't have the capability to evolve at all.","\"Heavens... you're already a Spirit Emperor? It's only been three months since you reached Spirit Lord! At this rate, you'll return to the sect as a Spirit Sovereign! Only Core Disciples who have been at the sect for over a hundred years have reached that level!\"","\"I guess I'll take the Core Disciple examination as soon as I return—Oh, right. I still need contribution points. What's the fastest way to earn a thousand contribution points?\" Yuan asked her.","\"The fastest way? Ask the Sect Leader for the points,\" she jokingly said.","However, this gave Yuan an idea.","'What if I can purchase contribution points with points?'","\"What's a realistic option?\" Yuan asked, just in case he couldn't purchase them.","\"There is none. Assist sect elders and participate in as many events as you can.\"","\"I see.\"","Time continued to pass, and before Yuan realized it, it'd been half a year since the Immortal Ensnaring Vault had trapped them inside the Desolate Continent. Yet, the Immortal Ensnaring Vault remained active.","'What is going on? Why is the Immortal Ensnaring Vault still active? It should've been deactivated by now...' Yuan thought to himself as he looked at the black barrier in the sky.","He gave it a few more weeks just in case he remembered wrong.","\"It's still active...\" he mumbled.","This was the second time the timeline had strayed from the one he knew.","He couldn't fathom why the Immortal Ensnaring Vault was still active. 'Could this be a different timeline? If that were the case, why do the people here have memories of my timeline's Tian Yang?'","Suddenly, Yuan noticed a drastic change in Elder Sun's expression, looking like she'd just eaten a fly.","\"Elder Sun? What happened?\" Yuan asked her.","She sighed.","\"Nothing. I just had an argument with Tian Yang.\"","\"What?\" Yuan's eyes widened at her puzzling response.","'She just had an argument with me? How's that possible?'","Elder Sun had been by his side this entire time, and there was no way he would've missed her interacting with Tian Yang, even if he was focused on training.","\"What did Tian Yang say?\" Yuan decided to dig deeper.","\"I'd secretly placed a life-saving treasure on him without telling him. He didn't give too much information, but someone he was close to died, and it seems like he's blaming me for it.\"","\"...\"","Yuan was speechless. That conversation sounded like what had occurred right outside Han Zexian's Tomb, but they'd never gotten close to that place.","'Wait... What if her memories are progressing as if she's in the original timeline, but in reality, she's living a different timeline, and I am the cause of this phenomenon because I made her remember Tian Yang, who doesn't exist in this world?'","After pondering a little longer, Yuan found it to make more and more sense.","'This won't trigger the destruction of this world, right?' Yuan swallowed nervously as he recalled what happened when Huang Xiao Li recalled memories of the original timeline.","The Immortal Ensnaring Vault lasted for another two months before finally being deactivated.","\"Looks like the Nine Immortal Clans are finally done. Are you ready to return to the sect?\" Elder Sun asked Yuan, who'd just finished slaying a magical beast.","\"Yes, I am ready.\"","Yuan thought about visiting Han Zexian's Tomb but decided against it in the end since it wouldn't really benefit him, who could purchase treasures at the point store.","Sometime later, Yuan and Elder Sun left the Desolate Continent on the flying treasure.","Once they returned to the Immortal Monastery, Elder Sun dropped Yuan off at his living quarters while she went to speak with the Sect Leader.","\"Get some rest. You've trained for over half a year with barely any rest. Come see me next week,\" she said to him before leaving.","However, Yuan didn't bother going home and went straight to the point store to sell his loot.","\"Can I sell materials obtained outside the sect for points?\" Yuan asked the clerk.","\"Of course.\"","Yuan sighed in relief after hearing this and immediately placed all of the spatial rings he'd filled with magical beasts on the desk.","\"I'd like to sell all of the materials here.\"","\"I understand. Give me a few minutes to calculate everything.\""]},{"number":1905,"title":"Chapter 1905 The Sect Leader’s Hatred","paragraphs":["Sometime later, the clerk returned with the spatial rings and said, \"I can give you 72,283,000 points for all of the materials here.\"","Yuan smiled and nodded, \"Sold.\"","The results were much better than he'd anticipated, but considering that he'd also hunted Spirit Enlightenment magical beasts, he wasn't too surprised.","After selling all of the material he'd collected from 8 months of grinding, Yuan could easily repay his debt. However, he didn't immediately visit the Sect Leader and asked the clerk, \"Can I purchase contribution points for the sect?\"","The clerk nodded and calmly responded, \"Yes, you can purchase one contribution point for 1,000 points.\"","\"Then I will purchase 1,000 contribution points.\"","\"The transaction has been completed. You now have 1,000 contribution points. Is there anything else you would like to purchase?\"","\"I would like to purchase an audience with the Sect Leader.\"","\"That will cost 1,000,000 points.\"","\"Done.\"","\"Give me a moment to contact the Sect Leader.\"","A few moments later, the clerk said, \"You may visit the Sect Leader tomorrow.\"","Yuan left the point store afterward and returned to his living quarters to rest.","The following day, Yuan went to the Sect Leader's headquarters for their meeting.","\"You have returned. Do you wish to repay your debt now?\" The Sect Leader asked.","Yuan nodded, \"11,000,000 points, right? Take it.\"","\"I have deducted 11,000,000 points. Now, what do you want to talk about?\"","\"I have a lot of questions.\"","\"I know, but I'll only answer them if you become a Core Disciple.\"","\"Why do I need to be a Core Disciple for answers?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows.","\"I don't like you. Is that a good enough of reason? Also, that question isn't free, so I will deduct 100,000 points from you.\"","Yuan's eyebrows twitched, but he remained composed and asked, \"Is it because I look like Tian Yang? What is your relationship with him? According to Elder Sun, he's just a disciple of this sect. You're the Sect Leader. Why do you hate a disciple?\"","The Sect Leader didn't immediately respond and silently glared at Yuan with narrowed eyes.","Eventually, he spoke, \"Since you bear his unpleasant face, I guess I can entertain you. I have also been wanting to talk about this with someone, anyway.\"","He continued, \"In the original world, Tian Yang was only a disciple at the Immortal Monastery for a short time and never advanced past Inner Court disciple because he never returned to the sect after leaving for training.\"","\"He was an insignificant existence at first, but after a series of events that occurred over many years, he caused the destruction of the Immortal Monastery.\"","Yuan's eyes widened after hearing this, and he quickly responded, \"What? The Immortal Monastery was destroyed? How is that possible? It was still standing before my master—Sect Leader Ji Ran—entered the Shadow Realm.\"","The Sect Leader explained, \"Although the Immortal Monastery wasn't completely destroyed, pretty much 90 percent of the sect was destroyed, and it required hundreds of years of effort before it recovered.\"","\"However, that's not all. Not only was the sect almost destroyed because of him, I also nearly lost my life. Fortunately, I didn't die—but I'd lost almost all of my cultivation, which required me to restart from scratch.\"","Yuan swallowed nervously after hearing this information. He didn't know why the Sect Leader hated Tian Yang, but if his claims were true, it justified his hatred.","The Sect Leader continued, \"Tian Yang—that bastard is a calamity who brings misfortune to everyone around him. Hell, he even caused the downfall of many powerful families, including the Nine Immortal Clans, who were the most powerful and influential families during this era.\"","After hearing this, Yuan asked, \"Is that why Tian Yang doesn't exist in this world? Because you didn't want him to ruin this world again?\"","\"No, there's another reason for that, but I can't tell you.\"","\"You'll tell me if I become a Core Disciple?\"","\"Even if you become the next Sect Leader, I won't be able to tell you—unless you want your soul to perish.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes after hearing this.","'If I don't want my soul to perish? This sounds like...' Yuan had an idea why the Sect Leader didn't want to tell him, but he decided not to say anything for now.","\"Alright, I'll return again once I become a Core Disciple.\"","\"Whatever. Your ten minutes is nearly up, anyway.\"","Yuan returned home shortly after to ponder about his conversation with the Sect Leader.","'If the Sect Leader couldn't tell me about something because it could destroy my soul, there's a high chance it's related to the Outer Gods... Perhaps they had something to do with the creation of this world. After all, not even a Cultivation God could create a world like this...'","While Cultivation Gods had the capability to create their own world, re-creating the Divine Heavens and its peoples with their memories from the Primordial Era was an entirely different story.","'If anyone had the capability to create such a world, they'd have to be beyond even Cultivation Gods. In other words, the Outer Gods...' Yuan thought to himself. 'If the Sect Leader is connected to them, I need to be careful around him.'","This was another reason why Yuan didn't want to carelessly mention the Outer Gods.","After spending an entire day pondering his next steps, Yuan left home to visit his group.","'It's almost been a year since I left. I wonder how they're doing.'","When Yuan arrived at Lan Yingying's living quarters, he quickly realized that she no longer lived there.","\"I guess she's managed to become an Inner Court disciple while I was away,\" he mumbled.","He went to check on the others, and sure enough, everyone from his group was no longer inside the Outer Court, suggesting they'd all moved to the Inner Court.","Realizing this, Yuan left the Outer Court and returned to the Inner Court to find Ji Ran."]},{"number":1906,"title":"Chapter 1906 Core Disciple Examination","paragraphs":["Shortly after arriving at Ji Ran's living quarters, Yuan quickly realized that he wasn't home. Instead of blindly wandering around to look for the others, Yuan asked a servant for the location of their living quarters.","However, even after checking all of them, none of them were available.","\"They must be quite busy after becoming Inner Court disciples.\"","After pondering for a moment, Yuan decided to just take the Core Disciple examination and get it out of the way.","Unlike the Inner Court examination, which follows a fixed schedule, the Core Disciple examination can be taken at any time—provided the candidate meets the necessary qualifications.","After arriving at the location where one goes to request for the examination, Yuan approached the sect elder working there and said, \"I would like to take the Core Disciple examination.\"","The sect elder looked at Yuan and said, \"You will need to be at least a Spirit Lord, as well as have a thousand contribution points.\"","Yuan revealed his cultivation to the sect elder, whose eyes widened with surprise, \"First level of Spirit Enlightenment? And you're just attempting the Core Disciple examination?\"","\"Pretty much.\"","\"What's your name?\"","\"Xiao Yang.\"","The sect elder looked through the disciple records, and his surprise became shock when he realized that Yuan had only been in the sect for a few years.","\"Heavens! You've reached Spirit Enlightenment in less than a decade? What monstrous talents! Do you have a master yet?\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"My master is Elder Sun.\"","\"What? The Incompetent Elder? I know she's pretty, but you should really consider switching Masters.\"","Not wanting to drag on the conversation, Yuan nodded, \"I'll consider it. Now, about the Core Disciple examination...\"","The sect elder retrieved a medallion and said, \"Head to the 77th Immortal Peak for the examination. If you do not take the examination within a month of accepting this medallion, it will be an automatic fail, and you will have to wait a decade to try again.\"","Yuan nodded and accepted the medallion before heading to the 77th Immortal Peak.","When he arrived at his destination, Yuan descended before a small hut and knocked on the door.","A middle-aged woman answered the door a moment later, \"Are you here for the Core Disciple examination?\"","Yuan showed her the medallion.","\"Yes.\"","After taking the medallion, she said, \"Follow me.\"","Yuan proceeded to follow the sect elder to a massive arena.","The sect elder entered the arena and spoke, \"The examination will consist of three different tests, but you will only need to pass two of them to become a Core Disciple. For the first one, showcase your understanding of the Peerless Immortal Technique. You'll pass this test if you have reached the third level.\"","Yuan immediately showcased his understanding of the Peerless Immortal Technique. After reaching Spirit Enlightenment, he was able to use it up to the fourth level, but he only showcased the strength of a peak third level.","\"What?! It took me 60 years to reach that level! To think a disciple who'd only been at the sect for a few years has reached the peak of third level!\" The sect elder almost fell on her buttocks after seeing the results.","\"Y-You pass...\" said the sect elder as she entered the arena.","\"You'll spar with me for the second test. I will restrict my cultivation to the third level of Spirit Enlightenment. You will pass if you manage to defeat me.\"","Although the test sounded simple enough, most disciples failed the second test. Not only was the sect elder much more experienced than the disciples in combat, but their cultivation was always two levels higher. Unless one was a cultivation genius, they'd have an incredibly hard time passing the second test. This is also why the examination had three different tests.","\"Allow me to apologize in advance,\" Yuan said as he readied his sword.","\"Why are you apologizing?\" the sect elder asked, her eyebrows raised in a puzzled manner.","\"You will find out in a second. Can I begin?\"","\"Whenever you are ready.\"","The second the sect elder said that, Yuan rushed forward and began his relentless assault.","'W-What is this pressure?! Am I really fighting a disciple?!'","It only took two exchanges before the sect elder realized she was not fighting an ordinary disciple and was forced to go all out.","However, even when going all out, the sect elder was still being pushed back. In the end, after a short ten-minute fight, the sect elder had to forfeit when the cold steel on Yuan's sword touched her neck.","\"I guess I am a Core Disciple now,\" Yuan calmly said as he lowered his sword.","\"Yes... Congratulations. You're probably the fastest disciple to become a Core Disciple in our sect's history,\" said the sect elder.","\"This is all thanks to my Master's teaching,\" Yuan smiled.","\"You can move into the center court as soon as you return, but your new outfits will take a few days to be completed.\"","Yuan nodded and left the 77th Immortal Peak with a new medallion—one that proved he'd become a Core Disciple.","\"I am a Core Disciple now, huh?\" Yuan muttered as he returned home. This was Tian Yang's dream before everything happened in the Desolate Continent.","As Yuan walked back to his living quarters, he noticed a certain beauty approaching him from a distance.","\"Yu—Xiao Yang! You're back!\"","It was Xi Meili.","\"Hey, looks like you've made it to the Inner Court.\"","\"Ji Ran learned that we could purchase contribution points, so we all made the move once we met the cultivation requirement,\" she explained.","\"When did you return?\" she then asked.","\"Yesterday.\"","\"So, how was it? Where did you go? And was it worth it?\"","\"I went to a place called the Desolate Continent. Although it'd cost me ten million points, it was worth it since I managed to acquire over 70 million points—despite my 50 percent deduction penalty.\"","If it weren't for the five-year 50 percent point deduction penalty from the tournament, he would've earned over 140 million points from the trip.","\"70 million points?! That's enough to purchase every treasure in the point store!\" Xi Meili exclaimed with a shocked face.","\"It's definitely more than I need. If you need anything from the store, let me know.\"","\"Not really. Although it'd be nice to have more treasure, I am mostly doing this trial for the experience. And now that you're back, do you know when you'll leave?\"","\"I still have some questions for the Sect Leader. I'll let you know in about a week.\"","\"I understand. I'll let the others know.\"","Yuan nodded and returned home—but not for long. He returned to the point store to purchase another audience with the Sect Leader.","The following day, Yuan went to meet with the Sect Leader.","\"You're back already? What's the rush?\"","Yuan showed the medallion he'd acquired from the Core Disciple examination to the Sect Leader and said, \"Well, I became a Core Disciple, and there's no reason to idle around when I can ask you questions immediately.\"","\"Very well. Ask me.\"","Yuan began asking his questions.","\"You said this world is a real world. Can you elaborate?\"","\"This question will cost you 1,000,000 points—\"","\"Just answer it. I don't care how many points it cost.\"","\"This world may seem like a replica of the Nine Heavens—because it is. A perfect duplicate, to be precise.\"","\"A duplicated world? How does that work? And why?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows."]},{"number":1907,"title":"Chapter 1907 Rashira","paragraphs":["\"It is exactly as it sounds. This duplicated world is an exact replica of the original—from the people to the locations, even down to the timeline. At least, that's how it should have been,\" the Sect Leader said, his voice trailing off as he paused.","\"Tian Yang,\" Yuan spoke. \"As far as I am aware, he doesn't exist in this world. Elder Sun tried looking for him in the Desolate Continent but to no avail. However, for some reason, her memories progress as if he exists.\"","The Sect Leader nodded, \"Indeed. Although Tian Yang couldn't be replicated for some reason, the people who had a connection to Tian Yang in the original world were perfectly duplicated, their memories included. However, that memory would only trigger if they are reminded of Tian Yang.\"","\"Why couldn't Tian Yang be duplicated? He's only a single individual.\"","\"Honestly, I am not the creator of this world. The one who created it said something along the lines of 'only being able to duplicate what's not beyond their powers'. And since I am not the creator, I also cannot tell you 'why' it was created.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and responded after a moment of silence, \"I already knew you weren't the creator when you told me this was a real world. Even a Cultivation God would not be capable of this. I cannot imagine who or what could have such powers.\"","The Sect Leader smiled and said, \"I could tell you, but your soul would be extinguished.\"","\"You told me that before. The only way that could happen is if the information is beyond human comprehension.\"","\"Oh?\" the Sect Leader expressed surprise at Yuan's words. \"You are quite knowledgeable. Did your Master—your real one—tell you that?\"","\"Not quite. I came from a family that is very familiar with this sort of topic. Why don't you try telling me? I bet my soul won't be destroyed.\"","However, the Sect Leader shook his head and said, \"Trust me, it's for your own good.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and spoke, \"Is it an Outer God?\"","\"You—?!\" The Sect Leader stood up from shock, his eyes as wide as saucers. \"You know about the Outer God?!\"","\"My family has studied their existence for generations. So this world was created by an Outer God, huh? I figured.\"","The Sect Leader swallowed nervously. He never thought he would find someone who was also aware of the Outer Gods.","\"How much do you know about the Outer Gods?\" he asked Yuan.","\"Honestly? Not a whole lot.\"","\"Are you willing to exchange information? I have been trying to learn more about them for some time now,\" said the Sect Leader.","Yuan nodded. \"Why don't you start by telling me how your connection to the Outer God started so I can get a better understanding of the situation?\"","\"How it started, huh?\" The Sect Leader gazed out the window, his eyes distant as he spoke. \"It was... incredibly random. In fact, the Outer God was the one who reached out to me first. I remember being on the brink of death, my final breaths slipping away. In those last moments, I found myself longing to relive the early days of the Immortal Monastery. And then—before I even realized what had happened—I was here, in this world, as an overseer of sorts.\"","\"I have acquired the power to control the time of this world, but my powers are limited. For example, I can not speed up time, but I can rewind time for a few minutes at most.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"Have you spoken to the Outer God since coming here? What is their goal?\"","The Sect Leader shook his head and said, \"I've only spoken to them once—when I first arrived in this world. They told me about their identity as an Outer God, as well as their name, and told me to 'watch over' this world. I haven't heard from them since.\"","\"How long have you been here? And what was their name?\"","\"I've only been here for about fifty thousand years. The Outer God called itself Rashira.\"","'Rashira, huh? That's a new name.' Yuan thought to himself.","\"So this whole trial thing was your own doing? Not because you were told by the Outer God?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Yes, this is all of my own accord.\"","\"Why?\"","The Sect Leader sighed, his gaze heavy with contemplation. \"Although the people in this world are undeniably real, it doesn't feel real to me. It's as if I'm merely watching a preordained performance, a grand play orchestrated by the universe itself—or so I once believed. But after the events on the Desolate Continent, I came to a realization... Some things have changed due to Tian Yang's absence. However, the true extent of these changes remains unknown.\"","\"Anyway, my reason for opening up this world is simple... I just want to pass down my inheritance to those living in the original world. Although I am not dead, my soul is now bound to this world, so I won't be able to return to the original world.\"","\"What about the residents of this world? Can they leave?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, their souls are also bound to this world. Only those who are not originally from this world, like you, can leave.\"","\"What happens when we leave? Do we just disappear from this world? And can we return once we leave?\"","The Sect Leader swiftly responded, \"You can return as long as your body in this world doesn't die. Once you leave, your body will temporarily 'disappear' until you return.\"","'So it's similar to Cultivation Online, but we only have one life in this world...' Yuan compared the two worlds. \"Do you plan on leaving soon?\" the Sect Leader suddenly asked.","\"Yes. My progress in the trial won't reset or anything while I am gone, right? Since I have already finished the first two requirements, I only need to master the Peerless Immortal Technique to complete the trial.\"","\"Don't worry, you will continue where you left off. However, since time flows slower in here, it's better to master the technique here. Anyway, tell me what you know about the Outer Gods now. You're not leaving until you do so,\" said the Sect Leader."]},{"number":1908,"title":"Chapter 1908 A Familiar Face","paragraphs":["\"Don't worry, I will tell you everything I know about Outer Gods. It won't be much, so don't have any high expectations,\" Yuan said.","After taking a deep breath, he continued, \"I know of two other Outer Gods, but I only know one of their names. Rashara.\"","Of course, Yuan knew Shura's name, but he decided not to reveal it.","\"Rashara? The name is quite similar to the Outer God I know—Rashira. Do you think they're related?\" The Sect Leader remarked.","Yuan shrugged. \"Who knows? Anyway, while I don't know much—if anything—about Rashara, I do know that they're working with the Celestial Emperor for some reason.\"","\"The Celestial Emperor, huh? Do you know why they exist? Or how powerful they truly are?\"","Yuan shook his head.","\"It's impossible to tell how powerful they truly are, but they're definitely beyond our comprehension. After all, just learning of their existence could shatter one's soul. That said, they're not invincible and can be defeated.\"","The Sect Leader raised his eyebrows and said, \"You sound like you're speaking from experience. Don't tell me you've fought them before?\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Who knows? Maybe I have.\"","\"Jokes aside, do you know how to contact them?\" the Sect Leader asked.","\"I do, but I'm not sure it'll work for your Outer God.\"","\"So you're saying every Outer God has their own unique method of communication, huh? I wonder when I'll hear from mine again.\"","Yuan and the Sect Leader continued their conversation about Outer Gods for the next hour, with most of it being just speculations on their existence.","\"When do you plan on leaving?\" the Sect Leader asked him at the end.","\"I need to talk to Elder Sun first. What will happen to them once I leave? Will they forget about my existence until I return?\" Yuan asked.","\"Something like that.\"","\"Alright. I'll come see you again when I'm ready to leave.\"","Yuan returned to the Inner Court afterward.","\"I plan on leaving next week,\" Yuan revealed his plans to the others, who had been waiting for him to return after Xi Meili contacted them.","He also revealed that they could return to this world in the future if they wanted. However, he didn't mention anything about the Outer Gods, as he wasn't sure they'd be able to handle the information.","\"Ji Ran, have you decided? Like I said, I don't mind if you stay here. Regardless of your decision, I will continue to work on creating your new body in our world.\"","Ji Ran gazed up at the sky and let out a sigh. \"When I was trapped in the Shadow Realm, I spent most of my time reminiscing about my days in the Immortal Monastery. Now that I'm living in it once again, I find myself wanting to stay here more and more.\"","\"Young Master—\"","Yuan suddenly interrupted, \"Before you give me an answer, I want you to reconsider it without thinking about me.\"","\"I know you want to repay me for getting you out of the Shadow Realm, but you don't need to always put me ahead of yourself. You're not my servant. Live the way you want.\"","\"If I don't go back with you, who will help the Lord recover his spiritual energy?\" Ji Ran asked.","\"That will no longer be necessary since I will be reconnecting the Nine Heavens and Earth soon, and there's nothing we can do until then since I cannot log out. Relax, it's not like you're leaving for good—unless you plan on staying in this world forever.\"","\"What? Of course not! Although life here is good, I still plan on rebuilding the Immortal Monastery!\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"In that case, stay here until I finish creating your new body.\"","After a moment of silence, Ji Ran suddenly dropped to his knees and bowed, \"Young Master, I will stay here to brush up my knowledge and memories of the Immortal Monastery so that there will be no mistakes when I rebuild the sect in the future.\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Alright. I'll try my best to finish creating your new body before then.\"","He turned to look at Tan Songyun and asked, \"What about you? Are you also going to stay here?\"","\"No, I have experienced enough. I'll leave with you.\"","\"Alright, let's return here in a week.\"","Sometime later, Yuan stepped into the center court. He had never had the chance to explore this place before, and now, as he wandered, he took in the serene atmosphere. The air was thick with spiritual energy, each breath invigorating and refreshing.","As he strolled through the tranquil surroundings, his gaze drifted toward the distance, where he noticed two beautiful female disciples engaged in conversation. Both wore the distinctive robes of Core Disciples, their presence standing out.","When Yuan noticed the disciples, they also noticed him, as he was still wearing his Inner Court outfit.","\"Hey, Inner Court disciples are not allowed to be here. Are you lost?\" One of them called out Yuan.","\"...\"","Yuan didn't respond, too preoccupied with staring at the disciple's face. It was undeniably beautiful, but that wasn't why he was fixated on it. There was something strangely familiar about her features, a nagging sense of recognition that he couldn't quite place.","\"Hm? You look familiar.\" The female disciple suddenly said out loud what Yuan was thinking, and she began approaching him.","As the female disciple drew closer, Yuan's eyes widened slightly as a sudden realization struck him.","His expression stiffened, and a flicker of surprise flashed through his gaze. In a low voice filled with disbelief, he muttered, \"Meng Lili?\"","\"How do you know my name? Do we know each other?\"","Yuan wanted to speak with her, but then he remembered the incident with Huang Xiao Li.","Without explaining or uttering another word, Yuan turned around and flew away as fast as he could.","'Although she'd matured, that was definitely Meng Lili! But how is she alive?!' Yuan couldn't fathom how Meng Lili was alive, much less a Core Disciple, when she'd died as an Outer Court Disciple in the original timeline."]},{"number":1909,"title":"Chapter 1909 Meng Lili","paragraphs":["\"What the hell? Who was that?\"","The disciple who was with Meng Lili asked shortly after Yuan left.","Meng Lili shook her head and said, \"I don't know, but he looked familiar, and he appeared to know me, too.\"","\"He was probably just another admirer. You're a Core Disciple, so it's not weird.\"","Meng Lili looked in the direction Yuan had left and mumbled, \"An admirer, huh?\"","Meanwhile, after leaving, Yuan returned to his living quarters to ponder about what had just happened.","\"Meng Lili is still alive in this timeline? So you're telling me that Meng Lili survived because Tian Yang doesn't exist in this world—even though she died before Tian Yang left the Bamboo Garden?\"","Yuan was beginning to wonder if Tian Yang was truly a calamity who brought misfortune to others, as Huang Xiao Li and Meng Lili had survived because Tian Yang didn't exist in this world.","In the original timeline, Tian Yang remained unaware of the true culprit behind Meng Lili's death for a long time—only uncovering the truth far later, long after he had already freed Kulas from the Immortal Confinement Dungeon. And it happened only because he'd coincidentally encountered Bai Zhan.","\"So she made it to Core Disciple, huh?\" A smile appeared on Yuan's face.","The following day, Yuan went to visit Elder Sun even though she had told him to visit him next week, as he intended to spend his last few days in this world with her.","However, when Yuan arrived at the Immortal Sun Peak, he was met with an unexpected sight. Unlike usual, Elder Sun was not alone. Standing beside her, engaged in conversation, was a female disciple dressed in the Core Disciple's uniform.","Though her back was turned to him, obscuring her face, Yuan didn't need to see it to recognize her.","It was Meng Lili.","Realizing this, Yuan turned around, but before he could leave, Elder Sun noticed him and called out to him, \"Xiao Yang? What are you doing?\"","\"Xiao Yang?\"","Meng Lili turned to look at Yuan with interest.","\"Hm? You're that disciple from yesterday. Don't tell me you followed me all the way here because you're an admirer of mine?\"","\"Admirer? What are you talking about? That's my disciple,\" Elder Sun said.","\"What?! You accepted a disciple?! When?!\" Meng Lili exclaimed, her face full of surprise.","\"Not too long ago—right after you left the sect for your mission,\" Elder Sun said.","\"Xiao Yang, come greet your senior apprentice-sister.\"","'Ha... whatever. If anything happens, the Sect Leader will take care of it.' Yuan sighed inwardly as he approached them.","\"Hello, senior. My name is Xiao Yang.\" Yuan greeted Meng Lili a moment later.","\"Hey, why did you run away yesterday?\" Meng Lili wasted no time asking him, almost as if she was worried he might run away again.","\"I wasn't running away,\" he quickly denied.","\"Don't lie. You were definitely running away. Were you afraid of getting in trouble?\"","\"Why would he be in trouble?\" Elder Sun asked.","\"He was inside the center court,\" she explained.","Yuan shook his head, but instead of explaining with words, he showed the Core Disciple's medallion to her.","\"What? When did you become a Core Disciple?\" Elder Sun's eyes widened with surprise.","\"Right after we returned from the Desolate Continent,\" he replied.","\"Unbelievable... Do you even know what it means to rest? You're just like a certain someone I know,\" Elder Sun sighed.","Yuan's heart skipped a beat when Elder Sun almost mentioned Tian Yang.","'Is she purposefully not mentioning him by name because of what happened?' he wondered.","\"So, what are you doing here?\" Elder Sun then asked.","\"Nothing much. I just wanted to spend some time with you.\" \"With me?\" Elder Sun raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","Yuan silently nodded.","\"You came here not to train but to spend time? I don't remember you being this clingy,\" she teased.","\"I'm entering seclusion soon,\" Yuan said.","\"Is that so... How long?\"","He shook his head. \"I don't know.\"","\"Then when are you going to enter seclusion?\"","\"In a week.\"","Meng Lili glanced between Yuan and Elder Sun, her gaze shifting back and forth for a brief moment. Then, with a soft smile, she said, \"I'll leave you two alone.\"","Before Elder Sun could say anything, Meng Lili flew away.","\"Who was that, anyway?\" Yuan asked shortly afterward.","\"Disciple Meng Lili. She's one of Elder Jing's disciples, and she'd recently returned to the sect from a mission,\" Elder Sun gave a brief explanation.","\"This is the first time you're showing interest in another disciple. Don't tell me you're actually an admirer?\" Elder Sun smiled in a teasing manner.","Yuan shook his head with a bittersweet smile, \"It's only because you seem close with her—even though you're a loner.\"","\"W-What?! A loner?! I am most certainly not a loner!\" Elder Sun hastily refuted.","\"Oh yeah? If you're not a loner, how come I never see you with anyone besides Elder Jing and myself?\"","Elder Sun was left speechless for a moment before she responded, \"I hang out with plenty of people! It's just that I only do that when you're not here!\"","\"Sure thing...\"","Yuan and Elder Sun continued going back and forth. After a long conversation, Elder Sun said, \"To tell you the truth, I am considering leaving the sect.\"","\"What? Why?\" Yuan's eyes widened after hearing this sudden confession.","\"As you already know, I joined the sect to distance myself from my family. However, it's not as if I severed ties with them completely,\" Elder Sun explained, her tone calm yet laced with an underlying weight. \"Eventually, I will have to return... and I feel like that that time is approaching.\"","\"So you'll be gone by the time I emerge from my seclusion?\"","She nodded.","\"Possibly.\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan said, \"If you're not here when I return, I'll go to where you are.\"","\"Don't. It's too dangerous.\" Elder Sun quickly rejected.","\"How so?\"","\"Even ignoring the fact that not just anyone can enter the Holy Continent, my family is special.\"","\"No matter how special they are, I will figure out a way to see you again,\" Yuan casually said with a calm smile on his handsome face, leaving her momentarily speechless."]},{"number":1910,"title":"Chapter 1910 Family Seal","paragraphs":["\"Is there anything I can say that will change your mind?\" Elder Sun asked, still reluctant to elt him visit her family.","Yuan smiled.","\"You should know me well enough by now to know the answer to that.\"","Elder Sun sighed, \"Even if your life might be endangered?\"","\"I'm sure you'll protect me.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Elder Sun said, \"Fine, if that's what you want to do. However, you must accept something from me.\"","\"Oh? A gift from you? Why would I refuse something like that?\"","\"In that case, take it.\"","Elder Sun suddenly flicked his forehead, the motion swift yet oddly gentle. A warmth spread from the point of contact, washing over him like a comforting embrace.","Although Yuan couldn't see it, a faint red symbol briefly appeared on his forehead, glowing softly before fading away as if it had never existed. The warmth lingered for a moment before dissipating, leaving behind an inexplicable sensation, as though something had subtly changed within him.","\"What did you do?\" Yuan asked as he rubbed his forehead.","\"I gave you my family seal. It basically recognizes you as someone approved by me. As long as you have that, my family won't kill you—probably.\"","\"A family seal?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, looking slightly surprised. \"Isn't that something one gives to someone who joins their family? We're practically married now.\"","\"What kind of nonsense is that?\" Elder Sun sighed out loud. \"Family seals can be given to people outside the family, but only those from the main family are allowed to do so.\"","Yuan chuckled, \"Is that so?\"","Despite Elder Sun's casual demeanor, the act she had just performed was anything but trivial. Bestowing a family seal was an incredibly significant and meaningful gesture—one that carried deep implications. It was not something given lightly, nor was it an act done on a whim. This was especially true for families with immense influence and reputation. Whether Yuan realized it or not, the family seal symbolized something far greater than mere sentiment.","For the next several days, Yuan would spend all of his time on the Immortal Sun Peak with Elder Sun. They would talk about many things, from their hobbies to their goals in life. Time passed quickly, and in the blink of an eye, it was time for Yuan and his group to leave the Immortal Monastery.","\"I'm going to enter seclusion today, Elder Sun. If you're not here by the time I come out, I'll definitely come visit you in the Holy Continent.\"","Elder Sun nodded and silently watched as Yuan disappeared from the Immortal Sun Peak.","Sometime later, Yuan and the others went to meet with the Sect Leader.","Outside the Sect Leader's headquarters, Ji Ran bid them farewell.","\"Good luck out there, everyone.\"","\"You too. Since time flows much faster in this world, it'll probably be a while for you before we return,\" Yuan said.","Ji Ran smiled and replied, \"Even if it takes millions of years, it still wouldn't compare to my time inside the Shadow Realm.\"","After saying their goodbyes to Ji Ran, Yuan and the others went inside the building to meet with the Sect Leader.","\"Are you all leaving?\" the Sect Leader asked.","\"Yes.\"","\"Very well. Once you leave, you will wake up on an island. To leave, you just need to go outside and enter the portal,\" said the Sect Leader.","The Sect Leader snapped his fingers, and a swirling purple portal materialized before them.","Without hesitation, Yuan stepped forward, entering the portal first, followed closely by Tan Songyun and the others.","The instant they crossed the threshold, their vision went blank. A strange weightlessness overtook them, their senses fading as their consciousness drifted away, much like when a player entered Cultivation Online.","A few moments later, Yuan's eyes fluttered open. Blinking away the lingering haze, he slowly took in his surroundings. He was lying on a bed inside a modest yet unfamiliar room, the atmosphere calm and still.","Instinctively, he inspected his body, running his hands over himself. Sure enough, he was back in his original body.","Just as he got out of the bed, a notification appeared before him, something he hadn't seen in years.","<You have received 'Seal of the Eternal Sun'>","\"Seal of the Eternal Sun? Is that Elder Sun's family seal?\" Yuan mumbled.","[Seal of the Eternal Sun: ???]","When he tried to look up its information, there were only question marks. However, what truly surprised Yuan was that the seal had carried over from the other world.","Sometime later, Yuan stepped out of the room and made his way outside. As he exited the building, his gaze was immediately drawn to his surroundings.","He found himself standing atop a small floating island, suspended in the vast sky. A gentle breeze swept past, carrying an air of mystique. However, what truly caught his attention was the sheer number of similar floating islands stretching across the horizon—thousands of them, each seemingly housing other participants.","Yuan attempted to step off the island, but the moment he did, he was met with an invisible force. A barrier surrounded the entire floating island, preventing him from leaving. He pressed his hand against it, feeling a faint resistance—solid yet intangible.","Its purpose was obvious. The barrier was likely there to prevent participants from interfering with one another.","Suddenly, Yuan's attention was drawn to movement nearby. The door of the adjacent building opened, and a familiar figure stepped out.","It was Lan Yingying.","Her elegant form emerged into the open, her gaze sweeping across the floating islands before finally landing on Yuan.","Lan Yingying waved at him. Her mouth was moving, but Yuan couldn't hear what she was trying to say.","Yuan pointed at the portal nearby before entering it, disappearing from the island. Lan Yingying followed suit and entered the portal on her island.","After emerging from the other side, Yuan and Lan Yingying found themselves back inside the City of Radiance. Moments later, Tan Songyun and the others also appeared out of thin air beside them."]},{"number":1911,"title":"Chapter 1911 Warning(End of Immortal Monastery Arc)","paragraphs":["\"Looks like everyone is here,\" Yuan said after Tan Songyun, Xi Meili, and Yingzi returned to the City of Radiance.","\"Young Master, you're back!\"","Feng Yuxiang emerged from his dantian a moment later and immediately embraced him.","\"Feng Feng? What happened to you after I entered the Immortal Monastery?\" Yuan asked her.","\"Well, after you entered the portal, I was forced to slumber. I didn't wake up until just now,\" she explained.","\"I also just woke up. Where's Ji Ran? I don't see him with you,\" Yu Ning's voice resounded.","\"Oh, Ji Ran decided to remain in the trial. Although we came out, we haven't completed the trial yet. Of course, he's not going to stay there forever. I will come back here once I create his new physical body,\" explained Yuan.","\"Is that so...\"","\"Now then, let's figure out how long we've been inside the trial. If I consider what the Sect Leader told me, only about a year should have passed since we entered the Immortal Monastery.\"","Yuan extended his divine sense, sweeping across the vast expanse of the City of Radiance in search of any presence. However, to his surprise, the once-bustling city was now eerily empty, and not a single soul remained apart from his group.","\"There's nobody here?\" he muttered, his voice tinged with disbelief.","Before they had entered the Immortal Monastery, the city had been teeming with cultivators, all eagerly searching for hidden treasures or just touring the place. Even if it had become clear that there were no treasures, that wouldn't have been enough to completely deter people from visiting this place—especially in the cultivation world, where people are the most persistent. Yet now, only a year later, the city stood completely abandoned.","That didn't make sense.","Something had happened. But what?","In the midst of his thoughts, Yuan noticed Tan Songyun was staring at her communication jade slip with a dumbfounded look on her face.","\"Did something happen?\" he asked her out of curiosity.","However, Tan Songyun didn't immediately respond and continued staring at her communication jade slip. Clearly, she was still busy with it.","While Yuan waited for her, a notification abruptly appeared before him.","<You have received a message from Qiang Qing Yun>","'Celestial Overlord Qiang?' Yuan raised an eyebrow.","This was the first time he'd received such a notification.","'Since it's related to the Celestial Overlord...'","Yuan raised his arm and glanced at his faction symbol.","A faction symbol was more than just a means of identification—it also functioned as a communication tool, much like a communication jade slip. However, its usage was restricted. Unlike communication jade slips, it could only be used for announcements since the messages are sent to every member, and only the higher-ups of the faction had the authority to send messages.","After Yuan had infused some of his spiritual energy into the symbol, it pulsed faintly, and a voice echoed within his mind.","\"This is a warning for all members. The Demon Worshippers, who have always acted from within the shadows, have recently increased their activity and started revealing themselves—an unusual shift in their behavior. Stay vigilant, and report any information or signs of their presence to the Demon Sealing Clan or the Demon Sealing Grotto immediately.\"","Yuan frowned after hearing the message.","Demon Worshippers typically thrived in secrecy, operating from the shadows and avoiding unnecessary attention. Their entire existence revolved around manipulation, deception, and silent corruption. However, according to the Celestial Overlord's announcement, they were now behaving in direct opposition to their usual methods—boldly revealing themselves instead of lurking unseen.","This was deeply out of character and worrying.","\"Did you also receive a warning from your faction?\" Tan Songyun's voice suddenly resounded, snapping Yuan out of his thoughts.","He looked at her and asked, \"About the Demon Worshippers' unusual activities? You also received it?\"","She nodded.","\"Our faction usually doesn't concern itself with matters unrelated to our vengeance. However, when we do pay attention, it's because the situation is so significant that even we can't ignore it.\"","Xi Meili joined their conversation and asked Yuan, \"I heard of them during your trial in the Stairway to Heaven, but I am still unfamiliar with their existence. What are they? And what are their goals?\"","Since Demon Worshippers didn't exist in the Ancient Dragon City, nor did they have to worry about them, Xi Meili was never taught about their existence.","\"You know what demons are, right?\" Tan Songyun asked.","\"Of course.\"","\"Well, Demon Worshippers, as their name implies, are those who revere and serve demons,\" Tan Songyun explained. \"Some are mere admirers, those who idolize demons but take no real action. Then, there are those who go a step further—acting on behalf of demons, carrying out their will in the world.\"","\"I can't fathom why anyone would revere demons, much less serve them,\" Xi Meili said, shaking her head in disbelief. \"Demons once ruled the world, didn't they? And they committed countless atrocities against everyone. Why would anyone willingly follow them?\"","To worship those who had once brought devastation to the world was unfathomable. Yet, the existence of Demon Worshippers proved that some people not only accepted demons but actively sought their favor.","\"It's quite simple, actually,\" Yuan said, his voice calm yet firm. \"For power.\"","He met Xi Meili's gaze as he continued, \"Demons may be ruthless and unreasonable, but their power is undeniable. Some people are willing to sacrifice everything—morality, humanity, even their own souls—just for a taste of that power. To them, it doesn't matter what demons have done in the past. All they care about is what they can gain in the present.\"","\"How does that work? How does one acquire the power of demons?\"","In response, Yuan extended a finger, revealing a single drop of blood glistening at the tip.","\"Their blood,\" he said a moment later. \"By consuming demon blood, one can gain immense regenerative abilities that rival those of demons themselves. Moreover, one's natural limitations—their innate talents can be bypassed, allowing them to achieve feats that otherwise aren't possible.\""]},{"number":1912,"title":"Chapter 1912 Extreme Yin Lake","paragraphs":["\"I understand their desire for power, but what's the point if you turn into a monster at the end?\" Xi Meili shook her head after hearing about Demon Worshippers. She could still vividly recall the grotesque transformation she witnessed during Yuan's trial.","\"That usually only happens when one consumes too much demon blood. A few drops won't turn one into a monster, but there is still a high chance it will affect their mind by making them more aggressive, hot-tempered, and unreasonable,\" Yuan explained further.","\"I was told this place was attacked recently by the Demon Worshippers, hence why it's empty right now.\" Tan Songyun suddenly revealed.","She turned to look at Yuan and asked, \"So, what are your plans now?\"","Yuan fell into deep thought, his expression unreadable as he pondered in silence.","He didn't know the exact reason behind the Demon Worshippers' sudden activity, but that didn't mean he was clueless. His mind drifted back to his encounter with the Demon Emperor Carnage a few years ago. Could this surge in Demon Worshipper activity be connected to him?","'If it's really the Demon Emperor's doing, something big will definitely happen soon, and I should get ready for it.'","Yuan looked at Tan Songyun and asked, \"Do you know of any place with extreme yin element? The colder the place, the better.\"","\"A place of extreme yin element, huh? Does it have to be in the Sixth Heaven?\" she asked.","\"No, but it would be great if there is one here.\"","Tan Songyun pondered for a moment before responding, \"The Extreme Yin Lake. It's located in the Sixth Heaven and is a very popular place for cultivators who specialize in the yin element.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Then that will be my next destination.\"","He wanted to improve his cold immunity further so his physique could evolve.","\"I don't mind, but why? You don't even cultivate Yin Qi.\"","\"I'm not going there to cultivate. It's to temper by body and train my cold immunity,\" he explained.","\"Is that so...?\"","Despite knowing his purpose, Tan Songyin still couldn't understand why he needed to train his cold immunity now. It just seemed too random and out of the blue.","With their next destination in mind, Yuan and his group made their way to the Extreme Yin Lake.","The Extreme Yin Lake was located near the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, one of the most prestigious and powerful sects in the Sixth Heaven.","Renowned not only for their peerless ice-based martial techniques, the sect was also widely recognized as a gathering place for the most beautiful women in the realm.","In the cultivation world, women are naturally attuned to the yin element, while most men are inherently aligned with yang energy. This natural balance follows the fundamental principles of Yin and Yang, where Yin represents coldness, tranquility, and the moon, while Yang embodies warmth, intensity, and the sun.","Because of this, female cultivators tend to naturally excel in Yin-based techniques, making the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect a predominantly female sect. However, there exist a few exceptions—men born with an extremely rare natural affinity for Yin energy. Their numbers are so few that they can be counted on one hand.","After traveling for several days, Yuan and his group arrived at their destination, the Extreme Yin Lake.","\"Wow, it's beautiful...\" Xi Meili muttered, her eyes shimmering as she gazed at the breathtaking scenery before them.","The Extreme Yin Lake was nestled within a valley of towering snowy mountains, their peaks blanketed in pristine white. The air was crisp and cool, carrying a faint, almost ethereal chill that seemed to seep into the soul. The entire landscape radiated a serene, otherworldly beauty, untouched and pure, as if frozen in time.","The temperature in the area was a staggering -200 degrees Celsius, an unbearable cold that could freeze cultivators unprepared for such extreme conditions.","Yet, despite the frigid atmosphere, the lake's surface remained untouched by ice. The water flowed with an almost ethereal stillness, shimmering under the pale light, as if defying the very laws of nature.","If one looked closely, they would notice several individuals seated around the Extreme Yin Lake, immersed in deep cultivation.","Most of them remained near the snowy banks, absorbing the pure Yin Qi radiating from the lake. However, two figures stood out, and they were cultivating directly on top of the lake itself.","\"How long are you going to stay here?\" Tan Songyun asked.","\"I don't know yet since it'll depend on how effective this training spot is, but I'll be here for a few days, at the very least.\"","\"In that case, I'll visit the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect. I know their Sect Leader.\"","\"Can I come with you? I'd like to see the sect, and I don't like this coldness.\" Xi Meili said.","\"Sure.\" Tan Songyun nodded. \"Then we'll be back in a few days. Try not to cause any trouble.\"","\"Yes, mother,\" Yuan responded in a joking tone.","Tan Songyun trembled, and she immediately responded with an angry frown, \"Don't you ever call me that again, even as a joke.\"","Yuan chuckled, \"Sorry.\"","After Tan Songyun and Xi Meili departed, Yuan made his way toward the Extreme Yin Lake, his steps steady despite the piercing cold.","With each step closer, the temperature plummeted even further, the air itself growing heavier with dense Yin energy. The chilling aura seeped into his skin, biting at his bones, but he pressed forward, undeterred.","As for Lan Yingying and Yingzi, one entered his Dantian while the other his shadow.","<Cold Resistance has improved>","<Cold Resistance has improved>","Yuan smiled after seeing the notification.","'It's nothing compared to the training grounds within the Primal Expanse, but I doubt I'll find a training place that extreme in the Sixth Heaven.'","When Yuan got close enough, the cultivators who had been cultivating by the Extreme Yin Lake finally paid attention to him.","'A man? Why is he wearing a mask?'","'Who's that? He's not a disciple at our Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect...'","Although the disciples were curious about Yuan's presence, they chose not to approach or disturb him. Instead, they merely observed in silence, their gazes carrying a mix of intrigue and caution.","It was rare for an outsider—especially a man—to approach the Extreme Yin Lake, let alone withstand its intense cold. Yet, Yuan walked forward with unwavering composure, as if the bone-chilling temperature had no effect on him."]},{"number":1913,"title":"Chapter 1913 Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect","paragraphs":["Although the Extreme Yin Lake was located beside the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect and primarily visited by its disciples, it was classified as a natural training ground rather than exclusive sect property. As such, outsiders were allowed to enter freely.","However, despite this openness, the lake's unforgiving cold served as a natural barrier. The chilling Yin energy was so intense that only those who had cultivated the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect's unique techniques could withstand it for extended periods. For anyone else, this training ground was a perilous area.","Because of this, while technically open to all, in practice, the Extreme Yin Lake remained a place almost exclusively occupied by the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect's disciples, and even then, only their most talented and experienced disciples would dare to train there.","When Yuan reached about 300 meters from the Extreme Yin Lake, he came to a stop. The air around him was so frigid that even the moisture in his breath froze instantly.","Without hesitation, he sat down and closed his eyes, entering a state of cultivation. Unlike others who would instinctively shield themselves from the cold, Yuan chose not to protect himself with spiritual energy.","Instead, he allowed the bone-chilling Yin energy to penetrate his body freely, embracing the raw intensity of the Extreme Yin Lake's environment. He was not merely cultivating—he was tempering his body, pushing himself beyond his natural limits.","<Cold Resistance has greatly improved>","<Cold Resistance has greatly improved>","<Cold Resistance has greatly improved>","Although the Extreme Yin Lake was indeed effective in improving his Cold Resistance, Yuan found the progress too slow for his liking.","A mere five minutes had passed when he opened his eyes, dissatisfaction flickering within them. Without hesitation, he stood up and began walking closer to the lake, stepping into the even denser Yin energy that surrounded the lake.","The disciples swallowed nervously when they realized Yuan wasn't protecting himself with spiritual energy and enduring the cold with his bare body.","'Is he insane? No... more importantly, how is he enduring the Extreme Yin Lake with his bare body? Does he have a heavenly yin physique?'","The disciples were shocked by Yuan's audacity and mysterious physique. A few moments later, when Yuan was only 200 meters away from the water, ice began forming around his body, slowly turning him into an ice statue. Yet, despite his seemingly dangerous state, Yuan did not feel like his life was in danger in the slightest.","'This is kind of disappointing... or maybe I was spoiled by the extreme training grounds at the Divine Dragon Sanctuary...' Yuan sighed inwardly as he recalled the truly perilous training grounds that could kill even immortals.","In the blink of an eye, Yuan closed the distance by another 100 meters. Now, he was standing right beside the disciples who were cultivating outside the lake.","\"W-Who are you...?\" one of them couldn't help but ask.","Yuan turned to look at the dazed female disciple and said, \"Xiao Yang.\"","Without saying anything else, Yuan continued to walk closer to the lake.","\"You should stop there if you value your life.\"","One of the individuals cultivating on the late suddenly spoke out loud when Yuan was just 50 meters away.","\"Don't worry, my condition is actually better than it may appear,\" Yuan said calmly.","The female disciple frowned and said, \"Seriously. I don't want to deal with your frozen corpse later. Unless you cultivate the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect's cultivation technique or have cold immunity, you won't survive the lake.\"","\"I appreciate your concern, but it's really fine. If I somehow end up as a corpse, my companion will deal with it.\"","\"Your companion? Where?\" The disciple looked around but couldn't see anyone.","\"They'll be back in a few days. If I have not returned by then, please let them know where I am.\"","\"What are you saying? I don't get it.\" The disciple raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","Yuan, who had reached the lake, pointed at the water and said, \"I'll be inside.\"","\"What?! You can't be serious—\"","Before the disciple could finish her sentence, Yuan jumped into the air and dove directly into the lake's center.","\"Holy shit! He went inside the water!\"","Shock rippled through the disciples as they stared, unable to believe what they witnessed.","Even the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect's Sect Leader, a cultivator renowned for possessing Cold Immunity, would not last more than a few seconds submerged in the lake's waters. Yet, Yuan went inside without any protection, treating it like an ordinary pool of water.","Meanwhile, Tan Songyun and Xi Meili arrived at the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect and were greeted by the Sect Leader herself when she heard Tan Songyun's name.","\"Senior Sister Tan! What a pleasant surprise! I haven't seen you in forever!\" A beautiful woman with white hair and blue eyes approached them with a bright smile on her face.","\"I was passing by the Extreme Yin Lake and decided to visit. How's the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect lately?\"","When the Sect Leader heard this question, her smile weakened, and she responded in a dispirited voice, \"It was doing great... until last month.\"","\"What happened?\" Tan Songyun inquired.","\"I don't know if you've heard, but the Demon Worshippers have been making a scene lately.\"","\"I was in the Hidden Domain until a few days ago, but I know of it. Did they attack your sect?\"","The Sect Leader glanced around, scanning their surroundings with a discerning gaze. After a brief pause, she spoke, \"Let's go somewhere more private.\"","\"Sure.\"","\"By the way, who is your friend?\" The Sect Leader asked as they walked back to her place.","\"She's Xi Meili. We're traveling together at the moment. Don't worry, she's trustworthy.\"","\"I'm not worried about that. I was just curious since you've never brought a friend before.\"","Sometime later, they went inside the Sect Leader's room.","Once she shut the door, the Sect Leader looked at Tan Songyun with a serious face and revealed, \"We don't know if it's related to the Demon Worshippers yet, but some of our disciples have gone missing lately.\""]},{"number":1914,"title":"Chapter 1914 Someone From the Demon Sealing Clan","paragraphs":["\"Missing... so you think your disciples are being kidnapped by the Demon Worshippers?\" Tan Songyun asked after hearing this.","\"That, or they were killed,\" sighed the Sect Leader.","\"What is the sect doing about this?\" \"So far, we've recalled most of our disciples back to the sect, unless they're on a really important mission. We have also restricted their movements to within the sect's boundary. Other than that... I don't know what else can be done.\"","\"What about the disciples at the Extreme Yin Lake? I saw a few of your disciples there,\" Tan Songyun said.","\"That's a special location. Most people can't even get close due to the extreme weather. Unless the Demon Worshippers have cold immunity or a special physique, they won't be able to go near it. Also, it's fairly close to the sect.\"","\"Sorry you have to deal with this.\"","The Sect Leader shook her head and said, \"I'm sure it'll be over soon, especially once that person from the Demon Sealing Clan arrives.\"","\"That person?\" Tan Songyun raised an eyebrow.","The Sect Leader smiled and said, \"Yes, she's very famous in the Demon Sealing Clan and the cultivation world. I'm sure you've heard of her before. I requested help from the Demon Sealing Clan as soon as I realized the Demon Worshippers were kidnapping my disciples, and they recently notified me that this individual would be coming to assist us. In fact, she should be arriving soon.\"","\"So, who is this individual?\" Tan Songyun asked again.","The Sect Leader smiled and said, \"Are you in a hurry to leave? If you are, I will tell you, but if you have some time, you should meet her. This is a really rare chance, after all. Hell, you'd probably stay after hearing her name.\"","Tan Songyun was a little annoyed by the secrecy, but she was also very curious.","\"I have a few days,\" she said.","\"Great! I'll let you know when she arrives. Is there anything you would like to do in the meantime? How about I show you around the sect?\"","Xi Meili immediately nodded and replied, \"That would be great.\"","Thus, the Sect Leader began showing them around the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect.","\"I know you already have a Demon Sealer on the way, but I know someone who might also be able to help,\" Tan Songyun said as they traveled.","\"Are you talking about Yu—Xiao Yang?\" Xi Meili asked.","Tan Songyun nodded, \"What do you think? You know him better than me, but from what I've seen, he seemed very familiar with demons and demon worshippers.\"","\"I'm not too sure, but if it's him, I'm sure he'll be helpful no matter what it is.\"","\"Who is this Xiao Yang?\" The Sect Leader inquired in a curious voice.","\"He's our traveling companion and the reason why we're here. He's currently training at the Frozen Yin Lake, though.\"","\"A man with Yin affinity? How rare.\"","Although the Sect Leader misunderstood his situation, they didn't bother correcting her.","A few hours later, midway through their tour, the Sect Leader suddenly halted her movements and retrieved a communication jade slip.","\"I just received news that the Demon Sealer has arrived at the sect, so we'll end the tour here.\"","Learning this, Tan Songyun and Xi Meili followed the Sect Leader to meet this Demon Sealer.","Surprisingly, they didn't head to the Sect Leader's headquarters. Instead, they traveled to the 7th Frozen Cloud Peak, a public area accessible by all disciples.","When they arrived at their destination, their gaze was immediately drawn to a beautiful woman in black and white robes standing gracefully by a water fountain.","Her presence was captivating, exuding a refined elegance that demanded attention.","Surrounding her were excited disciples, their expressions filled with awe and admiration. Some eagerly spoke with her, while others simply stood nearby, as if just being in her presence was an honor in itself.","\"That's... that's... who is that?\" Tan Songyun turned to look at the Sect Leader after failing to recognize the Demon Sealer. \"Seriously?! You don't recognize her?! That's Sun Ling Cai, also known as Myriad Colors! Not only is she one of the best painters in the Nine Heavens, but she is also a Master Demon Sealer! Each of her paintings, no matter how simple, fetches tens of millions of spirit stones!\"","\"Myriad Colors? That's the 'Sublime Painter'? Although I have never seen her before, I have heard of her name,\" Tan Songyun muttered with slightly widened eyes.","The Sublime Painter was renowned not only for her ability to create flawless masterpieces but also for the unique power her creations possessed. Unlike ordinary works of art, hers were capable of producing mystical effects akin to those of powerful treasures.","For example, one of her most famous works, Cultivator's Ascension, was a painting that functioned like a real spiritual treasure, capable of gathering and enhancing spiritual energy in its surroundings. Just by placing it within a cultivation chamber, one could experience a significant boost in their cultivation speed.","Because of this, her art was highly sought after, not just for its beauty, but for its practical and mystical properties, making it priceless to both mortals and cultivators alike.","\"She's a painter? I didn't know cultivators paid that much attention to such a profession,\" Xi Meili remarked, as she considered painting a mortal's profession.","\"She's not your ordinary painter. Her paintings function as treasures. Some have effects that benefit cultivation, while others can work as life-saving treasures. The only issue is that she cannot determine the effect of her paintings, so they vary greatly.\"","The Sect Leader approached Sun Ling Cai and bowed, \"It's a real honor to have you here, Senior Sun. I am the Sect Leader of the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, Yun Xi.\"","\"Nice to meet you, Sect Leader Yun. I was sent here by the Demon Sealing Clan after they reviewed your request. I will do everything in my power to assist you with your problem.\"","\"I can't imagine having someone more reliable than you here, Senior Sun. If you're ready, let's go somewhere more quiet.\"","\"Let's.\" Sun Ling Cai nodded."]},{"number":1915,"title":"Chapter 1915 Sublime Painter","paragraphs":["Shortly after greeting each other, Sect Leader Yun led Sun Ling Cai to her headquarters. Xi Meili and Tan Songyun followed them after receiving the Sect Leader's permission.","\"Am I the only Demon Sealer here? What about the Demon Sealing Grotto?\"","\"You're the only Demon Sealer here.\"","\"I see. I was half-expecting them to be here, too.\"","A stiff smile appeared on the Sect Leader's face as she spoke, \"To be honest, I contacted both the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto. However, only the Demon Sealing Clan responded to my request. I apologize if I did something I wasn't supposed to.\"","Sun Ling Cai calmly shook her head and said, \"No, you're fine. There's no rule stating that you can only contact one of us. I wouldn't mind working with them either if it means dealing with these Demon Worshippers faster.\"","She turned to look at Xi Meili and Tan Songyun and asked, \"Then who are you guys? You don't seem like disciples of this sect.\"","\"We're just guests here. However, if you need help, we're more than willing to lend a hand,\" said Tan Songyun.","She wasn't offering assistance just because of her friendship with Sect Leader Yun. This was a matter far greater than personal ties.","As a cultivator—as a human—she felt an obligation to stand against the Demon Worshippers, those who had forsaken their morals and humanity in pursuit of corrupt power. Their actions threatened not just sects or families but the balance of the world itself.","Once they arrived at the headquarters, Sect Leader Yun began explaining the situation to Sun Ling Cai in more detail.","\"According to those who witnessed the kidnappings, these Demon Worshippers are specifically targeting maidens,\" Sect Leader Yun stated grimly.","\"Maidens?\" Sun Ling Cai raised an eyebrow, her expression shifting to one of intrigue and concern.","Sect Leader Yun nodded, her voice steady as she continued, \"At first, we believed the Demon Worshippers were simply kidnapping our disciples at random. However, we soon realized there was a clear pattern. All the disciples who managed to evade capture, despite being present at the time of the incidents, were not maidens. Is there a reason why they're specifically targeting maidens?\"","Sun Ling Cai pondered for a moment before responding, \"Truth is, your Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect isn't the only place being targetted by the Demon Worshippers. Female cultivators around the Nine Heavens are being kidnapped on a scale we've never witnessed before. Although we don't know why, we do have some speculations.\"","\"The most obvious one is that they require sacrifices for something.\"","\"Could the Demon Worshippers be feeding them to the demons?\" Xi Meili asked.","Sun Ling Cai nodded and responded, \"It's possible, but there's no reason why they would only go after maidens since demons don't have preferences and eat whatever they get their hands on.\" \"If they're only going after maidens, maybe they are doing a ritual that requires maidens. I know there are forbidden techniques out there that demand maidens because of their pure essence,\" said Tan Songyun.","\"Yes, the Demon Sealing Clan also believes the Demon Worshippers are gathering maidens for some kind of ritual. As for the purpose of such ritual... we can only speculate.\"","\"So, how can we stop these Demon Worshippers? Unless you know where they are hiding, we can only react to their actions,\" Tan Songyun asked.","Sun Ling Cai retrieved a black metal compass and said, \"This is a treasure that can detect nearby demonic energy.\"","\"What a convenient tool,\" Xi Meili remarked.","\"It was only developed recently, and its uses are still limited, especially its detection range. However, it'll automatically improve as we use it,\" said Sun Ling Cai.","\"How far does its detection reach?\" Sect Leader Yun asked.","\"About a hundred miles.\" \"That's not much...\"","\"It's not, but it can detect even the faintest demonic energy—\"","In the midst of Sun Ling Cai's speech, the compass suddenly emitted a red glow, pulsing with an eerie intensity.","A moment later, a red light flickered above it, rapidly condensing into the shape of an arrow, its tip unwavering as it pointed toward a specific direction.","\"The compass activated?! So it detected demonic energy nearby?!\" Sect Leader Yun stood up in shock.","Sun Ling Cai nodded with a serious expression on her face.","\"The arrow... isn't it pointing in the direction of the Extreme Yin Lake?\" Xi Meili asked after noticing this.","\"It is. Let's hurry to the Extreme Yin Lake,\" Sect Leader Yun spoke with urgency.","Meanwhile, at the Extreme Yin Lake, the disciples have been staring at the lake for the last few hours.","\"It's been hours since he went inside. He's definitely dead, right?\"","\"If he's dead, why isn't his corpse coming back up?\"","\"Then he's probably not dead...\"","The disciples were in disbelief. They couldn't fathom how a man could endure so long inside the Extreme Yin Lake. \"He definitely has a heaven-defying Yin physique! Maybe he even possesses the legendary Arctic Saint Physique!\" one disciple exclaimed in shock.","\"That's impossible,\" another disciple immediately refuted, shaking her head. \"Only women can be born with that physique. No man has ever possessed it in history.\"","Suddenly, another disciple said, \"Hey, look over there.\"","The group instinctively turned their heads, their gazes locking onto the treeline.","There, several cloaked figures stood motionless, their dark robes barely shifting despite the cold wind. \"We sure have a lot of visitors today.\"","\"Snap out of it. They're oozing with malice, and they're not even hiding it.\"","The two disciples who had been cultivating on the lake suddenly jumped out of it to confront these newcomers.","\"Judging by your suspicious appearances and the recent incidents... you must be Demon Worshippers. Are you here to kidnap us?\"","\"Demon Worshippers?!\" The other disciples immediately became wary and nervous after hearing this.","Meanwhile, the Demon Worshippers wasted no time with words.","Without warning, they lunged forward, their dark cloaks billowing as they charged straight at the disciples, completely unfazed by the Extreme Yin Lake's deadly cold.","Seeing this, one of the disciples immediately retrieved a red talisman and tore it up.","\"I have notified the sect! We just need to last until they arrive!\""]},{"number":1916,"title":"Chapter 1916 Fighting the Demon Worshippers","paragraphs":["The Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect's disciples clashed with the Demon Worshippers. Due to the close distance between their sect and the Extreme Yin Lake, they only needed to defend themselves for several minutes before help arrived.","However, the disciples quickly realized that lasting even a minute would be challenging. The Demon Worshippers were incredibly powerful and fought without any regard for their own safety.","Moreover, despite having lower cultivation than the disciples, the Demon Worshippers displayed prowess that surpassed the disciples. This abnormal power is one of many reasons why Demon Worshippers abandon their humanity.","\"I won't be able to endure this much longer, Senior Sister!\"","Aside from the two Core Disciples who cultivated on the Extreme Yin Lake, the rest of the disciples were merely Inner Court Disciples, and they were on the verge of being overwhelmed.","Despite their efforts, the Inner Court Disciples were struggling against the Demon Worshippers' brutal assault, their techniques barely holding back the relentless attacks. One by one, they began to falter, their defenses crumbling under the sheer ferocity of their enemies.","As for the Core Disciples, while they were faring better, they were far from gaining the upper hand. Neither side was winning or losing, trapped in a deadlock where a single mistake could turn the tide.","Despite their desire to help their junior disciples, they simply weren't in a position to do so—their opponents were too strong, forcing them to remain fully engaged in their own battles.","If this continued much longer, the Inner Court Disciples would fall first, and the Core Disciples would eventually fall as well.","\"Ah!\"","\"Junior Sister!\"","One of the Inner Court Disciples let out a sharp cry as she was overwhelmed, her defenses shattering beneath the relentless assault. Her weapon slipped from her grasp, clattering against the icy ground as she collapsed, exhausted and defenseless.","The Demon Worshipper standing over her wasted no time. With a flick of his hand, dark chains materialized from thin air, writhing like living shadows before wrapping tightly around her body.","The moment the black chains latched onto her, a profound force sealed her spiritual energy, suppressing it completely.","The disciple's eyes widened in horror as she realized that her cultivation had been sealed. In an instant, she had been reduced to a mere mortal.","As soon as the first disciple was captured, the battle quickly turned one-sided.","One by one, the other Inner Court Disciples fell, unable to resist the overwhelming power of the Demon Worshippers. The black chains continued to manifest, restraining their spiritual energy and leaving them helpless as they were forcibly subdued.","Once all the Inner Court Disciples had been captured, the Demon Worshippers swiftly turned their attention to the Core Disciples. Though they had managed to hold their ground for a time, they were now outnumbered and outmatched.","Realizing they couldn't win, the Core Disciples fought desperately, trying to break through and free their fellow disciples, but it was futile. The Demon Worshippers coordinated their attacks flawlessly, exploiting every weakness and overwhelming them with sheer force.","In the blink of an eye, the battle was over.","All the disciples—Inner Court and Core alike—had been captured, their spiritual energy sealed, their struggles rendered meaningless.","\"No! I don't want to die!\"","The captured disciples began crying out, their voices filled with a mix of terror and shame.","They trembled, not just from fear, but from the crushing realization of their own weakness. They had only needed to hold out for a few minutes—just enough time for their sect's reinforcements to arrive. Yet, they had failed.","In less than two minutes, they had been completely subdued, their spiritual energy sealed, their bodies restrained like helpless mortals.","Tears welled in their eyes as frustration and despair settled in. They had trained for years, striving to become stronger, yet when it mattered most, their strength had meant nothing.","Their captors, the Demon Worshippers, stood over them in silent mockery, as if their struggle had been nothing more than an inevitable conclusion.","\"Bring them all away,\" said one of the Demon Worshippers.","However, just as the Demon Worshippers began lifting the subdued disciples, carrying them like mere luggage, a voice suddenly echoed through the icy air.","\"I thought I was smelling things, but sure enough, it's the stench of demonic energy.\"","The chilling words sent a ripple of unease through the Demon Worshippers. Their movements halted instantly, and their heads snapped toward the Extreme Yin Lake.","There—where no one had stood before—a masked figure had suddenly appeared out of thin air like a ghost.","However, when the Demon Worshippers noticed this figure was only at the second level of Spirit Enlightenment, they immediately relaxed.","\"Hurry up and kill him. I'll give you three seconds.\"","In response, one of the Demon Worshippers suddenly dropped the disciple in his grasp and lunged at Yuan.","The Demon Worshipper reached Yuan in one second and struck the next. However, in the third second, the Demon Worshipper suddenly stopped moving and collapsed on the ground, his body quickly turning into stone.","The Demon Worshippers were instantly alarmed after seeing their companion turn into a stone statue.","\"That power! He's a Demon Sealer!\" Yuan then spoke in a calm voice, \"Release those girls and surrender yourselves, or I'll turn you all into stone. I'll give you three seconds.\"","Realizing they were against a Demon Sealer, the Demon Worshippers no longer dared to look down on Yuan and decided to fight him together.","They released the disciples and attacked Yuan together, surrounding him from every direction.","There were six Demon Worshippers, and they were all around the Divine Lord level.","Despite being surrounded, Yuan calmly said, \"Your three seconds are up.\"","In response, the Demon Worshippers attacked.","At the same time as the Demon Worshippers attacked Yuan, Sun Ling Cai and the others arrived at the scene.","\"Who is that?! He's fighting six Divine Lord Demon Worshippers by himself! And he's only at the Spirit Enlightenment level!\" Sun Ling Cai almost couldn't believe her eyes when she saw the scene."]},{"number":1917,"title":"Chapter 1917 Fighting the Demon Worshippers(2)","paragraphs":["Although Sun Ling Cai wanted to intervene and help the masked individual, her curiosity got the best of her, and she decided to watch him a little longer.","As for Sect Leader Yun, she couldn't care less and immediately went to save her disciples the moment she noticed them.","\"Sect Leader! You're here!\"","The disciples cried tears of joy when they saw her beautiful face.","\"Are you all okay?!\" Sect Leader Yun asked them as she destroyed the black chains that restricted their cultivation.","\"Yes, we're okay. It's all because of him.\"","The disciples pointed at Yuan with their gazes, their eyes filled with admiration and gratitude.","\"That must be Senior Sister Tan's companion...\" Sect Leader Yun mumbled as she stared at Yuan, who was emitting a profound yin aura.","'That aura! He's attained Super Ice Resistance!' she cried inwardly. Despite cultivating in the Extreme Yin Lake for decades herself, she'd only managed to achieve Powerful Ice Resistance, which was one tier weaker than Yuan's Super Ice Resistance.","In just a few hours, Yuan had managed to upgrade his Weak Ice Resistance by two whole tiers, an unthinkable speed of progression for most.","After spending a few moments effortlessly dodging the Demon Worshippers' attacks, Yuan finally countered—using nothing but his bare hands.","His movements were swift and precise, flowing like water, yet carrying the force of a raging tempest. With every shift of his body, he evaded strikes with almost inhuman ease, making it seem as though he was merely playing with his enemies.","Despite wielding no weapon, the Demon Worshippers didn't dare to underestimate his attacks.","It wasn't his physical strength that frightened them—it was the Demon Sealing Aura radiating from his very being. To them, that aura was more terrifying than any weapon, capable of sealing their very existence if they weren't careful.","However, they quickly realized how futile their efforts were. Much like how the Inner Court Disciples struggled to fight back, the six of them were being pressured despite outnumbering him.","Soon, Yuan landed a strike on one of the Demon Worshippers, instantly turning him into stone.","\"To seal his opponent so quickly—what powerful Demon Sealing Aura!\" Sun Ling Cai cried out in shock, her eyes widening as she witnessed Yuan's effortless suppression of the Demon Worshippers.","As a Master Demon Sealer, very few Demon Sealers surpass her in Demon Sealing Aura within the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto. Yet, this masked individual was clearly much stronger than her. However, there was no way she wouldn't recognize such a powerful Demon Sealer.","\"Seriously, who is that? He's definitely not from the Demon Sealing Clan, but I know of every Master Demon Sealer in the Demon Sealing Grotto, too.\" Sun Ling Cai muttered in a dumbfounded voice.","\"That's our traveling companion, Xiao Yang,\" Tan Songyun said.","\"Xiao Yang? I don't recognize that name. Where did he learn how to use Demon Sealing Aura?\" Sun Ling Cai asked.","Tan Songyun shook her head.","\"I don't know. You'll have to ask him.\" \"There's no way someone with such powerful Demon Sealing Aura isn't affiliated with the Demon Sealing Clan or Demon Sealing Grotto!\" Sun Ling Cai refused to believe that some random cultivator could have such a strong Demon Sealing Aura.","After all, while one could learn Demon Sealing Aura through techniques, it wouldn't reach the level of Master Demon Sealer without guidance from an expert Demon Sealer.","By the time their conversation ended, Yuan had dealt with all but one Demon Worshipper.","\"P-Please, spare me...\"","The Demon Worshipper gave up resistance and began begging for his life.","\"Oh? You're begging for your life despite selling your soul to the demons? How ironic. Don't worry, I won't completely seal you. After all, I have some questions for you.\"","Yuan suddenly raised his leg and kicked the Demon Worshipper in the groins. The Demon Worshipper cried out loud in pain, and soon, everything but his head turned to stone.","\"Not only is his Demon Sealing Aura powerful, but his control over it is monstrous!\" Sun Ling Cai swallowed nervously.","'If he's not affiliated with the Demon Sealing Grotto already, I must bring him over to our side!'","Once it was clear that Yuan had dealt with the Demon Worshippers, Sect Leader Yun approached him and bowed, \"Thank you. If it weren't for your assistance, more of my disciples would've been kidnapped by those bastards.\"","\"There's no need to thank me. I was merely dealing with pests.\"","Tan Songyun and the others appeared shortly after.","Before Xi Meili or Tan Songyun could even speak, Sun Ling Cai rushed over and introduced herself, \"Hello, I'm Sun Ling Cai. You're Xiao Yang, correct?\"","'She's...'","Yuan instantly recognized Sun Ling Cai, as she was one of the Divine Paragon's Fanatic. Moreover, she was the one who painted him at the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library, even giving him a necklace afterward.","'What's she doing in the Sixth Heaven?' he wondered inwardly.","Yuan wanted to reveal his true identity to her, but he wasn't sure if he could trust her, especially when he was being hunted as a demon, so he decided to continue acting as Xiao Yang for the time being.","\"Yes, I am Xiao Yang.\"","Sun Ling Cai continued speaking, \"I am actually a Master Demon Sealer from the Demon Sealing Clan, and I cannot help but notice your powerful Demon Sealing Aura. Yet, I don't recognize you. Are you affiliated with the Demon Sealing Clan or the Demon Sealing Grotto?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before nodding, \"I am somewhat affiliated with the Demon Sealing Clan. Do you know Yan Hara?\"","\"Senior Sister Yan? Of course, I know her! We're practically family! What is your relationship with her?\" Sun Ling Cai was pleasantly surprised to learn that Yuan was not only affiliated with the Demon Sealing Clan but even knew Yan Hara, but this raised more questions.","\"Our relationship is a little complicated, but we're definitely quite close with each other. How's she been lately? I haven't seen her in a while.\" Yuan decided to learn more about Yan Hara's situation."]},{"number":1918,"title":"Chapter 1918 Extracting Their Memories","paragraphs":["\"Senior Sister Yan's situation, huh?\" An awkward expression appeared on Sun Ling Cai's face. \"It's a bit complicated.\"","Seeing Sun Ling Cai's expression, Yuan frowned and asked, \"Did something bad happen to her?\"","\"What? Oh, it's nothing like that, but... it might take some time to explain, so let's continue this chat later.\" Sun Ling Cai's gaze shifted to the sealed Demon Worshipper.","Yuan realized what she was trying to say and nodded, \"You're right. Let's continue this conversation after we deal with the Demon Worshippers. I was going to interrogate them, but if you have other plans, please let me know.\"","\"That's exactly what I was going to do,\" Sun Ling Cai said. \"I need to know more about their activities.\"","Sect Leader Yun then spoke, \"In that case, you can interrogate them at my sect. I'll prepare a place for you.\"","\"Thank you.\"","While they brought the Demon Worshippers to the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, Tan Songyun asked Yuan, \"What about your training?\"","\"It's done. Even if I continued training at the Extreme Yin Lake, my cold resistance wouldn't improve further... No, to be more accurate, it'll take too long to see any decent improvements.\"","\"Already? It's only been half a day since you started training at the Extreme Yin Lake...\" Tan Songyun looked at him with a dumbfounded face.","Yuan silently shrugged.","Upon arriving at the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, Sect Leader Yun sent all of the disciples to medical to ensure they were not injured before arranging a place for Sun Ling Cai and Yuan to interrogate the Demon Worshippers.","\"N-No matter what you do to me, I won't say anything!\" the partially sealed Demon Worshipper exclaimed, his voice trembling with defiance as he was forcibly placed inside a prison. His body felt heavy, and his spiritual energy was completely suppressed by Yuan's Demon Sealing Aura.","\"I don't doubt it. You probably can't reveal anything even if you wanted to,\" Sun Ling Cai calmly remarked.","It was common practice among Demon Worshippers to curse themselves, a ruthless safeguard ensuring their secrets remained buried.","These self-inflicted curses acted as a deadly failsafe—if a Demon Worshipper even attempted to reveal any information, their body would detonate instantly, reducing them to nothing but blood and ash before a single word could leave their lips. Because of this, interrogating Demon Worshippers was notoriously difficult.","Sun Ling Cai continued in a cold voice, \"Unfortunately for you, I have plenty of ways to extract information from you without even needing you to open your mouth. However, these methods are quite cruel and have a high chance of killing you. Even if you somehow manage to survive, you'll most certainly be crippled for life. These methods are too cruel to use on humans, but you're a Demon Worshipper—pests that cannot be considered humans.\"","The Demon Worshipper's face twisted with fear and horror after hearing such words.","Sun Ling Cai turned to Yuan and asked, \"You don't mind, right?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"You can skin him alive for all I care. Once you're done with him, I'll unseal the others so that you can interrogate them as well.\"","\"Thank you for your assistance.\"","In the next moment, Sun Ling Cai retrieved a massive paintbrush, its size comparable to that of a greatsword. With a swift, deliberate motion, she pressed the tip of the brush against the Demon Worshipper's forehead.","For a brief moment, nothing happened. Then—she suddenly swiped the brush in a perfect arc, and from the Demon Worshipper's forehead, a black orb of light was forcibly dragged out, writhing with a sinister energy.","Without hesitation, Sun Ling Cai guided the orb toward an empty scroll she had prepared. The moment the black orb entered the painting, the scroll came to life, ink flowing across its surface as a picture quickly formed.","As for the Demon Worshipper, the moment the black orb of light was forcibly extracted, he let out a bloodcurdling scream, his voice laced with sheer agony.","His face convulsed violently, with veins bulging as if something within him was being ripped apart. It was as though the very essence of his existence was being forcefully unraveled.","The hysterical screams lasted for only a brief moment before his head suddenly went limp. Just like that, the Demon Worshipper perished.","\"I have extracted the memories of that Demon Worshipper, but I could only extract about ten years—his last ten years. Hopefully, there is something useful.\" Sun Ling Cai said as she poured her spiritual energy into the painting.","A glowing string appeared from the painting and attached itself to Sun Ling Cai's forehead, showing the Demon Worshipper's last ten years of memories.","Sometime later, Sun Ling Cai opened her eyes and shook her head with a disappointed expression.","\"He was just a lackey. Besides being ordered to capture female maidens, he didn't know anything. Do you want to take a look? It's quite nasty, so I don't really recommend it,\" Sun Ling Cai looked at Yuan.","\"No, it's fine.\" Yuan politely refused. Although Sun Ling Cai acted nonchalantly, reading another's memory was a dangerous act.","Memories were not just images and thoughts; they carried the essence of a person's experiences, emotions, and even their will.","To extract and absorb them was to open oneself to the lingering traces of the person's soul, an act that could be incredibly dangerous, especially when dealing with Demon Worshippers, whose very existence was steeped in corruption.","If Sun Ling Cai wasn't careful, the malice and twisted beliefs of the Demon Worshipper could seep into her consciousness, corrupting her own thoughts and emotions.","However, Yuan wasn't worried the memories could corrupt him. He just didn't want to subject himself to such unpleasant memories, especially when it wasn't necessary.","\"But if it gets too hard for you, I can look at them instead,\" he said.","Sun Ling Cai smiled and said, \"You don't have to worry about me. I've extracted hundreds of Demon Worshippers' memories before without any issues.\""]},{"number":1919,"title":"Chapter 1919 Yan Hara’s Situation","paragraphs":["\"You're a Master Demon Sealer. I don't qualify to worry about you,\" Yuan chuckled.","\"That's not true. Your Demon Sealing Aura is powerful enough to qualify as a Master Demon Sealer—if you aren't one already.\"","\"I'm definitely not a Master Demon Sealer.\"","\"If you say so...\"","Sun Ling Cai continued to extract the memories of the next Demon Worshipper after Yuan partially unsealed them.","Once again, the Demon Worshipper released an ear-piercing scream when Sun Ling Cai extracted his memories with a calm expression on her face, clearly unaffected by it.","A few moments later, the Demon Worshipper went limp, his life extinguished.","This continued for several more times—until Sun Ling Cai extracted the memories from all of the captured Demon Worshippers. In the end, only one of them had managed to survive, but he had been crippled so badly that he couldn't even utter a word properly. However, he didn't live long, as Sect Leader Yun ended his misery shortly after.","\"Did you learn anything?\" Sect Leader Yun asked afterward.","Sun Ling Cai nodded and said, \"It appears there are several backgrounds involved. The Ling Family, Cheng Family, Red Saber Mountain, and the Purple Rain Monastery. Are you familiar with these names?\"","Sect Leader Yun's eyes widened with surprise after hearing these names, and she quickly said, \"Of course! The Ling Family is a prominent name in the business industry. The Cheng Family are renowned for their sword techniques and for producing many powerful swordmasters. As for the Red Saber Mountain and Purple Rain Monastery, they're both above-average sects. How are they involved?\"","\"From the memories I extracted, the Demon Worshippers we've captured belong to these places. Their positions within these places aren't very high except for one of them, who turned out to be a sect elder of the Purple Rain Monastery.\"","\"Their mission was to capture females who are still maidens and bring them to a certain area within the Smoldering Desert. I'll be heading there soon. Hopefully, I will find your missing disciples there.\"","\"I will come with you!\" Sect Leader Yun declared without hesitation.","Sun Ling Cai raised an eyebrow and said, \"I don't doubt your strength, but the environment there is quite harsh, especially for yin-attribute cultivators such as yourself. There's also a good chance we might encounter a demon there.\"","\"T-That's...\"","\"I also need someone to deal with the Ling Family and the other three. You can deal with them while I deal with the Smoldering Desert.\"","\"I'll come with you,\" Yuan suddenly said.","Sun Ling Cai immediately nodded, \"I can definitely use your help.\"","Despite Yuan's low cultivation, Sun Ling Cai couldn't underestimate him, who could fight cultivators several realms above his cultivation.","\"What about us?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"You should assist Sect Leader Yun,\" Yuan said. \"Alright.\"","\"Lead the way,\" Yuan said to Sun Ling Cai, who retrieved a flying treasure and gestured for him to ride it.","Yuan jumped onto the flying treasure, which took the appearance of a painting and flew away with Sun Ling Cai.","While they traveled, Sun Ling Cai spoke, \"Since we have some time now, let's continue our conversation.\"","\"Is Yan Hara in trouble?\" Yuan asked.","\"Before I answer that, I must ask you... What exactly is your relationship with the Demon Sealing Clan and Senior Sister Yan?\"","\"This is my relationship.\"","Yuan retrieved his Elite Demon Sealer's identification badge and showed it to her.","\"You're an Elite Demon Sealer? With that level of Demon Sealing Aura? I don't believe it.\"","\"It's been a while since I visited the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library, so I haven't gotten the chance to improve my rank. As for my relationship with Yan Hara... Sorry if this seems rude, but I cannot fully trust you.\"","Sun Ling Cai narrowed her eyes at Yuan's face—mask—and fell silent.","After a moment of silence, she spoke, \"Senior Sister Yan has started gathering people for her own faction within the Demon Sealing Clan—one that directly opposes the current leader. Of course, she didn't openly admit this, but her intentions are clear to everyone.\"","\"I don't know how much you know about the Demon Sealing Clan's current leader, but he is someone who fought desperately to reach his position, and someone like that won't let his position be threatened. Fortunately, because of the Demon Worshippers' activity, as well as the Demon Sealing Grotto's pressure, he has his hands full right now and cannot deal with Senior Sister Yan.\"","\"However, I'm afraid that once things calm down, he will start clashing with Senior Sister Yan. Although Senior Sister Yan is very powerful, with connections to many influential figures in the clan, the leader has about 90 percent of the Demon Sealing Clan on his side. It won't be an easy fight.\"","Hearing this, Yuan asked, \"What about you? Are you with Yan Hara?\"","\"Of course. We've known each other even before we joined the Demon Sealing Clan. The only thing preventing us from being real sisters is our blood. That's why I am very offended to hear you doubt me.\"","\"Sorry, but as you said, Yan Hara has essentially made herself a target within the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"It's not that extreme... yet. At this moment, Senior Sister Yan is just gathering trustworthy people to her side, which isn't against the rules or anything, and until she does something that directly clashes with the Clan Leader, she's not in danger.\"","\"Where is she right now?\" Yuan then asked.","\"I'm not sure, but she's definitely on a mission to deal with the Demon Worshippers right now. Hell, we're still looking for some ridiculously powerful demon that was last spotted in the Fourth Heaven.\"","Yuan's body stiffened after hearing Sun Ling Cai's last several words.","\"Ridiculously powerful demon in the Fourth Heaven?\" he repeated.","\"Yes. This demon was first spotted a few years ago in the Fourth Heaven by some people from the Nine Heavens Law and Order,\" Sun Ling Cai started with a shrug.","\"However, the description they gave is ridiculous—and quite frankly, nobody in the Demon Sealing Clan truly believes it exists.\""]},{"number":1920,"title":"Chapter 1920 Smoldering Desert","paragraphs":["\"This is my first time hearing about such a demon. Can you tell me more about it?\" Yuan asked.","Sun Ling Cai nodded and said, \"Then let me tell you what the Nine Heavens Law and Order told us. They claimed this demon was only at the Spirit King level when they first encountered it. Yet, this demon was able to overpower several immortals who have restricted their cultivation to the Divine King realm.\"","\"The demon wielded two Soul Weapons, a spear and a sword. They even claimed the demon was able to use Enhanced Sword Aura. They also claimed that this demon was able to regenerate from complete annihilation and even had the aura of a beast. Ridiculous, isn't it? Who would believe that such a demon would exist?\"","It was common knowledge that demons don't use weapons, let alone Soul Weapons, and if they did, these weapons would be crafted from their own blood. Moreover, a demon using Sword Aura was unheard of, much less Enhanced Sword Aura.","\"I have never heard of a demon using Soul Weapons before,\" Yuan remarked.","\"Right?\"","Sun Ling Cai suddenly fell silent.","After a slight pause, she looked at Yuan with a doubtful expression and spoke, \"Now that I think about it, are you suppressing your true cultivation? There's no way you're only at the second level of Spirit Enlightenment, right? After all, you were able to overpower those Demon Worshippers, who were all Divine Lords.\"","\"I'll leave that to your imagination,\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"...\"","'Even if he's suppressed his cultivation, it still wouldn't make sense how he was able to fight several Demon Worshippers who were four realms stronger than him...' Sun Ling Cai thought to herself.","Even if Yuan were a Cultivation God, since he suppressed his cultivation to Spirit Enlightenment, his prowess would only be around that level. Even if his techniques were superior, it would be extremely hard to compensate for four entire realms of power difference.","'His prowess is similar to that demon...'","Although Sun Ling Cai compared Yuan's fighting prowess to the demon, she didn't entertain the possibility that they were the same individual, even for a split second. Sometime later, they arrived at the Smoldering Desert, a vast, desolate expanse where the air shimmered with intense heat and the landscape stretched endlessly with blazing sand dunes.","There was no sign of civilization—only scorching winds, searing sunlight, and the ever-present danger of magical beasts that had long adapted to the harsh environment.","\"How are you feeling? If the heat becomes too unbearable, let me know,\" Sun Ling Cai said as she veiled her body with a thick layer of spiritual energy that was constantly being melted away from the intense heat.","\"I'll be fine,\" Yuan calmly responded. Due to his Fire Harmony, not only did he not feel the heat, but it was even comfortable for him.","'The way the heat is naturally being absorbed into his body... no way... he's achieved Fire Harmony...?' Sun Ling Cai swallowed nervously after realizing this. There was almost no doubt in her mind that Yuan was hiding his true cultivation, as she couldn't fathom someone at the Spirit Enlightenment achieving Fire Harmony.","\"Once we arrive at our destination, if we encounter any demons, please let me handle them. I'm not doubting your ability to seal demons, but I am on a mission, and I am technically your senior. However, if there is more than one demon, I'll probably need your help,\" Sun Ling Cai said as they neared their destination.","Yuan nodded, \"I'll deal with the Demon Worshippers and secure the kidnapped victims—if they are still alive—while you deal with the demon.\"","Sometime later, Sun Ling Cai stopped the flying treasure above an empty area and said as she looked down, \"They are beneath the sand. I can sense them. Out of the 42 presences I sense, only three of them have demonic energy. It's safe to assume that the other 39 are all kidnapped individuals.\"","She continued, \"As for the three with demonic energy... I'm certain that one of them is a demon. The other two are just Demon Worshippers, but they are both at the Divine Ancestor level. I'll leave them to you.\"","\"Sure,\" Yuan agreed without hesitation.","\"I'm going in.\"","Sun Ling Cai tilted the flying treasure, angling it sharply until its front pointed directly toward the ground.","Without hesitation, it plunged downward, cutting through the sand like a blade through silk.","As they descended, the surface layer of sand gave way to reveal a hidden subterranean chamber—a spacious area filled with towering pillars of compressed sand, sculpted over time.","To their surprise, the scorching heat of the desert vanished almost instantly upon entry. Down here, the air was cool and still, a stark contrast to the inferno above, as if they had crossed into an entirely different world beneath the sand.","The 42 individuals also came into view.","Thirty-nine of them were bound tightly by black chains, their spiritual energy completely suppressed, leaving them weak and unable to resist. They sat or lay scattered across the sandy ground, expressions filled with exhaustion, fear, or quiet defiance.","Not far from them, two humans stood watch. However, they seemed relaxed, their postures casual and unfocused—as if they didn't see the captives as a threat, nor expected any kind of interruption.","\"I'll leave them to you,\" Sun Ling Cai said.","\"Of course.\"","Yuan immediately jumped off the flying treasure, landing between the two Demon Worshippers and the captives. Meanwhile, Sun Ling Cai flew toward the demon, who was slumbering not too far away.","\"What the fuck?! Who are you?! And how did you find this place?!\" The Demon Worshippers were immediately alerted by their sudden invasion, but they quickly relaxed upon seeing Yuan's cultivation base.","\"Your friends from the Red Saber Mountain told us,\" Yuan said as he retrieved Number One Under Heaven, seemingly intent on finishing this as soon as possible.","\"The Red Saber Mountain?! Bullshit! There's no way they would betray us!\" The Demon Worshippers exclaimed as they also withdrew their weapons."]},{"number":1921,"title":"Chapter 1921 Rescuing the Captives","paragraphs":["The moment the Demon Worshippers retrieved their weapons, Yuan wasted no time attacking them. Coincidentally, the Demon Worshippers were also wielding swords, and they were bewildered when they failed to activate their swords' ability to block Yuan's attack, almost as if an unseen force had sealed their swords.","\"Wha—?!\"","\"My sword?!\"","Yuan took advantage of their brief moment of shock and landed two swift and seemingly non-lethal strikes.","At first, the Demon Worshippers didn't think much of the superficial injury they had received—a minor scratch at best. With a sneer, they quickly backed away from Yuan, unconcerned.","But mere moments later, their expressions began to change.","A strange stiffness crept through their limbs, slow at first, then rapidly intensifying. Their movements grew sluggish, their muscles locking up as an unnatural weight settled over their bodies.","Panic flickered in their eyes as they realized the truth. Their bodies were turning to stone—they were being sealed.","\"T-This is—?!\"","The two Demon Worshippers couldn't believe how quickly they had been defeated. And it was done by a mere Spirit Enlightenment cultivator. Yet, neither of them appeared too concerned for some reason.","They looked at Yuan and sneered coldly, \"Don't think this is the end. You'll realize what a horrible mistake you've made so—\"","\"Our Master will not let this—\"","Their sentence was interrupted when they were fully sealed.","After sealing the Demon Worshippers, Yuan went to help the captives by removing the black chains that suppressed their cultivation.","Meanwhile, Sun Ling Cai immediately began working on sealing the demon after disturbing its rest.","The demon didn't have any visible crystal on its outer appearance, meaning it was at least a Demon General. It also had the cultivation of a peak Immortal Ascension.","Sun Ling Cai was also at the peak of Immortal Ascension since that was the limit of the Sixth Heaven. Yet, she wasn't worried about her opponent being a Demon General.","Sun Ling Cai fought with an elegance that bordered on artistry, almost as if she were painting. Her massive brush moved through the air in fluid, sweeping strokes, each motion resembling the graceful flourish of a master painter.","But instead of ink and parchment, her canvas was the demon before her, and each stroke of the brush carried the weight of Demon Sealing Aura.","Unlike Yuan, whose Demon Sealing Aura was powerful enough to seal demons near his level in a single strike, Sun Ling Cai had to slowly accumulate it in the demon, slowly sealing it.","While Sun Ling Cai wasn't overwhelming her opponent, she wasn't pressured by the demon either and even had the leisure to speak while she fought it.","\"You demons and your worshippers have been lurking in the shadows since the Demon Sealing Clan defeated most of the demons during the Demonic Era,\" Sun Ling Cai said coldly, her brush continuously striking the demon.","\"What changed? Why are your worshippers suddenly acting so bold and brazen?\"","The demon, despite slowly being sealed, smiled provocatively and responded in an amused tone, \"A new era is coming.\"","\"What?\" Sun Ling Cai frowned at such ominous words. \"Do you really think demons will rule the world again? How foolish! The only reason you demons even managed to rule humans during the Demonic Era was due to the massive casualties caused by the Heavenly War of Immortals and Gods that greatly diminished our population of powerhouses!\"","\"Our numbers are not only much greater than before, but our strength has also improved drastically since then—incomparably so! Meanwhile, all you demons have done since your defeat is hide and starve in the shadows!\"","The demon laughed uncontrollably at Sun Ling Cai's words, which wasn't wrong. If the Heavenly War of Immortals and Gods hadn't claimed so many lives, humans might not have been enslaved by the demons.","Although demons are immortal, that immortality does not equate to limitless power. Like humans and beasts, demons require resources to grow—specifically flesh and blood, the raw essence of life. Without it, their strength stagnates and slowly decays.","Since the end of the Demonic Era, demons have been forced into hiding with few opportunities to feed or cultivate their strength. Meanwhile, humankind has flourished, building powerful sects, expanding across realms, and growing ever stronger with access to abundant spiritual resources.","\"What you experienced and witnessed during the Demonic Era was only a fraction of our Demon Clan's true power!\" the demon roared, its voice laced with hatred and madness.","\"Soon, you livestock will learn what true fear is—and once again, you will live beneath our feet like the worms you are!\"","Its eyes gleamed with a sinister light as it stepped forward, unfazed by the Demon Sealing Aura assaulting it.","\"You may have defeated us back then, but it was only because of the Divine Paragon! Without him, you humans are nothing! Worthless insects!\"","Then, its gaze narrowed on Sun Ling Cai and continued with a mocking sneer.","\"And you so-called Demon Sealers... You've grown weak—so much weaker than before! Your end is coming... and this time, there will be no one to save you! Hahahaha...!\"","A chilling laugh erupted from its throat right before it was fully sealed.","Although she had successfully sealed the demon, Sun Ling Cai felt no relief, no sense of victory or pride. If anything, a heavy unease settled over her heart.","She took a deep breath and sighed, \"Whatever these bastards are up to, we'll definitely stop it!\"","Meanwhile, moments before Sun Ling Cai sealed the demon.","\"Everything will be fine now,\" Yuan said to the captives as he released them.","\"W-What about the demon?\" one of them asked.","\"I came here with a Master Demon Sealer from the Demon Sealing Clan, and she's dealing with it now. There won't be any issue since there's only one of them.\"","\"N-No!\" The young lady's face exclaimed, her voice filled with horror. \"There is more than one demon here!\"","Just as Sun Ling Cai turned to leave, her body suddenly froze mid-step.","A new presence had emerged—not far from where she stood—and it was like a crushing wave of malice crashing down upon her senses.","Her instincts screamed in alarm. This wasn't just another demon. Its aura was unlike anything she had ever encountered. It was cold, suffocating, and utterly overwhelming, filled with a primordial hatred that seemed to rot the very air around it.","A chill ran down her spine.","Something terrifying had arrived."]},{"number":1922,"title":"Chapter 1922 The Sudden Appearance of a Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["After sensing the overwhelming malicious presence, Sun Ling Cai had to force herself to turn around. Every instinct in her body warned her to run, yet she stood her ground.","At first, she saw nothing—just the empty, distorted air ahead, heavy with oppressive energy. But then, a silhouette began to take shape, emerging slowly from the shadows as if reality itself were bending to make way for it.","Each step it took was deliberate, and with every step, the pressure grew heavier, colder—like a noose tightening around her soul.","'A second demon? How is that possible?! My divine sense has been active and surrounding this place ever since we entered, yet I only just sensed it! Did it teleport in here just now?' Sun Ling Cai couldn't fathom how she could've missed this demon, who was emitting a ridiculous amount of demonic energy.","\"To think I'd return to intruders... I only left for a couple of minutes, too.\"","The silhouette spoke as it emerged from the shadow, revealing its appearance.","Just like the Demon General, this demon did not appear to have a crystal outside its body. However, its demonic energy and presence was several times stronger than the Demon General, which could only mean one thing.","\"A Demon Emperor...\" Sun Ling Cai muttered under her breath, her voice barely audible, laced with tension.","She clenched her fists tightly, her jaw locking as pure fear crawled down her spine.","After spending just a few moments in its presence, she began to recognize the undeniable familiarity in the aura. It was nearly identical to the one she had felt during the Supreme Demon Sealer Examination a few years ago.","The Demon Emperor before Sun Ling Cai was not the same one at the examination. It was a new one that she'd never heard of or seen before.","'Fuck, what should I do?' Sun Ling Cai could only stand there and ponder her limited options as the Demon Emperor slowly approached.","Although both she and the Demon Emperor had their cultivation sealed to the peak of Immortal Ascension, Sun Ling Cai wasn't confident she'd be able to face this Demon Emperor even if she had her full cultivation and the demon didn't.","She could try running away, but that would bring shame to her status as a Master Demon Sealer, not to mention Yuan and the captives were not far away from her. If she ran, they would most certainly die. The Demon Emperor suddenly stopped before the sealed Demon General. After a brief pause, it placed its palm on the sealed demon and began infusing demonic energy into it. A moment later, cracks began appearing on the sealed demon.","'It's unsealing the other demon?!'","Seeing this, Sun Ling Cai instinctively attacked the Demon Emperor.","Without even glancing in Sun Ling Cai's direction, the Demon Emperor casually flicked its hand, a motion so effortless it almost seemed dismissive.","In that instant, a massive wave of demonic energy surged forth—thick, black, and seething with malice.","It struck Sun Ling Cai like a collapsing mountain, the sheer force of it leaving no room to resist. Her body was violently repelled, sent flying through the air as if she were nothing more than a leaf caught in a storm.","By the time Sun Ling Cai stabilized herself, which only took a second, the sealed demon was released from its stone prison.","\"I apologize for my incompetence, Emperor.\" The Demon General kneeled before the Demon Emperor.","The Demon Emperor calmly gazed upon the demon and spoke, \"Take care of the other invader. I'll deal with this livestock myself.\"","\"As you command.\"","The Demon General left without any delay, ignoring Sun Ling Cai, who could only watch as it disappeared. 'He should be fine...' Sun Ling Cai wasn't too worried for Yuan, who she was sure was hiding his true cultivation. 'I won't be able to defeat this Demon Emperor by myself, so I can only try to hold it off until he defeats that Demon General...'","Sun Ling Cai could only rely on Yuan's assistance to defeat this Demon Emperor, but even that seemed unlikely.","According to what she heard from others in the Demon Sealing Clan, it took their Clan Leader, as well as two Supreme Demon Sealers, to capture the other Demon Emperor, and they were all at full strength.","Meanwhile, she was only a Master Demon Sealer. It'd take a miracle for her to hold off the Demon Emperor for a few minutes, let alone seal it.","'Let's just focus on defense until Xiao Yang arrives...' Sun Ling Cai thought to herself as she prepared to fight the Demon Emperor, who merely stood there in silence.","At the same time, the Demon General appeared before Yuan and the captives, who were trembling in fear due to the Demon Emperor's presence that filled the entire space there. The pressure was so terrifying and suffocating that the captives couldn't even stand up despite their cultivation returning, let alone escape.","\"Spirit Enlightenment? How did a weakling like you seal those two idiots?\" The Demon General narrowed its eyes at Yuan after accessing the situation, its gaze filled with confusion.","\"Don't worry, you'll experience it for yourself in just a moment,\" Yuan calmly said.","\"Hmph! Ridiculous!\" The Demon General sneered.","Yuan turned to face the captives and said, \"Close your eyes. All of you. It'll be over in just a moment.\"","Hearing his soothing voice, calm and steady like a gentle breeze, the captives felt an unexpected sense of comfort wash over them. Without realizing it, they all began to close their eyes tightly.","\"Normally, I'd use you to entertain me before I kill you. Unfortunately, I don't have the time today since I need to help that girl as soon as possible, so if you don't mind—\"","The Demon General interrupted with a cold laugh, \"Using me as entertainment? I should be saying that to you!\"","In a fit of rage, the Demon General lunged toward Yuan—or at least, it tried to.","But the moment it moved, its body suddenly froze, locked in place by an unseen force.","Confusion flashed across its face as it looked down to find several sword-shaped lights piercing through its body, glowing with pure, radiant energy that sizzled against its flesh.","\"W-What? Where did this come from?\" it muttered in a daze, eyes wide with disbelief as it sensed an unfamiliar sensation—pain.","[Swords of Eternal Torment]","When the Demon General lifted its head up again, Yuan was already standing right before it with a humble-looking red sword in his grasp.","The Demon General's eyes widened some more after sensing the terrifying Demon Sealing Aura being emitted by the sword, and its body trembled in fear as it recalled this forgotten feeling called fear.","\"T-That sword! Why do you—\"","Yuan flicked his arm, and with a surreal grace, he swung the blade in a perfect horizontal arc, its path tracing cleanly across the demon's neck.","The movement was strange. Slow and fast all at once. There was no wasted motion, no dramatic flourish, and the demon's head came cleanly off, its body completely sealed in an instant, long before its head could even reach the ground.","Thud.","The demon's head hit the sand with a muffled thud, sinking slightly into the soft grains, and its face was locked in a terrified expression, wide eyes filled with the dawning horror of realization."]},{"number":1923,"title":"Chapter 1923 Facing the Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["After sealing the Demon General, Yuan said to the captives trembling in fear behind him, \"You can open your eyes again. I have dealt with the demon.\"","When the captives opened their eyes, their faces became filled with shock after seeing the sealed demon. After all, only a few seconds had passed since they were told to close their eyes.","'He sealed a Demon General in seconds?! How is that even possible?!'","The captives couldn't comprehend it.","Yuan continued, \"Unfortunately, there is still a demon that needs to be dealt with. Stay here and don't move until I return. Otherwise, I won't be able to guarantee your safety.\"","Without waiting for their response, Yuan left the scene and moved toward the Demon Emperor's presence.","Meanwhile, Sun Ling Cai started her battle with the Demon Emperor shortly after the Demon General left.","\"If you're not going to attack, I'll come to you,\" the Demon Emperor spoke as it slowly approached Sun Ling Cai.","Gritting her teeth, Sun Ling Cai quickly pulled out several paintings and threw them into the air. They floated around them, forming a circle. Moments later, the scrolls opened up, releasing a wave of Demon Sealing Aura that created a protective barrier.","The purpose of the barrier was to weaken any demons caught within, much like Yuan's Demon Sealing Zone. However, the Demon Emperor didn't so much as flinch, standing unaffected as though the aura had no effect on it at all.","\"You Demon Sealers have truly fallen. Compared to those of the past, your Demon Sealing Aura is laughably weak,\" the Demon Emperor said, his voice laced with both mockery and disappointment.","Sun Ling Cai did her best to ignore the Demon Emperor's taunts and continued to bombard it with Demon Sealing Aura. But with the Demon Emperor treating her attacks as no more than empty air, the vast gap between them quickly became undeniable—and overwhelming.","The Demon Emperor suddenly vanished from Sun Ling Cai's sight, and in the blink of an eye, before she could even react, she found herself sprawled on the ground, her limbs twisted at unnatural angles.","Sun Ling Cai coughed up a mouthful of blood.","'W-What just happened?!' she screamed inwardly.","Lifting her gaze, she saw the Demon Emperor standing over her, its eyes cold and condescending—like it was merely observing a crushed insect.","\"Consider yourself fortunate. I'd kill you, but your Pure Yin Essence will serve my goals far too well,\" the Demon Emperor remarked coldly.","\"What do you need my Pure Yin Essence for...?\" she asked, her voice strained.","Despite the seemingly brutal state of her body, such injuries were superficial for an Immortal like Sun Ling Cai. As long as her Dantian and soul remained unharmed, she could easily recover from such injuries.","\"What do you think? I'm going to use your Pure Yin Essence to refine the 'key'.\"","\"Key...? Are you trying to unseal the Demonic Realm?!\" she exclaimed.","\"Oh? I guess you're not that clueless, after all.\"","\"Your plan won't succeed! The Demon Sealing Clan will never allow the Demonic Realm to open!\" Sun Ling Cai gritted her teeth.","\"Hahaha! The Demon Sealing Clan? You speak as if you guys have the same power as before! Without the Divine Paragon, you guys are powerless!\"","\"W-We're not alone!\"","\"Are you talking about the Demon Sealing Grotto? Even if there are a hundred of you, it won't change anything. If you want to stop us, you better dig the Divine Paragon out of his grave or something!\"","'Dig the Divine Paragon from his grave? We never even saw his corpse...' Sun Ling Cai sighed inwardly.","The Divine Paragon had vanished without a trace at the end of the Demonic Era. No matter how many resources were poured into searching for him, not a single clue was ever found.","\"It may sound insane, but I truly regret that the Divine Paragon is no longer around,\" the Demon Emperor said, eyes fixed on the sand-carved ceiling. \"The only reason I've made it this far is because of the hatred I bear for that man. I'd give anything to watch him on his knees, begging for his life...\"","\"That's not quite right.\"","A new voice echoed through the air, calm yet unmistakably firm.","The Demon Emperor's eyes narrowed as he turned toward the masked figure standing silently in the distance.","\"You're only standing there now because you ran away—tail tucked between your legs like a frightened cat.\"","Yuan spoke calmly as he walked toward them, his eyes fixed on Sun Ling Cai, who was lying on the ground with all of her limbs twisted in a gruesome manner. However, he wasn't too concerned about her condition since he could tell that her life wasn't in danger.","\"What happened to the demon I sent after you? I can't sense his presence—but there's no way he would've fled,\" the Demon Emperor questioned Yuan after realizing this, not even entertaining the possibility that the Demon General had been sealed in such a short time by a Spirit Enlightenment cultivator.","\"And I can't just ignore what you said. Ran away like a frightened cat? You'll regret those words.\"","The Demon Emperor remained composed, its calm demeanor betraying utter confidence—like it could crush an insect like Yuan whenever it wished.","\"Isn't it the truth, though? Once you realized you couldn't defeat me, you—along with 'Carnage' and that other Demon Emperor—fled like cowards.\"","The Demon Emperor's expression darkened. It wasn't because Yuan had struck a nerve with facts or that he'd mentioned Demon Emperor Carnage by his demon name, something only very few knew, but because he spoke as if they had been the ones retreating from him.","\"Xiao Yang...? What are you...?\" Sun Ling Cai muttered, her eyes wide with disbelief.","Yuan met her gaze and said softly, \"Thank you for not running away and risking your life to face this Demon Emperor. I'll take it from here.\"","Then, without another word, he raised his hand to his mask and slowly removed it.","The moment the Demon Emperor saw Yuan's handsome face, its expression contorted with shock and instinctive fear. Without hesitation, it leapt away from Sun Ling Cai's side and distanced itself.","\"D-Divine Paragon?!\" it exclaimed afterward."]},{"number":1924,"title":"Chapter 1924 Demon Sealing Sword","paragraphs":["Sun Ling Cai stared at Yuan's face, stunned. It was identical to the statue enshrined in the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library—handsome, timeless, and unmistakable.","It had been years since Sun Ling Cai last saw Yuan, and in that time, he had matured. He no longer merely resembled the Divine Paragon—he was his exact likeness, down to the last detail.","\"F-Founder...? That's impossible...\" Sun Ling Cai had spent many years gazing at the Divine Paragon's statue since she joined the Demon Sealing Clan, and as a painter who painted countless pieces of him, there was no way she could mistake his features. Yet even now, she struggled to believe what her eyes were showing her.","\"Your first instinct is to run again? I thought you wanted to see me, Demon Emperor 'Slaughter',\" Yuan said coldly as he walked toward Sun Ling Cai's battered body.","When Yuan reached her side, he retrieved a recovery pill and gently placed it in her mouth. Just as Sun Ling Cai had once been forced to watch the Demon Emperor free the Demon General from his seal, Demon Emperor Slaughter could now only watch helplessly as Yuan healed her—its body paralyzed by fear.","\"Founder... is it really you? Where have you been this entire time?\" Sun Ling Cai asked, her voice trembling as tears streamed down her face.","A faint smile touched Yuan's lips as he replied calmly, \"I'll explain everything once I've handled our little situation here.\"","After treating Sun Ling Cai, Yuan turned to face the Demon Emperor, who looked like it had just seen a ghost.","\"Why do you look so surprised to see me? Didn't Demon Emperor Carnage tell of my return?\" Yuan asked, having assumed the news would've spread after their brief encounter years ago.","\"Carnage knew?! Impossible! We spoke not long ago! He never mentioned anything about your return!\" Demon Emperor Slaughter exclaimed.","\"He didn't? How odd. Well, whatever reason he has for keeping it to himself, I'm not complaining. This works better for me anyway.\"","\"You hateful bastard... how the fuck are you still alive?! It's been hundreds of millions of years since the Demonic Era ended! No human should live that long!\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes. \"If you demons—beings beneath me—can live that long, then why shouldn't I? In case you forgot, let me remind you something—that I won't take my last breath until I eradicate every single demon in existence!\"","Sure enough, Demon Emperor Slaughter can still vividly recall the Divine Paragon always uttering such words whenever they clashed.","\"No! I don't know why you look like the Divine Paragon, but you can't be him! Right! You're only at the level of Spirit Enlightenment, and I can tell that's your real cultivation!\"","\"Since when did my cultivation ever matter?\" Yuan scoffed. \"I wiped out half your race before I even stepped into the Immortal Realm.\"","Demon Emperor Slaughter clenched its jaw in frustration, the bitter memory surfacing once more. During the Demonic Era, the Divine Paragon had defied all logic—slaughtering demons with a cultivation far beneath theirs, turning their pride into shame.","Unlike battles between cultivators, fighting demons hinged on one thing—the strength of one's Demon Sealing Aura, and in that regard, no one even came close to the Divine Paragon.","\"Since you refuse to believe I've truly returned, there's only one option left... I'll beat the reality into you.\"","Yuan retrieved the crimson blade from his spatial ring again—the very sword he had used to seal the Demon General.","\"T-That sword! The Demon Sealing Sword!\"","Demon Emperor Slaughter trembled at the sight of it. That weapon had sealed countless demons, and its presence alone stirred deep, ancestral fear within its core.","\"The Demon Sealing Sword?! The strongest of the Three Demon Sealing Treasures?!\" Sun Ling Cai gasped, just as stunned by its appearance. No one had seen the legendary weapon since the Divine Paragon vanished, and most had long believed it was lost with him.","Upon sensing the Demon Emperor's presence, the Demon Sealing Sword began to tremble, as if quivering with anticipation, eager to taste demonic blood once more.","\"It's been too long since you had a proper meal, hasn't it?\" Yuan murmured to the blade. \"Don't worry... I'll give you a feast soon.\"","Yuan then retrieved another treasure from his spatial ring, and it was another ring.","\"That ring...\"","It took her a moment, but Sun Ling Cai recognized the ring. It was a mysterious treasure that had long rested within the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library treasury. Though its purpose remained unknown, it had astronomical value because it was once owned by the Divine Paragon.","Sure enough, this ring was the Unknown Sealed Ring Yuan had acquired in the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library treasury for 2,000 points after passing his Elite Demon Sealer Examination, and other than the Divine Paragon himself, nobody knew of its true purpose.","Once the ring was in his grasp, Yuan bit his lip until blood welled up, then pressed a gentle kiss to the surface.","<Unknown Sealed Ring has absorbed your blood>","<Unknown Sealed Ring's seal has been lifted>","<Unknown Sealed Ring reveals its true self>","The Unknown Sealed Ring suddenly shattered into countless fragments, each shard drawn toward the Demon Sealing Sword before being absorbed into the blade as if returning to where it truly belonged.","After absorbing the ring, the Demon Sealing Sword erupted with an overwhelming surge of Demon Sealing Aura. The aura was so potent that it began sealing Demon Emperor Slaughter merely by proximity.","<Demon Sealing Sword has awakened>","<Demon Sealing Sword has changed name, becoming Demon Devouring Sword>","<Demon Devouring Sword's Grade has increased>","[Demon Devouring Sword]","[Grade: Celestial]","[Quality: Peak]","[Requirement: Can only be wielded by Player Yuan.]","[Description: Once wielded by the Divine Paragon. Not only does it seal demons, but it can also devour them, using their demonic energy to strengthen itself.]","[Unique Ability: When wielding the Demon Devouring Sword, all Demon Sealing Techniques will have their power amplified by 666,666%.]","[Unique Ability(2): The Demon Devouring Sword can devour demons and their souls, turning them into its own strength.]","[Unique Ability(3): You can summon the soul of demons devoured by the Demon Devouring Sword. Qi consumption increases based on the summoned demon's strength.]","[Unique Ability(4): When Demon Devouring Sword is out, all demons within its vicinity will be greatly weakened, and all demons below Demon Emperor will have their abilities sealed.]"]},{"number":1925,"title":"Chapter 1925 Demon Devouring Sword","paragraphs":["\"Did you know? The Demon Sealing Sword was once an ordinary sword that evolved through the demon blood it was constantly soaked in.\"","Yuan calmly revealed this information as he looked at the sword in his grasp. If it hadn't been protected by his Demon Sealing Aura, the Demon Sealing Sword would've most likely evolved into a cursed treasure instead.","'I need to run!'","At the sight of the Demon Sealing Sword, the Demon Emperor abandoned all thoughts of battle. Fear took hold, and it began desperately searching for a way to escape.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the Demon Emperor, a grin tugging at his lips.","\"That look... Trying to run again?\"","The Demon Emperor's entire being trembled at his words, shock rippling through it. Instinct took over, and it bolted—only to crash against an invisible barrier. Yuan had activated the Demon Sealing Zone long before, silently trapping it within.","\"HAHAHAHA!!!\"","Yuan suddenly burst out laughing, his voice loud enough to shake the space around them.","\"F-Founder...?\" Startled, Sun Ling Cai's body jumped slightly.","\"This is too hilarious! If only you had remained inside your hole after I allowed you to escape the last time, you wouldn't be in this situation, Demon Emperor! If you think you can escape from me a second time, think again!\"","Yuan chased after the Demon Emperor with the Demon Devouring Sword in his grasp, its blade trembling from anticipation.","\"Devour this coward!\" Yuan swung his sword from a distance. In the very next moment, the Demon Emperor's right arm vanished—erased from existence, as if devoured by an unseen force.","Normally, a wound like this would be meaningless to a demon, as their god-like regeneration would restore the damage in an instant. But this time, the Demon Emperor's arm remained gone, as if it had been erased from existence itself.","\"Fuck! You goddamn bastard, Divine Paragon!\" The Demon Emperor roared angrily. Knowing it could not escape, it decided to fight to the death instead and lunged at Yuan.","\"That's more like it!\"","[Dragon Transformation!]","Although Yuan activated Dragon Transformation to bridge the gap in cultivation, the Demon Emperor still held the advantage, remaining slightly faster and stronger than him. Fortunately, the Demon Emperor was missing a limb, and Yuan's regeneration rivaled demons.","Of course, Yuan's most significant advantage was his overwhelming Demon Sealing Aura, which greatly weakened the Demon Emperor's combat prowess. Without it, Yuan wouldn't have stood a chance against it, much less dominate it.","Meanwhile, Sun Ling Cai watched their clash with a dazed, almost dreamlike gaze. When she snapped out of it, she retrieved a blank scroll and her brush. Despite the lingering pain in her still-healing arms, she began to paint, capturing the battle unfolding before her.","'This is it! I was born to witness and paint this scene!'","Sun Ling Cai's eyes sparkled with fervor, her heart pounding, her blood ablaze. Every detail of the battle seared itself into her soul as she poured it all into her painting.","As Yuan and the Demon Emperor continued clashing, the sheer force of their battle grew overwhelming. The surrounding landscape began to crumble under the pressure, collapsing in on itself as their power tore through everything in its path.","Seeing the devastation unfold, Sun Ling Cai quickly used her spiritual energy to shield the captives from afar, even transporting them to safety. Yet she herself remained in the heart of the battlefield, unmoving—unwilling to miss a single moment, even if it meant risking her life to witness and capture history in the making.","\"Stop toying with me, Divine Paragon!\"","The Demon Emperor suddenly roared. It knew Yuan was only messing around since he hasn't used 'devour' again after the first one.","\"Are you in that much of a hurry to die? Then allow me to fulfil your wish!\"","[Devour!]","[Devour!]","[Devour!]","In the blink of an eye, the Demon Emperor's remaining limbs were devoured by the Demon Devouring Sword.","'What kind of ability is that?! Does it have no limit?!'","Sun Ling Cai swallowed hard, her nerves trembling at the Demon Devouring Sword's godlike power. She had believed herself well-versed in its history, having studied every record available. But witnessing it in action shattered that illusion. There was still so much the world didn't know about the Divine Paragon and his Demon Sealing Treasures.","\"THIS ISN'T OVER YET, DIVINE PARAGON!\"","Even with all its limbs erased from existence, the Demon Emperor refused to yield. Its mutilated form still radiated overwhelming menace and bloodlust. Hovering in the air, its body twisted unnaturally, and from its back, two massive, blood-soaked wings burst forth, beating with raw, defiant fury.","\"ENDLESS SLAUGHTER!\"","A crimson barrier, formed from blood and eerily reminiscent of Demon Emperor Carnage's Blood Sphere, suddenly materialized, encasing both Yuan and the Demon Emperor within its ominous glow.","However, before the barrier could fully form, Yuan slashed through it with ease, tearing it apart like fragile paper.","\"What do you think you're doing?\" he said coldly, his voice laced with offense. \"That trick might've worked on other Demon Sealers, but who do you think you're facing? Are you looking down on me, you demon bastard?\"","\"You fucking monster...\" The Demon Emperor gritted its teeth.","Yuan grinned at its words.","\"Let me show you what a real monster looks like...\"","With a single vertical slash, Yuan tore through the air, rending open a gap in space itself.","In the next moment, a figure emerged from the rift, its presence radiating an ominous aura eerily similar to the Demon Emperor's, heavy with malice and bloodlust.","Demon Emperor Slaughter's eyes widened in shock the moment it saw the figure. It wasn't just familiar—it was someone it had once fought alongside, a former comrade from an era long past.","\"Demon Emperor Malice...\" Demon Emperor Slaughter muttered in a dazed voice.","The presence Yuan had summoned with the Demon Devouring Sword was none other than Demon Emperor Malice, one of the Nine Demon Emperors he had slain during the Demonic Era."]},{"number":1926,"title":"Chapter 1926 Devouring the Demon Emperor","paragraphs":["'That level of demonic energy... another Demon Emperor has appeared?! What is happening?!' Sun Ling Cai's jaw dropped after seeing Demon Emperor Malikce's sudden appearance. It was so shocking that it forced her to stop painting briefly.","\"You probably already know this, but in case you don't, 'Malice' was the first Demon Emperor to be slain by me. Although Malice wasn't the strongest amongst the Demon Emperors, he came the closest to defeating me—mostly because I was still inexperienced back then.\" Yuan looked back at their battle as his gaze stared at Demon Emperor Malice, who stood there with a blank look on its face, resembling a soulless puppet. He gave a simple gesture, beckoning the figure forward.","In response, Demon Emperor Malice stepped toward him—and without hesitation, dropped to its knees, then lowered itself further until it was bowing low, its forearms to the ground in a show of absolute submission.","Demon Emperor Slaughter's eyes widened in a mix of shock and fury as it watched Yuan calmly sit atop Demon Emperor Malice's back—using its fellow Demon Emperor as if it were nothing more than a chair.","\"How dare you!\" Demon Emperor Slaughter roared, his aura skyrocketing from rage.","\"Why wouldn't I dare? Once I devour you in a moment, I'll make you wash my clothes or something,\" Yuan casually mocked it.","\"YOU AND I—THE DEMON CLAN—CANNOT COEXIST UNDER THE SAME SKY!\"","Demon Emperor Slaughter roared, unleashing a torrent of bloodlust so overwhelming it seemed to shake the very air around them.","A blood-red aura erupted around Demon Emperor Slaughter as it launched itself at Yuan, recklessly hurling its body forward—completely disregarding its own safety in a frenzy of rage.","\"Why are you stating the obvious? The first thing you demons did after appearing in our world is treat humans as livestock.\" Yuan sneered as he stood up from his seat and prepared to face the approaching Demon Emperor.","[Demon Devouring Strike]","As the Demon Emperor closed in, Yuan swung the Demon Devouring Sword without hesitation. In the blink of an eye, mid-attack, the Demon Emperor vanished—its entire existence seemingly erased, as if it had never been there at all.","<Demon Devouring Sword has devoured Demon Emperor Slaughter>","<Demon Emperor Slaughter can now be summoned through the Demon Devouring Sword>","<Demon Devouring Sword has refined the demonic energy into spiritual energy, which can be absorbed at any time>","\"D-Did you defeat the Demon Emperor?\" Sun Ling Cai suddenly asked, breaking the silence.","\"Yes, it's dealt with now,\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"No way...\" Sun Ling Cai swallowed nervously.","Despite witnessing it herself, she still couldn't believe how easily Yuan had defeated the Demon Emperor, an existence that could threaten the entire Demon Sealing Clan. \"Are you okay?\" Yuan asked as he approached her.","\"Y-Yes!\" When Sun Ling Cai realized that she was still sitting on the floor, she quickly stood up. \"Thank you for saving my life, Founder.\"","\"About that founder thing...\"","Yuan retrieved the necklace Sun Ling Cai had given him before and showed it to her.","\"Huh? That necklace...\" Sun Ling Cai's eyebrows rose, looking confused, but not because she didn't recognize the necklace.","\"But I gave that to the Little Founder...\" she muttered.","Yuan smiled at her words and explained, \"That's right. It's me, Yuan.\"","\"W-What...?\" Sun Ling Cai stared at his handsome face with a dumbfounded expression on her face.","\"I'm Yuan,\" he repeated in a firmer tone.","\"But...\"","\"I know what you're thinking. I am Yuan, but I am also the Divine Paragon. I am his reincarnation.\"","Sun Ling Cai gazed at Yuan, her face blank with disbelief—until the weight of what she'd just heard sank in, and her expression shifted into utter shock.","At that moment, all Sun Ling Cai could think about were the jokes made about Yuan being the reincarnation of the Divine Paragon because of his uncanny resemblance. What once seemed like idle talk amongst the Divine Paragon Fanatics had turned out to be the truth.","\"I apologize for tricking you. I had to make sure you were trustworthy since my existence could drastically affect everyone in the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","Sun Ling Cai shook her head and said, \"You don't have to apologize. I completely understand. However, I must ask... does Senior Sister Yan know about this?\"","\"Yes, she knows of my true identity, and you're the second person within the Demon Sealing Clan to know.\"","\"Hm? Wait a second... Is that why she started gathering people?\"","He nodded and explained, \"We plan on removing the current Clan Leader from his position; that's why she's gathering trustworthy people.\"","\"Qian Chu? Is there any particular reason why? Of course, I don't have any issues with it. In fact, I believe you should lead the Demon Sealing Clan again.\"","\"Do you remember that incident during the Supreme Demon Sealer Examination?\"","\"Of course. It only happened a few years ago, and because of that incident, our relationship with the Demon Sealing Grotto has hit rock bottom. We're on the verge of war right now... No, we're already past that point...\"","\"Well, I don't know why, but Qian Chu planned that to happen. Moreover, there's something off about him. I can't pinpoint it, but that's what my instincts are telling me.\"","\"A-Are you saying that Qian Chu, the current leader of the Demon Sealing Clan, is a demon?!\" Sun Ling Cai exclaimed.","\"No, there's no proof that he's a demon, nor am I saying he's a demon. However, there's definitely something odd about his existence. I'll try to look deeper into it once I reach the Seventh Heaven.\"","\"Um... Is there anything I can do to help you? Although my abilities as a Demon Sealer may be lacking, there should be something I can do to help! Since Senior Sister Yan has decided to fight against the Clan Leader, I cannot sit back and do nothing!\"","\"You want to help, huh? I'm not sure what to tell you, but if you want, you can go talk to Yan Hara. I'm sure she'll have an idea.\"","\"Okay!\" Sun Ling Cai eagerly nodded."]},{"number":1927,"title":"Chapter 1927 Returning to the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect","paragraphs":["\"By the way, why are you hiding your identity, even going as far as to wear a mask?\" Sun Ling Cai asked Yuan when he wore his mask again.","\"Do you remember that demon the Nine Heavens Law and Order warned you about?\"","\"That ridiculous and unbelievable existence? What about it?\"","\"Well, that 'demon' is me,\" Yuan calmly revealed.","\"WHAT?!\" Sun Ling Cai exclaimed loudly, her eyes wide with shock.","\"They mistook me for a demon because of my regenerative abilities,\" Yuan shrugged.","\"Did you really kill one of them? If you hadn't done that...\"","\"Yes, I did kill one of them. They wouldn't listen to me and got on my nerves.\"","Sun Ling Cai then spoke in a cold voice, \"Those bastards dared to call the Founder of the Demon Sealing Clan a demon! You should've killed all of them!\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Let's continue our conversation later. There are still people waiting for us to return.\"","\"Okay.\"","Sometime later, Yuan and Sun Ling Cai returned to the captives' side. Moreover, before then, Yuan devoured the Demon General, who was only sealed.","\"The demons have been dealt with. Right now, we'll take you to the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, where we will sort everything out and help you return to your home,\" Sun Ling Cai said to the captives, who immediately began crying from an overwhelming sense of relief.","Sun Ling Cai retrieved her flying treasure, which could have its size adjusted and made it spacious enough to carry everyone there.","Once the captives were on the flying treasure, they began their journey back to the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect.","It didn't take long for them to uncover solid evidence implicating the entire Cheng Family and Ling Family in the cult's activities. As for Red Saber Mountain and Purple Rain Monastery, the investigation revealed that only a handful of individuals were involved, and the sects themselves were not wholly complicit.","Due to the incident, both the Cheng Family and the Ling Family were executed.","Once Yuan and Sun Ling Cai arrived at their destination, the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect immediately began assisting the captives in reuniting with their families. Fortunately, those who had been kidnapped from the sect were still alive and among the rescued.","\"I cannot thank you enough for your help, Senior Sun.\" Sect Leader Yun bowed to her.","\"I didn't do much... In fact, Foun—Xiao Yang here did most of the work,\" Sun Ling Cai said.","\"That's not true. It was Senior Sun who defeated the demons. I merely assisted her,\" Yuan shook his head.","\"Demons?! You encountered demons?!\" Sect Leader Yun exclaimed in shock.","\"Yes, there were two of them. Fortunately, they weren't anything special, or we wouldn't have been able to return in one piece.\"","Yuan and Sun Ling Cai agreed to keep the appearance of the Demon Emperor a secret for now. After all, no one would believe that the two of them had defeated both a Demon Emperor and a Demon General, and it would attract unwanted attention to Yuan.","As for the captives, they knew almost nothing about demons and couldn't distinguish their ranks. Because of that, Yuan wasn't concerned about them revealing the truth.","\"Anyway, I have dealt with the demons, and I even learned something about the reason behind their unusual activities, so I will be returning to the Demon Sealing Clan soon,\" Sun Ling Cai said.","Before leaving, Sun Ling Cai and Yuan had one last private conversation.","\"I am allowed to let the Demon Sealing Clan know about the demon's motives, right? Of course, I won't mention anything about the Demon Emperor,\" Sun Ling Cai asked.","Yuan nodded. \"Yes, go ahead and tell them.\"","\"We must stop the demons from unsealing the Demon Realm at all costs...\"","However, Yuan then said, \"Actually, regarding the Demon Realm, I also plan on unsealing it.\"","\"What?! Why would you do something like that? Ah, I am not questioning your decision. I just want to know your reasoning so that I can better understand it.","\"Regardless of the demon's motives, it's true that the seal to the Demon Realm isn't everlasting. It will eventually break, and once it does, we'll have another war with the demons. Unless all demons are defeated—including those in the Demon Realm—we will never truly be safe. Since it will eventually open, I might as well open it myself. Also, the demons will continue to kidnap and sacrifice humans until they achieve their goal.\"","\"I see... That makes sense... In that case, maybe it'd be better to not let the Demon Sealing Clan know about it? They will definitely increase the security of the Demon Realm once they learn about the demon's plan to unseal it.\"","\"It would make for a good distraction. I don't intend on unsealing the Demon Realm until I take care of Qian Chu, anyway.\"","\"Ah, I cannot wait to see you lead the Demon Sealing Clan again...\" Sun Ling Cai muttered with a dreamy look on her face.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"But I don't have any intention of leading the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"What?! If you don't, who will replace Qian Chu?!\"","\"Yan Hara. I am going to make her the next leader.\"","\"No way... then what are you going to do?\"","\"I have countless other things to do. Moreover, the Demon Sealing Clan will become obsolete once there are no longer any demons left.\"","\"That won't happen! Even if there are no more demons left in this world, the Demon Sealing Clan will not perish!\" \"I didn't say they'll disappear. They'll just lose their purpose and will have to find other things to focus on.\"","\"That's...\" Sun Ling Cai couldn't refute this inevitability.","\"I guess we'll have to figure it out once we get there. Anyway, is there really nothing I can do to help you before I leave?\"","\"Unless you can help me improve my Cold Immunity or enter the Seventh Heaven in complete secrecy, I can't think of anything else,\" he said. \"Your Cold Immunity?\" Sun Ling Cai raised her eyebrows."]},{"number":1928,"title":"Chapter 1928 Yuan’s Heavenly Tribulation","paragraphs":["\"Is that why you were at the Extreme Yin Lake? To improve your Cold Immunity?\" Sun Ling Cai asked.","\"That's right. I need to train my body in a place with extremely strong Yin Qi.\"","Sun Ling Cai pondered for a moment before speaking, \"Actually, I might be able to help you in this regard.\"","She retrieved a scrolled painting from her spatial ring and continued, \"This is one of my masterpieces. It's called 'The Cold That Cuts Heaven', and I painted it when I visited the White Hell, one of four forbidden zones within the Nine Heavens.\"","\"White Hell? What kind of place is that?\" Yuan asked, his curiosity sparked upon learning it was one of the four Gateways to Hell, much like the Vanishing Valley.","\"It's a land where the snow never stops falling—a world buried in endless white, which is how it got its name,\" Sun Ling Cai explained. \"It's also one of the coldest places in the Nine Heavens. Even Immortals can freeze to death there.\"","\"I see... So how exactly will that painting help me improve my Cold Immunity?\" Yuan asked, raising an eyebrow.","In response, Sun Ling Cai unfurled the scroll. The moment it opened, a wave of chilling aura surged out, instantly filling the room with an icy presence so intense that frost began creeping across the walls, freezing everything in sight.","As for the painting itself, it depicted the peak of a towering snowy mountain—majestic and desolate—its summit shrouded in swirling frost, capturing the very essence of an eternal winter.","\"This is one of many snowy mountains within White Hell,\" Sun Ling Cai explained. \"I can send people inside, and the environment and temperature are nearly identical to the real thing. If you're looking to train your Cold Immunity, this is the perfect place.\"","\"Training inside a painting, huh? That's a first for me,\" Yuan said, raising an eyebrow with mild amusement.","Sun Ling Cai offered an awkward smile. \"To be honest... this painting was originally meant to trap enemies. It's more of a torture chamber than a training ground...\"","\"That's fine by me. The harsher the environment, the faster my Cold Immunity will improve.\"","Sun Ling Cai added, \"Also, you're trying to reach the Seventh Heaven without drawing attention, right? I haven't tested it before, but in theory... I might be able to smuggle you in using this method.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"Since I don't know if it'll actually work, I am going to try it out on someone else first,\" she continued.","\"I'll just find someone who's willing to participate in this experiment and take them to the Seventh Heaven with me when I visit the Demon Sealing Clan's headquarters. After I finish reporting to the Demon Sealing Clan, I will return here to help you with your Cold Immunity training,\" she explained.","\"Alright, then I will wait for you here at the sect. How long do you think it'll take for you to return?\"","Sun Ling Cai pondered for a moment before responding, \"It shouldn't take longer than a month.\"","\"Then I will see you in a month.\"","Sun Ling Cai left the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect shortly after.","Before heading to the Seventh Heaven, Sun Ling Cai went to look for a guinea pig for her experiment.","After some thinking, she went to a prominent family in the Sixth Heaven and offered one of her treasured paintings to whoever was willing to assist her experiment.","Due to Sun Ling Cai's reputation, she didn't have any issue gaining their trust, and with such an attractive offer, it didn't take long before she acquired a volunteer.","Once prepared, Sun Ling Cai transferred the volunteer into one of her paintings before making her way to the Stairway to Heaven.","However, she was unable to ascend to the Seventh Heaven because the Stairway to Heaven had detected the volunteer's presence within her treasure.","'So I can't use the Stairway to Heaven, huh?'","Fortunately, Sun Ling Cai was not out of options.","After the attempt to smuggle a volunteer through the Stairway to Heaven failed, Sun Ling Cai retrieved a rare and valuable treasure—one that allowed her to return directly to the Seventh Heaven without relying on the Stairway to Heaven.","It was a one-time-use teleportation treasure, capable of sending its user to any previously marked location. Unlike most teleportation treasures, which were restricted to the same or lower realm, this one had no limitations. Despite its rarity and staggering cost, Sun Ling Cai didn't hesitate to use it for her experiment.","Sometime later, Sun Ling Cai returned to the Seventh Heaven.","After her return, she immediately retrieved her painting and the volunteer from it.","'It worked!' she cried inwardly after seeing the volunteer in perfect condition. 'Now I just need to return to the Sixth Heaven and do it again with the Founder!'","Meanwhile, as he waited for Sun Ling Cai's return, Yuan absorbed the spiritual energy refined by the Demon Devouring Sword.","<You have reached the Ninth Level Spirit Enlightenment>","After reaching the peak of Spirit Enlightenment, Yuan pondered whether he should attempt to enter the Divine Realm.","'If I'm going to enter the Seventh Heaven soon, I should enter the Divine Realm before I do so. Hopefully, my physique won't prevent me from doing so.'","Yuan closed his eyes and began attempting to enter the Divine Realm.","<You are attempting to enter the Divine Realm>","<You have evoked Heavenly Tribulation(Minor)!>","Hearing the notifications, Yuan opened his eyes.","\"Heavenly Tribulation, huh?\"","He wasn't surprised that he had evoked a Heavenly Tribulation since every cultivator had to face a minor tribulation to ascend from the Spirit Realm to the Divine Realm.","Just as Yuan stood up and prepared to leave his living quarters to confront the Heavenly Tribulation, another notification appeared.","<Celestial Emperor's Curse has been activated>","<Due to the Celestial Emperor's Curse, the Heavenly Tribulation has been affected, becoming more fierce!>","<Heavenly Tribulation(Major) prepares to descend!>","Meanwhile, the skies above the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect darkened as ominous black clouds gathered overhead. Thunder rumbled in the distance, its echo rolling across the land, audible from miles away.","\"H-Heavenly Tribulation! Someone triggered a Heavenly Tribulation!\" The disciples were shocked and alerted by the phenomenon."]},{"number":1929,"title":"Chapter 1929 Entering the Divine Realm","paragraphs":["Yuan stared at the new notifications with raised eyebrows. He didn't know the Celestial Emperor's Curse had such an effect since it wasn't mentioned in its description.","<Heavenly Tribulation(Major) descends!>","Before Yuan could even step outside or prepare himself, the Heavenly Tribulation struck without warning.","The dark clouds above the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect roared with fury as a colossal bolt of lightning—large enough to engulf an entire building—crashed down, striking both Yuan and his house in a blinding explosion of light and power.","The house was instantly vaporized by the Heavenly Tribulation. Yet, despite the overwhelming power of the strike, the nearby buildings remained untouched. The destruction was eerily precise—confined solely to Yuan's house, as if the Heavenly Tribulation possessed a will of its own, targeting only its intended prey.","\"Heavens! That power! This is a Major Heavenly Tribulation! Is someone attempting to break their mortal shackles right now?!\"","The disciples scattered in panic, fleeing as far as they could from the terrifying display in the sky.","Normally, only those who had committed grave offenses against the heavens—or those attempting to ascend into the Immortal Realm—would trigger a Major Heavenly Tribulation. The sheer scale of what they were witnessing filled them with dread and awe.","\"Yuan?! Are you okay?!\"","Xi Meili and Tan Songyun, who lived in separate buildings beside Yuan's, rushed out the moment they sensed the commotion.","Their eyes widened in shock when they saw that Yuan's house had vanished—replaced by a smoldering crater where it once stood.","\"It's a Heavenly Tribulation! A major one, at that!\" Tan Songyun exclaimed after seeing the darkened sky. \"But why did one appear now?! And why did it target him?!\"","A moment later, a figure suddenly leapt from the crater, rising into the sky with effortless grace.","It was Yuan, and to everyone's astonishment, he looked completely unscathed, as if the Heavenly Tribulation hadn't touched him at all.","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has negated Heavenly Tribulation(Major)!>","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has absorbed Heavenly Tribulation(Major)!>","Because the Heavenly Tribulation was lightning-attributed, it was useless against Yuan's Flawless Heavenly Physique. The divine energy that would have devastated others merely washed over him without leaving a mark.","\"Don't worry, I am fine. I have experienced worse in the Primal Expanse,\" Yuan said.","<Heavenly Tribulation(Major) prepares to descend again!>","As if provoked by Yuan's words, the Heavenly Tribulation rumbled furiously in response, gathering its power once more as it prepared to unleash a second, even more furious strike.","Seeing this, Yuan said to the others, \"It'll attack again soon. You should leave.\"","Xi Meili and Tan Songyun listened to his advice and got away right before the second lightning bolt descended.","BOOM!","The second bolt struck with far greater fury than the first, its destructive power obliterating everything around Yuan. The ground was reduced to scorched, blackened earth.","Yet, Yuan remained unfazed even after being struck by such a powerful force.","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has negated Heavenly Tribulation(Major)!>","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has absorbed Heavenly Tribulation(Major)!>","In fact, it only made him stronger.","<You have stepped into the Divine Realm and reached First Level Divine Warrior!>","Yuan could feel his spiritual energy and overall prowess skyrocketing. The leap from the Spirit Realm to the Divine Realm was staggering—an unfathomable gap, like the distance between heaven and earth.","He looked toward the sky and spoke, \"Is this all you got? If so, get lost.\"","<Due to Player Yuan's provocation, Heavenly Tribulation(Major) has increased in fierceness!>","<Heavenly Tribulation(Supreme) prepares to descend!>","Purple lightning danced across the dark sky, writhing around like snakes.","When the spectators saw this, their eyes widened with disbelief.","\"Supreme Heavenly Tribulation! I have only ever heard about this level of Heavenly Tribulation from others! I never thought it would appear in the Sixth Heaven!\" Sect Leader Yun nearly fell on her buttocks from shock.","A Supreme Heavenly Tribulation was powerful enough to obliterate even Immortals, after all.","Eventually, the third strike descended—an immense bolt of lightning so vast it lit up the entire sky before crashing down on Yuan. The impact was catastrophic, destroying every building and object within a ten-mile radius.","Fortunately, the disciples had evacuated long before, and despite the destruction, there were no casualties.","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has negated Heavenly Tribulation(Supreme)!>","<Flawless Heavenly Physique has absorbed Heavenly Tribulation(Supreme)!>","<You have reached Second Level Divine Warrior>","\"Ahaha!\" Yuan suddenly burst out laughing. \"Thanks for the boost, you sore loser! Keep coming at me if you dare!\" The clouds rumbled once more, echoing the heavens' fury at Yuan's continued provocation. But no further strike came. As much as the Heavenly Tribulation burned with the desire to smite him again, it was bound by its own laws.","Yuan had withstood its wrath and survived the tribulation. If the heavens wished to challenge him again, they would have to wait for the next appointed time. For now, he had earned his qualifications to be in the Divine Realm.","<You have earned the title 'One Who Dares to Provoke the Heavens'>","<You have earned the title 'One Who Dares to Mock the Heavens'>","Eventually, the dark clouds looming over the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect began to fade, slowly dissolving into the heavens. Moments later, a clear blue sky emerged.","Xi Meili, Tan Songyun, and Sect Leader Yun approached Yuan shortly afterward.","\"Y-You! What did you do to summon a Supreme Heavenly Tribulation?!\" Tan Songyun demanded answers, her voice trembling with disbelief. \"And how are you completely unscathed?!\"","As an Immortal herself, Tan Songyun had endured a Supreme Heavenly Tribulation—and had barely survived. The memory of it still haunted her, making Yuan's effortless survival all the more unfathomable.","\"The Heavenly Tribulation appeared because I was attempting to enter the Divine Realm,\" Yuan calmly explained. \"Divine Realm?! That would only summon a Minor Heavenly Tribulation—Major Heavenly Tribulation at most for those with heaven-defying talents. However, what you summoned was the Supreme Heavenly Tribulation, which only appears when a Bronze Immortal attempts to become a Silver Immortal!\" Tan Songyun said."]},{"number":1930,"title":"Chapter 1930 A Month of Cultivation","paragraphs":["Yuan shrugged and said, \"It became more powerful when I provoked it.\"","\"Y-You provoked the Heavenly Tribulation...? Not even a madman would dare to do something so insane...\" Tan Songyun's jaw dropped at this information.","\"Anyway...\" Yuan turned to face Sect Leader Yun and bowed to her.","\"I apologize for summoning the Heavenly Tribulation right in the middle of your sect, even destroying a portion of it.\"","Sect Leader Yun snapped out of her daze and shook her head before saying, \"It's fine. The destroyed property can be fixed. As long as nobody was hurt, I couldn't care less. Moreover, you saved several of our disciples. The least I can do is overlook something this minor.\"","\"Thank you,\" Yuan said.","\"Now then... since all of our guest houses are destroyed, you can stay at my place for now. It's big enough to accommodate all of you with ease, too.\" \"Okay.\"","Sometime later, Yuan and the others moved into Sect Leader Yun's living quarters.","\"I can't believe you're already at the second level of Divine Warrior when you were only at the second level of Spriit Enlightenment yesterday,\" Tan Songyun sighed in a heavy voice.","Yuan smiled and said, \"It's only the Divine Warrior realm. I'm going to push my cultivation as much as possible before we go to the Seventh Heaven.\"","\"Isn't it bad for your body to rush through so many cultivation levels so quickly?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"For normal people, yes. However, my physique is unique, and I have already reached these levels before—several times, at that.\"","\"Haaaa... looks like our distance will widen even more now...\" she sighed.","Hearing this, Yuan retrieved a monster core that once belonged to an Immortal-level magical beast and offered it to her.","\"You can cultivate too.\"","\"That's an Immortal-level monster core! Where did you get such a thing? That level of magical beasts shouldn't exist below the Seventh Heaven.\" Tan Songyun asked.","\"No, there is one place where you can find Immortal-level magical beasts... the Vanishing Valley.\"","\"The forbidden zone?! You actually visited such a dangerous place?\" Tan Songyun swallowed nervously. If she was given the opportunity to go to the Vanishing Valley, she would, without a doubt, refuse.","Sometime later, Yuan entered his room and resumed his cultivation.","Instead of consuming monster cores, Yuan chose to absorb the spiritual energy stored within the Demon Devouring Sword first since the sword held an enormous reserve of spiritual energy gathered during the Demonic Era.","<You have reached Third Level Divine Warrior>","<You have reached Ninth Level Divine Warrior>","<You have reached Fifth Level Divine Master>","<You have reached Ninth Level Divine Master>","<You have reached First Level Divine Grandmaster>","Although Yuan had reached the Divine Grandmaster realm, absorbing spiritual energy manually from the Demon Devouring Sword was a slow process. Unlike consuming monster cores, which could instantly boost his cultivation, this method required patience and time.","Of course, that was only considered slow by Yuan's standards. Compared to other cultivators, his cultivation speed was nothing short of absurd—practically defying common sense.","<You have reached Fourth Level Divine Lord>","<You have reached Ninth Level Divine Lord>","<You have reached First Level Divine King>","In just a single month, Yuan had advanced from the Spirit Enlightenment realm all the way to the Divine King realm—a feat that would be unthinkable for even geniuses. And he had done it while under the effects of the Celestial Emperor's Curse, which slowed his cultivation speed by 99 percent.","However, Yuan wasn't the only one whose cultivation surged. Lan Yingying, who received a portion of the spiritual energy Yuan absorbed through her Supreme Seal, had also advanced rapidly—reaching the first level of the Divine Lord realm.","But unlike Yuan, such rapid progress came with risks. Advancing too quickly could destabilize her foundation and harm her cultivation. To protect her, Yuan sealed her Supreme Seal, halting her progress while he continued to cultivate.","As for Feng Yuxiang, her cultivation had risen to the peak of the Divine Emperor realm. However, this wasn't newfound growth but merely the restoration of the strength she had once lost, and the Supreme Seal only quickened that recovery.","Meanwhile, Sun Ling Cai returned to the Demon Sealing Clan and reported her findings. She revealed her encounter with two demons in the Sixth Heaven and their disturbing plan to unseal the Demon Realm using a key forged from the sacrifices of innocent maidens.","This revelation sent a wave of alarm through the entire Demon Sealing Clan. Anything concerning the Demon Realm was considered highly sensitive—and potentially catastrophic.","Thus, to prevent the demons from achieving their goal, the Demon Sealing Clan declared the eradication of the Demon Worshippers their top priority. While they had kept a watchful eye on the cult in the past, they had never fully committed their resources. As for the search for the so-called 'demon' who had killed a cultivator from the Nine Heavens Law and Order, the Demon Sealing Clan chose to suspend the investigation for now. With the threat of the Demon Realm's unsealing looming, their priorities had shifted. After completing her report, Sun Ling Cai wasted no time and went to look for Yan Hara. With the Demon Sealing Clan having recalled most of their Demon Sealers to address the crisis, it didn't take long for her to locate her.","\"Senior Sister Yan! Can you spare me some of your time? I have something important to tell you!\"","\"Sure. Let's go to my office.\"","Once they entered Yan Hara's office and closed the door, Sun Ling Cai retrieved a painting from her spatial ring and said, \"I painted this during my travel to the Sixth Heaven—when I encountered the demons.\"","When she revealed the painting of Yuan fighting the Demon Emperor, Yan Hara's eyes widened with surprise.","\"Huh? Wait a second... Isn't that...\"","The first thing Yan Hara noticed was Yuan's handsome face.","\"Yes, it's the Founder... or should I call him Little Founder?\"","Yan Hara's entire body stiffened at such words.","She swallowed nervously before asking in a shaky voice, \"W-What are you trying to say...?\"","\"Judging by your reaction, I think you know exactly what I'm trying to say,\" Sun Ling Cai responded with a teasing smile."]},{"number":1931,"title":"Chapter 1931 Demon Sealing Clan’s Highest Priority","paragraphs":["\"I—I don't know what you're talking about!\" Yan Hara exclaimed, slamming her hand on the desk as she shot to her feet. Her voice trembled, and the panic in her eyes was impossible to miss.","Sun Ling Cai chuckled, \"You're really cute when you panic, Senior Sister Yan. You're also very bad at acting. Who are you trying to fool with that kind of reaction? Anyway, I know that the Little Founder is the Divine Paragon's reincarnation.\"","Yan Hara's entire body trembled at such words.","\"H-How did you...?\"","\"Relax, the Little Founder told me himself.\"","\"You met Yuan?! Where and when did you meet him?!\"","\"I was with him right before I returned to the Demon Sealing Clan. Ah, he's in the Sixth Heaven right now.\"","\"He's in the Sixth Heaven already?!\"","Despite knowing that Yuan was the Divine Paragon's reincarnation, Yan Hara was still surprised by his fast progress.","\"Yes, and he'll be arriving at the Seventh Heaven soon.\"","\"In that case, I must head down to the Seventh Heaven to meet him as soon as possible!\" \"Slow down a bit, Senior Sister Yan. I still have a lot to tell you.\"","\"Oh, right... I heard you dealt with two demons before returning. Was he with you at that time?\"","Sun Ling Cai nodded with a somewhat bitter look on her face and said, \"Honestly, he was the one who dealt with the demons.\"","\"Eh?\" Yan Hara's eyebrows rose in a questioning manner.","\"I altered my report to protect the Little—the Founder. In truth, the demons weren't ordinary demons. One was a Demon General, and the other... was a Demon Emperor.\"","\"A Demon Emperor?!?!?!\" Yan Hara exclaimed, nearly falling on her buttocks from shock.","\"The Founder called it Demon Emperor Slaughter. If it weren't for the Founder, I would've died that day.\"","\"So he's powerful enough to defeat a Demon Emperor by himself now...\" Yan Hara clenched her fists in excitement. \"He didn't just defeat the Demon Emperor. He practically toyed with it. I have never seen anyone mess with a demon like that before, much less a Demon Emperor.\" Sun Ling Cai sighed as she recalled their fight.","\"I am going to need you to tell me everything that happened from the beginning to end without missing a single detail,\" Yan Hara spoke with a serious look on her face.","Sun Ling Cai nodded.","Once they were seated, tea in hand, Sun Ling Cai began recounting everything to Yan Hara in vivid detail. She left nothing out—starting from her arrival at the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect, to witnessing Yuan confront the Demon Worshippers, and finally, his battle with and victory over the Demon Emperor.","Yan Hara's body trembled with delight as she listened. \"Ah... he's truly grown into an unfathomable individual since I last saw him... I cannot wait to see him again,\" she muttered in a daze.","\"Also, I can't believe he turned out to be the demon we've spent the last several years searching for... It's no wonder he'd hide his identity from you.\"","Sun Ling Cai then spoke, \"Oh, right. When I asked him if I could be of any assistance, he asked me to ask you.\"","\"Assistance, huh? Actually, I do need some help. I have been thinking about recruiting people outside our clan to my group, and you, who have more influence than me outside the Demon Sealing Clan, can help me do that.\"","\"You're trying to dethrone Qian Chu, right? Why would outsiders matter in the Demon Sealing Clan's affairs?\" Sun Ling Cai asked.","\"You're not thinking far enough. While an outsider may have no say in our affairs, do you think Qian Chu will peacefully hand over his position to us?\"","\"Probably not... We all know how obsessive he is with his position. He might even fight us to death if it means protecting his position.\"","Yan Hara nodded and continued, \"And once he starts fighting, those on his side will join. Qian Chu has over half of the Demon Sealing Clan's support. If we want to defeat him, we'll need external help.\"","\"That might be true now, but if the Founder reveals himself, I'm sure most of them would switch sides,\" said Sun Ling Cai.","\"That's very possible, but it's still better to be safe than sorry.\"","\"That makes sense...\"","\"When will you be returning to the Sixth Heaven?\" Yan Hara then asked.","\"Right after the Demon Sealing Clan's meeting.\"","\"Alright.\"","A few days later, the Demon Sealing Clan started their major meeting, drawing participation from nearly all of its Demon Sealers regardless of rank or status. The topic was about Sun Ling Cai's report on the demons' plans to unseal the Demon Realm.","\"During my encounter with the demons, I questioned their reason for kidnapping maidens, and it told me that they were making a 'key' to open the Demon Realm.\"","A tense atmosphere filled the place when Sun Ling Cai mentioned the Demon Realm.","If the Demon Realm were ever unsealed, the Nine Heavens would, without a doubt, experience another Demonic Era, and nobody there wanted such a thing to happen.","\"W-We must stop that from happening at all costs! If the seal to the Demon Realm ever unseals, countless people will die!\"","\"That's right! We have to do something about this!\"","\"Isn't that obvious?\"","The meeting was brief and to the point. Qian Chu issued a firm directive: the Demon Worshippers were now the highest priority. All Demon Sealers were to remain vigilant and travel the Nine Heavens while giving special attention to any cases involving kidnappings and places with high numbers of missing people.","At the end, Qian Chu also announced that he would be away from the Demon Sealing Clan for some time, but he didn't go into details or even mention why he'd be away. However, nobody there questioned him.","Yan Hara wanted to question him, but she didn't want to attract more attention to herself right now. However, she did task someone from her group to follow Qian Chu and report all of his activities to her."]},{"number":1932,"title":"Chapter 1932 Supreme Cold Immunity","paragraphs":["After the meeting, Sun Ling Cai and Yan Hara met up one more time before Sun Ling Cai made her way back to the Sixth Heaven.","In the Sixth Heaven, before heading back to the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect to meet with Yuan, Sun Ling Cai dropped off the volunteer back at his home.","\"Wow, what happened here? Did a demon attack your sect while I was gone?\" Sun Ling Cai was dumbfounded by the destruction in the sect and asked Sect Leader Yun.","\"No... A Supreme Heavenly Tribulation occurred when Xiao Yang attempted to breakthrough to the Divine Realm.\"","\"Supreme Heavenly Tribulation?! But that's usually only reserved for Immortals! Is he okay?!\" Sun Ling Cai was greatly shocked by this news. Although she was confident in Yuan's abilities as the Divine Paragon's reincarnation, she was still worried he might not be able to handle a Supreme Heavenly Tribulation that threatened even Immortals like her.","\"He's fine. Hell, he emerged from it unscathed.\" \"Unscathed...? Is that even possible?\" Sun Ling Cai stared at the Sect Leader with a dumbfounded look on her pretty face. \"How did he do it?\"","\"You're asking the wrong person.\" Sect Leader Yun shrugged before continuing, \"I don't know how he did it, but he treated the Supreme Heavenly Tribulation as if it was a joke.\"","Sun Ling Cai pondered for a moment before muttering, \"I can only think of one possibility... he'd achieved the legendary Heavenly Physique that grants immunity to lightning.\"","\"Heavenly Physique?! That's impossible!\" Sect Leader Yun exclaimed, her eyes wide with disbelief. Most cultivators only cultivate a single elemental immunity in their life because it takes a lifetime to train even one. She already knew Yuan possessed Cold Immunity, so the thought of him having another defied all reason.","\"Heavenly Physique?! That's impossible!\" Sect Leader Yun exclaimed, her eyes wide with disbelief. Most cultivators only cultivate a single elemental immunity in their life because it takes a lifetime to train even one. She already knew Yuan possessed Cold Immunity, so the thought of him having another defied all reason.","Moreover, lightning immunity was the hardest immunity to train, and the number of people who have achieved Heavenly Physique since the beginning of time could be counted on one hand.","\"Impossible? Nothing is impossible for the Found—him.\"","'Found?' Sect Leader Yun raised an eyebrow.","\"Anyway, where's Xiao Yang?\"","\"He's currently staying at my place.\"","Sect Leader Yun brought Sun Ling Cai back to her living quarters shortly after.","\"Welcome back. How did it go?\" Yuan asked her once they were alone.","\"It worked! I managed to bring someone from the Sixth Heaven to the Seventh Heaven—even the Eighth Heaven! I tried going through the Stairway to Heaven at first, but that didn't work out, so I had to use a treasure.\"","\"Anyway, when do you want to go to the Seventh Heaven?\"","\"I'll go right after I finish training my Cold Immunity.\"","\"...\"","Sun Ling Cai suddenly went silent.","\"Is something wrong?\" Yuan asked.","\"Huh? Oh, nothing's wrong. I was just wondering if you truly have the Heavenly Physique or not.\"","\"Heavenly Physique? I have it.\" Yuan admitted.","\"How old are you in this life, again?\"","\"I'm still in my twenties in this life.\"","\"Your twenties?! And you already have the Heavenly Physique and Cold Immunity?!\" Sun Ling Cai exclaimed in a terrified voice.","Seeing how she reacted, Yuan didn't dare to reveal that he also had Poison Immunity and Fire Immunity.","Sometime later, Sun Ling Cai said, \"By the way, I spoke with Senior Sister Yan. She said that she'd like to meet you once you arrive at the Seventh Heaven.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Alright, when do you wish to start your training?\"","\"I'd like to start now if you don't mind.\"","\"I understand.\"","Sun Ling Cai proceeded to retrieve the painting 'The Cold That Cuts Heaven' and opened it, instantly turning the room into an ice chamber.","\"I'll be watching over you constantly, so if you need anything, just shout it out loud,\" she said.","Yuan nodded and said, \"Alright. Don't take me out unless I tell you to, even if it looks bad.\"","\"Okay. I'll send you inside the painting now.\"","Sun Ling Cai lightly tapped Yuan's shoulder with her brush, its tip glowing with profound energy. Then, with a graceful motion, she drew the brush toward the painting. In the next instant, Yuan's figure was pulled into the scroll—vanishing into the painted world as if swallowed by it.","<You have entered 'The Cold That Cuts Heaven'>","After entering the painting, Yuan found himself standing atop the very snowy mountain depicted in the scroll. The world around him was blanketed in endless white—sky, ground, and horizon blending together in a frozen stillness.","Despite having Super Cold Resistance, he could feel the bitter chill biting into his skin, the cold so intense it began to creep into his veins, threatening to freeze his blood solid. Yet, he did nothing to fight it.","<Your Cold Resistance has improved significantly>","Within moments, the frigid air overwhelmed him. A thick layer of ice rapidly formed over his body, sealing him completely. In the blink of an eye, Yuan stood frozen—transformed into a statue of ice, motionless amidst the endless snow.","Sun Ling Cai, who was watching this, immediately wondered if she should take Yuan out of the painting. 'No... although his entire body is frozen, his heart is still beating.'","Time flowed quietly in the frozen world, and three full months had passed in the blink of an eye. Yet Yuan remained unchanged—still encased in ice, unmoving, as though time itself had forgotten him.","<Your skill 'Super Cold Immunity' has developed into 'Supreme Cold Immunity'>","At long last, the ice encasing Yuan began to crack—thin fractures spreading like spiderwebs across its surface. Moments after attaining Supreme Cold Immunity, a surge of energy pulsed through his body, and with a sharp burst, he shattered the frozen shell around him, breaking free from his long, silent imprisonment.","'If I want to reach the next level, I'll need to visit the real White Hell.'","While he could continue training inside the painting and achieve the next level, it would take too much time, hence why he decided to stop there.","\"I'm ready to leave!\" Yuan lifted his head toward the sky and spoke loudly.","A moment later, Yuan felt a profound energy wrap around him, and in the blink of an eye, the icy world vanished. When he opened his eyes, he was back in his room. Before him, Sun Ling Cai sat quietly in front of the painting with a relieved smile on her face."]},{"number":1933,"title":"Chapter 1933 Arriving at the Seventh Heaven","paragraphs":["\"How did it go? I hope you've achieved satisfactory results,\" Sun Ling Cai said.","\"How long have I been inside the painting?\" Yuan asked.","\"A little over three months.\"","\"I see... It wasn't too bad. However, if I want to advance further, I'd need to visit the real White Hell personally.\"","\"Seriously...? I know you have Cold Immunity, but that place is so dangerous that even those with Cold Immunity aren't safe.\"","\"Then how did you manage to paint this painting there?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"Did you think I went there alone? I had assistance from the Sun God's Temple. They have a treasure that can protect you from the weather in White Hell. However, even that treasure has its limits. Otherwise, I would've gone deeper inside the White Hell.\"","\"Is that so? Well, I am going there to train, so any protection will only hinder my progress. Where can I find the place?\"","\"You can find it in the Seventh Heaven.\"","\"That's great. I'll head over there once I am finished with my other business,\" said Yuan.","\"So, are you ready to head to the Seventh Heaven?\"","\"I am, but let me talk to Xi Meili and Tan Songyun too.\"","Sometime later, Yuan revealed his plan to enter the Seventh Heaven through Sun Ling Cai.","\"Are we leaving now?\" Xi Meili asked.","Yuan nodded.","Tan Songyun then said, \"In that case, I'll have to leave your group for some time. I need to speak with my Faction Leader, so I'll return to my faction for some time. Once I am done, I'll find you again.\"","\"Are you sure? What if I do something bad while you're away?\" Yuan teased.","Tan Songyun stared at him with narrowed eyes for a moment before sighing. Then, she spoke in a defeated tone, \"Fine, I admit that I was wrong about you. However, I will need some time to accept it, as I have spent the last several thousand years blinded by hatred.\"","This is one of the main reasons why she decided to leave the group temporarily, as she needed time to clear her mind.","\"I don't blame you. The only one at fault is the individual who started spreading those false rumors.\"","Tan Songyun nodded.","\"By the way, since I have already been to the Seventh Heaven, I can go there by myself, so I won't be coming with you,\" she said a moment later.","\"I understand. Until next time.\" Tan Songyun left the Frozen Cloud Ethereal Sect shortly after.","Sun Ling Cai was very curious about their relationship, but not wanting to appear nosy, she decided to stay silent.","\"Stay here for a bit. I have to go outside for a moment.\" Yuan said to them before leaving the house.","\"Yin. Yang. Are you here?\"","A moment later, two cloaked figures appeared before Yuan.","\"We are at your service.\"","\"I will be heading to the Seventh Heaven soon. Will you be able to follow me there?\" he asked.","\"We can follow you all the way to the Ninth Heaven.\"","\"That's good. By the way, do you know anything about the Dragon Spiral Mountain located within the Seventh Heaven?\"","Yang spoke first. \"The Dragon Spiral Mountain in the Seventh Heaven is currently under the control of the Holy Dragon Clan. Their bloodline ranks among the top three royal bloodlines of all dragon bloodlines.\"","Yin followed. \"They're extremely reclusive and seldom leave their territory. Naturally, that also means they rarely accept visitors.\"","\"Is that so?\"","After his conversation with Yin and Yang ended, Yuan returned inside the house and said, \"Alright, I am ready. Let's head to the Seventh Heaven.\"","Sun Ling Cai retrieved a painting shortly after and sent Yuan and Xi Meili inside it.","\"I'll let you know when we arrive. It won't take long.\"","After putting away the painting, Sun Ling Cai notified Sect Leader Yun of their departure before retrieving a treasure that brought her to the Seventh Heaven and used it without hesitation.","Once they arrived in the Seventh Heaven, Sun Ling Cai brought Yuan and Xi Meili out of the painting.","\"Welcome to the Seventh Heaven,\" she said to them.","\"Wow... I thought the spiritual energy was already impressive enough in the Sixth Heaven, but it cannot even compare to the spiritual energy in the Seventh Heaven.\" Xi Meili muttered with a dazed look on her face. She could feel her cultivation improve significantly with every breath. \"Not just spiritual energy. The Immortal Qi here is also incomparably more abundant,\" said Sun Ling Cai.","\"Immortal Qi... I guess we'll be encountering Immortals now.\" Xi Meili swallowed nervously.","\"That's right. After all, there is no longer any restriction to one's cultivation from the Seventh Heaven and onwards. In fact, you could even encounter a Cultivation God in the Seventh Heaven.\"","Sun Ling Cai continued, \"Also, unlike the First Heaven to Sixth Heaven, traveling between the Seventh Heaven and Ninth Heaven is much easier and much less restrictive.\"","\"So, what are you going to do now?\"","Sun Ling Cai and Xi Meili looked at Yuan.","\"As much as I want to head straight to the Dragon Spiral Mountain immediately, I need to prepare myself a little.\"","Yuan looked at Sun Ling Cai and continued, \"Can you help me with my training?\"","\"Of course. What kind of training?\"","\"I want to be able to use Immortal Qi.\"","\"Huh? But Immortal Qi is something you can use only after you become an Immortal. It's not something that can be attained from effort and training alone.\"","Yuan smiled and exuded some of his incomplete Immortal Qi.","\"?!?!\"","Sun Ling Cai nearly jumped from shock.","\"Immortal Qi?! It's not perfect, but it's definitely Immortal Qi! How is that even possible?\"","\"Nothing is impossible for him,\" Xi Meili chuckled.","After snapping out of her daze, Sun Ling Cai asked, \"How do I help you?\"","\"It's quite simple. You just need to keep attacking me with your Immortal Qi,\" he said.","Her eyes widened with disbelief.","\"You want me to attack you with Immortal Qi?! I can't do something like that!\"","\"Don't worry, I won't die.\"","\"That's not the issue! You're telling a Divine Paragon Fanatic to attack the Divine Paragon! How will I be able to face the others after knowing what I have done?!\"","\"That's your worry...?\" Yuan was speechless.","\"Please! I'll do anything but that!\"","\"But you're the only one here who can train me. Or are you telling me to wander this place that's teeming with Immortals without being able to use Immortal Qi?\"","\"That's... Oh, right! Senior Sister Yan will be here soon! You can ask her to help you! Her Immortal Qi is much stronger than mine, too!\"","\"Yan Hara? She's coming here?\" \"Yes. I spoke with her when I returned to the Demon Sealing Clan, and she said that she wanted to see you. I gave her this location before returning to the Sixth Heaven. She should be here soon.\"","Just as Sun Ling Cai finished her sentence, Yuan could sense a presence speeding toward their location.","Moments later, a beautiful woman halted right above the island to look at them.","When Yan Hara saw Yuan, she immediately landed right before him and gave him a firm embrace.","\"I've missed you!\"","Sun Ling Cai's jaw dropped. However, it was not because she was jealous.","\"How can you touch the Founder so casually?!\" she exclaimed.","Yan Hara's body froze at her words. After a moment of silence and stillness, Yan Hara released Yuan and immediately kowtowed.","\"I am so sorry! I got too excited and instinctively acted on my old habits!\" she apologized.","\"I don't mind.\" Yuan removed his mask and showed her a handsome smile.","\"It's been a while. How have you been?\"","Yan Hara didn't respond—her attention was completely consumed by Yuan's face. It was a perfect reflection of the Divine Paragon, so strikingly identical that she couldn't look away.","\"Ahem.\" Sun Ling Cai cleared her throat.","Yan Hara quickly snapped out of her daze and spoke with a red face, \"If you visited the Demon Sealing Clan's Grand Library right now, it'd definitely cause a commotion. I also want to see Qian Chu's reaction when he sees you.\"","\"I'll visit the library as soon as I finish my other business,\" he said.","\"I can't believe it hasn't even been a decade since you first visited the library. I thought I would have to wait several decades before I could see you outside of the library,\" Yan Hara said.","\"Anyway, I have a lot to talk to you about. Let's change our location first.\"","\"Wait. Before we leave, I need your help.\"","\"I'll do it,\" Yan Hara instinctively responded without any hesitation.","\"Good. Then attack me with your Immortal Qi.\"","Yan Hara's body trembled at his words, and her eyes widened as she spoke, \"W-What? I think I misheard—\"","\"Attack me with your Immortal Qi,\" Yuan repeated. \"It's for my training.\"","\"What kind of training are you doing?!\" she exclaimed."]},{"number":1934,"title":"Chapter 1934 Learning Immortal Qi","paragraphs":["\"I'm trying to learn—complete my Immortal Qi.\" Yuan showed Yan Hara his incomplete Immortal Qi.","\"You can already use Immortal Qi? But you're only at—Divine King?! How did you improve your cultivation so quickly?! You were only around Spirit King a few years ago!\"","Yan Hara just noticed his cultivation and was greatly bewildered by his progress. If she knew that hemd gone from Spirit Enlightenment to Divine King in the past month, who knows how she'd react.","As for Sun Ling Cai, her mouth and eyes were wide open. She knew Yuan was only Spirit Enlightenment last month, and she knew he'd triggered a Supreme Heavenly Tribulation to enter the Divine Realm, but she didn't realize he was already Divine King.","'What kind of outrageous cultivation speed is this?!' she cried inwardly.","\"Why are you so surprised? Have you forgotten who I am?\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Anyway, attack me with your Immortal Qi. I'll be fine. I promise.\"","Despite her hesitation, Yan Hara eventually nodded her head and agreed to train him.","Sun Ling Cai and Xi Meili flew off the island a moment later and distanced themselves from Yuan.","Sometime later, Yan Hara released her Immortal Qi and attacked Yuan with it.","\"It's not strong enough! Don't hold back and come at me as if you're trying to kill me!\" Yuan shouted after barely feeling it.","Yan Hara gritted her teeth and increased her Immortal Qi output tremendously.","Boom!","Yan Hara's Immortal Qi pressed down on Yuan like a mountain.","Yuan coughed up a mouthful of blood afterward.","\"Yuan!\" Yan Hara instinctively retracted her Immortal Qi when she saw his blood.","\"Don't stop! It's just a little blood!\"","\"...\"","Yan Hara was reluctant to continue, but seeing Yuan's fierce eyes, she gritted her teeth and continued blasting him with Immortal Qi.","<Your comprehension of Immortal Qi has improved tremendously!>","<Your comprehension of Immortal Qi has improved tremendously!>","<Your comprehension of Immortal Qi has improved tremendously!>","Yan Hara was a Golden Immortal—on the verge of becoming a True Immortal—so her Immortal Qi was immensely powerful.","Although Yuan could have trained his Immortal Qi in the Sixth Heaven, the process would've been painfully slow. While Immortal Qi could still be used by Immortals even when their cultivation was suppressed, its power would be significantly weakened.","This is why he waited until he arrived at the Seven Heaven, where Immortals could use their Immortal Qi properly.","Yuan's entire body was screaming in pain from Yan Hara's Immortal Qi, but it wasn't enough to put his life in danger. If anything, his body was getting stronger by the moment due to his physique.","\"You can increase the power a little more now,\" Yuan said to Yan Hara a few days later.","Yan Hara, who'd been using the power of a Bronze Immortal, slowly increased her strength to that of a Silver Immortal.","After two weeks of training, the Immortal Qi that Yuan was exuding was no longer incomplete and resembled that of a true Immortal. <You have fully comprehended Immortal Qi>","<You are now able to use the powers of an Immortal!>","\"What do you think?\" Yuan asked as he released his Immortal Qi.","Yan Hara swallowed nervously. It wasn't just the fact that Yuan could use Immortal Qi that left her stunned—it was the sheer mastery with which he wielded it. His control, precision, and efficiency surpassed even her own as a Golden Immortal. It was as if he had been using Immortal Qi for far longer than she had, despite only recently learning it.","However, then she remembered that he was the Divine Paragon's reincarnation.","\"You're really something, Yuan.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"Immortal Qi is just the beginning. Until I can use Celestial Qi, I am still vulnerable.\"","\"Celestial Qi?\" Yan Hara echoed, her brows raising. \"There have been rare cases of cultivators using Immortal Qi before reaching the Immortal Realm, but there's no precedent—none—of anyone below the God Ascension realm comprehending Celestial Qi.\"","\"No precedent—yet.\" Yuan smiled, leaving her speechless.","Xi Meili and Sun Ling Cai returned to the island shortly after.","\"He actually managed to learn Immortal Qi...\" Sun Ling Cai muttered under her breath.","Sometime later, Yuan and the others jumped on Sun Ling Cai's flying treasure and sped away.","After arriving at a city, Yan Hara brought them to a tea house.","\"This is Tea Paradise, one of the most famous teahouses in the Nine Heavens.\"","Once they were seated, Yan Hara said to the server, \"Give us your best tea.\"","\"Our best...?\" The server raised an eyebrow before asking, \"Only those with—\"","Before the server could even finish her sentence, Sun Ling Cai retrieved a green medallion and placed it on the table.","\"Please wait a moment! I will bring your tea right away!\"","The server hurriedly left the room.","\"What was that about?\" Xi Meili asked.","Yan Hara chuckled and said, \"Unless you have a membership, your options in this place are limited. However, even with a membership, you won't be able to experience their best tea without a certain rank. I'm just an ordinary member, but Junior Sister Sun here...\"","\"I am not a member but an honorable guest. This medallion was given to me by the owner of this teahouse himself,\" she explained.","\"I don't know if you know this, but she's a bigshot in the Nine Heavens. In fact, I am a nobody when compared to her,\" Yan Hara said with a smile on her face.","\"I heard that she's a famous painter,\" said Yuan.","\"Not just any famous painter! She's the most famous!\" Yan Hara bragged as if she was talking about herself.","\"It's really nothing that amazing...\" Sun Ling Cai said, appearing somewhat bashful.","Their tea arrived a few minutes later, and the server explained the tea's background.","\"This is the Starry Dream Infused Tea, brewed using million-year-old leaves from a Starry Tree, which can only be found in the Starry Sky, as well as a drop of Celestial Dew.\"","Once the server left, Xi Meili said, \"I know I am supposed to be impressed by the ingredients, but I don't know anything about them...\"","Sun Ling Cai then explained, \"The Starry Tree is an exotic plant that only grows in the Starry Sky. The Celestial Dew is a precious treasure that can only be found in—\"","\"Let's just say that the cost of this tea is enough to purchase an Empyrean-grade treasure,\" Yan Hara interjected.","\"The price of an Empyrean-grade treasure?!\" Xi Meili exclaimed, not daring to believe her ears. How could a pot of tea be comparable to an Empyrean-grade treasure?"]},{"number":1935,"title":"Chapter 1935 Demon Sealing Grotto True Identity","paragraphs":["Xi Meili stared at her cup of tea and hesitated to touch it, much less drink it.","\"What are you waiting for? Go ahead and drink it,\" Yan Hara said right before downing her cup of tea in one motion.","Sun Ling Cai also drank the tea without any hesitation.","Xi Meili swallowed nervously before grabbing the cup. Then, with one swift and forceful movement, she drank it.","\"Wow! My cultivation increased by an entire level just from drinking that small cup! And I can still feel a tremendous amount of spiritual energy in my body that is slowly being absorbed!\" Xi Meili exclaimed with a shocked face.","\"That amount of spiritual energy will probably be enough to raise your cultivation by an entire realm once you fully absorb it. However, due to your lack of cultivation, you'll only be able to drink one cup of tea for now. If you try to drink more, you'll absorb too much spiritual energy for your body to handle and... boom—your Dantian will explode.\" Yan Hara warned her.","\"It's not just your cultivation that has improved. I'm sure you're starting to notice it, but all of your senses have also improved greatly. Your body should have strengthened, as well.\" Sun Ling Cai added.","\"A single cup of tea is able to benefit me so much? It's hard to believe even though I am experiencing its effects as we speak...\" Xi Meili swallowed nervously.","\"Ah, thank you very much for this opportunity, seniors.\"","\"There's no need to be so formal with us. Just call us Senior Sisters,\" Yan Hara said.","Meanwhile, Yuan also consumed his cup of tea. However, unlike Xi Meili, it'd barely affected him.","\"The tea has a really unique flavor. I quite like it,\" said Yuan as he placed his cup down.","\"Here's another cup.\" Yan Hara quickly refilled his cup.","Without hesitation, Yuan drank the whole thing again.","\"Here's some more.\"","Yan Hara poured him another cup; her movements were so natural that it felt like she'd done this a million times.","In the blink of an eye, Yuan drank half of the tea in the pot.","\"The two of you should drink too,\" he said to them.","\"It's fine. We've been here several times. And this is mostly to celebrate your arrival in the Seventh Heaven. You can drink all of it—if you can handle it.\"","\"If you say so...\"","Yuan didn't hesitate to drink the rest of the tea. Although he liked the taste, it wasn't the only reason he was drinking it.","<Your comprehension of Celestial Qi has increased slightly>","After his third cup, his Celestial Qi comprehension began improving with every cup. The progress was minimal, nearly imperceptible, but it was progress nonetheless—and for something as elusive as Celestial Qi, even the smallest advancement was invaluable.","As Yuan continued to drink his tea, Yan Hara revealed the situation within the Demon Sealing Clan to him, as well as her current activities.","\"The drama between the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto has only gotten worse since your last visit to the library—much worse. We're at the point where we start fighting the moment we see each other without so much as exchanging any words.\"","\"Has Qian Chu done anything to calm the situation?\" Yuan asked.","\"He claims to be working on it, but we haven't seen any noticeable results even several years later. Most recently, right before I came to meet you, he disappeared somewhere after giving us the order to prioritize the Demon Worshippers.\"","\"Disappeared?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"He said he had some business, but he didn't go into any details. However, I have someone following him, so we should know his activities soon.\"","Sun Ling Cai then spoke, \"By the way, the Demon Sealing Grotto's headquarters are in the Seventh Heaven, so you'll most likely run into them while you're here.\"","\"Are you worried that I might become a target?\" Yuan asked with a smile.","\"While that is a concern, I'm pretty confident you'll be able to defend yourself. After all, you managed to defeat a Demon Emperor alone.\"","\"Don't worry, even if I encounter them, they won't know I'm with the Demon Sealing Clan, and I have no reason to reveal myself.\"","Yan Hara then spoke, \"Honestly, I was hoping you could speak with the leader of the Demon Sealing Grotto.\"","\"Hmm? Why?\" Yuan asked.","\"If we're going to fight Qian Chu, I think it would benefit us to have the Demon Sealing Grotto on our side,\" she admitted.","\"I don't really know much, if anything at all, about them. I know that they're essentially a second Demon Sealing Clan, but that's about the extent of my knowledge on them.\"","Yan Hara sighed and said, \"The Demon Sealing Grotto may have come after the Demon Sealing Clan and was even created after the Demonic Era, but to tell you the truth, they qualify to be the Demon Sealing Clan more than us.\"","\"I don't get it.\"","\"The Demon Sealing Grotto was founded by Demon Sealers who originally belonged to the Demon Sealing Clan,\" Yan Hara explained. \"After you disappeared, the clan lost its direction. Disagreements over leadership led to internal strife, and people fought to become the next Clan Leader, causing a lot of bloodshed. This led to the creation of the Demon Sealing Grotto, a haven for those who wanted to stay true to the Divine Paragon's teachings.\"","Yuan couldn't help but notice the similarities between this situation and what the Celestial Overlords were currently facing—internal division and power struggles after their founder left.","Yan Hara continued, \"The reason the Demon Sealing Grotto has surpassed the Demon Sealing Clan in strength is simple—they stayed true to the old traditions and rigorous training. Meanwhile, the Demon Sealing Clan... what can I even say? We've become pathetic.\"","She let out a quiet sigh. \"Honestly, I considered joining the Demon Sealing Grotto at first. But in the end, I chose to stay with the 'original'.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"I understand the situation now. In that case, we should definitely get the Demon Sealing Grotto to be on our side.\""]},{"number":1936,"title":"Chapter 1936 Seventh Heaven’s Dragon Spiral Mountain","paragraphs":["\"When are you going to visit the Demon Sealing Grotto? I would love to go with you, but my position within the Demon Sealing Clan would only make things more difficult for you,\" Yan Hara said.","\"I have some business at the Dragon Spiral Mountain, so I will be going there first. After that, I want to check up on my friends, but that won't take long. If nothing else comes up, I'll visit the Demon Sealing Grotto.\"","Yan Hara raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner and inquired, \"The Dragon Spiral Mountain? What business do you have with the Holy Dragon Clan? I thought they didn't accept visitors.\" \"You're aware that my current body is only an avatar of my soul, right?\"","\"Yes, I am aware. The Celestial Emperor told us about you guys, but so far, you're the only person I've met who's from that world.\"","\"Well, I intend on coming to the Nine Heavens with my real body, and the Dragon Spiral Mountain is the key to making that a reality.\"","\"Coming here with your real body?! Such a thing is possible?\" Yan Hara exclaimed in shock.","\"The Dragon Spiral Mountain is actually a massive teleportation device that connects with the other Dragon Spiral Mountains, and one of those mountains is in my world. I'm not sure how it works, but I'll figure it out once I get there.\"","\"That's only if the Holy Dragon Clan even allows you entrance,\" said Yan Hara.","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"At what level is the strongest individual there?\"","\"If you're thinking about forcing your way inside, forget about it. They have several God Ascension Realm powerhouses there,\" Sun Ling Cai said, shaking her head.","\"Do you think I am a brute or something?\" Yuan chuckled. \"I just wanted to know their prowess.\"","Yan Hara then spoke, \"If you're asking about their prowess, the Holy Dragon Clan is within the top 20 most powerful backgrounds in the Nine Heavens, and in terms of Dragon Clans, they're top 3.\"","\"Top 20 in the entire Nine Heavens? That's quite impressive.\"","\"If you need help, I can ask around,\" Sun Ling Cai said.","\"No, it's fine. I have several plans in mind already.\"","\"If you say so... but if you ever need my help, just ask. Here is my communication jade slip for contacting me.\" Sun Ling Cai placed her jade slip on the table before Yuan.","\"Thanks.\"","Yuan accepted the jade slip.","Sometime later, after Yuan finished drinking all of the tea and they finished their conversation, Yan Hara spoke, \"As much as I would like to travel with you, I don't want to bring unnecessary attention your way, especially from Qian Chu and his followers.\"","Yuan nodded. \"I understand.\"","Sun Ling Cai then spoke, \"Well, good luck with the Holy Dragon Clan. They're renowned for their stubbornness.\"","Sun Ling Cai and Yan Hara left first after paying for the tea.","\"Let's head to the Dragon Spiral Mountain now, shall we?\" Yuan said to Xi Meili, who eagerly nodded.","After leaving the tea house, they made their way to the nearest teleportation device.","Many teleports later, they arrived at Silverfoam Harbor, a bustling city located near the Sea of Dragons.","The Sea of Dragons was a vast, unique ocean in the Seventh Heaven, renowned for its abundance of sea beasts that bore the appearance of dragons. However, despite their fearsome looks, most of these beasts were not true dragons, and only a rare few possessed actual dragon blood in their veins.","No one truly knew why the sea beasts resembled dragons, but legend had it that a mighty ancient dragon once perished within those waters. Its blood seeped into the sea, tainting the depths and altering the creatures that dwelled within—giving rise to the dragon-like beasts that now roamed the Sea of Dragons.","As for the Dragon Spiral Mountain, it was located on a secluded island somewhere in the middle of the Sea of Dragons. Its remote and treacherous location was a natural deterrent to visitors, especially with powerful Immortal-level sea beasts prowling the surrounding waters.","While Yuan didn't fear the sea beasts, Xi Meili was a different story.","\"Maybe I should stay in this place while you head to the Dragon Spiral Mountain. I don't want to be a burden,\" said Xi Meili as they stood before the Sea of Dragons.","Yuan shook his head.","\"Don't say that. Also, your presence might help me convince the Holy Dragon Clan to assist us, so I cannot leave you behind. Just stay close to me. I'll protect you.\"","\"Young Master, you're not alone.\"","Feng Yuxiang suddenly appeared before them.","\"I'll also help out.\"","\"Thank you...\" Xi Meili nodded.","\"We also have Yingzi, who is as powerful as a Golden Immortal,\" Yuan added.","Feng Yuxiang then spoke, \"Instead of flying around like we usually do, it's about time we start making use of flying treasures.\"","With that, she retrieved a small crimson ship from her storage and tossed it into the air. The ship began expanding midair until it was large enough to accommodate a thousand people with ease. The sudden appearance of such a massive flying treasure left everyone at the harbor utterly dumbfounded.","\"This is the Soaring Phoenix,\" Feng Yuxiang introduced the flying treasure to them as she jumped on it. \"Although it's not the fastest flying treasure out there, it has what many ordinary flying treasures lack—defensive formations that will keep its riders safe. As long as we don't encounter any Immortal-level threat, we'll be safe while riding it.\"","Yuan and Xi Meili entered the ship a moment later.","\"This is quite something. Why didn't you bring this out before? We could've used something like this during some of our long travels.\"","Feng Yuxiang then said, \"Because it doesn't operate with just spiritual energy. It also requires Immortal Qi, which can only be found in the Seventh Heaven and above.\"","Moments later, the Soaring Phoenix stirred to life, and in the blink of an eye, it shot into the distance, vanishing from the harbor's view, leaving only ripples in its wake and stunned silence behind."]},{"number":1937,"title":"Chapter 1937 Sea of Dragons","paragraphs":["Chapter 1937 Sea of Dragons","After entering the Sea of Dragons, it didn't take long for the sea beasts to launch their assault on the Soaring Phoenix. Even though the flying treasure flew high above the waves, the creatures below unleashed powerful long-range attacks. Some even went as far as jumping out of the water to strike them using their entire body.","The sea beasts of the Sea of Dragons were notoriously aggressive, attacking anything that moved without hesitation. This was one of many reasons why few dared to traverse its waters. Navigating the sea required not only specialized equipment but also a vast amount of resources to defend against the relentless onslaught of these powerful creatures.","\"Why are the sea creatures here so aggressive? It wasn't nowhere this bad at the Purple Sea,\" Xi Meili wondered out loud as she watched them bounce off an invisible barrier that protected the flying treasure.","\"Well, dragons are aggressive creatures by nature,\" Feng Yuxiang said with a casual shrug.","\"That's not true... at least not for the dragons in the Ancient Dragon City,\" Xi Meili responded, a hint of defensiveness in her tone.","\"I'm not saying all dragons are violent,\" Feng Yuxiang replied calmly. \"But many are. It's in their blood—just like how phoenixes are naturally prideful creatures. It's part of who we are.\"","\"...\"","Xi Meili fell silent, unable to refute Feng Yuxiang's words, especially with the evidence right before her eyes. The sea beasts, dragon-like in form and ferocity, were living proof of the aggression woven into their bloodline. All she could do was watch in quiet contemplation.","\"So, how do you plan on approaching the Holy Dragon Clan, Young Master? I can't say I've dealt with them before, but I've heard many stories about them.\" Feng Yuxiang asked Yuan.","\"Are you going to disguise yourself as a Dragon Emperor like you usually do?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"No, that trick probably won't work with them, especially if they're one of the top dragon clans in the Nine Heavens. Moreover, their God Ascension experts will most likely see through my disguise.\"","\"Then how are you going to trick them? I doubt they'd pay attention to a human.\" Feng Yuxiang said.","\"Since there's a good chance they have a connection with Dragon Goddess Yeyou, I can use that to my advantage. After all, I have Dragon Goddess Yeyou's soul with me.\"","\"I see... so you're going to use Dragon Goddess Yeyou's identity...\"","\"If that doesn't work, I'll think of something else.\"","The Sea of Dragons was so vast that even with a high-speed flying treasure, crossing from one end to the other would take years. The Dragon Spiral Mountain was located at the very heart of the Sea of Dragons, and Yuan estimated that their journey would take several months at the very least.","With an abundance of time, the group dedicated themselves to cultivation. Thanks to the rich spiritual energy of the Seventh Heaven, Xi Meili's cultivation advanced at an astonishing pace.","Lan Yingying and Yingzi appeared to cultivate. While Lan Yingying focused on stabilizing her cultivation, Yingzi's cultivation soared at an unimaginable speed. After a few weeks at sea, Feng Yuxiang returned to Yuan's Dantian and entered slumber. Fortunately, the Soaring Phoenix required no active supervision to operate. With a destination already set and absorbing the natural spiritual energy and Immortal Qi around it, the ship continued sailing steadily toward Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Meanwhile, Yuan continued to absorb the spiritual energy within the Demon Devouring Sword. It didn't take long for his Divine King cultivation to enter the Divine Emperor realm. However, after reaching the peak of Divine Emperor, Yuan encountered his bottleneck.","<An unknown force prevents your cultivation from advancing further>","<Any additional Qi you consume will be used to strengthen your body instead>","After reaching his bottleneck, Yuan focused on improving his Soul Strength.","Unlike spiritual energy, which could only be enhanced by absorbing more of it, Immortal Qi functioned differently. While it could be strengthened through conventional cultivation, it also grew stronger through one's Soul Strength, hence why Immortals spend more time cultivating their Soul Cultivation Technique than their Spiritual Cultivation Technique.","Of course, due to the rarity of Soul Cultivation Techniques, not all Immortals had the luxury of strengthening their Soul Strength. This was where factions became crucial. Beyond offering protection and resources, many powerful factions possessed Soul Cultivation Techniques, making them invaluable to those seeking to advance further.","'Heaven's Indomitable Soul... truly an unfathomable technique. I wonder how it's related to my past lives...' Yuan thought to himself as his Soul Strength strengthened with every passing second.","As the Soaring Phoenix drew closer to Dragon Spiral Mountain, the sea beasts grew noticeably more aggressive and far more powerful. Their appearances also resembled dragons more and more.","At first, the Soaring Phoenix effortlessly absorbed all incoming attacks, its defenses unfazed by the sea beasts' aggression. But now, the sea beasts were powerful enough to shake the flying treasure with their attacks.","\"The barrier looks like it's struggling... It's not going to break, is it?\" Xi Meili asked, a worried look on her face as the ship shuddered again.","\"Feng Feng said the flying treasure can withstand attacks up to the Silver Immortal level,\" Yuan replied calmly. \"The sea beasts are still only in the Immortal Ascension realm, so we're fine—for now.\"","\"Is that so?\" Feeling relieved, Xi Meili returned to her cultivation.","In just eight months, Xi Meili increased her cultivation to the 8th level of Divine Master from Divine Warrior. Lan Yingying had stabilized her cultivation at the 1st level of the Divine Lord level and had begun cultivating toward the next level by herself. As for Yingzi, her cultivation saw the most significant improvements, reaching the 3rd level of Divine Grandmaster. As their journey entered its ninth month, the Soaring Phoenix came to a sudden halt for the first time since they had set sail.","Sensing the shift, Yuan and the others paused their cultivation to investigate, expecting to see their destination. But to their confusion, the Dragon Spiral Mountain was nowhere in sight.","\"Young Master, several powerful presences are blocking our path,\" Feng Yuxiang reported calmly. \"But it doesn't seem like they've noticed us. In fact, it looks like they're currently fighting among themselves.\""]},{"number":1938,"title":"Chapter 1938 Ancient Monolith","paragraphs":["1938 Ancient Monolith","After hearing Feng Yuxiang's words, Yuan expanded the range of his divine sense. Although he kept it active at all times, he usually limited its scope to avoid distracting others—or worse, being mistaken for spying, a common source of conflict among cultivators.","Several hundred miles away, Yuan's divine sense locked onto a large gathering of individuals. They were unmistakably dragons—humanoid in form but marked by prominent horns and swaying dragon tails.","There were around twenty of them, split into two distinct factions. One group was dressed in elegant white and gold robes, radiating a noble aura. The other wore black and light blue garments, their presence colder and more ominous.","\"The Holy Dragon Clan has monopolized the Dragon Spiral Mountain for far too long!\" One of the black and blue-clothed individuals shouted angrily. \"Shut up! We've been protecting the Dragon Spiral Mountain since the Primordial Era! What right do you have to tell us to leave?!\"","\"That's right, you greedy bastards!\"","\"Your intentions for wanting the Dragon Spiral Mountain aren't good, either! We'll never hand it over to you!\"","The gold-robed individuals responded.","\"Young Master, should we intervene?\" Feng Yuxiang asked Yuan.","\"Not yet. If we intervene now, we might offend both sides. Let's wait a little longer,\" he calmly responded.","Soon, the Holy Dragon Clan and the opposing faction resumed their battle.","The combatants were all powerful, most being at the Immortal Ascension realm, with each side led by a single Bronze Immortal. At first, the two forces seemed evenly matched, their attacks shaking the very air with dragon techniques.","But as the battle dragged on, it became clear that the dragons in black and blue robes were gaining the upper hand, steadily pushing back the Holy Dragon Clan.","\"I'm going to intervene now.\" Yuan suddenly left the Soaring Phoenix and flew toward the battle.","Sometime later, once Yuan arrived at the scene, he cleared his throat loudly and spoke, \"Excuse me, can I have a moment of your attention?\"","\"Huh? Who the hell is that?\"","Both sides abruptly halted their battle and turned their attention to Yuan. At first, they tensed with suspicion, assuming he was a reinforcement from the opposing side. But as they caught his scent and realized he was human, their expressions shifted from wariness to confusion.","\"I'm trying to find the Dragon Spiral Mountain, but I'm lost,\" Yuan continued speaking in a calm and clear despite the tension in the air.","\"T-This crazy human bastard actually interrupted us over some bullshit like that...?\"","\"You'll pay for your sin with death!\"","One of the black-robed dragons suddenly flew at Yuan with clear killing intent radiating from his aura.","\"What's with the hostility? I'm just trying to ask for directions...\"","Yuan sighed as he retrieved Dragon God's Vengeance.","\"?!?!?!\"","The instant the Dragon God's Vengeance appeared, the black-robed dragon charging toward Yuan came to an abrupt halt, his instincts screaming at him to stop.","Gasps rippled through the others, their faces etched with instinctive terror. A primal fear gripped them—one they couldn't suppress—as the weapon exuded a deadly pressure that made their very blood run cold. From the Dragon God's Vengeance, they felt an overwhelming aura of destruction, one that threatened their lives just by existing.","\"What's wrong? Weren't you about to punish me for my sins?\" Yuan asked calmly, his gaze fixed on the dragon who had just charged at him.","\"T-That's...\" the dragon stammered, his voice trembling. He hesitated to speak further, terrified that a single wrong word might provoke the figure before him and cost him his life.","Instead, a voice from the Holy Dragon Clan spoke a moment later.","\"What business do you have at Dragon Spiral Mountain?\"","The speaker was their Bronze Immortal—a woman whose tone carried both authority and unease. Though Yuan's cultivation appeared negligible at first glance, her eyes were fixed on the ominous weapon in his grasp. Something about it unsettled her deeply. It radiated a presence that felt inherently hostile to dragons, perhaps even a bane to their kind.","The others from the Holy Dragon Clan quickly grasped the intent behind their Bronze Immortal's question. Their expressions sharpened, and subtle shifts in their stances revealed their readiness. If Yuan's next words hinted at any ill intent toward Dragon Spiral Mountain, they were prepared to act—no matter how ominous the weapon in his hand appeared.","\"It's complicated.\"","\"I don't care how complicated it is. Explain.\"","Yuan's gaze sharpened, a chill threading through his voice as he addressed the Bronze Immortal. \"I don't like your tone.\"","Sensing the undercurrent of danger, the Bronze Immortal instinctively shifted into a defensive stance. The others reacted similarly and prepared to face Yuan.","Seeing this, Yuan stowed away the Dragon God's Vengeance and said calmly, \"My business with Dragon Spiral Mountain concerns Dragon Goddess Yeyou. That's all I'll say.\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou?!\"","21:54","Gasps rippled through the crowd, shock evident on every face. The mere mention of her name from a human's lips left them stunned.","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou?!\"","Gasps rippled through the crowd, shock evident on every face. The mere mention of her name from a human's lips left them stunned.","Even among the dragon clans, Dragon Goddess Yeyou was a name spoken rarely, known only to a few. That a human would mention her made the moment all the more startling.","Meanwhile, deep within the Dragon Spiral Mountain, a towering monolith of unknown origin stood in silent majesty. Moments after Yuan took out the Dragon God's Vengeance, the monolith stirred, releasing a profound aura that swept across the mountain like a silent storm. The sudden pulse of unfathomable power startled every being in its reach, even those at the God Ascension Realm.","Within moments, many powerful figures appeared before the monolith.","\"W-What is going on with the Ancient Monolith?! It hasn't reacted like this since Dragon Goddess Yeyou's disappearance!\"","\"Is it sensing Dragon Goddess Yeyou's presence?! Has she finally returned to us?!\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou has returned!\"","\"Quickly! Notify the Holy Dragon Emperor and the rest of the clan!\"","Unbeknownst to Yuan, he'd accidentally stirred up a storm within the Dragon Spiral Mountain, sending the Holy Dragon Clan into a frenzy."]},{"number":1939,"title":"Chapter 1939 Holy Dragon Clan","paragraphs":["1939 Holy Dragon Clan","\"Well, if you're not going to tell me where to find the Dragon Spiral Mountain, I'll take my leave now.\" Yuan said shortly after putting away the Dragon God's Vengeance.","Without giving the Holy Dragon Clan an opportunity to speak, Yuan turned around and flew away.","\"W-Wait a second—!\"","The Bronze Immortal from the Holy Dragon Clan tried to chase after Yuan but was blocked by the black-robed dragons.","\"Where do you think you're going?! We're not finished here yet!\"","\"Get lost!\"","Their battle continued, but in a sudden shift, the tides turned. The Holy Dragon Clan, who had been on the brink of defeat just moments earlier, now surged with newfound strength, quickly overpowering the black-robed dragons.","Realizing they could no longer stand against the Holy Dragon Clan, the black-robed dragons retreated. But instead of taking to the skies, they plunged into the sea below, vanishing beneath the waves.","\"We need to return to the Dragon Spiral Mountain and report what happened here to the others,\" said the Bronze Immortal.","Meanwhile, Yuan returned to the Soaring Phoenix and continued to watch them fight from a safe distance.","\"Are you sure you should've just left them like that?\" Feng Yuxiang asked. She thought he was going to save the Holy Dragon Clan.","\"It's fine. I doubt they'd believe anything I say. My purpose was just to reveal my presence to them and make them question my identity so when I show up at the Dragon Spiral Mountain later, they won't immediately turn me away.\"","\"I see... but what if they perish at the hands of those black-robed dragons?\"","Yuan then responded in confidence, \"Although they are fighting with each other, none of them are showing real killing intent, so it is unlikely they are going to kill each other. If things get real dangerous, I'll intervene again.\"","In the end, events unfolded just as Yuan had predicted. The clash between the Holy Dragon Clan and the black-robed dragons concluded without any true casualties.","Shortly after the Holy Dragon Clan left, the Soaring Phoenix began moving again, slowly following behind them.","At the same time, the rest of the Holy Dragon Clan was in an uproar due to the Ancient Monolith's sudden activity.","Shortly after the Ancient Monolith sensed the Dragon God's Vengeance, nearly every single bigshot and important figure within the Holy Dragon Clan appeared at the monolith to witness the phenomenon for themselves.","\"I-It's true! The Ancient Monolith has awakened!\" \"Does this mean that Dragon Goddess Yeyou is really back?\"","\"What should we do now?\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor then spoke.","\"We must prepare for Dragon Goddess Yeyou's return!\"","Though it remained uncertain whether Dragon Goddess Yeyou had truly returned—or when she might appear—the Holy Dragon Clan dared not take any chances. They began preparing in earnest for her grand return.","\"It stopped!\"","Moments later, the Ancient Monolith fell silent once more, its presence returning to stillness. However, that did not change their plans, and the Holy Dragon Clan went on to prepare for Dragon Goddess Yeyou's return regardless.","Shortly after, the Holy Dragon Clan received news from the group that Yuan had encountered in the Sea of Dragons.","\"What? A human who knows about Dragon Goddess Yeyou was looking for the directions to our Dragon Spiral Mountain?\" The Holy Dragon Emperor almost couldn't believe his ears.","Besides those living in the Dragon Spiral Mountain and those who lived near it, knowledge of Dragon Goddess Yeyou was almost nonexistent.","'Does this human have something to do with the Ancient Monolith's activation?' he wondered inwardly as he received this news.","\"Where is this human now?\" he asked the messenger.","\"According to the scouts, he left before they could stop him.\"","\"What? How could a mere human escape from their grasp?\" Holy Dragon Emperor questioned out loud with raised eyebrows.","\"They were stopped by those sea bastards, whom they encountered and was fighting before meeting the human.\"","\"Seriously...?\" The Holy Dragon Emperor rubbed his eyes and continued, \"How long before they return?\"","\"They should return in 45 days.\"","\"As you wish, Your Majesty.\"","Once the messenger left, the Holy Dragon Emperor lifted his head to look at the tall ceiling and mumbled, \"Are you truly back, Dragon Goddess...?\"","Forty-three days later, the dragons who had encountered Yuan finally returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain. They were summoned without delay by the Holy Dragon Emperor, who demanded they recount every detail of their encounter.","'Their encounter with that human coincides almost perfectly with the activation of the Ancient Monolith... And a spear of such unfathomable power, is it?' The Holy Dragon Emperor mused silently, his thoughts deep and unreadable.","\"Your Majesty, what should we do about them? They're becoming more brazen by the day,\" asked the Bronze Immortal, who was still unaware of the Ancient Monolith's activation.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan, huh? Stubborn as ever—they won't rest until the Dragon Spiral Mountain is theirs,\" the Holy Dragon Emperor muttered, his gaze distant. \"I have no desire for war, but neither can we surrender the mountain.\" He let out a weary sigh.","\"So war is unavoidable, huh?\" The Bronze Immortal shook her head.","\"Unfortunately. Anyway, you are dismissed. Thank you for the report.\"","\"I do not deserve your recognition, Your Majesty.\"","Time passed swiftly, and within a week, the Soaring Phoenix had brought Yuan close enough to see the Dragon Spiral Mountain rising on the horizon.","Unlike its counterpart on Earth, the Dragon Spiral Mountain in the Seventh Heaven was vastly more expansive—so immense that the one on Earth would amount to barely ten percent of its size.","After another day of travel, the Soaring Phoenix finally reached the Dragon Spiral Mountain. However, before they could get close to the land, several figures emerged from the skies, surrounding their flying treasure and blocking any further approach."]},{"number":1940,"title":"Chapter 1940 A Real Dragon Emperor","paragraphs":["1940 A Real Dragon Emperor","\"Identify yourselves!\"","A group of golden-robed dragons surrounded the Soaring Phoenix.","\"My name is Xiao Yang, and this is my traveling companion, Xi Meili.\"","\"What purpose do you have at our Dragon Spiral Mountain?\"","\"That doesn't concern you,\" Yuan calmly said.","\"Doesn't concern us?! We, the Holy Dragon Clan, are the rightful owners of the Dragon Spiral Mountain! Everything related to the mountain is of our concern!\"","\"If you're looking to cause trouble here, get lost before we forcefully remove you!\"","Hearing their threats, Yuan laughed out loud, \"I heard the Holy Dragon Clan are Dragon Goddess Yeyou's loyal followers. What if I told you that I am Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy? Will you still tell me to leave then?\"","\"What?! Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy?!\"","A wave of shock swept through the crowd, but it quickly faded, replaced by rising anger, as though Yuan's words had been a deliberate insult to them.","One of them sneered, \"I was wondering what sort of excuse you'll give, but Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy? What absolute rubbish!\"","Another spoke with contempt in his voice, \"Who do you think you're trying to fool?! Why would Dragon Goddess Yeyou choose a lowly human as her envoy?!\"","Yuan turned to look at the one who had just questioned him and responded with narrowed eyes, \"That's a funny thing to say, considering that Dragon Goddess Yeyou was once a loyal servant to a lowly human.\"","Yuan's words instantly shifted the atmosphere, drawing frowns from the surrounding dragons, yet not one of them could offer a rebuttal.","\"If you claim to be Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy, you must have proof. Let us see it.\"","Yuan fell silent, mostly because he didn't have anything that could be used as evidence.","\"What? You don't have anything to prove your identity? Why am I not surprised? How dare you try to take advantage of us using Dragon Goddess Yeyou's name! You'll pay for your crimes with death! Kill them!\"","The next moment, all of the dragons lunged at the Soaring Phoenix.","Seeing this, Yuan activated his Dragon Transformation and retrieved Dragon God's Vengeance.","However, he only intended to scare them, so he didn't attack them. Of course, the dragons were all frozen from fear the moment they sensed the Dragon God's Vengeance.","Yuan then spoke, \"It's not that I don't want to show you proof. Information about Dragon Goddess Yeyou is highly sensitive, and you're simply not qualified to hear it. Take me to your leader—the head of the Holy Dragon Clan.\"","The dragons exchanged uncertain glances, but before any could speak, a powerful presence descended upon them.","A figure emerged, radiating a domineering aura that commanded instant reverence. He, too, was a dragon, clad in a resplendent golden robe nearly identical to the Golden Dragon Robe in Yuan's possession.","Yuan couldn't discern the depth of his cultivation, but instinct told him this was a being who had stepped into the God Ascension Realm.","At the sight of him, the surrounding dragons immediately bowed in unison.","\"We greet His Majesty, the Holy Dragon Emperor!\"","In the next instant, several more dragons appeared, each radiating a profound and majestic presence—just a shade beneath that of the Holy Dragon Emperor himself.","Seeing this, the dragons hastily greeted them, \"W-We greet the Holy Dragon Ancestor, Supreme Elder, Holy Princess, Holy Prince, Holy—\"","\"Enough.\"","The Dragon Emperor suddenly interrupted. If he'd allowed them to continue the greetings, they'd be there all day.","He then turned to face Yuan with slightly narrowed eyes.","'He's clearly human, yet he possesses the ability to transform into a dragon... Only those with a pure and high-quality dragon bloodline can achieve such a feat. And yet, such individuals usually carry a strong dragon scent—but from him, I sense nothing of that sort, ' the Holy Dragon Emperor mused inwardly, his gaze sharp as he studied Yuan's Dragon Transformation.","When he attempted to probe deeper into Yuan's body, a sudden chill crept down his spine. He couldn't quite identify it, but within Yuan's very bones, he sensed the presence of something ancient... something unfathomably profound, lying dormant yet quietly watching.","'Among the scarce fragments of knowledge surrounding Dragon Goddess Yeyou, there was one rumor that stood out. It was said she possessed the power to bestow her talents upon any being, dragon or not. With her blessing, even the weakest of creatures, an ant, could wield the might of dragons,' he recalled, the memory surfacing like a forgotten echo from a bygone era.","\"Human, I heard your earlier words,\" the Dragon Emperor said, his tone calm yet laced with innate pride. \"I may not be the leader of the Holy Dragon Clan, but my status within it is no less significant. Tell me—am I, the Dragon Emperor, worthy to see your so-called proof?\"","This was Yuan's first encounter with a real Dragon Emperor. However, after encountering many ancient dragons within the Primal Expanse, the Dragon Emperor before him did not feel anything special. \"I don't mind showing you.\"","Holy Dragon Emperor nodded and spoke, \"We can continue our conversation somewhere more private. Follow me.\"","He turned around and flew inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Seeing this, Feng Yuxiang, who was still inside Yuan's Dantian, continued the Soaring Phoenix to follow the Holy Dragon Emperor.","Soon, they entered the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Although the other dragons didn't like the idea of letting someone as suspicious as Yuan enter their sacred territory, none of them could defy the Dragon Emperor's decision.","Once the Soaring Phoenix entered the Dragon Spiral Mountain, the other powerhouses followed behind to ensure Yuan wouldn't try anything funny. Though their cultivations far surpassed Yuan's and they could probably kill him with a sneeze, an unshakable unease settled over them in the presence of the Dragon God's Vengeance.","Meanwhile, the moment Yuan entered the Dragon Spiral Mountain, he could feel something stirring within him.","'This feeling... the Nine Dragon Symbols? Is it reacting to something within the Dragon Spiral Mountain?' he wondered inwardly."]},{"number":1941,"title":"Chapter 1941 Destroying the Ancient Monolith","paragraphs":["1941 Destroying the Ancient Monolith","After entering the Dragon Spiral Mountain, the Dragon Emperor led Yuan to the mouth of a colossal cave, its entrance veiled in a faint, ancient pressure. As they approached, the Nine Dragon Symbols within Yuan stirred restlessly, trembling with excitement. Whatever it was resonating with was inside the cave. \"This is the first time an outsider has visited this place,\" said Holy Dragon Emperor as they reached the entrance.","\"It's an honor,\" Yuan smiled.","\"However, if you fail to prove your identity, you won't be able to leave this place alive.\"","\"...\"","\"Let's go.\"","The Dragon Emperor entered the cave, and Yuan calmly followed him. Xi Meili quietly trailed behind Yuan, staying close to him. Due to her lack of cultivation, just being in the presence of so many powerful beings was a challenge for her.","After traversing a shadowed tunnel, they emerged into a vast, dimly lit cavern. At its center stood a towering monolith, ancient and imposing, its presence dominating the chamber in solemn silence.","'That monolith must be the cause for the Nine Dragon Symbol's unrest...' Yuan narrowed his gaze at the Ancient Monolith.","The Dragon Emperor came to a halt about a dozen meters from the monolith, then turned to face Yuan.","\"Only those who hold the highest status within the Holy Dragon Clan are permitted to enter this place,\" he said calmly. \"So rest assured—everyone present is just as qualified as I am to witness your proof.\"","Yuan turned around to look at the others who followed them to the monolith and nodded, \"I don't mind.\"","\"Then whenever you are ready.\"","The Dragon Emperor and the others fell into a heavy silence, their gazes fixed on Yuan as they patiently awaited the proof of his claim as the envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","\"...\"","'Since it has come to this point, let's just try summoning her...'","Yuan retrieved the Dragon God's Vengeance again, unaware of the Holy Dragon Clan's true intentions.","They alone knew of the Ancient Monolith's ability to sense the presence of Dragon Goddess Yeyou. And with Yuan's arrival coinciding perfectly with its recent awakening, they had a strong suspicion that he was the cause. They only needed to confirm their suspicions with their own eyes.","However, when Yuan retrieved the Dragon God's Vengeance, the Ancient Monolith remained silent.","This caused the Dragon Emperor and the others to raise their eyebrows.","'He's not the cause for the Ancient Monolith's awakening?'","'If not him, then who was responsible?'","The Dragon Emperor let out a quiet sigh, his voice laced with disappointment as he spoke,","\"He's not the one. Kill him.\"","\"What?\" Yuan's eyes widened in shock at the sudden decree. He hadn't even had the chance to call upon Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","\"I'll handle him,\" said a girl with the appearance of a refined young lady.","In the next moment, her aura flared—powerful and sharp—revealing her cultivation at the Silver Immortal Realm.","\"You dare exploit the name of Dragon Goddess Yeyou? You wretched human... you'll pay for your insolence!\"","With a flash of movement, she lunged at Yuan, her body partially transformed. Her right arm morphed into a massive, white-scaled limb that gleamed with draconic power as it tore through the air toward him.","Yuan did not dare to underestimate her and immediately activated Dragon Transformation.","The moment Yuan transformed, the Ancient Monolith behind the Dragon Emperor began trembling. However, nobody there noticed it since they were fully absorbed with Yuan's transformation.","\"Get behind me!\" Yuan shouted, stepping forward to shield Xi Meili as his gaze locked onto the charging young lady.","A heartbeat later, their clash erupted. The sheer force of their collision sent shockwaves through the cavern, causing the very walls to tremble beneath the pressure.","Though Yuan managed to block the attack, the impact sent him hurtling through the air, and he was thrown directly toward the Ancient Monolith, crashing into its surface a moment later with a resounding thud.","\"Yuan!\" Xi Meili exclaimed.","\"I'm fine...\" Yuan muttered as he rose to his feet. Though he hadn't suffered any injuries, the situation was far from ideal. No matter how talented he was, there was no way for him to defeat so many experts at once. Even if he could escape with his life intact, there was still Xi Meili, who was his biggest concern.","\"Huh?\"","However, just as Yuan braced for the young lady's next strike, he paused. Something was wrong. She, along with the other dragons, stood frozen, their eyes locked onto him, wide with disbelief, as if they were witnessing the impossible.","It was then that Yuan noticed a subtle vibration behind him—the Ancient Monolith was trembling beneath his touch.","\"Why is the Ancient Monolith reacting now?! Is Dragon Goddess Yeyou nearby?!\"","The Dragon Emperor immediately spread his divine sense as far as possible, covering the entire Dragon Spiral Mountain and much more. However, he was unable to sense Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","As the Dragon Emperor and the others anxiously scanned the area for any sign of Dragon Goddess Yeyou, a sudden flash of movement drew their eyes back to Yuan.","The Dragon God's Vengeance slipped free from his grasp, rising into the air to hover before him, gleaming with an eerie light.","\"Yeyou...?\" Yuan murmured, confused.","The spear slowly tilted—its tip turning not toward the crowd, but toward Yuan... or more precisely, the Ancient Monolith behind him.","Whoosh!","In the blink of an eye, the Dragon God's Vengeance surged forward without hesitation, transforming into a streak of light. Before anyone could react, it pierced the Ancient Monolith and rooted itself within—a structure long believed by the Holy Dragon Clan to be utterly indestructible.","<Dragon God's Vengeance has absorbed a fragment of Dragon Goddess Yeyou's Soul>","<Dragon Goddess Yeyou's Soul has regained some of its strength>","\"Y-You destroyed the Ancient Monolith?! Are you insane?!\"","The Dragon Emperor roared in anger after snapping out of his daze. Even if Yuan were Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy, he wouldn't be spared for such blasphemy.","But in the very next moment, the Dragon God's Vengeance released a wave of profound aura—deep and ancient. From within its radiant glow, a figure slowly began to emerge, cloaked in divine presence.","Once she fully materialized, she was revealed to be a woman of breathtaking beauty. Yet, none among the dragons spared a thought for her appearance, as her overwhelming presence was so overbearing that it engulfed the entire Dragon Spiral Mountain.","And though none of the dragons recognized her appearance, not a single one of them doubted her identity for even a split second.","She was none other than Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","\"D-Dragon Goddess—\"","The Dragon Emperor began to speak, but his words faltered and died in his throat as Dragon Goddess Yeyou turned to face Yuan without even sparing them a glance.","Yuan stood frozen, eyes wide in disbelief.","Unlike her previous appearance, she was no longer a semi-transparent apparition. The Dragon Goddess standing before him radiated presence and substance, as though she had truly descended into the world once more.","\"Yeyou...\" Yuan breathed her name, the word slipping from his lips without thought.","Without a word, Dragon Goddess Yeyou stepped forward. In one fluid motion, she grasped his collar with a firm hand and pulled him into her before pressing her soft lips against his in a deep, passionate kiss that left everyone there in stunned silence."]},{"number":1942,"title":"Chapter 1942 Four Pieces","paragraphs":["1942 Four Pieces","\"W-What does this vixen think she's doing to my Young Master?!\" Feng Yuxiang exclaimed, her voice filled with envy as she watched this unfold from Yuan's Dantian.","The members of the Holy Dragon Clan stood frozen in place, eyes wide and jaws agape, as if the very ground had been pulled from beneath them. Some looked as though their souls had momentarily left their bodies, stunned beyond words by what they were witnessing.","After what felt like an eternity, Dragon Goddess Yeyou finally released Yuan and spoke, \"This doesn't mean I have forgiven you, so don't think for a second that you're out of the hot water.\"","However, Yuan ignored her words and changed the topic, asking, \"I didn't know your soul wasn't in one piece. Why didn't you mention this before?\"","\"Did you think a mere treasure could contain my soul as a whole? In order to survive, I had to split my soul into several pieces. I am fated to recover my soul, so there's no point mentioning it,\" she explained.","Only a being of Dragon Goddess Yeyou's caliber could speak of splitting her soul with such casual ease. Even cultivators at the God Ascension Realm wouldn't dare attempt such a feat, and realistically, not even a Cultivation God might possess the ability to do what she had done.","\"How many more pieces of your soul are still out there?\" Yuan then asked.","\"I split my soul into four pieces, so there are still two pieces.\"","\"Do you know where I can find them?\"","\"No, since it was the Dragon Ancestor who safeguarded my soul. If you want to know, ask him. However, you'll eventually find them even if you don't.\"","\"Because of fate, huh?\"","\"Anyway... I've reached my limit,\" Dragon Goddess Yeyou said softly, glancing down at her hand as it began to fade, turning slowly transparent.","Her form had taken shape thanks to the recovery of a second fragment of her soul—but it was only temporary.","Before she returned to the Dragon God's Vengeance, Dragon Goddess Yeyou turned to face the Holy Dragon Clan and said, \"If I had a little more time, I would've punished you for baring your fangs at him, but I don't, so I'm willing to give you a second chance. Treat him as you would treat me.\"","As for the young lady who had attacked Yuan, she stood frozen in place, mainly because Dragon Goddess Yeyou's gaze was directly on her. The sheer pressure of such a gaze caused her body to tremble nonstop, her clothes drenched in sweat.","Without saying another word, Dragon Goddess Yeyou returned inside the Dragon God's Vengeance.","A deafening silence settled over the cavern in the wake of Dragon Goddess Yeyou's departure. Not a single member of the Holy Dragon Clan rose to their feet even long after her presence had faded. It was as if they dared not move, awaiting Yuan's permission.","\"You guys can stand up now...\" Yuan eventually said, breaking the silence.","The dragons slowly rose to their feet, nodding in silent acknowledgment. Their gazes lingered on Yuan, filled with questions they clearly wished to ask, yet none of them dared to speak them aloud.","Knowing that his identity would be revealed sooner or later, Yuan decided to just reveal it himself.","\"When I said that I was Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy... I lied, sorry. I'm actually the master of the Nine Divine Supreme—the Immortal Monarch. I know this is hard to believe, so I am willing to prove my identity.\"","However, to his surprise, the Dragon Emperor shook his head and said, \"There's no need. We believe you. After all, the Dragon Goddess Yeyou would only do something like that to the Immortal Monarch.\"","Of course, despite his confident tone, his face was full of shock and disbelief.","\"The Holy Dragon Clan is at your service, Immortal Monarch. If you wish, we'd even be willing to go to war for you.\"","Yuan shook his head and quickly said, \"That's not necessary. I didn't come to the Dragon Spiral Mountain to take advantage of the Holy Dragon Clan.\"","\"In that case, why did you come here? Was it to retrieve the Dragon Goddess' soul from the Ancient Monolith?\"","\"No, that was just a coincidence. I came here because I need to use the Dragon Spiral Mountain's teleport formation.\"","\"The teleport formation...? May I ask for what purpose? It hasn't been activated ever since the Divine Heaven became the Nine Heavens.\"","\"Do you know about 'Players'?'","\"You mean those from the missing fragment of the Divine Heaven who travel here with the help of the Celestial Emperor—those like you?\"","Yuan calmly nodded. He was not surprised that the Dragon Emperor saw through his avatar since it had happened before.","\"My real body is currently in the other world, but due to special circumstances, I am unable to return to it. In other words, I am stuck here as a soul avatar, and in order to return to my body, I will need to activate the Dragon Spiral Mountain's teleport formation and connect this world to my world, where the other Dragon Spiral Mountain exists.\"","The Dragon Emperor nodded his head as he digested the information.","\"I understand the situation. Unfortunately, we have a slight issue. The key to activating the formation is currently in the Azure Dragon Clan's possession...\"","\"Azure Dragon Clan?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows. He recalled the dragons in black and blue robes from before.","\"Yes, they're the dragon clan that commands the Sea of Dragons, and they've been trying to acquire the Dragon Spiral Mountain for centuries now. We lost the key to them several decades ago after losing to them in a certain battle.\"","\"Why are they trying to acquire this place?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"They never say it out loud and refute anything we say, but it's clear that they want the Dragon Spiral Mountain to appease the Great One,\" explained the Dragon Emperor.","\"Appeasing the Great One...?\" Yuan repeated in a mumble."]},{"number":1943,"title":"Chapter 1943: Azure Dragon Clan","paragraphs":["\"Appeasing the Great One?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","The Dragon Emperor gave a solemn nod and began to explain, \"Just as we are devoted to Dragon Goddess Yeyou, the Azure Dragon Clan offers their loyalty to the Great One. They would go to any lengths just to earn even a sliver of his attention.\"","\"Unfortunately for them, the Great One rarely shows interest in anything, as he already possesses everything one could desire. However, there is one exception—he always shows interest in matters related to Dragon Goddess Yeyou. And while our Dragon Spiral Mountain may not hold any true connection to her... It's enough to pique the Great One's interest.\"","\"Fortunately for us, the Great One is too prideful to personally take over this place, hence the Azure Dragon Clan's motivation. Anyway, if we want to activate the teleport formation, we will need to retrieve the key from them, but they definitely won't let it go without a fight.\"","After taking a moment to digest the information, Yuan asked, \"How did you lose it in the first place?\"","A stiff smile made its way on the Dragon Emperor's face as he spoke, \"I'm ashamed to even say this, but we lost it in a bet.\"","Yuan looked at him with a dumbfounded face.","\"A bet?\"","He nodded and explained, \"Every five hundred years, all dragon families with royal bloodlines gather to have their youngest evaluated for talent. During the last gathering, we made a wager with the Azure Dragon Clan—staking the key on our belief that our family would produce the most gifted genius. But in the end... they won.\"","\"In other words, they won the key fair and square, huh?\" Yuan sighed. He was hoping that the Azure Dragon Clan had acquired the key by force, giving him justification to reclaim it by force.","\"Anyway, I'll think of something to reclaim the key. Is there a way to contact the Azure Dragon Clan? I'd like to have a conversation with them.\"","\"Of course. There's no way the Azure Dragon Clan would refuse audience with the Immortal Monarch,\" said the Dragon Emperor.","Yuan quickly shook his head and said, \"No, I don't want to reveal my identity. In fact, I expect everyone here to keep my identity a secret. It's not time for the world to know that I have returned... not yet.\"","\"I understand. In that case, while it might not be peaceful, we can still set up a meeting with them. However, we'll need a reason to do so. They won't just accept a meeting for no reason.\"","Yuan began pondering in silence. A few moments later, a sly smile appeared on his face. The Dragon Emperor and the other subconsciously swallowed nervously after seeing his smile.","\"Alright, this is what we'll do...\" Yuan began explaining his plan to the Holy Dragon Clan.","Sometime later, the Dragon Emperor smiled at Yuan's plan and nodded, \"Alright, I'll follow your plan. Since it might take some time for them to respond, we'll prepare a living quarter for you to stay.\"","He turned to look at the young lady who had fought with Yuan and said, \"Sheng Qing, take them to our best living quarters and stay with them while I contact the Azure Dragon Clan.\"","\"Y-Yes!\" she hastily nodded.","The Dragon Emperor turned to Yuan and said, \"There's still much I'd like to discuss with you... but let's continue this conversation later—after I've had time to fully process everything that's happened today. To be honest, I'm still overwhelmed. It's difficult to believe any of this is real...\"","\"Take your time.\"","Yuan and Xi Meili followed Sheng Qing to their living quarters shortly after.","Once Yuan was gone, the Dragon Emperor and the others could finally breathe properly. Some of them even fell onto their buttocks from fatigue despite being Immortals.","\"What do you think of that human? Is he really the Immortal Monarch?\"","\"I don't know about that human, but that woman was definitely Dragon Goddess Yeyou. I have never felt my blood tremble like that before—not even before the Great One.\"","The Dragon Emperor spoke with a thoughtful expression on his handsome face, \"He appears far too young to be the Immortal Monarch, and his cultivation is too low. But that doesn't rule out the possibility. In the end, none of those details truly matter. What does matter is his direct connection to Dragon Goddess Yeyou... close enough for her to kiss him without hesitation. Aside from the Immortal Monarch himself, I can't imagine her showing such intimacy to anyone else.\"","After a brief pause, the Dragon Emperor continued, \"Furthermore, Dragon Goddess Yeyou herself commanded that we treat him as we would treat her. So even if he's not the Immortal Monarch, we already have more than enough reason to honor him as one.\"","The surrounding dragons exchanged glances, but none voiced dissent—nor did any show signs of disapproval. Dragon Goddess Yeyou had spoken, and to her loyal followers, her word was absolute.","\"What should we tell the rest of the clan if we have to keep his identity a secret?\"","\"Just follow the original script and tell them he's Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy. As for Dragon Goddess Yeyou's return... we should let them know since they didn't say anything about that.\"","\"Let's do that then.\"","Sometime later, the Dragon Emperor and the others left the cave.","Meanwhile, after departing from the cave, Sheng Qing led Yuan and Xi Meili toward the residential area. The Holy Dragon Clan rarely received visitors, so there were no designated guest quarters—only the private residences of its members. Fortunately, there were still plenty of unoccupied buildings, and Yuan was given the most luxurious building in the Dragon Spiral Mountain while Xi Meili was given the building next to his.","\"If you need anything, you can find me here,\" Sheng Qing said to them.","\"Thank you.\"","\"Um... Senior Immortal...\" Sheng Qing suddenly became fidgety, looking like she was hesitant about something.","Yuan could guess what she wanted to say and spoke with a smile on his face, \"If you're worried about attacking me, you don't have to worry. I wasn't hurt, and I don't blame you for your actions.\"","\"T-Thank you!\"","She immediately bowed, feeling an immense relief, as if a mountain had been lifted off her shoulders."]},{"number":1944,"title":"Chapter 1944: Young Dragons","paragraphs":["A few hours after Yuan and Xi Meili were given a living quarter, the Dragon Emperor showed up at their place.","\"I have contacted the Azure Dragon Clan, but it may take a few days, if not weeks, before we get a response,\" he said. \"In the meantime, you can treat the Dragon Spiral Mountain as if it's your own home.\"","\"I will do just that,\" Yuan nodded.","\"Would you like to walk with me? I'll give you a tour around the place. There's also a lot I would still like to discuss with you.\"","\"Sure.\"","\"Can I come along?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"I don't see why you cannot.\"","As they walked through the residential grounds with the Dragon Emperor leading the way, he suddenly spoke, his tone laced with concern, \"How is the Dragon Goddess? Is she... well?\"","Yuan nodded and responded, \"She's fine.\"","\"May I ask what happened to her? She disappeared right after the Divine Heavens split into the Nine Heavens and hasn't made an appearance until today.\"","\"Let's just say we faced a powerful opponent.\"","The Dragon Emperor fell silent. He couldn't fathom a being stronger than Dragon Goddess Yeyou, who was so powerful that not even the Dragon Ancestor and the Great One could hold a candle against her.","\"I'd like to ask you something as well,\" Yuan said, breaking the silence. \"Why does the Holy Dragon Clan devote itself to her?\"","The Dragon Emperor glanced at him, then replied, \"It is in a dragon's nature to follow strength, and Dragon Goddess Yeyou stands among the most powerful beings in existence. For many, that alone would be reason enough to revere her. But for us, there is another reason we worship her.\"","\"Back then, the Holy Dragon Clan was of no great lineage—just an ordinary bloodline, struggling to survive. We stood on the brink of annihilation.\"","He continued in a solemn voice, \"But Dragon Goddess Yeyou descended in our darkest hour. She gave us a second chance, blessing us with a drop of her divine blood. That single act transformed our lineage, elevating our bloodline to rival even those of royal descent.\"","\"Oh, I think I remember when that happened.\" Yuan suddenly said with a reminiscing expression on his face.","\"Really? It was a time long before I was even born,\" the Dragon Emperor looked at him with surprise.","Even now, he could hardly believe Yuan was the Immortal Monarch.","As they wandered the Dragon Spiral Mountain, its residents would stare at them from a distance while mumbling to each other.","\"That must be Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy. Why do you think he's here?\"","\"I'm more interested in why Dragon Goddess Yeyou chose a human to be her envoy.\"","\"It's not that surprising if you consider that she used to follow a human around.\"","\"You mean the Immortal Monarch? People claim he's human, but I do not believe it for a second. He was definitely a dragon disguising himself as a human, and you cannot convince me otherwise!\"","The Dragon Spiral Mountain in the Nine Heavens closely resembled its counterpart on Earth—a towering peak with a spiraling path winding around its body. However, it was vastly larger in scale, both in height and breadth, soaring several times higher and far more expansive.","Its colossal size was no coincidence—it was a deliberate tribute to Dragon Goddess Yeyou's overwhelming power. The mountain had been purposefully shaped to surpass the others, a testament to her unmatched divinity.","The foot of the mountain was filled with stores, restaurants, and all the amenities one would expect from a thriving city. A little higher up the mountain lay the residential area, sprawling across most of its vast expanse and housing the majority of its inhabitants.","The praying area and training grounds were situated above the residential area, and beyond that point, only those with significant status within the clan were permitted to ascend any higher.","\"How many individuals does the Holy Dragon Clan hold?\" Yuan asked as they arrived at the training grounds, where many young dragons could be seen sparring with each other while supervised by Immortal experts.","\"We have around 20,000 dragons within the Holy Dragon Clan. It may seem like a lot, but we're actually one of the smallest Dragon Clans in the Nine Heavens. The Azure Dragon Clan, for example, has over 100,000 members within its clan. Moreover, only about 50 of us actually have the Holy Dragon Bloodline.\"","The young dragons at the training grounds quickly noticed the Dragon Emperor and bowed to him with respect. A few of them approached him and asked, \"Your Majesty, who is this person? He also has a unique scent on him that I don't recognize,\" one of the young dragons asked as he looked at Yuan with curiosity.","The Dragon Emperor smiled and declared, \"This individual is a human—and the envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy?!\"","The young dragons stiffened in shock, and the realization hit them like thunder. Without hesitation, they bowed deeply to Yuan.","\"We greet the envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\"","Though they didn't fully understand what the title entailed, the mere presence of her name within it was enough. That alone made it sacred.","Yuan gave a casual wave of his hand and said, \"No need for formalities. Just treat me like a friend.\"","\"Then... what exactly is an envoy?!\" one of the young dragons suddenly asked, curiosity gleaming in their eyes.","\"It's like a messenger or representative,\" Yuan replied with a faint smile. \"In this case, I'm a messenger for Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","\"Wow! Does this mean that Dragon Goddess Yeyou sent you here?!\"","\"Why did she send you here? Does she have a message for us?\"","The young dragons bombarded Yuan with questions.","\"Enough. You're bothering him,\" the Dragon Emperor said sharply, his tone firm and commanding, bringing an immediate hush over the young dragons.","\"It's fine,\" Yuan said, and he began answering their questions one by one.","\"That's right, I was sent here by Dragon Goddess Yeyou. As for why I am here... I cannot tell you the full details, but it is related to the Azure Dragon Clan.\""]},{"number":1945,"title":"Chapter 1945: Young Dragons(2)","paragraphs":["\"The Dragon Azure Clan! Did the Dragon Goddess send you here to get rid of those pests trying to steal our home?!\"","The young dragons' eyes sparkled when Yuan mentioned the Dragon Azure Clan.","\"Who knows?\" Yuan shrugged.","A few of the young dragons then approached Xi Meili and asked her, \"Are you also Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy?\"","\"Hm? No, I am not. I am just his traveling companion.\"","\"How old are you, Senior Sister?\" one of them suddenly asked.","\"I stopped counting after 10,000 years,\" she calmly stated.","\"Huh? You're only at that level even after 10,000 years? You must be very lazy, Senior Sister.\"","\"What?! Who are you calling lazy?!\"","Xi Meili's expression froze in disbelief after being called lazy.","Though she was still considered young by dragon standards, the dragons before her were even younger—all under a thousand years old. And yet, each one had a cultivation level that surpassed her own.","Because of this, the young dragons could only view Xi Meili, who was older yet weaker than them, as lazy in their eyes.","\"If you're not lazy, why is your cultivation so much lower than ours?\" asked one of the young dragons, and the others stared at her with a suspicious gaze.","\"T-That's because I grew up in a place with much less spiritual energy than you all!\" Xi Meili explained.","Even though she knew she wasn't lazy, Xi Meili couldn't help but feel uneasy under the weight of so many young dragons' doubtful gazes.","Yuan then spoke, \"We actually just arrived in the Seventh Heaven.\"","\"Ohh...\"","The young dragons nodded their heads as if they understood the situation.","\"Then, would you like to train with us, Senior Sister?\"","\"Of course!\" Xi Meili didn't hesitate to accept their offer.","\"Have fun,\" Yuan said with a smile on his face.","Xi Meili nodded and followed the young dragons to the arena, where she began sparring with them first.","Due to their difference in cultivation, they agreed not to use any martial techniques and focused purely on their skills.","\"I guess she really wasn't lying. Although her cultivation is lacking, she's very experienced and skillful.\"","Xi Meili quickly earned the young dragons' respect with her skillful performance.","However, despite her ten thousand years of experience, she was unable to secure a single victory. Out of ten matches, she lost them all.","It wasn't just their superior cultivation—the young dragons possessed exceptional technique, battle sense, and even physique. They were simply incomparably stronger than the dragons she would spar with within the Ancient Dragon City.","\"Damn it... I knew I was weak, but I didn't expect myself to be this weak... Is this what it means to be a frog in a well?\" Xi Meili mumbled as she lay on the arena, her body soaked in sweat.","\"Don't look so down. You're very talented. I'm sure you'll catch up soon,\" Yuan said as he approached the arena.","Xi Meili turned her head to look at him without getting up and asked, \"If I have your 'Seal', would it make it stronger?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan nodded, \"Yes, you would undoubtedly become stronger with the Immortal Monarch's Supreme Seal.\"","He answered with a serious face.","\"However, I won't give you the seal if that's your reason for wanting it.\"","Xi Meili showed a bittersweet smile.","\"I know. I was only joking.\"","She immediately stood up and spoke loudly, \"Alright! Let's spar again!\"","Yuan turned to the Dragon Emperor.","\"This is just a personal request of mine, but do you mind letting her train with you guys?\"","\"Of course. The young ones seem to have taken a liking to her as well,\" the Dragon Emperor said with a faint nod. \"While her cultivation and experience are certainly lacking, I can sense a remarkable talent within her. My instincts also tell me her bloodline is unique—perhaps even one that could rival our own Holy Dragon Bloodline.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Have you heard of the Ancient Dragon City?\"","The Dragon Emperor's eyes widened.","\"You mean to tell me that she's from that place?\"","\"Not only that, but she's also from a royal bloodline.\"","The Dragon Emperor turned to look at Xi Meili and asked, \"What was her name again?\"","\"Xi Meili.\"","\"Surnamed Xi!\"","The Dragon Emperor trembled.","\"You recognize it?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","He nodded thoughtfully and said, \"There is another Dragon Emperor who bears the surname Xi. His clan resides in the Eighth Heaven. It may be nothing more than coincidence... but there's a chance their bloodlines are connected.\"","\"The Eighth Heaven, huh? I'll be sure to visit them in the future.\"","Some time later, a young female dragon approached Yuan and bowed politely.","\"Senior Envoy, may I respectfully request a spar with you?\" she asked with clear determination in her voice.","Yuan turned to look at her. Though her appearance resembled that of a human teenager, she could very well be over a thousand years old. Her cultivation was nothing to scoff at either, firmly at the peak of Immortal Ascension.","The Dragon Emperor frowned, but before he could say anything, Yuan nodded with a smile.","\"Why not?\"","\"Thank you!\" The female dragon's face immediately brightened.","Yuan followed her to an empty arena shortly after.","\"Huh? Look over there! Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy is going to fight Senior Sister Sheng Ran!\"","Almost everyone at the training ground shifted their attention to Yuan.","\"Sheng Ran? Are you from the main bloodline?\" Yuan asked the female dragon after hearing her name.","\"That is correct. I am the 4th youngest in the family, Sheng Ran. Let's have a great match, Senior Envoy!\"","\"Let's.\"","\"...\"","Yuan and Sheng Ran stood motionless on the stage. Neither made a move even moments later, almost as if they were waiting for the other to strike first.","\"Umm... Senior Envoy, are you not to release the suppression on your cultivation?\" Sheng Ran asked.","\"Hm? This is my real cultivation, though.\"","\"What?! You're only at the peak of Divine Emperor?!\" she exclaimed, not daring to believe him."]},{"number":1946,"title":"Chapter 1946: Young Dragons(3)","paragraphs":["\"There's no way Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy is only a Divine Emperor! You must be teasing me!\" Sheng Ran refused to believe that would be Yuan's true cultivation.","Yuan smiled and said, \"But it's the truth.\"","\"No way...\"","After a moment of awkward silence, Sheng Ran spoke again, \"Okay... I'll suppress my cultivation to match yours.\"","However, Yuan shook his head and said, \"There's no need for you to do that.\"","\"What? But that wouldn't be fair.\"","\"Why not? Because I cannot use Immortal Qi?\"","Sheng Ran quietly nodded.","The next moment, Yuan exuded his Immortal Qi, shocking Sheng Ran and the spectators.","\"He can use Immortal Qi even though he's only a mortal?!\"","In the Seventh Heaven and above, all cultivators who have yet to breakthrough Immortal Ascension and reach Bronze Immortal are considered mortals.","Sheng Ran could only stand there with a dumbfounded look on her face.","\"Are you still going to underestimate me? I promise you that I am Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy for a reason,\" said Yuan, snapping Sheng Ran out of her daze.","\"I-In that case, let's spar without any restrictions...\" she muttered.","Yuan nodded, \"That's more like it.\"","\"By the way, I won't be using any techniques or weapons,\" he added.","\"So you'll only be using your physique? I'll do that as well!\"","\"Whenever you are ready,\" Yuan said calmly.","After a brief moment of stillness, both sprang into action, moving almost at the same instant. Yuan, however, was a split second slower, having deliberately waited for Sheng Ran to make the first move.","Their bodies shrouded in Immortal Qi, Yuan and Sheng Ran collided with explosive force, sending a powerful ripple surging through the arena. Fortunately, a protective formation surrounded the battlefield, containing the shockwave and preventing it from spilling into the surrounding area.","A look of surprise appeared on Sheng Ran's face when she noticed how powerful Yuan's physique was.","'I have never seen such a sturdy and powerful physique before! Can humans really achieve this level of physique as a mortal?!' she cried inwardly.","Sheng Ran was a genius in her own right, hence why she was able to use Immortal Qi while only being at the peak of Immortal Ascension. However, when she compared herself to Yuan, she felt like an ordinary mortal who had no talents.","As the battle wore on, the outcome became increasingly clear. Sheng Ran was drenched in sweat, her breaths growing heavy and uneven, exhaustion evident in every movement.","In stark contrast, Yuan stood calm and composed, without so much as a single drop of sweat marring his body.","The Dragon Emperor watched with intense focus, not daring to miss even the slightest detail.","'His experience and prowess are far above what it appears... This is beyond the realm of geniuses... So he's a True Reincarnator, huh? That explains everything...' The Dragon Emperor finally pieced together the truth and understood the situation.","\"Y-You win!\" Sheng Ran declared her own defeat as she fell to the ground in exhaustion. Although Sheng Ran could wield Immortal Qi, doing so drained her energy and stamina at an alarming rate, especially under the relentless pressure from Yuan. As a result, the match lasted just over an hour before she was completely exhausted, unable to continue.","\"It was a good match,\" said Yuan.","Before Yuan could even step off the stage, another figure leapt onto it, his eyes gleaming with excitement.","\"Senior Envoy, she wasn't even enough to count as a warm-up, was she?\" he said with a grin. \"How about a match with me, Sheng Ming?\"","Yuan turned to look at the handsome young man standing before him. His cultivation had reached Bronze Immortal, and his body exuded an aura that was much stronger than Sheng Ran's.","\"Why not?\" Yuan said with a smile.","Seeing this, Sheng Ran quickly got off the stage so they could begin their fight.","The moment Sheng Ran stepped off the stage, Sheng Ming lunged at Yuan with fierce momentum, his aura surging so violently that the very air around them trembled without end.","Sheng Ming had decided to go all out from the very beginning. Not wanting to disappoint him, Yuan activated his Dragon Transformation before clashing with him.","\"He can use Dragon Transformation even though he's a human?!\" Sheng Ran and the other dragons were greatly shocked to see this.","\"That must be Dragon Goddess Yeyou's powers! There's no doubt that he's her envoy!\"","\"I knew you were holding back... but I didn't expect you to be hiding this much power,\" Sheng Ming muttered through gritted teeth.","He had intended to press the offensive, but the overwhelming pressure from Yuan made it impossible. Forced onto the defensive, Sheng Ming could only hope to spot an opening amidst the relentless assault.","However, his hopes never materialized. Within half an hour, Sheng Ming was thoroughly defeated, unable to withstand Yuan's relentless pressure.","\"I haven't experienced this level of defeat since I graduated from this place...\" Sheng Ming sighed out loud as he lay on the ground.","Just like Sheng Ming, several more dragons jumped onto the stage. However, they weren't as powerful as Sheng Ming. Yet, they still wanted to experience fighting with Yuan.","\"I'll face all three of you at once. Whenever you're ready.\" Yuan beckoned them.","\"Thank you for this opportunity, Senior Envoy!\"","The young dragons bowed to him before attacking simultaneously from different directions.","Although Yuan didn't deactivate his Dragon Transformation, he didn't go all out either, allowing the young dragons to fight a satisfying match.","Time passed, and in the blink of an eye, Yuan spent the rest of the day sparring with the young dragons in the training grounds.","\"I am going to train here a little longer. You can leave without me.\" Xi Meili said to them at the end of the day.","Yuan nodded and continued ascending the Dragon Spiral Mountain with the Dragon Emperor.","\"Sorry that took so long. I only planned on a few matches.\"","\"There's nothing to apologize for. I was even expecting it to take a few days. The young dragons enjoyed it. That's all that matters.\"","Yuan looked at him and smiled, \"You know, a certain friend told me how the Dragon Emperors have a terrible personality.\"","The Dragon Emperor burst out laughing at such unexpected remarks and said, \"Well, your friend isn't wrong.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan looked at him with raised eyebrows."]},{"number":1947,"title":"Chapter 1947: Seven Dragon Emperors","paragraphs":["\"Don't look at me like that. I'm not talking about myself.\"","The Dragon Emperor shook his head with a weak smile on his face.","\"Since you've only recently arrived in the Seventh Heaven, you probably haven't heard of any rumors on the Dragon Emperors since they rarely get passed down to the lower heavens.\"","\"There are only seven Dragon Emperors across the entire Nine Heavens—including myself,\" the Dragon Emperor said solemnly. \"Yet most of them are steeped in controversy. Take the Blood Dragon Emperor, for example. He is infamous for his uncontrollable bloodlust, going on murderous rampages every few years. Entire cities and bloodlines have been reduced to ruins beneath his wrath.\"","\"Another example is the Poison Dragon Emperor,\" the Dragon Emperor continued. \"A master of venom and toxins, he shows no regard for anything around him when he unleashes his power. Every battlefield he touches is left tainted for centuries, poisoning the land, the waters, and all life nearby. Many innocent beings have perished because of his recklessness.\"","\"Why do they behave like that? Hell, how did they even become Dragon Emperors?\" Yuan asked.","\"How much do you know about Dragon Emperors? How they are chosen, for example?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"I admit that I don't know much about Dragon Emperors since they weren't really a thing during the Immortal Monarch's Era.\"","\"I see. Then allow me to explain this system to you.\"","\"There are two main requirements to becoming a Dragon Emperor,\" the Dragon Emperor explained. \"First, you must be born into one of the ten recognized royal bloodlines. Second, even if you possess a royal bloodline, it must reach a certain threshold of purity. Without fulfilling these two requirements, one cannot ascend to the title of Dragon Emperor.\"","\"There are many self-proclaimed Dragon Emperors out there, but only seven of us are true Dragon Emperors.\"","\"If someone is born meeting both conditions, they must still undergo the Dragon Emperor Ceremony, where they are tested through a series of rigorous trials,\" the Dragon Emperor continued.","\"However, that is not the final step. Even after passing the ceremony, they must receive the approval of at least six of the ten recognized royal bloodlines, along with the endorsement of at least two current Dragon Emperors.\"","\"If there are fewer than four Dragon Emperors in existence, one may ascend without needing their approval. However, there can never be more than seven Dragon Emperors at any given time.\"","\"If there are already seven Dragon Emperors, anyone who meets all the prior requirements may challenge an existing Dragon Emperor to a deathmatch—fighting for their title.\"","Hearing this, Yuan asked, \"Have you ever been challenged for your title before?\"","\"I have only been challenged twice since I became a Dragon Emperor 120,000 years ago,\" the Dragon Emperor replied with a faint smile. \"After all, a dragon who meets all the qualifications is born only once every few thousand years, and they tend to challenge the weakest Dragon Emperor out there.\"","\"Do Dragon Emperors face no consequences for their actions? What are the other dragon clans doing?\" Yuan then asked.","The Dragon Emperor sighed and said, \"Unfortunately, that's the reality we live in. Dragon Emperors aren't just powerful individuals—they have the full backing of their clans, along with the support of various other forces. Unless someone possesses overwhelming strength and an unshakable reputation, it's nearly impossible to challenge or hold a Dragon Emperor accountable.\"","\"Even if someone qualifies to challenge them, it's rarely worth the risk, as such actions could easily ignite wars,\" the Dragon Emperor added with a heavy tone.","\"What about the Dragon Ancestor and the Great One? What are they doing now?\" Yuan then asked about the Dragons of Origin.","\"The Great One is the very embodiment of aloofness and selfishness,\" the Dragon Emperor said. \"He has no interest in the affairs of the Dragon Emperors—his only concern lies in expanding his personal collection of treasures. As for the Dragon Ancestor... he hasn't been seen for many thousands of years.\"","\"Is that so... I guess I'll do something about it.\"","The Dragon Emperor looked at Yuan with wide eyes, but he didn't object. After all, Yuan was the Immortal Monarch, and he had Dragon Goddess Yeyou's backing. If anyone could deal with the Dragon Emperors, it would be Yuan.","Unfortunately, Yuan lacked the capabilities to deal with the Dragon Emperors at this moment, so he had to wait until he did.","Some time later, they arrived at the area situated just above the training grounds, where a single large building stood. It served a singular purpose, used exclusively by the higher-ups of the Holy Dragon Clan for important meetings and discussions.","Since there was nothing of importance inside, they simply walked past the building and continued their ascent toward the mountain's peak.","Eventually, they arrived at the summit, where an elevated circular platform stood, resembling a grand stage. In front of it stood a stone tablet, distinguished by a uniquely shaped hole carved through its center.","\"Is this...?\"","The Dragon Emperor nodded and confirmed Yuan's suspicions, \"Yes, this is the teleportation device. Although it's capable of extremely long-distance teleportation, it's limited to the other Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","\"But alas, the key used to operate it... is currently in the Azure Dragon Clan's possession.\"","\"Speaking of the Azure Dragon Clan, could you tell me more about them?\" Yuan asked. \"I'd like to better understand their situation before I confront them.\"","The Dragon Emperor nodded and replied, \"Of course. The Azure Dragon Clan once lived peacefully, hidden away in the Sea of Dragons. For countless years, they remained secluded, causing no conflict. However, for reasons unknown, they began making aggressive moves toward our Dragon Spiral Mountain a few thousand years ago, trying to appease the Great One. We tried asking for an explanation, but they refused to reveal anything. It's likely the Great One has something to do with it, but it's not like we can confront him. The Great One has a short temper and is easily offended, after all.\""]},{"number":1948,"title":"Chapter 1948: Frozen Palace","paragraphs":["\"The Great One, huh? Do you know his location?\" Yuan asked.","The Dragon Emperor shook his head and said, \"The number of individuals who may know his location can be counted on one hand. He loves traveling the Nine Heavens in search for treasures and can be anywhere. When he's not traveling, he's most likely hidden within his own realm or slumbering somewhere in the Starry Sky.\"","\"I see.\"","\"Anyway, going back to the Azure Dragon Clan. They are one of the ten recognized royal bloodlines, but they are ranked last in terms of prowess and influence.\"","After a slight pause, he added, \"In case you are wondering, the Holy Dragon Clan is ranked sixth.\"","\"Their bloodline grants them complete mastery over water, so they established their main dwelling deep on the floor of the Sea of Dragons.\"","The Dragon Emperor continued to talk about the Azure Dragon Clan.","Sometime later, Yuan said, \"I have a good understanding of the Azure Dragon Clan—somewhat. Until I meet and speak with them personally, I can't say I know them. Anyway, it'll take some time before they respond to our offer, right?\"","\"That's correct,\" the Dragon Emperor replied. \"The fastest we've ever received a response was five weeks, and the longest took nearly seven months. Their timing is unpredictable.\"","\"I'd like to train in the meantime,\" Yuan said. \"Does the Dragon Spiral Mountain have any unique training grounds? Specifically, something related to the yin attribute. I'm working on strengthening my Cold Immunity.\"","The Dragon Emperor nodded and replied, \"Of course. We have special training grounds for those who have graduated from their initial training—what you experienced earlier.\"","The Dragon Emperor led Yuan back down the mountain, retracing their steps until they returned to the training grounds.","However, instead of stopping at the familiar arenas, where Xi Meili was still engaged in spirited sparring with the young dragons, they continued deeper, heading toward a more secluded area.","When they reached their destination, Yuan found himself standing before five towering pagodas, each emanating a distinct and ancient aura.","After taking a moment to admire their imposing beauty, Yuan shifted his gaze to the large signs hanging above each entrance.","\"Four Levels of Inferno, Frozen Palace, Endless Tribulations, Venomous Altar, and the Unyielding Playground, huh?\" Yuan mumbled the names written on each sign with intrigue.","The Dragon Emperor began introducing each pagoda in detail, \"Each of these pagodas contains a realm of its own, far more vast than their appearance suggests.","This one is the Four Levels of Inferno. It is designed to temper one's resistance to fire, with four ascending levels of difficulty. You can challenge a higher floor as your endurance improves.\"","He continued, \"The first level is intended for beginners with no fire resistance. The second is suited for those with Weak Fire Resistance. The third is for those with Powerful Fire Resistance.","As for the fourth level, it should only be attempted by those who possess Super Fire Resistance. Anything less would be courting death.\"","\"The Frozen Palace follows the same structure,\" the Dragon Emperor continued, \"but it's designed to train one's resistance to cold, which should suit your needs.\"","He gestured to the next pagoda.","\"The Endless Tribulation is for tempering one's body against lightning.\"","Then to another, \"The Venomous Altar sharpens one's resistance to poison.\"","Finally, he pointed to the last pagoda, \"And last but not least, the Unyielding Playground—where gravity is greatly intensified to strengthen one's raw physique and endurance.\"","After learning about the five pagodas, Yuan asked, \"So the Frozen Palace only trains one's cold resistance to Supreme Cold Resistance?\"","\"Actually, the Frozen Palace has five levels, so you can train your cold resistance past Supreme Cold Resistance. The Unyielding Playground has the most levels since we prefer training our raw physique,\" the Dragon Emperor clarified.","Yuan nodded, \"Alright, I'll be training on the fifth level within the Frozen Palace. By the way, do you have a way to contact me when the Azure Dragon Clan responds?\"","\"Don't worry, I'll personally come get you when they respond.\"","\"I understand. Have fun.\"","Without any delay, Yuan stepped into the pagoda dedicated to cold resistance training.","The moment he crossed the threshold, his surroundings shifted. He found himself standing in a vast, snowy expanse, where icy winds howled across an endless frozen plain.","Far in the distance, towering against the pale horizon, stood a massive castle sculpted entirely from shimmering ice—its presence both majestic and foreboding.","Since he already had Supreme Cold Resistance, Yuan didn't feel any discomfort, but it was clear that the training had yet to truly begin.","Without hesitation, Yuan began making his way toward the ice palace.","Even before reaching the gates, Yuan could see a figure sitting in front of the entrance.","When Yuan got near, this figure opened his eyes and spoke, \"Since this is your first time here, allow me to give you a brief introduction.\"","\"There are five floors in the Frozen Palace. You can increase the difficulty of your training by heading to the next floor. On each floor, you will not only have to endure the cold, but you'll also have to fight enemies. If they hit you, your body becomes more prone to the cold. If you need to leave, just shout for help and I will come rescue you.\"","Yuan nodded before asking, \"Are you with the Holy Dragon Clan?\"","The middle-aged man shook his head and said, \"No, I am from the Glacial Dragon Clan—the true owners of this realm. The Holy Dragon Clan merely borrows this training ground from us.\"","\"I see...\" Yuan murmured thoughtfully. \"So the pagodas are actually teleportation devices.\"","The Dragon Emperor had purposefully skipped this detail to surprise Yuan.","\"What are the rules?\" Yuan then asked.","\"There is only one rule here,\" the middle-aged man said firmly. \"You are strictly prohibited from disturbing others who are training on the same floor. Violate this, and you will be immediately expelled from the training ground—and banned from returning for one hundred years.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and muttered, \"There will be others?\""]},{"number":1949,"title":"Chapter 1949: Frozen Palace(2)","paragraphs":["\"Of course, there will be others. This is a public training ground, after all,\" said the middle-aged man. \"That said, the majority of these individuals are from the dragon clans, so you won't be seeing many humans.\"","\"I see. Understandable.\"","\"Whenever you're ready to begin your training, simply pass through the gates behind me,\" the middle-aged man instructed.","Yuan nodded and, without hesitation, stepped through the gates, arriving at the first floor of the training area.","The moment he crossed over, the temperature plummeted far lower than it had been outside, as if he had stepped into the heart of a frozen world. Of course, since this floor was meant for beginners, it didn't affect Yuan, who had reached Supreme Cold Resistance.","Without lingering, Yuan made his way straight toward the staircase leading to the second floor.","As he walked, he couldn't help but notice just how vast the floor truly was—the space seemed endless. Aside from the entrance wall behind him, the castle's outer walls were nowhere in sight, swallowed by the seemingly infinite expanse of snow and ice.","Moreover, at a glance, there appeared to be several thousand individuals scattered across the vast expanse, each focused intently on their training. As the middle-aged man had mentioned, the overwhelming majority of them were dragons, and those who didn't belong to the dragon clans were mostly from other beast races.","Suddenly, Yuan sensed a surge of killing intent hurtling toward him.","Turning swiftly to face the threat, he spotted a knight clad in icy armor, its entire form sculpted from frost. The knight charged at him with relentless momentum, its sword raised high, gleaming coldly under the pale light.","Without even bothering to draw his weapon, Yuan casually sidestepped the knight's sword and swung his fist.","The moment his strike connected with the icy armor, the knight's entire body shattered into countless glittering fragments, scattering like snow in the air.","After destroying the knight, Yuan noticed his Cold Resistance and spiritual energy increasing slightly.","<Your Cold Resistance has improved slightly>","\"So they're not just an annoyance, huh?\"","Eventually, Yuan reached the staircase leading to the next floor—only to find that it was actually a teleportation device designed to transport him directly upward.","Upon arriving on the second floor, he immediately noticed the change. The number of individuals training had thinned considerably, with only a few hundred scattered across the vast frozen landscape. Moreover, the cultivators on the second floor were far stronger than those on the first. While the first floor was filled with individuals still in the Spirit Realm, the ones here had already stepped into the Divine Realm and beyond.","Once again, Yuan immediately made his way to the next teleportation device.","Some time later, Yuan arrived on the third floor, where the number of individuals training had been cut in half.","On the third floor, the ice knights were not only more powerful than on the previous floors, but they also made more frequent appearances. By the time Yuan made it to the teleportation device to the fourth floor, he had to defeat six ice knights.","On the fourth floor, the number of individuals had dwindled to fewer than a hundred. Most of them possessed cultivation levels around Immortal Ascension, and a few among them had already stepped into the Bronze Immortal Realm.","Eventually, Yuan arrived at the teleportation device to the fifth floor, and right beside the device was a warning that read, \"Only those who have achieved Supreme Cold Resistance should proceed to the fifth floor.\"","After glancing at the warning, Yuan, without hesitation, entered the teleportation device and teleported to the fifth floor.","The moment Yuan stepped onto the fifth floor, a bone-chilling cold that he hadn't been able to experience in the previous four floors immediately washed over him. For the first time, he didn't need to fight the ice knights to feel his cold resistance being tempered, and simply standing there was enough to push his body toward growth.","The fifth floor was noticeably less spacious than the previous levels, its confined space concentrating the cold into a much smaller area. As a result, the frigid temperature bore down on everything with a far greater intensity. Moreover, a massive ice structure stood at the very center of the training room, its towering presence radiating an even deeper, more penetrating chill.","As for the number of people training on the fifth floor, there were only four, and three of them were female. Unsurprisingly, the vast majority of people training inside the Frozen Palace were females.","When Yuan arrived on the fifth floor, none of the others spared him so much as a glance, each completely absorbed in their own training.","Yuan wanted to start his training immediately, but he was somewhat disappointed by the training grounds.","'This place is only slightly better than Sun Ling Cai's painting,' he sighed inwardly as he made his way to an empty spot and began his training.","An hour into his training, Yuan had to deal with an incoming ice knight. The ice knight did not have a cultivation base, but its raw strength was comparable to someone at the peak of Immortal Ascension, and it was very skilled with its ice sword.","However, Yuan was still able to completely destroy them with his bare fists.","<Cold Resistance has improved>","After defeating the ice knight, Yuan stood there with a pondering look on his face.","'What a second... That guard said if I get hit by these ice knights, my body becomes more prone to the cold. If I purposefully let myself get hit and weaken myself, would that increase the speed of my training?'","He had to test out his theory and waited for the next ice knight to appear with anticipation.","An hour later, another ice knight appeared before Yuan.","This time, instead of destroying it instantly, Yuan allowed it to land a strike on him.","<You have been temporarily cursed with Glacial Trace>","<Your Cold Resistance has been weakened>"]},{"number":1950,"title":"Chapter 1950: Glacial Traces","paragraphs":["After being struck by the ice knight and being cursed with Glacial Trace, Yuan inspected his body.","'My body definitely feels colder now, but it's not enough.'","Since a single curse wasn't enough to see any difference, Yuan decided to let the ice knight strike him a few more times.","<You have been cursed with Glacial Trace>","<You have been cursed with Glacial Trace>","<You have been cursed with Glacial Trace>","Although Yuan took no real damage or injuries from the ice knight's attacks, a glowing blue chain-like tattoo would appear across his body with each strike, each mark representing a single Glacial Trace.","After accumulating ten Glacial Traces, Yuan finally sensed a change. His cold resistance had weakened to the point where the fifth floor's environment now felt genuinely threatening. However, in exchange, his cold resistance was strengthening at a noticeably faster rate than before.","Naturally, Yuan wasn't the first individual to have considered this reckless action. However, he was definitely the first to weaken himself so much.","The middle-aged man standing guard outside the palace had been watching Yuan out of curiosity and was dumbfounded by Yuan's actions.","\"Ten Glacial Trace! His Supreme Cold Resistance is now only as strong as Super Cold Resistance! What a reckless human!\"","He'd seen impatient individuals purposefully receiving Glacial Traces to speed up their training before, but most of them only dared to receive one or two Glacial Traces. Even the most reckless individual to train at the Frozen Palace has only accepted seven Glacial Traces. Yet, Yuan went ahead and purposefully received ten Glacial Traces at once.","However, that was only the beginning of the guard's shock, as Yuan decided to receive even more Glacial Traces, racking up twenty Glacial Traces in total.","\"This is more like it.\"","A smile tugged at Yuan's lips as he shattered the ice knight after accumulating twenty Glacial Traces.","By now, his cold resistance had dropped to the level of Powerful Cold Resistance—a full two stages lower than the recommended threshold for surviving on the fifth floor. Yet despite the overwhelming cold, his excitement only grew.","The other four individuals training on the fifth floor finally turned their attention to Yuan, their faces filled with shock and disbelief as they realized what he had done to himself.","Lowering his cold resistance to such a dangerous level in this environment was nothing short of madness—and yet he stood there, unyielding.","\"Who is that? I've been training here for over a hundred years, and this is my first time seeing him,\" one of them questioned out loud.","\"He's a human, too.\"","\"Hmph. Whoever he is, he won't last long with that many Glacial Traces on him. I'll give him a few days at most before he is forced to leave or dies,\" one of them sneered.","After showing brief interest in Yuan, the four individuals quickly returned to their own training.","Hours turned into days.","A week had passed since Yuan arrived on the fifth floor and started training his Cold Resistance. The others believed that he would only last a few days, but he persisted for an entire week and didn't appear to be giving up anytime soon.","A month later, the middle-aged man who usually guarded the entrance unexpectedly appeared on the fifth floor, drawing puzzled looks from those training there. It was the first time any of them had seen him abandon his post.","The middle-aged man approached Yuan after finding him.","\"I have a message from the Holy Dragon Clan's Dragon Emperor,\" he said.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan has responded. They have agreed to meet you. It will happen in three months on a specific island. You can continue training here for another two and a half months since it'll take us two weeks to arrive at the meeting place.\"","\"That's the end of his message. Do you have anything to say to him?\"","Yuan then said, \"Tell him that I'll see him in two months.\"","The middle-aged man silently nodded and left the next moment.","\"He received a message from the Holy Dragon Clan's Dragon Emperor! What's his relationship with the Dragon Emperor?\"","\"His background must be quite extraordinary.\"","The four individuals itched to approach Yuan and strike up a conversation, curiosity burning in their eyes. However, bound by the strict rules of the training ground, they didn't dare disturb him, knowing that even a simple word could be seen as interfering with his training.","Even when they spoke aloud, it was little more than muttering to themselves, carefully avoiding direct conversation with one another to stay within the rules.","Once the middle-aged man left, Yuan returned to his training.","However, when the ice knight appeared half an hour later, Yuan allowed it to strike him, giving himself several more Glacial Traces.","\"Heavens! He's at 30 traces now! Is he actually trying to kill himself?!\"","The others were in disbelief at Yuan's recklessness.","Unbeknownst to them, Yuan would've died countless times already if it weren't for his regeneration ability and powerful physique.","'I need to achieve Cold Immunity before I meet the Azure Dragon Clan!'","With that determination, Yuan increased his Glacial Traces until he reached forty.","With forty Glacial Traces suppressing his cold resistance, Yuan was essentially left without any defense against the cold, enduring a temperature intended for those with Supreme Cold Resistance.","\"Holy shit! How is he not dead?!\"","\"His cultivation is only at Divine Emperor, too!\"","\"Look closely! His body is recovering as it is being frozen and shattered! I cannot imagine the pain he must be experiencing right now!\"","\"What horrifying regenerative abilities. He must have some kind of god-like physique. Or maybe he consumed a miracle treasure before coming here.\"","The four individuals training on the fifth floor were so shocked—and unsettled—by Yuan's reckless training that they found themselves unable to concentrate on their own.","One by one, they abandoned their training, their full attention drawn irresistibly to Yuan instead.","They all wanted to see his limit."]},{"number":1951,"title":"Chapter 1951: Cold Immunity","paragraphs":["An entire month has passed since Yuan accepted forty Glacial Traces on his body. Although his training progress has sped up tremendously, Yuan could tell that he would still not be able to achieve Cold Immunity within what little time he had left.","Thus, he decided to push himself further and accepted another ten Glacial Traces, bringing his total to fifty.","His recklessness was so mindboggling that it indirectly disturbed the others' training. There was simply no way they could focus on their own training when there was such a madman in their presence.","With only one week remaining, Yuan suddenly began making his way toward the massive ice structure at the center of the floor—the very source of the coldest, most concentrated energy in the entire training ground.","The others could only watch in silence, occasionally swallowing hard as tension gripped them.","Each of them was a Golden Immortal—one even a True Immortal—yet not a single one dared to approach the ice structure. Its oppressive cold was something even they instinctively feared.","And yet, Yuan walked toward it without hesitation.","\"He's actually approaching the Heavenfrost Essence... That thing could instantly freeze an Immortal even if they have Cold Immunity...\"","There was a reason why everyone was training far away from the Heavenfrost Essence.","<Cold Resistance has improved tremendously>","<Cold Resistance has improved tremendously>","<Cold Resistance has improved tremendously>","Yuan's cold resistance was improving at a tremendous rate, but his body was also experiencing unspeakable pain. His skin, blood, and even his bones were constantly freezing and shattering with every passing second.","A few days later—","<Your skill 'Supreme Cold Resistance' has developed into 'Cold Immunity'>","A unique aura enveloped Yuan's figure the moment he achieved Cold Immunity.","\"H-He's actually achieved Cold Immunity!\"","<You have achieved four different types of immunity>","<You have earned the title 'True Impervious Physique'>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun fusing with Cold Immunity>","<Progress: 1%>","As Yuan had anticipated, his Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique began to merge with his Cold Immunity.","However, unlike his time in the Primal Expanse, the training ground here, despite its intensity, was ultimately too weak to yield any significant progress.","Yuan turned his gaze toward the towering ice structure in front of him, the thought of taking a few bites out of it briefly crossing his mind as a way to accelerate his progress.","But after a moment of consideration, he shook the idea away. This training ground didn't belong to him, nor even to the Holy Dragon Clan. Claiming something so central to its design would be crossing a line he wasn't willing to step over.","'Looks like I will have to visit White Hell to complete its fusion,' he sighed inwardly.","Since he'd achieved his goals, Yuan decided to end his training there and began walking toward the teleportation device.","\"E-Excuse me! Are you done with your training?\" One of the four Immortals suddenly called out to Yuan.","If he'd finished his training, it wouldn't be against the rules to disturb him.","Yuan halted his steps and turned to face the four Immortals.","\"Yes, I am done here.\"","\"May I ask for your name? I'm Bing Xin from the Glacial Dragon Clan!\"","Yuan pondered for a moment whether he should use his real identity or a fake one.","In the end, he spoke with a calm smile, \"My name is Yuan, and I'd like to thank the Glacial Dragon Clan for sharing this training ground.\"","Bing Xin didn't know what else to say and could only watch as Yuan entered the teleportation device and disappeared from the fifth floor.","Sometime later, Yuan left the ice palace.","Noticing his presence, the middle-aged man could only shake his head and mumble, \"You're a monster.\"","\"Thank you. By the way, how do I leave this place?\"","\"There is only one teleportation device. It'll take you back to the place you came from.\"","\"Alright.\"","Sometime later, Yuan returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","The Holy Dragon Emperor was waiting for him in front of the pagoda when he returned and said, \"How was your training?\"","\"I have achieved one of my goals, but I am still far from reaching my final goal. Anyway, when will we head out to meet the Azure Dragon Clan?\"","\"We can immediately leave.\"","\"Let's do it.\"","\"Very well.\"","The Dragon Emperor suddenly took a deep breath before speaking in a loud voice that rippled throughout the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"We're leaving immediately!\"","A few moments later, a massive flying treasure in the shape of a boat appeared in the sky.","The Holy Dragon Clan had been preparing for their departure the moment they received the Azure Dragon Clan's response and was only waiting for Yuan's return.","Without any delay, Yuan and the Dragon Emperor flew onto the flying treasure, where Xi Meili and other Holy Dragon Clan members were waiting. Moreover, there was a small group of elite warriors, looking like they were prepared to go to war.","\"Welcome back, Yuan.\" Xi Meili approached him with a smile on her face.","Yuan smiled back and said, \"Looks like you've been working hard these past few months.\"","Xi Meili's cultivation had not only soared to the peak of Divine Grandmaster, but her aura was also much sharper than before.","\"The Holy Dragon Clan was generous enough to provide me with a personal instructor, and I have been training pretty much every day since then,\" she revealed. \"I heard you've been training inside the Frozen Palace. I plan on training at the Unyielding Playground once we return.\"","\"Senior, are we allowed to leave now?\" asked the owner of the flying treasure.","Yuan nodded, \"Yes, we can leave now.\"","Soon, the flying treasure began moving, flying with immense speed.","\"We're headed to the Dragon Assembly Hall. It's a building built on an unnamed island specifically for meetings between the Holy Dragon Clan and the Azure Dragon Clan,\" the Dragon Emperor explained as they traveled."]},{"number":1952,"title":"Chapter 1952: Meeting the Azure Dragon Clan","paragraphs":["\"Are they soldiers?\" Yuan asked, his gaze settling on the group of elite warriors stationed around the ship, standing like silent sentinels.","\"Yes,\" the Dragon Emperor replied. \"We're not expecting a battle with the Azure Dragon Clan, but it's a precaution. They'll be doing the same on their end.\"","\"I see.\"","Their journey to the Dragon Assembly Hall took just over a week, so they still had a few days to spare before their scheduled meeting with the Azure Dragon Clan.","The Dragon Assembly Hall itself was an imposing dome-shaped structure, constructed at the heart of a barren, isolated island.","Normally, sea beasts roamed these waters in abundance, but Yuan couldn't sense a single presence near the island. It was as if something on the island itself was repelling them.","\"Can I explore the place before the Azure Dragon Clan's arrival?\" Xi Meili asked.","However, the Dragon Emperor shook his head and said, \"Since this is a formal meeting, we can only enter the island on the scheduled date, even if we've arrived early.\"","\"Oh, okay.\"","The Azure Dragon Clan didn't make an appearance until a day before the scheduled meeting. Unlike the Holy Dragon Clan, who traveled by air, the Azure Dragon Clan moved through the sea depths, emerging gracefully from the sea, as if the ocean itself parted to welcome them.","\"So that's the Azure Dragon Clan, huh?\" Xi Meili murmured, her eyes scanning their features with quiet curiosity.","Unlike the Holy Dragon Clan, who bore black hair and golden eyes, the Azure Dragon Clan stood out with their light blue hair, shimmering like the sea under sunlight, paired with the same striking golden eyes that marked their royal heritage.","However, just like the Holy Dragon Clan, they did not set foot on the island and merely camped out right outside it.","Just as the Dragon Emperor predicted, the Azure Dragon Clan also brought their own warriors. In fact, they brought thrice as many soldiers as the Holy Dragon Clan.","The next day, both the Azure Dragon Clan and the Holy Dragon Clan entered the island and made their way to the building.","Neither attempted to speak with the other until they were inside the building.","Once they were seated, the leader of the Azure Dragon Clan, Jiao Zhenhai, spoke, \"What's the meaning of this, Holy Dragon Emperor? Why did you bring a human to such an important meeting?\"","\"Watch your mouth, Jia Zhenhai. He's not your typical human.\"","Yuan then spoke, \"Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Yuan, and I was the one who arranged our meeting today.\"","\"What? You're...\"","\"Yes, I am Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy.\"","\"Hahaha!\" Jiao Zhenhai suddenly burst out laughing.","\"Do you really expect me to believe that you, a human, are the Dragon—\"","Before Jiao Zhenhai could even finish his sentence, Yuan activated his Dragon Transformation, unleashing a surge of aura that flooded the entire room with overwhelming pressure.","\"?!?!\"","The soldiers of the Azure Dragon Clan reacted instantly. Sensing the sudden release of power, they instinctively shifted into combat stances, their bodies tensing as if bracing for a battle.","Seeing this, the soldiers of the Holy Dragon Clan also braced themselves.","However, the tense atmosphere quickly calmed down when Yuan remained still.","\"So you can use Dragon Transformation. I fail to see how that proves you are Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy,\" Jiao Zhenhai sneered in disbelief.","\"It proves you know nothing about Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","Someone from the Holy Dragon Clan sneered.","\"What?\" Jiao Zhenhai frowned at such provocative words.","The Dragon Emperor smiled and elaborated, \"Dragon Goddess Yeyou has the ability to grant abilities unique to dragons to other beast races, including humans. The fact that he can use Dragon Transformation is proof that he was blessed by Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","Jiao Zhenhai narrowed his eyes and asked, \"When did you become her envoy? As far as I am aware, Dragon Goddess Yeyou has not made any appearances since the Immortal Monarch's era.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Recently.\"","\"What?!\"","Many from the Azure Dragon Clan showed surprise, even shock, upon hearing this.","\"Are you implying that Dragon Goddess Yeyou has returned?!\" Jiao Zhenhai asked. Although he tried to hide it, his voice was still trembling slightly.","\"That's exactly what I am trying to say.\"","\"Bullshit!\"","\"I have witnessed evidence of her return with my own eyes,\" said the Dragon Emperor.","\"Me too.\"","Those who were there to witness Dragon Goddess Yeyou's appearance in the Dragon Spiral Mountain joined in.","\"...\"","Jiao Zhenhai remained silent for a good moment before he finally responded, \"Since the Holy Dragon Clan vouches for him, I'll take your word for it. So, Dragon Goddess Yeyou's Envoy, why did you organize this meeting?\"","\"I'll get straight to the point. The key you took from the Holy Dragon Clan. I need it.\"","\"You mean the key that our Azure Dragon Clan won during a bet? I don't mind lending it to you, but it won't be free, even if you're Dragon Goddess Yeyou's Envoy.\"","\"Of course, I don't intend to take it for free,\" Yuan said calmly. \"What do you want in exchange?\"","\"I want the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","\"...\"","The room fell into a suffocating silence.","The members of the Azure Dragon Clan struggled to maintain their composure, faint smirks tugging at the corners of their lips and amusement flickering in their eyes.","Meanwhile, the expressions of the Holy Dragon Clan darkened, their brows furrowed deeply in barely restrained indignation.","\"Unfortunately, I do not own the Dragon Spiral Mountain, so I cannot give it to you. However, I can give you something else.\"","\"And what can you possibly give me that's worth more than the Dragon Spiral Mountain?\" Jiao Zhenhai sneered in disdain.","\"The reason you want the Dragon Spiral Mountain is because you want the Great One's attention, right? Do you need something from him?\"","\"Even if I do need something from the Great One, it's not something you can provide.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"You're right. I may not be able to provide it, but Dragon Goddess Yeyou might.\"","\"What...?\"","Jiao Zhenhai's expression stiffened."]},{"number":1953,"title":"Chapter 1953: Azure Dragon Clan’s Predicament","paragraphs":["Yuan continued, his voice steady and firm, \"You may not know much about Dragon Goddess Yeyou—but surely, you should be aware that among the Three Dragons of Origin, she stands as the strongest. Whatever the Great One can offer, there’s little—if anything—that Dragon Goddess Yeyou cannot match or surpass.\"","Jiao Zhenhai fell silent to ponder Yuan’s words, and the rest of the Azure Dragon Clan began exchanging glances with each other.","Eventually, Jiao Zhenhai spoke, \"I am willing to negotiate, but I will only continue speaking if you, Dragon Goddess Yeyou’s Envoy, are alone. That means the rest of the Holy Dragon Clan must leave.\"","\"That’s unreasonable!\"","\"There’s no way we could leave Senior Envoy alone with you bastards!\"","The Dragon Emperor then spoke, his tone calm yet resolute, \"I must agree with the others—he holds as much importance to us as Dragon Goddess Yeyou herself. We cannot, in good conscience, allow him to be left in the hands of your Azure Dragon Clan, especially after the aggression you’ve already shown.\"","\"This matter pertains to information meant solely for the Azure Dragon Clan,\" Jiao Zhenhai said firmly. \"It is not something to be shared with outsiders, especially the Holy Dragon Clan.\"","Holy Dragon Emperor pondered for a brief moment before responding, \"In that case, I alone will stay here with him. I may be with the Holy Dragon Clan, but I have my own reputation to uphold as a Dragon Emperor. I can even make an oath if you’re not satisfied.\"","Jiao Zhenhai nodded and said, \"If it’s just you, and you’re willing to swear an oath you will keep it to yourself, I am willing to let you stay.\"","The Dragon Emperor turned to glance at the members of the Holy Dragon Clan behind him. Without a single word exchanged, they quietly took their leave, offering no complaints or objections. With the Dragon Emperor present, the strongest among them, they had no reason to doubt Yuan’s safety.","Once the Holy Dragon Clan left, the Dragon Emperor solemnly swore an oath, binding himself to secrecy until death regarding anything discussed in the conversation that followed.","Only after the oath was spoken did Jiao Zhenhai finally open his mouth to speak.","\"I’ll get straight to the point,\" Jiao Zhenhai said, his expression turning grave.","\"Our clan’s bloodline is cursed. With each passing generation, its purity diminishes. If this continues, the Azure Dragon Clan will eventually fall beneath the threshold required to be recognized as a royal bloodline. To stop this decline... we need the assistance of the Great One. However, to even get his attention, we need something he’s interested in, and that’s the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","\"How can you be so sure it’s a curse that’s causing your bloodline to decline?\" Dragon Emperor asked with a doubtful look on his face.","\"Because that’s what the bastard who did it to us said!\" Jiao Zhenhai shouted angrily as he slammed the desk.","\"That bastard?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"I don’t know who or what he truly is,\" Jiao Zhenhai said, his voice low with lingering unease. \"He simply appeared before our headquarters one day and demanded our family heirloom. When we refused and attempted to drive him off, he warned us... that he would curse our bloodline. That was many thousands of years ago. Since then, our lineage has steadily declined. At first, the changes were subtle—barely noticeable. But now... It’s growing worse with each generation.\"","\"I see. So this curse is the source of your problem, and if I get rid of it, you’ll lend me the key?\" Yuan said.","\"If you can solve our predicament, let alone lend you the key, we’ll give it to you!\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"That’s a promise. As for your curse, I have a simple solution that doesn’t even require Dragon Goddess Yeyou’s involvement.\"","\"What?\"","In response to the Azure Dragon Clan’s puzzled expressions, Yuan retrieved the Sacred Chalice of Purification and explained, \"If you pour a few drops of your blood into this chalice, it’ll get rid of your curse.\"","\"Th-That...? What kind of treasure is that?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked, swallowing nervously as he felt the profound and unfamiliar aura radiating from the chalice.","Even the Dragon Emperor’s eyes narrowed with intrigue. The aura it emitted was unlike anything he had ever sensed—ancient, otherworldly, and utterly unique. No one present could recall encountering anything quite like it before.","\"It belongs to Dragon Goddess Yeyou,\" Yuan explained briefly. \"Are you worried it might do something to you?\"","Jiao Zhenhai hesitated, then shifted his gaze to the Dragon Emperor, seeking silent reassurance, as if needing his approval before proceeding.","\"If anything happens to you, I’ll offer you my life.\" The Dragon Emperor spoke without an ounce of hesitation in his voice.","Jiao Zhenhai nodded and fed several drops of his blood to the chalice.","Yuan and everyone in the room waited in tense silence, a mix of anticipation and unease hanging heavily in the air.","However, nothing happened even after many moments, causing Yuan to raise an eyebrow.","\"What’s wrong?\" Jiao Zhenhai could no longer keep silent and questioned.","Yuan inspected the chalice to ensure nothing was wrong with it before looking at Jiao Zhenhai and speaking with a serious face, \"You’re not cursed.\"","\"What?! How is that possible?!\" Jiao Zhenhai exclaimed in disbelief. \"You must be messing with me!\"","\"What would I gain from lying to you?\" Yuan shook his head. \"This is a profound treasure that can remove even the strongest curses out there. The fact that it’s not responding to your blood is simply because you are not cursed!\"","\"Then how do you explain what’s been happening to my clan’s bloodline?!\" Jiao Zhenhai roared, his voice trembling with frustration. \"Are you telling me my entire family has been wrong all this time?!\"","He refused to believe it was all just a misunderstanding—there had to be more behind the slow collapse of his lineage.","Yuan shrugged and said, \"I have no way of knowing that unless I take a closer look for myself. How about I come to your place and investigate it further?\""]},{"number":1954,"title":"Chapter 1954: Visiting the Azure Dragon Clan’s Territory","paragraphs":["\"Did I hear you correctly? You want to visit the Azure Dragon Clan's headquarters?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked with a deep frown.","\"Yes,\" Yuan replied with a nod.","\"And what exactly do you hope to accomplish?\" Jiao Zhenhai pressed. \"Our clan has lived there for tens of thousands of years. We've searched every corner, and nothing we've found has ever explained our situation or hinted at a solution.\"","\"Who knows? I can't tell you until I see it for myself. Maybe you missed something. What do you have to lose, anyway?\"","Jiao Zhenhai rubbed his eyes and sighed, \"Dragon Emperor, will you be joining him? I won't allow anyone else from the Holy Dragon Clan to join.\"","Holy Dragon Emperor nodded and said, \"Naturally. Wherever he goes, I will follow.\"","\"Since this involves the entire clan, I cannot make this decision myself. Let me return to my clan to speak with the others first. I will contact you within two months.\"","\"Very well.\"","The meeting ended shortly after with the Azure Dragon Clan and the Holy Dragon Clan returning to their own homes.","\"So? What's happening?\"","The Holy Dragon Clan asked the Dragon Emperor as they rode their flying treasure back to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"I cannot go into details since I made an oath, but Senior Envoy and I will be making a trip to the Azure Dragon Clan soon.\"","\"What?! You're heading directly to their headquarters?! That's too reckless even for you, Your Majesty!\"","\"It's fine. Even if they try to do something, I will take down at least half of their clan before I perish.\"","Yuan shook his head and tried to reassure the others that it would be fine.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan is in a unique situation. I doubt they'll do anything to us.\"","\"I don't know what's happening, but what if they're tricking you, Senior Envoy? What if it's an ambush?\"","Yuan chuckled and said, \"Do you really think we'll be going there alone? Have you forgotten who else is with me?\"","They quickly came to a realization.","\"That's right! You have Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Indeed. With Dragon Goddess Yeyou at our side, not even the Great One could do anything to us,\" he said.","Hearing this, the Holy Dragon Clan was no longer worried about their safety. If anything, they hoped the Azure Dragon Clan would try something so they could be erased from existence by Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","Once they returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain, Xi Meili immediately returned to her training. As for Yuan, he also returned to the Frozen Palace to progress his physique, even if it was just a little.","\"You're back? Why?\" The middle-aged man was puzzled by his return and said, \"Didn't you already achieve Cold Immunity? It won't go any further than that even if you train for a thousand years.\"","\"I know.\"","Without offering any explanation, Yuan entered the fifth floor.","\"Hm? There's nobody here?\"","Yuan had expected to see the four Immortals who were training there during his last visit. With only two weeks having passed, they should still have been in the midst of their training.","Unbeknownst to him, however, the four had been so shaken by Yuan's reckless training that they chose to take a break from their own cultivation","Some time later, Yuan seated himself beside the Heavenfrost Essence.","Despite his Cold Immunity, the presence of the ice crystal radiated an intense chill that was still bitterly cold, even for him.","When the ice knight appeared an hour later, Yuan purposefully allowed it to attack him, quickly stacking up Glacial Traces again.","This time, Yuan pushed himself directly to fifty Glacial Traces. However, even after an entire hour, his physique showed no signs of improvement.","Curious, he attempted to push further, stacking additional Glacial Traces onto his body. Yet as he reached sixty, he realized there was a limit to their effectiveness. Beyond fifty, the additional traces had no noticeable impact; it felt no different than before.","An entire week later, Yuan finally noticed some improvements to his physique, but it was incredibly minimal.","<Progress: 2%>","After an entire week of relentless training, Yuan's progress had increased by only a single percent.","At this rate, it would take him nearly two full years to reach completion—but knowing the nature of his physique, he understood all too well: the closer he came to perfecting it, the slower and harder the progress would become.","Realistically, no matter how much time he spent here, it was unlikely he would ever fully complete his physique in this place alone.","Still, Yuan wanted to make the most of the opportunity. He devoted all his time to training on the fifth floor while awaiting a response from the Azure Dragon Clan.","A month and a half passed before the long-awaited message finally arrived. In that time, he had managed to increase his physique's progress by only another 3 percent.","\"The Dragon Emperor has a message for you.\"","Before the man could convey the Dragon Emperor's message, Yuan walked toward the teleportation device and said, \"No need. I'll hear it from him personally.\"","Sometime later, Yuan met up with the Dragon Emperor.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan has responded. They agreed to let us visit their territory, and they'll pick us up from this place in a month.\"","\"Sounds good.\"","With a month remaining before his visit to the Azure Dragon Clan's territory, Yuan spent his days sparring with the young dragons at the training grounds.","Time passed in the blink of an eye, and a month later, Jiao Zhenhai and a small group of elite guards showed up at the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Yuan and the Dragon Emperor wasted no time and grouped up with them.","\"Before we depart, do you need any water-breathing pills?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked, aware that humans couldn't breathe underwater.","\"I'll be fine as long as I cover myself with spiritual energy,\" said Yuan.","Jiao Zhenhai raised an eyebrow and said, \"What if you run out of spiritual energy? Don't underestimate the Sea of Dragons. It can be quite rough even for an Immortal—Ah, whatever. Even if you exhaust your spiritual energy, we have some water-breathing pills prepared for you, so you won't die from drowning.\"","\"Thank you for your consideration.\" Yuan smiled."]},{"number":1955,"title":"Chapter 1955: Underwater City","paragraphs":["After forming an airtight barrier of spiritual energy around himself—functioning like a self-contained air tank—Yuan stepped forward and followed Jiao Zhenhai into the depths of the Sea of Dragons.","The waters of the Sea of Dragons were remarkably clear, allowing Yuan to see his surroundings with ease, even without the aid of any special techniques or artifacts.","Once they had descended deep enough into the sea, one of the soldiers accompanying Jiao Zhenhai suddenly shifted into his true form—a massive, blue-scaled dragon whose presence seemed to ripple through the surrounding waters with raw majesty and power.","\"Hop on.\"","Jiao Zhenhai said to them as he stood on the dragon's back, treating it like a mount.","Flying treasures that functioned underwater were rare and not as fast as they were in the sky, but for the Azure Dragon Clan, such tools were unnecessary. Masters of the sea, they traversed the waters with ease, relying on their natural prowess rather than external aid.","\"We will arrive at our destination in a month,\" said Jiao Zhenhai.","\"A month? Your base isn't as far as I expected,\" Yuan remarked.","Jiao Zhenhai laughed at Yuan's remark and said, \"It only takes a month because we're taking a shortcut. If we travel normally, it'd take several years to reach our place.\"","\"By shortcut, do you mean the underwater currents?\"","\"A few of those and a natural teleporter.\"","Just as the Primal Expanse possessed natural teleporters, so too did the Nine Heavens, though most of them were hidden deep beneath the sea.","As for the underwater currents, they functioned like one-way tunnels, allowing anything within them to travel at incredible speeds with minimal effort.","A few days later, they reached their first underwater current. The moment the dragon entered it, a powerful force surged around them, and their speed increased severalfold, propelling them through the depths like an arrow loosed from a bow.","However, these water currents are not without drawbacks. One of the drawbacks to these underwater currents was their sheer intensity. Some were so powerful that they could tear a body apart if one wasn't strong enough to withstand the force.","'It's been a while since I entered one of these...' Yuan thought to himself as he reminisced about the previous times he'd traveled underwater as Tian Yi, the Immortal Monarch.","The Azure Dragon Clan wasn't the only one to call the ocean depths their home. Countless species and races had carved out their own domains beneath the waves.","While the underwater world wasn't nearly as densely populated as the lands above, it was far from empty, filled with a wide variety of beings who had adapted to life in the vast, mysterious deep. When he was still living as the Immortal Monarch, he'd even visited cities that were entirely built under water.","After spending several days riding the current, they finally reached its end.","However, it wasn't long before they came across another one just a few hours later—and without hesitation, they entered and let it carry them onward through the depths once more.","As for Yuan's barrier, it was under constant assault from the powerful currents. If not for his physique that constantly replenished his spiritual energy and experience, maintaining it would have been impossible for someone at his cultivation level.","Half a month later, they arrived at their first natural teleporter, which existed in a suspicious-looking fissure at the sea floor.","Throughout their journey, Yuan encountered many unique sea beasts, some bearing a striking resemblance to dragons, although lacking the distinct, commanding aura that true dragons possessed.","Yet despite their size or appearance, these creatures would always steer clear once they sensed the group's presence, instinctively avoiding the path of the Azure Dragon Clan. Hell, Yuan even came across a few Flying Leviathans, but like the rest of the sea beasts, they veered away the moment they sensed the group's presence.","After passing through the deep fissure, Yuan's group emerged into an entirely different region of the sea.","The terrain had shifted so drastically that without thousands of years of experience living in these waters, it would be nearly impossible to navigate or know where to go next.","After passing through several more currents and one final natural teleporter, Yuan and his group finally arrived at the Azure Dragon Clan's territory.","Nestled deep within the tranquil blue of the sea, the territory resembled a small, self-contained city—its structures crafted from a combination of gleaming coral, crystal, and flowing stone that shimmered with life and energy.","Towering spires curved like sea serpents, and wide pavilions were anchored to the seabed by living roots that pulsed faintly with energy.","Glowing flora swayed with the tides, illuminating the surroundings with a gentle bioluminescence. At the same time, aquatic beasts native to the region glided peacefully between structures, coexisting in harmony with the Azure Dragons.","Despite being underwater, the city exuded a quiet, regal grandeur—an ancient calm that reflected the pride and heritage of the Azure Dragon Clan.","Unlike the Holy Dragon Clan, which remained largely self-contained within the Dragon Spiral Mountain, the Azure Dragon Clan operated more like a traditional royal house, complete with its own city, infrastructure, and citizens. They didn't just command a bloodline; they ruled a domain.","As for the inhabitants of the Azure Dragon Clan's territory, they weren't limited to dragons alone. A diverse array of sea races could be seen moving through the city, most of them bearing the human form.","Just like most land-dwelling beasts, sea beasts had adopted human forms for convenience, making interaction, movement, and daily life far easier within a structured society.","As Yuan's group passed over the city from above, the scene below shifted. Everyone, regardless of race or status, paused what they were doing and looked up. With reverent expressions, they offered respectful bows or gestures, honoring the presence of the Azure Dragon Clan.","\"Is this your first time seeing an underwater city?\" Jiao Zhenhai suddenly asked Yuan.","He shook his head and responded with a slight smile, \"No, but it's definitely been a while since I've visited one.\""]},{"number":1956,"title":"Chapter 1956: Azure Dragon Clan’s Three Elders","paragraphs":["After passing through the underwater city, Yuan's group continued their journey for several more hours, gliding deeper into the heart of the Azure Dragon Clan's domain.","Eventually, they arrived at their destination—a massive underwater courtyard residence that stretched across several miles of seafloor. Its grand architecture blended seamlessly with the surrounding ocean, featuring sweeping halls made of reinforced coral, shimmering crystal pillars, and roofs shaped like flowing waves. The entire structure radiated an aura of nobility and ancient power, befitting the status of a royal dragon clan.","Yuan's group landed right at the entrance, where a group of individuals from the Azure Dragon Clan stood in orderly formation, awaiting their arrival.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan welcomes the envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou and the Holy Dragon Emperor to our humble domain.\"","\"Thank you for having us,\" Yuan said politely as he leapt down from the dragon's back, landing lightly on the sea floor.","\"Let's head inside first,\" Jiao Zhenhai added, gesturing toward the grand entrance as he began walking ahead.","Once inside, Jiao Zhenhai led them through a series of ornate halls before guiding them into a spacious chamber where three more individuals awaited.","Unlike those outside, these figures radiated a far greater presence—each one exuding a level of cultivation and authority that rivaled the upper echelons of the Holy Dragon Clan's command. Their gazes were sharp, their auras refined.","\"Let me give you a brief introduction. They are the Three Grand Elders. Their position and authority within the Azure Dragon Clan is only below mine and our ancestor.\"","\"I'm the first elder, Jiao Wenyan.\"","\"Second elder, Jiao Yansheng.\"","\"Third elder, Jiao Hanchen.\"","\"I'm Yuan, envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","\"We've heard everything from the Clan Leader. You claim we've not been cursed, is that correct?\" said the Second Elder.","Yuan nodded and said, \"If you don't believe me, you can give it a try as well.\"","He retrieved the Sacred Chalice of Purification and gestured at them.","\"Don't worry, we'll definitely do so. However, we won't be the ones doing it. Instead, it'll be someone who is, without a shadow of doubt, cursed,\" said the First Elder as he made a gesture with his hand.","The next moment, a middle-aged man entered the room—his wrists bound in thick chains like a prisoner, and his complexion pale as moonlight, as though drained by time or torment.","The Third Elder explained, \"We've placed a powerful curse on him right before your arrival, so we know he's definitely cursed. If you're able to remove that curse with your treasure, we'll believe your claims.\"","Yuan nodded and said to the man, \"Feed this chalice several drops of your blood.\"","The man gave a faint nod and followed the instructions with slow, weakened movements.","Once the man offered his blood to the chalice, Jiao Zhenhai and the three elders observed in solemn silence, their expressions tense and unreadable.","Moments later, the two dragons etched into the chalice stirred to life, gliding around its surface in fluid motion, as though awakened by the blood itself. They circled the chalice with growing excitement, their movements swift and vibrant, reacting to something within the offering.","\"Now drink this.\"","Yuan gathered the liquid from the chalice with his spiritual energy and hovered it above the man, who opened his mouth and drank it without question.","Before long, a visible change came over the sickly man. Color began to return to his pale complexion, and the weakness in his limbs slowly faded.","His breathing steadied, his posture straightened, and a faint glow returned to his eyes.","Jiao Zhenhai and the three elders stared in astonishment, their solemn expressions giving way to surprise and wonder as they witnessed the transformation before them.","After a brief moment of stillness, the Third Elder suddenly sprang into action and began inspecting the man.","\"I-It's real! His curse has been lifted!\" he revealed in a trembling voice.","\"What?! But we'd placed a Supreme Curse on him! How could it be removed with such ease?!\" exclaimed the First Elder, his voice filled with disbelief.","\"Satisfied?\" Yuan asked them.","\"Just a second! We still need to use the treasure on us to confirm that we're not cursed!\" said the Second Elder.","Yuan offered no objection to their request and began testing their blood one by one.","However, by the end of it all, the chalice remained completely still, showing no reaction to any of them.","\"How do we know that you're not controlling the treasure so that it only works with your permission?\" the Third Elder suddenly questioned.","Yuan shrugged and said, \"That's impossible to prove, so you'll just have to believe me.\"","\"You're overestimating yourselves a little too much. The envoy has no reason to harm your Azure Dragon Clan,\" The Dragon Emperor suddenly spoke in a somewhat disdainful tone.","\"T-That's...\"","\"I just want the key you took from the Holy Dragon Clan. If I wanted to harm the Azure Dragon Clan, I would've taken it by force,\" said Yuan.","\"And we would've helped him.\" The Dragon Emperor added with a smile.","\"Alright, we get it.\" Jiao Zhenhai sighed as he rubbed his eyes.","\"We'll trust you. What are you going to do now?\"","\"Well, I've been thinking about it for the past month, but there's really nothing I can say or do until I take a look around the place.\"","\"In that case, we'll show you around our territory.\"","\"Sure thing.\"","\"I have something to do, so I'll assign some guards to be with you. It's not that I don't trust you, but it'll make traversing our territory much more convenient,\" said Jiao Zhenhai.","\"I understand.\"","\"Then please wait here for a moment.\"","Jiao Zhenhai and the Three Grand Elders left Yuan and the Dragon Emperor alone inside the room while they gathered a small group of guards.","About half an hour later, two guards arrived at their room, a young man and a young woman, both Golden Immortal cultivators.","\"My name is Xuanbing,\" said the young man.","\"I'm Binglan, and we'll be your guide,\" said the young woman.","\"I'm Yuan. Let's get along.\""]},{"number":1957,"title":"Chapter 1957: Investigation","paragraphs":["\"Where would you like to visit first, envoy of Dragon Goddess Yeyou?\" Xuanbing asked.","\"That's too long. Just call me Yuan.\"","\"Then, Senior Yuan, where would you like to go?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before speaking, \"Let's take a look around this place first since we're already here.\"","\"Very well.\"","Rather than searching within the Azure Dragon Clan's residence, Yuan chose to explore the area surrounding their living quarters.","Xuanbing and Binglan followed quietly a short distance behind Yuan. While their presence served as a protective escort, it was clear they were also there to keep a close eye on him, ensuring he didn't do anything deemed suspicious.","The area surrounding the Azure Dragon Clan's residence was vast and open, teeming with vibrant marine life. Colorful corals sprawled across the seafloor alongside smooth stones and swaying seaweeds, creating a natural tapestry rich with motion and life.","'Does the Azure Dragon Clan use this space for anything?\" Yuan asked.","\"Not that I am aware of. However, they do keep this place organized, treating it like an outdoor garden,\" said Binglan.","\"No wonder it looks so beautiful,\" Yuan said as he swept the entire area with his divine sense.","However, he was unable to find anything out of the ordinary.","\"I don't see anything here. Let's check out the city.\"","Some time later, Yuan made his way back to the city they had passed through not long ago.","\"This place is even more magnificent from up close.\"","The underwater city bore a striking resemblance to those on land, complete with bustling businesses, residential buildings, and streets paved with smooth seastone. Even food stalls lined the pathways, their colorful banners swaying gently in the currents, offering all manner of underwater delicacies to passersby.","Yuan approached one of the nearby stalls with quiet intrigue. On land, such stalls typically sold skewers, steamed buns, or sizzling grilled dishes. But here, beneath the sea, every vendor offered only raw seafood and vegetables. It wasn't surprising, of course. In a place where fire was useless, raw delicacies were the norm.","\"How much for that one?\" Yuan asked, pointing to a piece of seafood neatly wrapped in what looked like blue seaweed.","\"Two ordinary shells,\" said the vendor.","Yuan raised his eyebrows at this unfamiliar currency.","\"We have our own currencies down here,\" said Xuanbing. \"Allow me to pay for you.\"","Xuanbing produced two beautiful and identical shell-like objects and handed them to the vendor, who immediately accepted them before handing Yuan his food.","As soon as it was in his hand, Yuan took a bite. The texture was smooth and delicately soft, almost melting on his tongue. A strong, briny flavor filled his mouth—a rich, oceanic taste that was clean and refreshing, the kind only found in the freshest, highest-quality fish. The blue seaweed used to wrap the seafood offered a pleasant contrast, slightly tougher in texture, but with a satisfying crunch that complemented the softness of the filling.","\"What kind of food is this?\" Yuan asked the vendor.","\"That is Flying Leviathan meat wrapped with Spiritual Seaweed.\"","\"What?\"","Surprise and bewilderment flashed across Yuan's face the moment he learned the identity of what he'd just eaten.","Flying Leviathans were known as the king of the seas by mortals, especially back in the Primordial Era. And yet, here they were... reduced to affordable stall food, casually served and consumed as though they were no more special than common fish.","\"Is there something wrong with the food?\" the vendor asked with a worried look on his face, clearly afraid to offend someone being escorted by two soldiers from the Azure Dragon Clan.","\"Oh, there's nothing wrong. The food was delicious. Thank you.\"","Yuan continued to wander through the city, his expression calm and almost leisurely, like that of a curious traveler taking in the sights.","But beneath that relaxed exterior, he remained vigilant. His divine sense was constantly at work, quietly sweeping through the surroundings as he diligently inspected every corner for anything unusual.","Due to the city's immense scale, it took Yuan nearly two full weeks to explore it in its entirety. He left no alley, district, or passage unchecked—his divine sense meticulously combing through every layer of coral, stone, and structure.","Yet, despite his thorough search, he found nothing out of the ordinary.","\"Anything?\" Binglan asked him.","Yuan shook his head.","\"Not surprising. The Azure Dragon Clan has already searched through the city... several times, at that.\"","Yuan then said, \"You said the Azure Dragon Clan fought with the individual who cursed your clan, right?\"","\"Yes, that's right.\"","\"Where did the fight take place? Can you take me there?\"","\"What's the point? The fight occurred many thousands of years ago. I doubt there are anything left from that event.\"","\"We won't know until we see it for ourselves.\"","\"...\"","Xuanbing and Binglan exchanged glances with each other. Eventually, Xuanbing said, \"Alright, we'll take you there.\"","The group made their way back toward the Azure Dragon Clan's residence, but instead of stopping, they continued past it.","After traveling several hundred miles through the serene, light-dappled waters, Xuanbing and Binglan came to a halt before a strange and desolate field.","The area stretched wide and eerie, marked by hundreds of deep, irregular craters etched into the seabed—each one like a scar carved into the ocean floor.","\"The battle took place here,\" Xuanbing said solemnly. \"Though the Azure Dragon Clan fought against a single individual, that person held their ground for an entire month against all of us. And in the end... they still managed to escape with their life.\"","\"...\"","Yuan didn't respond. He simply stood there, eyes fixed on the cratered landscape, a faint frown settling on his face.","\"Do you see something?\" the Dragon Emperor asked, noticing Yuan's expression. His voice was calm but curious—he himself couldn't sense anything unusual.","\"Yes...\" he nodded.","\"What is it? What do you see?!\" Binglan asked, her voice filled with urgency and excitement.","<Perfect Poison Immunity has resisted '???'>","\"It's poison. This place is filled with poison,\" he revealed."]},{"number":1958,"title":"Chapter 1958: Unknown Poison","paragraphs":["\"Poison?!\" Binglan suddenly burst out, her voice sharp with disbelief. \"Are you saying poison is what caused the decline of our Azure Dragon Clan's bloodline?! That's outrageous!\"","Her eyes flared with fury as she stepped forward. \"I've tolerated this farce only because it was my father's wish—but I can no longer endure it! You're nothing but a fraud!\"","\"E-Elder sister... please, calm down,\" Xuanbing said softly, stepping in with a concerned expression, trying to ease the rising tension.","Yuan looked at her with raised eyebrows.","\"Father? You're the Clan Leader's daughter?\"","\"That's right! My full name is Jiao Binglan, and I am the eldest daughter in the Azure Dragon Clan!\"","Xuanbing sighed and spoke next, \"I'm Jiao Xuanbing, the second eldest son. Also, this isn't our real appearance.\"","Now that their identities had been exposed, there was no longer any need for concealment. In the next moment, they shed their disguises, revealing their real appearances.","\"Senior Envoy, are you sure it's poison? I don't mean to doubt you, but I also cannot sense anything,\" said Dragon Emperor with a doubtful look on his face.","\"I'm certain. Unfortunately, I cannot tell you what kind of poison it is.\"","\"Why are you so certain?\" Jiao Xuanbing asked.","Yuan looked at him and said without any hesitation, \"Because I have Perfect Poison Immunity, and it reacted the moment I entered this place.\"","\"Perfect Poison Immunity?!\" Jiao Binglan exclaimed, her voice rising with disbelief. \"Isn't that the highest level of poison resistance—one that only exists in legends?! And you expect us to believe you, a human, have actually acquired such an ability?!\"","Yuan gave a light shrug. \"Whether you believe me or not is your choice. And for the record, there's no definitive proof yet that this poison is tied to your clan's predicament. It's just a possibility.\"","After learning about the poison, Yuan and the others hurried back to inform Jiao Zhenhai and the Three Grand Elders about the discovery.","\"Poison?! Are you sure...?\"","Unsurprisingly, Jiao Zhenhai and the Three Grand Elders met the news with skepticism. Doubt flickered across their faces, their expressions tightening as they struggled to accept such an improbable explanation.","\"I've never heard of a poison capable of weakening a royal bloodline,\" said the First Elder.","As the Azure Dragon Clan's foremost poison expert, his skepticism carried weight.","\"We've examined our bodies and blood thoroughly in the past, but there were no traces of any poison.\"","\"This might be something entirely new,\" Yuan replied. \"A poison specifically designed to target your bloodline without leaving behind the usual signs.\"","\"You can't be serious! Do you even know what it would take to create something like that? And why would they target our Azure Dragon Clan? We've always lived here in peace without offending anyone!\" Jiao Binglan exclaimed.","\"You said he came here for your family heirloom, right? Do you think I can take a look at it?\" Yuan asked.","\"That must be your true purpose here!\" Jiao Binglan snapped, her eyes blazing with fury. \"Are you working for that bastard?!\"","Without hesitation, she withdrew her weapon and leveled it at Yuan, her killing intent sharp and immediate.","But before she could take another step, the Dragon Emperor moved. In an instant, he stepped between them, and the room was flooded with his overwhelming pressure, so heavy it made the walls groan and the very water around them tremble.","\"Stop!\"","Jiao Zhenhai roared.","\"Binglan, what are you doing?! Lower your weapon right this instant and apologize to our guest!\"","\"B-But—\" she trembled with hesitation.","\"I will not repeat myself!\"","Jiao Binglan gritted her teeth in frustration as she lowered her weapon before putting it away.","\"I apologize for her unruly behavior.\" Jiao Zhenhai said with a weary sigh. \"This is a deeply sensitive matter for our clan, and emotions are running high. I ask for your patience and understanding.\"","Yuan shook his head lightly. \"It's fine. I understand how you feel. I don't expect you to place your trust in me so easily, either.\"","He paused for a moment before continuing, \"How about this—let me return to that area and investigate further. The poison doesn't affect me, so I'm in no danger.\"","\"Honestly, we can only enter that area up to a certain point before we're forced to retreat,\" Jiao Zhenhai admitted. \"The deeper we go, the more nauseating it becomes, and if we push any further, we eventually lose consciousness, regardless of our cultivation.\"","\"Why didn't you tell me that before I wasted two weeks wandering the city?\" Yuan sighed.","Jiao Zhenhai fell silent. He didn't have any excuses for this blunder.","Yuan turned to look at the Dragon Emperor and said, \"I should do this alone. I don't want you to become poisoned.\"","\"There's a good chance that I am already affected by it.\"","\"Yes, but I believe it's unlikely,\" Yuan replied. \"The poison may be unique and potent, but it seems to act very slowly. If it were truly aggressive, the Azure Dragon Clan's bloodline would have begun deteriorating much earlier. More likely, it's a poison that requires prolonged exposure, something that seeps in gradually over time before it begins to take effect.\"","\"In that case, I'll listen to your advice and stay here for now.\"","\"Allow me to accompany you,\" said the First Elder, stepping forward. \"I possess the most extensive knowledge of poisons among us.\"","Yuan considered mentioning that the First Elder likely wouldn't be of much help, given that even he couldn't detect the poison.","But he held his tongue and simply gave a quiet nod, choosing not to worsen his relationship with them.","Sometime later, Yuan and the First Elder made their way to the poisoned area.","<Perfect Poison Immunity has resisted '???'>","\"My poison immunity starts reacting from this point,\" Yuan said.","The First Elder didn't respond. Instead, he calmly retrieved a set of tools from his spatial ring—treasures designed for detecting poison.","He activated them and tested the surrounding water. After a few moments, he shook his head and said grimly, \"Nothing.\"","Yuan then said, \"I'll be going deeper. I suggest you stay here.\"","\"No, I'm coming with you.\"","\"Do as you please.\""]},{"number":1959,"title":"Chapter 1959: Source of the Poison","paragraphs":["As Yuan ventured deeper, the waters around him grew increasingly murky and dim. The clarity faded into a thick, shadowy haze, and a foul stench began to fill the area, seeping through even the protective barrier around him.","It was the pungent, unmistakable smell of decay, as if he were swimming through water steeped in rot and corruption.","\"Heavens... It was nothing like this when we visited this place for the last time a hundred years ago...\" The First Elder remarked with a disgusted expression on his face, even pinching his nose, trying to fight off the pungent smell.","\"The last time you visited this place was a hundred years ago?\" Yuan asked to confirm.","\"Yes. Since nobody can venture into this place without fainting, we eventually gave up on exploring this place. We even had people from outside the Azure Dragon Clan attempt it, but the results remained the same.\"","\"Of course, nobody could explain the phenomenon, either. By the way, I am starting to feel my consciousness slipping away, so this is the furthest I can go. Good luck.\"","The First Elder halted his movements for a second before turning around and walking back to the Azure Dragon Clan's residents.","\"I'll see you back at the house,\" said Yuan before he continued walking even deeper, his Perfect Poison Immunity blocking the effects of the poison every second.","Soon, the waters became so dirty that it was nearly impossible to see anything with his bare eyes, and even his divine sense was of little help.","Since divine sense no longer worked, Yuan had to use divine gaze, which consumed more spiritual and mental energy, but that wasn't a problem for him.","After wandering for days, Yuan eventually noticed something and hurried his pace.","A few moments later, Yuan came upon a massive corpse resting on the seafloor—its presence dark and unsettling.","The remains appeared to belong to some sort of serpent-like creature, but its body was so deformed and ravaged that its original identity was nearly impossible to discern. Twisted flesh, torn scales, and warped bones made it a grotesque shadow of whatever it once was.","At the center of the corpse, nestled deep within its mangled remains, Yuan spotted a large black orb—its surface so dark and smooth that it nearly vanished into the surrounding murky water.","It pulsed faintly, as if absorbing the decay around it, and gave off a presence that felt both unnatural and deeply ominous.","It didn't take even a second before Yuan determined this black orb to be the source of the poison. He carefully picked it up and inspected it.","The poison from it wasn't as deadly as the poisons he'd encountered in the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp, but it had a really unique property. If he had to compare it to the poison within the swamp, it'd be somewhere in the inner zones.","'This must be a new type of poison, specifically created to mess with the Azure Dragon Clan's bloodline. Whoever created this is incredibly skilled.'","Now that Yuan had acquired the source of the poison, he had to deal with it. Fortunately, he had Perfect Poison Immunity and the Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique, which allowed him to absorb and refine the poison.","Although he wanted to bring the poison back to the Azure Dragon Clan to show the Clan Leader and the Three Great Elders as proof, he'd only endanger their lives.","With no other option, Yuan sat down and began to absorb the poison, refining it into his own power.","'There's a lot of poison in this thing, likely built up for tens of thousands of years... It'll take some time before I fully purify it...'","As Yuan began purifying the poisonous orb, a faint glow surrounded his body, spreading out like ripples through the murky water. At the same time, he drew in the lingering poison around him, steadily absorbing and neutralizing its corruptive essence.","Bit by bit, the oppressive darkness faded, and the once-foul water began to clear.","Time flowed quietly, and after several days of tireless effort, Yuan was nearly halfway through purifying the poison.","But just as he continued his work, a sudden surge of killing intent flared from behind him. Instinctively, he halted, his body tensing as he turned to face the threat.","Whoosh!","A sharp, needle-like object tore through the water with blinding speed, aimed straight at Yuan. He reacted instantly, raising his arm to intercept it, but the weapon was shrouded in powerful Immortal Qi, disrupting his defense and slipping past his guard.","It struck his body with a jarring force, but thanks to his powerful physique, it failed to pierce through completely. Had he been any weaker, the needle would have bored into his heart.","Even so, it still wouldn't have been enough to kill him.","<Perfection Poison Immunity has resisted Whisper of the Abyss>","\"What is the meaning of this?\" Yuan spoke to the approaching figure.","A few moments later, a familiar-looking old man appeared before him.","\"First Elder.\"","The one who'd attacked him was none other than the First Elder.","\"So it was true that you have Perfect Poison Immunity. What a pity. You could've had an easy death if you didn't.\"","Although his poisoned attack had failed to kill Yuan, the First Elder showed no sign of concern. His expression remained calm, almost indifferent.","After all, Yuan was merely at the peak of the Divine Emperor Realm, while he himself stood at the 2nd level of the God Ascension Realm. From his perspective, the outcome was already decided.","\"Before you kill me, how about giving me an explanation?\" Yuan said calmly, his gaze steady. \"Why are you doing this?\"","\"Why?\" the First Elder sneered, his eyes narrowing. \"It's simple. You're interfering with our great project—something that's taken thousands of years of planning and a fortune in resources. We won't let one outsider ruin it all.\"","\"That doesn't really explain anything. What's the plan? Who are you working for?\" Yuan continued to question the First Elder, trying to acquire as much information as he could."]},{"number":1960,"title":"Chapter 1960: Fighting the First Elder","paragraphs":["\"Why do you even care about such things when you're about to die?\" The First Elder sneered. \"You should be worrying about your own life.\"","Yuan shrugged and replied, \"Why bother worrying about something that's out of my control? You're a God Ascension Realm cultivator, while I am still a mortal. The outcome should be obvious. And if I am going to die, I want to at least know why.\"","\"It's simple. The reason you're going to die is because you stuck your nose into something you shouldn't have.\"","Yuan sighed, \"What else am I supposed to do? I need the key you took from the Holy Dragon Clan. By the way, aren't you afraid of offending Dragon Goddess Yeyou? In case you forgot, I am her envoy.\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou? Hahaha!\" The First Elder began laughing out loud. \"Who'd be foolish enough to believe such a lie? There's no way you're Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy. She died long ago!\"","\"Why are you so certain that she died? Did you witness her death with your own eyes?\" Yuan asked.","\"She hasn't been seen since the Immortal Monarch Era. That's more than enough proof! Anyway, enough yapping. I'm going to kill you now.\"","\"Are you sure you want to do that? The others might become suspicious of you if you return alone.\"","\"I'm going to tell them that you'd never returned. They can't prove that I'd killed you if your corpse is in a place where nobody can reach. Even the Holy Dragon Emperor, who came here with you, won't be able to reach this area.\"","\"Is that so? What a pity. Unfortunately for you, it won't be that easy to kill me.\"","\"We'll see about that.\"","The First Elder raised his hand, palm facing Yuan, and unleashed a wave of Immortal Qi. The pressure surged through the water, seeking to suppress him with overwhelming force.","Yuan, however, remained unfazed. A faint smile curved his lips.","\"Immortal Qi?\" he said calmly. \"What—afraid to use Celestial Qi? Worried you might alert the others?\"","\"...\"","Although the First Elder had reached the second level of the God Ascension Realm, he had yet to fully master Celestial Qi. Because of this, he was reluctant to risk using it, especially when doing so might alert the others to his betrayal.","\"Looks like I hit the nail on its head,\" Yuan smiled. \"You won't be able to kill me with Immortal Qi alone, even if you're at the God Ascension Realm.\"","Yuan activated Dragon Awakening, causing his aura and strength to surge tremendously.","It was so powerful that it took the First Elder by surprise.","'How can a mortal human release such pressure? And why does he seem so... confident? Does he really think that he can defeat me with the difference in our cultivation?'","\"WHAT A JOKE! I'LL RIP THAT HEAD OFF THOSE SHOULDERS WITH MY BARE HANDS!\"","The First Elder flew at Yuan.","Yuan retrieved Number One Under Heaven and began fighting the First Elder.","'A God Ascension realm cultivator, huh? Need my help?' Zi Xuan's voice suddenly resounded inside Yuan's head.","'So you're finally awake. Not yet. I want to test my current limit,' he said.","'If you say so...'","Hundreds of exchanges later, a grim realization settled over the First Elder—he couldn't overpower Yuan through brute strength.","The revelation was nothing short of shocking. He was a God Ascension Realm cultivator, a dragon no less, beings renowned for their overwhelming physical might and dominance in close combat.","And yet, he was being steadily pushed back by a mere human... one who stood several cultivation realms below him.","\"Is this the strength of a God Ascension Realm cultivator? What a disappointment.\" Yuan mocked.","However, he knew that the First Elder was holding back most of his strength.","\"Imprudent brat!\"","Suddenly, the First Elder's appearance began to shift. Blue scales rippled across his skin like living armor. His eyes burned brighter, and his aura surged. He had activated Dragon Awakening, though not in its complete form. Even so, the partial transformation greatly amplified his power, making his already formidable presence even more oppressive.","After activating Dragon Awakening, the First Elder's power surged, and he began to push Yuan back—but only slightly.","\"I guess you don't want a painless death! In that case, allow me to assist you!\"","Realizing brute force alone wouldn't be enough, the First Elder finally began unleashing his martial techniques, skills he had deliberately withheld until now.","\"Current Cleaving Strike!\"","The First Elder swung his claws with such immense force that the very water around him split apart.","Trapped by the water's resistance, Yuan's movements were heavily restricted, making it impossible to evade the devastating blow.","The First Elder's claws tore through him with brutal precision, rending his body into three separate parts—blood clouding the water as shockwaves rippled through the depths.","\"Hmph.\"","Believing he had finally ended the battle, the First Elder let out a breath and deactivated his Dragon Awakening.","But just as the mist of blood began to settle, a gleam of silver light tore through it—a spear, surging forth with deadly precision.","\"What?!\" the First Elder gasped, caught off guard. He moved to evade, but his guard was down, and the strike was too sudden.","The spear pierced through him before he could fully react.","Though the spear struck him, it hadn't landed a fatal blow. The First Elder jumped backward through the water, blood trailing from the wound as he clenched his teeth in pain and disbelief.","As the blood mist fully cleared, the First Elder's eyes widened in disbelief.","Yuan stood there with the Dragon God's Vengeance in his grasp, completely unharmed.","\"H-How are you still alive?!\" the First Elder roared, his voice echoing with disbelief and fury. \"I know I tore your body to pieces!\"","\"You sure? Maybe it was just your imagination,\" Yuan calmly spoke. \"After all, you're quite old already.\"","\"Bullshit! I know my technique landed! There was even blood! What the hell are you?!\" The First Elder clenched his fists in frustration."]},{"number":1961,"title":"Chapter 1961: A Taste of His Own Medicine","paragraphs":["\"Don't get ahead of yourself and think you've already defeated me! Although you managed to land a hit on me, this amount of damage is nothing—\"","\"No, it's over for you.\" Yuan suddenly interrupted.","\"What are you—\"","Just as the First Elder opened his mouth to speak, he froze—his expression contorting in agony.","A searing pain suddenly erupted from within, spreading through his body like wildfire. It felt as though his very blood was boiling, his insides being scorched from the inside out.","He staggered, clutching his chest before coughing up a mouthful of dark blood.","\"W-What did you do to me?!\" he shouted, his voice a mix of panic and disbelief.","\"Since you tried to kill me with poison, I'm giving you a taste of your own medicine.\"","\"Poison?! You poisoned me?! But I also have poison immunity! The Ten Thousand Poison Immunity!\" The First Elder was in disbelief.","Yuan chuckled and responded in a mocking tone, \"Just the Ten Thousand Poison Immunity? You'd need at least True Poison Immunity to deal with the Heaven's Bane.\"","\"Heaven's Bane?! You mean to tell me that you can use the most potent poison in the Nine Heavens?! Impossible! Not even the Poison Dragon Emperor can use that level of poison!\"","\"Believe what you want, but you'll die soon.\" Yuan shrugged.","Since his life was in jeopardy, the First Elder no longer cared about being caught and used his Celestial Qi to not only attack Yuan but also to resist the poison in his body.","Although Heaven's Bane was regarded as the most potent poison in existence, Yuan's current cultivation was still lacking.","As a result, he couldn't instantly kill someone as powerful as the First Elder, a God Ascension Realm cultivator whose resilience and vitality far surpassed even immortals.","Even so, the poison was already doing its work—slowly, but relentlessly.","Yuan coughed up a mouthful of blood after being struck by Celestial Qi.","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi has increased slightly>","\"H-How in heaven's name are you still standing?! You're just a mortal!\"","The First Elder was greatly baffled to see Yuan withstanding his Celestial Qi, something even immortals could not resist.","After all, Celestial Qi didn't just assault the body—it attacked the soul as well.","'Even if he had a strong body, his soul should be a different story! Unless his soul strength is just as monstrous as his physique, he shouldn't be alive after being hit by Celestial Qi, much less standing!'","The First Elder coughed up another mouthful of blood when his focus was broken for a second due to shock.","\"I told you that killing me wouldn't be easy...\" Yuan stared at the First Elder with a cold grin on his face.","Though he was resisting the First Elder's Celestial Qi, it wasn't easy. In fact, he was barely standing.","'If I don't kill him quickly, I'll definitely die here!' The First Elder cried inwardly.","Yuan could see the fear and anxiety in the First Elder's eyes and provoked him even further, \"Hm? Is that fear I sense? A God Ascension Realm cultivator fearing a mortal like me? That's quite hilarious...\"","\"SHUT UP!\"","The First Elder let out a furious roar as he unleashed his Celestial Qi to its absolute limit, so recklessly that it began to tear into his own body, inflicting internal damage in a desperate attempt to purge the poison.","Yuan was unable to withstand the overwhelming Celestial Qi and finally fell to his knees.","\"Haha... That was a foolish thing to do...\"","Despite the searing pain coursing through him, Yuan let out a low chuckle, his voice calm and cutting.","\"Using your Celestial Qi so recklessly...\" he said, eyes fixed on the writhing elder, \"...will only make the poison spread faster.\"","Sure enough, the poison within the First Elder's body suddenly surged in response, spreading like wildfire through every vein and organ.","Within moments, his strength crumbled, and he collapsed to the ocean floor—his body trembling, his breath ragged.","But he wasn't dead. Even with his entire body consumed by poison, a cultivator at the God Ascension Realm didn't perish so easily.","However, he was essentially paralyzed. In such a condition, he couldn't even lift a finger, much less use Celestial Qi.","Once the pressure on him was gone, Yuan stood up and slowly approached the First Elder with a grin on his face.","\"Looks like the one who'll be dying today will be you...\"","Yuan raised his sword and prepared to decapitate the First Elder.","But just as he swung, a sudden surge of force swept through the water. In the next instant, something struck his blade mid-swing with a sharp clang, deflecting it before it could strike the First Elder.","The force of the clash also sent Yuan skidding backward through the water. Regaining his balance, he quickly turned his gaze toward the source—only for his eyes to narrow in recognition.","A familiar figure stood right in front of the First Elder, clearly trying to protect him.","\"So,\" Yuan said calmly, raising an eyebrow, \"you were in on this too, Third Elder?\"","The Third Elder didn't immediately respond and turned to look at the First Elder, who was staring at him and clearly wanted to speak but couldn't.","He picked up the First Elder before speaking, \"You have no idea who you're messing with. You'll regret messing with our plan.\"","\"I sure don't. Why don't you enlighten me so I know who I am dealing with?\"","\"Hmph.\" The Third Elder coldly sneered.","\"Don't worry, you'll find out eventually when they come for you.\"","\"Whoever they are, they won't find out if I kill you two here.\" Yuan prepared to use the Immortal Monarch's techniques.","However, before he could do so, the Third Elder activated some sort of teleportation treasure, teleporting the First Elder and himself away.","\"Tch. They ran away, huh?\"","Yuan sucked his teeth in annoyance.","\"What a pity. If you had let me fight, I could've killed both of them in an instant,\" said Zi Xuan.","Yuan shook his head.","\"That would be overkill. Save your energy for something that's actually worth it.\""]},{"number":1962,"title":"Chapter 1962: The Elders’ Betrayal","paragraphs":["After the First Elder and the Third Elder left, Yuan returned to purifying the poison.","A week later, the pitch-black taint that once clouded the waters had completely vanished. The sea now shimmered with clarity, indistinguishable from the untouched stretches around it—serene, pure, and free of corruption.","Once he purified all of the poison, Yuan made his way back to the Azure Dragon Clan's residence while taking the now-purified orb with him.","However, he didn't even make it halfway back to the Azure Dragon Clan's living quarters before he encountered Jiao Zhenhai, Holy Dragon Emperor, and the others.","\"Senior Envoy! Are you okay?\" The Dragon Emperor asked him.","\"Yes, I am fine.\"","\"W-What did you do to this place?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked, his expression one of utter disbelief. \"It used to be filthy, and we could barely get this far without blacking out...\"","Yuan held out the now-purified orb and spoke calmly, \"This was the source of the poison. But I've already cleansed it. If you go a bit further down, you'll see a corpse.\"","\"I see... I'll have the First Elder analyze it,\" said Jiao Zhenhai. \"By the way, where's the First Elder? He came out here with you, correct? We came all the way out here because we sensed his Celestial Qi and thought he was in a fight.\"","\"...\"","Yuan didn't immediately respond.","\"What's wrong?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked.","Yuan looked at the Second Elder, who was still with the Azure Dragon Clan, and said, \"You won't like what I am about to say. Hell, you might even get angry at me for even saying it.\"","After taking a deep breath, Yuan continued, \"The First Elder betrayed the Azure Dragon Clan. He had a hand in the poison, and he attacked me while I was trying to purify it.\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Everyone in the Azure Dragon Clan exclaimed loudly, their faces filled with disbelief.","\"It's not just the First Elder, either. The Third Elder is also involved.\"","Jiao Zhenhai subconsciously took several steps back from absorbing the shock.","\"T-There's no way! You're making that up!\" Jiao Binglan suddenly shouted. \"The First Elder and the Third Elder are some of the most loyal members of the family! They wouldn't do something like betray us!\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"Why don't you listen to the details before you come to a conclusion? Here is what happened...\"","Yuan recounted the entire series of events in detail—from the moment he first began purifying the poisonous orb, to the fierce battle that followed with the First Elder, and how the Third Elder had appeared unexpectedly, intervened at the last moment to save his fellow conspirator before vanishing without a trace.","\"Hahaha! Do you really expect us to believe that you'd defeated the First Elder, who was at the second level of God Ascension and forced the Third Elder to escape, when you're only at the peak of Divine Emperor?!\" Jiao Binglan laughed out loud, finding his claims humorous and ridiculous.","\"If you don't believe it, I can show it to you? How I defeated the First Elder, that is. However, it's going to be a very painful experience.\" Yuan narrowed his eyes at her.","Jiao Binglan immediately erupted in anger, causing her aura to surge.","\"STOP!\" Jiao Zhenhai suddenly roared.","\"B-But father—\"","\"If the First Elder and the Third Elder are innocent, they will appear before us to explain everything,\" he said before looking at Yuan and continuing, \"If what you claim is true, they probably won't return to the Azure Dragon Clan, right?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, they will undoubtedly return. However, it'll be to destroy the Azure Dragon Clan or finish whatever I intervened.\"","Jiao Zhenhai clenched his fists in frustration.","\"We don't know that for sure. For all we know, they could've already returned to the residences and are waiting for our return.\"","\"Then why don't we return to the residence first?\" Yuan suggested.","Jiao Zhenhai nodded, and they began making their way back to the Azure Dragon Clan's living quarters.","\"I'm sorry you have to experience this, Senior Envoy...\" The Dragon Emperor apologized to him as they moved. \"If only we hadn't gambled away the key...\"","\"It's fine.\"","Sometime later, they returned to the Azure Dragon Clan's living quarters.","\"Has anyone seen the First Elder or the Third Elder?! Did they return yet?!\"","Jiao Zhenhai questioned every single individual they passed by in the courtyard.","\"No, Your Majesty. The First Elder and the Third Elder have not returned yet. We can send them a message requesting their return.\"","\"Do it immediately! If they don't respond, let me know!\"","The servants hurriedly went to contact the First Elder and the Third Elder through their communication jade slip. However, neither of them responded.","Sometime later—","\"Your Majesty, we tried contacting them several times, but neither of them is responding.\"","\"No way...\"","Jiao Zhenhai suddenly staggered backward, his face pale with disbelief. His legs gave out, and he collapsed onto the floor, breath shallow, eyes wide. The reality that two of the clan's highest elders, pillars of the Azure Dragon Clan, had betrayed them from within was sinking in.","\"Father, there must be an explanation!\" Jiao Binglan cried out, her voice trembling. \"First Grandpa and Third Grandpa would never betray us!\"","Tears streamed down her face as she shook her head in denial. They had been there since the day she was born, watching over her, guiding her, even treating her as their grandchild. The thought that they could turn against the Azure Dragon Clan—against her was too painful to accept.","Xuanbing and the Second Elder remained silent, but their pale faces and trembling forms betrayed the storm of emotions churning within them.","\"Why...?\" Jiao Zhenhai muttered, his voice cracking under the weight of disbelief. \"Why would they betray the Azure Dragon Clan? They've been supporting the clan for longer than even I have...\"","His fists clenched, and a hint of denial lingered in his tone. \"It doesn't make any damn sense...\"","Instead of sticking it in their faces, Yuan remained silent and patiently waited for them to accept the situation."]},{"number":1963,"title":"Chapter 1963: Absorbing the Poison","paragraphs":["Eventually, the Azure Dragon Clan calmed down.","\"We'll deal with the First Elder and the Third Elder later. For now... since you purified the poison, does that mean our problem has been fixed?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked Yuan.","He shook his head.","\"Hard to say. Since the Azure Dragon Clan has been exposed to the poison for thousands of years, it might have a permanent effect on your bloodline. However, it's also possible for your bloodline to improve in future generations.\"","\"Can't you just purify the poison in our body?\" the Xuanbing asked.","\"Like I said, the poison is already deeply rooted in your body. It'd be like trying to remove salt that has already been dissolved in water. It's not impossible, but it's going to be very difficult and time-consuming.\"","\"How long would it take for you to cleanse one person?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked.","\"I won't know until I try it,\" Yuan said.","\"Can you try it? Only the younger generation really needs to be healed since they're going to be the ones carrying on our bloodline and legacy.\"","\"I'll give it a try, but if it takes too long or is too risky, I won't be able to help you.\"","Jiao Zhenhai nodded and turned to look at Xuanbing.","\"Xuanbing, are you willing to be first?\"","He nodded and said, \"Of course. Anything for the family.\"","\"Now lend us a quiet place with little to no disturbance,\" said Yuan.","Jiao Zhenhai brought them to his own room and said, \"I'll forbid anyone from approaching this place so you can do the treatment in complete silence.\"","Yuan looked at Xuanbing and asked, \"Are you ready?\"","\"Whenever you are.\"","They sat down with Yuan sitting behind Xuanbing.","\"I'm going to examine your body first. Do not resist my spiritual energy.\"","Yuan placed his palms on Xuanbing's back and began spreading his spiritual energy around to examine the interior of Xuanbing's body.","\"The poison isn't affecting your physical strength, and your internal organs remain unharmed,\" Yuan said as he carefully examined Xuanbing. \"As for the poison itself, it's deeply embedded within your body, from your blood to your cells, to the point that it's almost undetectable. I'm going to begin the purifying process now. Let me know if it hurts.\"","Without hesitation, Yuan began the process of removing the poison from Xuanbing's body.","Unlike traditional purification techniques, his method was far more direct. He wasn't neutralizing the poison but absorbing it into himself.","Xuanbing's body began to tremble uncontrollably, his muscles tensing as the poison was drawn out. Yet not a single sound escaped his lips. He clenched his jaw and bore it in silence, choosing to endure rather than show weakness.","Seeing this, Yuan decided to continue without saying a word.","Exactly one week later, Yuan paused the process and examined Xuanbing's condition, comparing his current condition to what it had been when they first began to see how long it'd take to fully heal him.","\"At this rate, it will take around four months to remove all of the poison in your body, and the pain will only get worse,\" Yuan said to Xuanbing.","\"F-Four months...?\" Xuanbing swallowed nervously. \"I-It's okay! I can endure it! No! I will endure it!\"","\"Alright, let me speak with your father before we continue.\"","Sometime later, Jiao Zhenhai appeared before them.","\"I can heal him in four months.\" Yuan went straight to the point.","\"That's great! Then—\"","\"However, I will be done once I heal him.\" Yuan suddenly interrupted. \"I have already solved the source of your problem, so I am technically already done. Once I heal him, I'll need the key. If you cannot accept this... then things might get complicated.\"","\"That's...\"","The excitement on Jiao Zhenhai's face immediately disappeared when he remembered that Yuan wasn't helping them for free. Regardless of their situation, none of it was Yuan's problem. Moreover, it was not as if the Azure Dragon Clan's lives were in danger.","\"Is there no room for negotiation? I have five children, which would only take a little under two years to cure.\"","In Jiao Zhenhai's eyes, two years was nothing.","\"Two years may be nothing in your eyes, but don't forget that I am a human. I also have many things to do. Two years is a long time for me. However, if you make it worthwhile, I guess I can stay here for two years.\"","\"T-The treasury! I'll let you take one treasure from our Azure Dragon Clan's treasury for every child of mine you cure after Xuanbing!\" Jiao Zhenhai said.","Yuan narrowed his eyes, but he didn't immediately respond.","\"Let me think about it. We can continue this conversation once I heal your son, since we still don't know if he can endure it until I completely remove the poison from his body. It's a painful process, after all.\"","\"Okay.\" Jiao Zhenhai nodded, hope flickering within his gaze.","After speaking with Jiao Zhenhai, Yuan spoke with the Dragon Emperor.","\"I'll be here for at least another four months to heal Xuanbing. After that, I may or may not heal the others, which could take another two years. I'm not going to ask you to stay here with me, so you can return to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","\"Are you sure you want me to leave? What if...\"","\"It's fine. I doubt the Azure Dragon Clan would do anything to me at this point. Even if they want to do something, Dragon Goddess Yeyou is at my side. Moreover, my friend, Xi Meili, should know about my situation. I don't want her to worry.\"","\"I understand. But instead of leaving immediately, I'll leave in four months, just in case.\"","Some time later, Yuan resumed the process of cleansing the poison from Xuanbing's body.","Time passed swiftly, and in the blink of an eye, four months had gone by.","\"I've successfully removed ninety-nine percent of the poison from your body. While a trace amount remains, it's insignificant—far too weak to have any effect on you.\"","Yuan said to Xuanbing, who was drenched in sweat."]},{"number":1964,"title":"Chapter 1964: Azure Dragon Clan’s Treasury","paragraphs":["\"Thank you!\" Xuanbing stood up once he regained enough energy and bowed to Yuan.","\"No problem.\"","They contacted Jiao Zhenhai and the others shortly after.","\"So? How are the results?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked.","\"I have purified ninety-nine percent of the poison in his blood. As for the remaining percent, it's too little to have any effect on him, so he's essentially fully healed,\" Yuan explained.","\"Thank you!\" Jiao Zhenhai said with a slightly lowered head. \"Now, about the others...\"","Yuan then said, \"Let me rest for a few days, then I want to take a look at your treasury. If the contents interest me, I'll accept your offer.\"","\"In that case, contact me whenever you are ready. I have already prepared a room for you.\"","Yuan was led to his room shortly after.","\"I'll head back to the Dragon Spiral Mountain now,\" said the Dragon Emperor in front of his room.","Yuan nodded.","\"I'll return as soon as I am done here. Thanks for coming here with me.\"","The Dragon Emperor left Yuan alone shortly after, but he didn't leave the Azure Dragon Clan yet.","\"Jiao Zhenhai, I will be returning to the Dragon Spiral Mountain now.\"","\"Already? Does that mean the envoy won't—\"","\"That's not it. I will be returning alone. Senior Envoy will remain here. In fact, I believe that the Senior Envoy has already decided to help your family, hence why he's sending me away.\"","\"Is that so...\" Jiao Zhenhai sighed in relief.","\"The Senior Envoy's safety is now your Azure Dragon Clan's responsibility. If anything happens to Senior Envoy while I am gone, you'll have to answer the entire Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","Jiao Zhenhai sneered, \"Relax, Dragon Emperor. He's our Azure Dragon Clan's savior. We'll return him to the Dragon Spiral Mountain safely once he's done here.\"","The Dragon Emperor nodded and left without saying another word.","A few days later, Yuan emerged from his room and was personally escorted by Jiao Zhenhai to the Azure Dragon Clan's treasury.","Unlike most treasuries confined to physical space, this one was hidden within a separate dimension—Jiao Zhenhai's personal world. Upon entering, Yuan found himself standing before a massive, square-shaped structure that resembled an ancient museum, grand and imposing.","The entrance was sealed behind a powerful level 9 formation, a barrier that only Jiao Zhenhai could unlock.","Inside, the building opened into a single vast chamber, and Yuan was greeted by an overwhelming sight. Rows upon rows of treasures, each one neatly displayed in elegant cases and along finely carved wall shelves.","The sheer number of treasures stored within the chamber caused the air itself to pulse with concentrated spiritual energy.","The pressure was immense, so dense and overwhelming that a cultivator at the Spirit Enlightenment Realm would be crushed the moment they stepped inside.","\"Take your time looking around, and if you see anything that piques your interest, don't hesitate to speak up,\" said Jiao Zhenhai as he gestured for Yuan to enter.","Yuan wasted no time and immediately began looking at the treasures.","The vast majority of the treasures within the treasury were weapons, armor, and artifacts. Most were of Mythic-grade or higher.","The shelves dedicated to pills held a dazzling array of Tier 8 elixirs, and among them, a handful of exceedingly rare Tier 9 pills.","\"Only the best and most powerful treasures make it to our treasury,\" said Jiao Zhenhai in a prideful tone.","\"I can see that,\" Yuan said with a smile.","The more Yuan explored the treasury, the more he was tempted to accept Jiao Zhenhai's offer.","'Two years... While it's not a lot of time for most people, it's a lot to me...'","With his talents, Yuan could easily achieve what most people take centuries to achieve in two years, not to mention his real body was still stuck on Earth.","After several hours of meticulously examining each treasure, Yuan finally reached the far end of the room. There, set apart from all the others, was a single display—elevated slightly and encased in its own reinforced barrier.","Inside sat a breathtaking blue crystal, glowing faintly with a serene yet powerful light. Despite its relatively small size, no bigger than a drop of water, its luster shimmered like moonlight on still water, and its aura was unlike anything else in the room.","\"What is this treasure?\" Yuan asked, his gaze lingering on the luminous blue crystal.","Jiao Zhenhai's expression stiffened slightly before he offered a nervous smile and said, \"That... is our family heirloom, the Tear of the Azure Heavens.\"","\"Tear of the Azure Heavens? Never heard of it. So this is the treasure that the person who poisoned your clan wanted... What does it do?\"","Jiao Zhenhai shook his head and said, \"I'm being completely honest when I say this, but I have no clue what it does.\"","\"Huh? So you have an unknown crystal as your family heirloom?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows in puzzlement.","\"This treasure has been with our family since ancient times. It is said that it used to belong to our ancestor.\"","\"...\"","Yuan stared at the crystal in silence. Its unique aura wasn't the only reason he took an interest in it.","<Nine Dragon Symbols is reacting to something!>","The Nine Dragon Symbols have been acting up since he entered the treasury, and it was currently having the strongest reaction.","\"Is there any chance you'd be willing to give me this treasure for the treatment? I'm willing to treat all of your children for this one treasure,\" Yuan said.","\"T-That's... I'm sorry, but that's impossible.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before speaking, \"What if I give you a few drops of Immortal Monarch's blood?\"","\"What?! The Immortal Monarch's blood?!\" Jiao Zhenhai couldn't believe his ears and almost fell down from shock.","Among the beast race, there existed a widely famous legend, one that had endured for generations.","It was said that the blood of the Immortal Monarch possessed a miraculous property—the ability to elevate the bloodline of any who absorbed it.","For beasts of royal lineage, who valued the purity of their bloodline more than life itself, such a thing was beyond priceless.","Jiao Zhenhai swallowed nervously as he seriously contemplated Yuan's offer."]},{"number":1965,"title":"Chapter 1965: Tear of the Azure Heavens","paragraphs":["After Yuan offered the Immortal Monarch's blood for the Tear of the Azure Heavens, Jiao Zhenhai began to seriously contemplate his offer.","The Immortal Monarch's blood would not only help the Azure Dragon Clan recover their weakened bloodline but might even strengthen it past their original purity.","\"H-How many drops of the Immortal Monarch's blood do you possess?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked in a hesitant tone.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Enough for you and all of your children.\"","\"That much?!\" Jiao Zhenhai almost couldn't believe his ears.","However, Jiao Zhenhai didn't immediately agree and pondered.","'The Tears of Azure Heavens has been with our family since ancient times, but if I'm being honest, we have no use for it. Hell, we don't even know what it does. However, if we have the Immortal Monarch's blood, it would solve our predicament and might even strengthen our bloodline.'","'But for him to offer something as valuable as the Immortal Monarch's blood, the Tears of Azure Heavens must be as valuable, if not even more valuable, than the Immortal Monarch's blood... Damn it! Do I take his offer or not?!'","Eventually, Jiao Zhenhai made up his mind and spoke, \"I'm—\"","However, Jiao Zhenhai's voice abruptly stopped, and his eyes widened with shock and disbelief when Yuan suddenly coughed up a mouthful of blood.","Both Jiao Zhenhai and Yuan simultaneously looked down, only to see a gleaming blue trident jutting clean through Yuan's chest, right where his heart was located.","The next moment, Yuan collapsed to the ground.","\"W-What?!\" Jiao Zhenhai exclaimed in bewilderment, mostly because he recognized the tridant.","He subconsciously turned to look at the entrance and saw a lone figure standing there.","\"Second Elder?! How did you get in here?! No, more important, what do you think you're doing?!\"","\"What does it look like I am doing?\" the Second Elder calmly responded.","\"Don't tell me... you've betrayed the Azure Dragon Clan too?!\" Jiao Zhenhai's voice trembled with disbelief as shock flooded his face.","After the First Elder and the Third Elder's sudden betrayal, they had tirelessly interrogated the Second Elder for the past four months to ensure that he wasn't working with them since the three of them were like peas in a pod. And after many hours of questioning, the Second Elder had been cleared of any suspicion.","But alas...","\"Why did the three of you betray the Azure Dragon Clan?!\" Jiao Zhenhai roared as his cultivation erupted furiously.","The Second Elder shrugged and said, \"It's quite simple. The Azure Dragon Clan is no longer worth our protection and loyalty.\"","\"There's no way you'd be stupid enough to betray us over such a reason!\"","The Second Elder smiled and said, \"You're right. We found a place that's worth our loyalty.\"","\"Who?! Who are you working for?!\" Jiao Zhenhai roared as he pounced at the Second Elder.","\"Does it even matter? The Azure Dragon Clan will soon cease to exist, anyway.\"","The Second Elder calmly raised his hand and deflected Jiao Zhenhai's furious strike.","The clash sent shockwaves rippling through the treasury, but with both of them being at the fourth level of the God Ascension Realm, they stood locked in place, equally matched.","\"I'll force everything out of you even if it's the last thing I do!\" Jiao Zhenhai roared.","\"I'd like to see you try!\"","Jiao Zhenhai and the Second Elder clashed fiercely, their battle shaking the very foundation of the dimension. Blades of energy tore through the air, waves of Celestial Qi collided, and spatial distortions cracked around them like glass.","Yet, despite the overwhelming power of their techniques, not a single treasure in the room was disturbed. Every weapon, pill, and artifact remained untouched.","After nearly a thousand intense exchanges, the tide of battle began to shift, and the Second Elder's cultivation suddenly increased to the fifth level.","The Second Elder, though evenly matched at first, immediately started to gain the upper hand.","\"Hahaha! How do you like this?! I, who have always been slightly behind you, am now stronger! This is the result of betraying the Azure Dragon Clan!\"","\"You despicable bastard!\"","Eventually, the Second Elder overpowered Jiao Zhenhai and sent him flying across the treasury.","\"Once I kill you, acquire the Tear of the Azure Heavens, and accomplish our goal, we'll receive even more benefit from the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan!\"","Jiao Zhenhai trembled after hearing the name 'Mystic Sea Dragon Clan'.","\"You were colluding with the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan this entire time?! You low-life bastards!\" Jiao Zhenhai roared, his voice thunderous with fury.","The Second Elder covered his mouth with a hand and spoke in a teasing tone, \"Oops. I wasn't supposed to reveal that. Well, it doesn't really matter since you're going to die so—\"","In the midst of his sentence, the Second Elder suddenly stiffened, a sharp jolt of pain lancing through his back, like a blade piercing straight through him.","His eyes widened in disbelief as he slowly turned around... only to see Yuan standing mere inches behind him, a dagger firmly gripped in his hand.","\"You—! How are you still alive?!\" the Second Elder gasped, staggering slightly as a burning pain rippled throughout his body.","However, what stunned him even more than the fact that Yuan was still alive after taking a spear through the heart was how he had managed to slip behind him completely unnoticed.","\"Just like the First Elder, you seem to like attacking people from the back, so I'm letting you experience it for yourself. How is it? Do you enjoy it?\"","Snapping out of his daze, the Second Elder roared loudly and lashed out with a wild, powerful swing of his arm.","Splat!","Yuan's head was torn clean from his shoulders before it hurtled across the room, where it struck the wall with a sickening splatter of blood.","\"That son of a bitch... I don't know how he survived being struck in the heart, but he's definitely dead now. No mortal can survive without their head!\"","However, as the Second Elder turned away from the blood-smeared wall and back toward Yuan, his eyes widened in shock and his complexion paled instantly, almost as if he'd seen a ghost.","\"Sup,\" Yuan said with a smile on his face."]},{"number":1966,"title":"Chapter 1966: A Glimpse of Zi Xuan’s Prowess","paragraphs":["As if struck by a sudden nightmare, the Second Elder recoiled in horror. With a sharp gasp, he leapt backward instinctively.","\"W-What the hell are you?!\" the Second Elder exclaimed, his voice riddled with fear. \"How are you still alive?!\"","Before Yuan could even respond, the Second Elder spoke again, \"It can't be! That regenerative ability! You're a demon!\"","\"Hahaha!\"","Yuan laughed at the Second Elder's assumptions.","\"Are those your last words?\"","The Second Elder clenched his fists and roared, \"So what if you're a demon?! You're still a mere Divine Emperor! I can crush you with a finger!\"","The Second Elder raised a trembling finger at Yuan, gathering Celestial Qi with murderous intent blazing in his eyes.","But the moment the Celestial Qi began to surge through him, a searing pain erupted from deep within his body, far more intense than before.","His expression twisted in agony as the burning sensation multiplied, coursing through his veins like wildfire, threatening to tear him apart from the inside.","\"This is... poison?! You poisoned me?!\" The Second Elder immediately retrieved a handful of pills and swallowed them simultaneously after realizing Yuan had poisoned him.","\"Those pills won't save you,\" Yuan said coldly. \"Heaven's Bane is one of the most lethal poisons in the universe. Unless you have specifically prepared for it, you won't get rid of it.\"","Moreover, Yuan had struck the Second Elder with Baneful Abyss, his Soul Weapon that not only amplified the potency of Heaven's Bane but also accelerated its effects to a terrifying degree.","Despite having a much higher cultivation than the First Elder, it took less time for the Second Elder to succumb to the poison.","The Second Elder fell to his knees a moment later. However, despite his seemingly hopeless situation, he smiled and said, \"So you managed to kill my physical body, but as long as my soul is intact, I am not dead!\"","\"I know,\" Yuan said. \"I also know that I don't have the power to destroy your soul. However, I know someone who can.\"","\"Hahaha!\" the Second Elder laughed, even as pain twisted his features. \"If you're talking about the Clan Leader, not even he could destroy my soul! Don't underestimate a God Ascension Realm cultivator!\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes slightly, his tone calm and dismissive.","\"God Ascension?\" he sneered. \"I've killed more of them than I can count.\"","Yuan immediately put away Baneful Abyss and retrieved Number One Under Heaven.","\"Zi Xuan, I'll leave him to you.\"","\"What happened to using my energy on something worth it? He's hardly worth my energy,\" Zi Xuan said.","\"I know, but unfortunately, we cannot let him live.\"","Suddenly, Number One Under Heaven began to tremble, its entire form radiating an intense golden light. The brilliance grew blinding, until the light itself began to shift, condensing, reshaping.","Moments later, standing where the weapon once hovered was the beautiful figure of an adult woman. Her presence was regal and imposing, her voluptuous form wrapped in flowing black and golden robes that shimmered like starlight.","\"His sword transformed into a human...?\" Jiao Zhenhai watched the scene before him with a dumbfounded expression.","Zi Xuan examined her body for a moment before turning to look at Yuan with a dissatisfied face and said, \"I am able to take this form since you've improved your cultivation to Divine Emperor, but it's not good enough. I can barely last a few minutes right now, and that won't be anywhere near enough to satisfy me. I will need to be able to remain in this form for at least a month to have a proper 'session' with you.\"","\"A whole month? Please spare me...\" Yuan said with a stiff smile.","\"I refuse. This is non-negotiable, especially since you left me in that depressing place for so long.\"","The Second Elder stood frozen, his eyes locked on Zi Xuan as she casually chatted with Yuan, but not out of infatuation. It wasn't her devastating beauty that left him dazed, but the overwhelming, unfathomable aura radiating from her presence.","\"Anyway, let me take care of this trash first.\"","Zi Xuan slowly turned her gaze toward the Second Elder.","The moment her eyes met his, his body began to tremble uncontrollably.","The sheer weight of her presence, conveyed through nothing more than a casual glance, was enough to crush his will.","In that single moment, all hope drained from the Second Elder's eyes. He knew he wasn't facing a cultivator but something far beyond his comprehension.","\"How dare a lowly rat lay its filthy paws on my beloved?\"","Zi Xuan's voice rang out.","She took a single step toward the Second Elder, graceful yet absolute.","The moment her foot touched the ground, a ripple of overwhelming force erupted outward, infused with Supreme Sword Qi.","The entire dimension quaked in silent awe, as if bowing to the sheer majesty of Zi Xuan's presence.","All around them, the display cases that had remained undamaged even through the cataclysmic battle between Jiao Zhenhai and the Second Elder began to crack.","As Zi Xuan took her second step, every display case within the treasury dissolved into countless fragments impossible to see with the naked eye.","The Second Elder's body met the same fate. One moment he was there, and he was gone the next. No blood, no remains. Not even a speck of dust lingered. He had been erased, utterly and completely.","Yet, the Second Elder was still alive, as his soul still existed.","However, that wouldn't last long, lasting only until Zi Xuan took her third step.","Realizing that he was a goner, the Second Elder spoke to Jiao Zhenhai through voice transmission before he was erased from existence, \"Even if you kill me, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan is already on their way here. It'll only be a matter of time before the Azure Dragon Clan falls to them!'","After the Second Elder was reduced to nothingness, Zi Xuan turned on her heel and began walking toward Yuan. Her steps, though silent, carried a presence that made the very air part before her.","When she stood before him, her body glowing, she leaned in and gave him a passionate kiss with her soft lips.","\"I'm going to take a nap. Work hard to improve your cultivation so we can have more fun later,\" she said to him before returning to her sword form and going silent."]},{"number":1967,"title":"Chapter 1967: Consuming the Tear of the Azure Heavens","paragraphs":["After putting away Number One Under Heaven, Yuan turned to look at Jiao Zhenhai, who was sitting on the floor with a dazed look on his face, and said, \"I apologize for the destruction of this place.\"","Jiao Zhenhai looked around with a dumbfounded look on his face before responding, \"I-It's fine. As long as the treasures themselves aren't damaged.\"","\"Thank you. Now then, about what you were trying to tell me about our offer...\"","Jiao Zhenhai slowly stood up before speaking in a solemn tone, \"I am willing to give you the Tear of the Azure Heavens for the Immortal Monarch's blood, but I want one more thing from you.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Help me defend my Azure Dragon Clan,\" said Jiao Zhenhai with a serious frown on his face.","\"Defend the Azure Dragon Clan? What about you talking about?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow, unaware of what the Second Elder said to Jiao Zhenhai through voice transmission.","Jiao Zhenhai immediately explained the situation.","\"The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, whom the elders have been working with, are coming here as we speak. The Second Elder said this to me right before his death through voice transmission. Without the Three Elders, our chances of defeating the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan are slim to none. However, with you—and your sword's assistance—we might be able to win.\"","Yuan didn't immediately respond. Zi Xuan had expended most of her energy just now and would probably take several weeks, if not months, to fully recover. If the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan showed up before she recovered, it might get a bit dangerous.","Of course, he still had Dragon Goddess Yeyou, but he wasn't sure how much she could actually do in her current state.","After contemplating for some time, Yuan nodded and said, \"Alright, I'll help the Azure Dragon Clan. However, I will need the Tear of the Azure Heavens now. My sword is exhausted after killing the Second Elder and needs to recover.\"","Jiao Zhenhai nodded, \"Okay.\"","Some time later, Jiao Zhenhai handed the Tear of the Azure Heavens to Yuan.","\"I'm going to use this right now. You should alert the rest of your family.\"","\"I know this isn't the proper time to ask this, but... what does it do?\" Jiao Zhenhai couldn't contain his curiosity.","However, Yuan shrugged and responded in a genuine voice, \"I don't know.\"","\"What? Then why do you want it?\"","\"My instincts,\" he said.","\"...\"","Jiao Zhenhai fell silent.","After a moment, he asked, \"Are you going to do it here?\"","\"Preferably. Since nobody can disturb me here. Don't worry, I won't steal your treasures, if that's what you're worried about.\"","\"I trust you.\"","Without saying anything else, Jiao Zhenhai left the treasury and summoned everyone from the Azure Dragon Clan.","Meanwhile, Yuan sat on the floor with the Tear of the Azure Heavens in his grasp.","<Your Cold Resistance has improved significantly>","<Progress: 7%>","Yuan's cold resistance has been increasing since he touched the Tear of the Azure Heavens, which was a pleasant surprise.","\"Do any of you guys know what this is?\" Yuan asked the others.","\"No.\" Lan Yingying quickly responded.","\"I have also never seen or heard of this treasure before,\" said Yu Ning.","\"That is the heart of the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix,\" said Feng Yuxiang.","\"This is the heart of a phoenix?\" Yuan repeated, raising an eyebrow in surprise.","\"Yes,\" Feng Yuxiang confirmed. \"The Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix is a rare and powerful species whose flames don't burn, but freeze everything they touch. Their hearts contain immense yin energy and are considered priceless among yin-attribute cultivators.\"","\"Honestly, I'm surprised one managed to be preserved for this long,\" Feng Yuxiang remarked. \"The Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix has been extinct for ages, after all.\"","\"So, what kind of effect does it have?\" Yuan asked.","\"It's quite extraordinary,\" Feng Yuxiang explained. \"For cultivators, it grants the ability to cultivate and wield yin-attributed energy, even if they had no prior affinity for it. As for beasts, consuming it can transform their bloodline into one aligned with yin. And if they already possess a yin-attributed bloodline, it will elevate their lineage to an entirely new level.\"","\"No wonder the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan is trying to destroy the Azure Dragon Clan just so they can get their hands on this treasure,\" Yuan mumbled.","\"Anyway, I am going to consume this now.\"","Without a moment of hesitation, Yuan brought the heart of the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix to his lips and took a bite. Though it had the hardness of crystals, his teeth sank into it effortlessly, as if biting into a piece of delicate cake.","The moment it touched his tongue, the crystallized heart melted away like cotton candy, releasing an intense wave of chilling energy that spread through his body.","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix's Heart has been refined by Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique>","Suddenly, Yuan's entire body erupted in a blaze of azure-colored flames, radiating an intense cold so profound it felt as though he were being burned and frozen simultaneously.","The surrounding air trembled, and in the blink of an eye, the entire treasury was coated in a thick layer of glistening ice. Shelves, walls, even the very ground beneath him crystallized under the overwhelming yin energy now pouring from his body.","Yuan himself also turned into an ice statue.","As for his Cold Resistance, it improved at a frightening rate.","<Progress: 23%>","<Progress: 66%>","<Progress: 81%>","In just a few days, his progress skyrocketed to 99 percent.","Meanwhile, the Azure Dragon Clan began mobilizing for war against the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","With a population exceeding 100,000, including those residing in the city, their forces were vast. While not every member was suited for combat, the overwhelming majority had already reached at least the Divine Realm.","The city, once bustling like any ordinary settlement, transformed into a fortress overnight.","Barricades rose where markets once stood, defensive formations were activated across the seafloor, and patrols of armored warriors now roamed the area around the Azure Dragon Clan's territory."]},{"number":1968,"title":"Chapter 1968: Completed Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique","paragraphs":["\"Where's Senior Envoy?\" Jiao Xuanbing asked Jiao Zhenhai a month after they began preparing for war.","\"He's in seclusion.\"","\"Are you sure he'll even be of any help? He's only at the peak of Divine Emperor...\" Jiao Binglan said, expressing her doubts. \"And for the record, I still don't believe he managed to defeat the First Elder.\"","Jiao Zhenhai looked at his foolish daughter and said, \"I didn't mention this, but it was he who killed the Second Elder. If it weren't for him, I wouldn't be standing here right now.\"","\"What?! He killed the Second Elder, who is the strongest amongst the Three Elders?!\"","The others from the Azure Dragon Clan expressed shock and bewilderment after learning of this.","\"Binglan, you need to start respecting him, or you'll come to regret it later,\" Jiao Xuanbing said to her. \"Your hate is unreasonable in the first place. He didn't do anything to offend you, and he's helped our clan tremendously. If it weren't for him, the Three Elders would've continued to stab us in the back.\"","\"That's...\" Jiao Binglan fell silent.","Suddenly, someone rushed into the room and shouted, \"We've spotted the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan! They'll arrive in our territory in two weeks!\"","\"How many people do they have?\" Jiao Zhenhai questioned.","\"Around fifty thousand!\"","\"They only brought a fourth of their forces? These bastards are underestimating us a little too much!\" Jiao Zhenhai gritted his teeth in frustration.","Yet, he didn't dare to underestimate their opponents. The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan was a royal bloodline just like them, after all.","At the same time, Yuan had just finished absorbing the Tear of the Azure Heavens.","<Progress: 100%>","<Your Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has successfully merged with Cold Immunity>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique(Incomplete) has evolved to Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique(Completed)>","BOOM!","The moment Yuan completed his Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique, the bottleneck that kept him at the peak of Divine Emperor shattered, and his cultivation began soaring to the next level.","<You have reached First Level Divine Sovereign>","<You have reached Fifth Level Divine Sovereign>","<You have reached Ninth Level Divine Sovereign>","<You have reached First Level Divine Ancestor>","<...>","In the blink of an eye, Yuan's cultivation surged to the peak of the Divine Ancestor Realm, just a single step away from Immortal Ascension.","However, entering the Immortal Ascension Realm wasn't as simple as accumulating enough spiritual energy. A cultivator needed exceptional Soul Strength and, more importantly, profound insight into the nature of cultivation itself.","This was the barrier that trapped countless experts at the Divine Ancestor level.","Of course, Yuan was no ordinary cultivator. His Soul Strength already rivaled, if not surpassed, that of Immortals, and with the vast experience and insight he'd accumulated from his past lives, he only needed to attempt entering it... No, he could enter Immortal Ascension even in his sleep.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan began his attempt to break through to Immortal Ascension, the first step on his path toward true immortality.","Moments later, a surge of Immortal Qi erupted from Yuan's body, flooding the air with boundless pressure.","<You have successfully taken your first step towards true immortality, entering First Level Immortal Ascension>","To ascend to the next level, one must continually refine their Soul Strength and deepen their insights into the Dao. However, for someone like Yuan, it was merely a question of whether he chose to ascend.","Mere seconds after stepping into the first level of Immortal Ascension, another surge of Immortal Qi burst forth from Yuan's body as his cultivation soared into the second level.","<You have successfully entered Second Level Immortal Ascension>","From that moment on, Yuan advanced through each level as if it were mere child's play. In the blink of an eye, he reached the ninth level of Immortal Ascension—just one step away from becoming an Immortal. Yet that final step was unimaginably vast, a chasm where countless cultivators had faltered and fallen.","Of course, if Yuan wanted to take that step, he could easily do so. However, when he attempted to do so, he was met by a familiar barrier.","'So my physique still has room to grow, huh?' Yuan mused. 'Come to think of it, my Fire and Cold Immunities are only at the first stage, while my Poison and Lightning Immunities have already reached their peak.'","\"Congratulations on reaching the peak of Immortal Ascension, Young Master.\" Feng Yuxiang cheered loudly.","\"You're now only a step away from becoming a Bronze Immortal,\" said Lan Yingying.","\"I have never seen or heard anyone going from the first level to the peak in one sitting...\" Yu Ning muttered in a dazed voice.","\"It's not just my cultivation that benefited from the Tear of the Azure Heavens. I also acquired new abilities.\"","Yuan flipped his palms and summoned a blue flame.","\"That's the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix's unique flames, the Heaven-Freezing Flame!\" Feng Yuxiang exclaimed.","\"This is just one of the few abilities I acquired. I'll show you the rest later,\" Yuan said with a smile.","\"Anyway, how long have I been cultivating?\" he then asked.","\"A little over a month.\"","\"Since nobody disturbed me, I guess the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan has yet to arrive. Alright, let's go check out the situation.\"","Yuan left the treasury shortly after.","The moment Yuan exited the treasury, Jiao Zhenhai sensed it and immediately stopped everything he was doing to meet with Yuan.","\"Senior Envoy! Are you done with your seclusion?\" Jiao Zhenhai asked him.","Yuan nodded and said, \"Yes.\"","He released some of his cultivation.","\"Ninth Level Immortal Ascension?! Did you really reach that level from the peak of Divine Emperor in just a month?!\" Jiao Zhenhai cried out loud, not daring to believe his eyes.","\"It's mostly thanks to the Tear of the Azure Heavens.\"","\"W-What? Tear of the Azure Heavens...? What is he talking about, Father?\" Jiao Binglan inquired with a dazed look on her face.","Jiao Zhenhai, who kept their deal a secret this entire time, finally explained the full situation to everyone there."]},{"number":1969,"title":"Chapter 1969: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion","paragraphs":["\"WHAT?! YOU GAVE OUR FAMILY HEIRLOOM TO HIM?!\" Binglan exclaimed with a horrified expression after hearing Jiao Zhenhai's explanation.","It wasn't just Jiao Binglan. Jiao Xuanbing and the others were also just as shocked. None of them could've expected Jiao Zhenhai would be willing to part with their family heirloom.","\"I understand your feelings, but what use is our family heirloom if our clan is destroyed in the process of trying to protect it? Moreover, we will receive the Immortal Monarch's blood! This is a blessing none of you can even begin to fathom!\" Jiao Zhenhai said.","\"The Immortal Monarch's blood?\" Binglan and the others turned to look at Yuan with suspicious gazes.","Yuan smiled back and said, \"Thank you for letting me consume the Tear of the Azure Heavens. Here is the Immortal Monarch's blood, as promised.\"","Before coming out of the treasury, Yuan collected several drops of his blood and stored them in small glass vials.","He retrieved a wooden box and handed it over to Jiao Zhenhai, who accepted it with trembling hands.","Jiao Zhenhai wasted no time opening the box the moment it was in his grasp, and sure enough, there were six vials resting inside, just enough for him and his children.","\"The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan will arrive in two weeks. We need to absorb this to strengthen ourselves before then.\" Jiao Zhenhai handed a drop of the Immortal Monarch's blood to each of his children.","\"T-Thank you, Senior Envoy!\" Jiao Xuanbing bowed to him.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, you don't need to thank me. I didn't give it to you for free. It was an exchange.\"","Jiao Zhenhai and the others wasted no time and went to absorb the Immortal Monarch's blood.","Meanwhile, Yuan asked around about the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","\"Who are the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan?\" Yuan asked the first person he came across.","\"They've been long-time rivals of the Azure Dragon Clan since ancient times, as both possess the power to command the waters. However, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan has been adapting more ice-attribute techniques lately.\"","\"The Azure Dragon Clan and the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan have clashed many times before, but never with stakes this high. Until now, their conflicts were little more than skirmishes.\"","\"I see... What about the Clan Leader's wife? What about the rest of his family?\" Yuan then asked about the Azure Dragon Clan's situation.","\"The Mistress died trying to defeat the intruder who tried to take away our family heirloom many thousands of years ago. As for the others... while they're not dead, they all left the Azure Dragon Clan long ago to look for a cure for the curse. However, the Clan Leader should've already notified them of the situation, so they should be heading back here as we speak.\"","\"I see...\" Yuan mumbled.","Hearing that the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan has been learning ice-attribute techniques made it very clear why they wanted the Tear of the Azure Heavens—the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix's heart.","Unfortunately for them, Yuan had already absorbed the treasure for himself, so they were waging a pointless war against the Azure Dragon Clan.","This made Yuan wonder if the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan would back out once they learn about it.","A week later, Jiao Zhenhai and the others emerged from seclusion, having fully absorbed the Immortal Monarch's blood.","The first thing they did was test their bloodlines, and as expected, not only had their bloodline's purity been restored, it had even surpassed its former peak, and everyone except Xuanbing still had poison in their body. As for Xuanbing, who wasn't affected by the poison, his bloodline had become the purest and most powerful in the clan's history, by a wide margin.","Seeing Xuanbing's results gave immense hope and joy to the others, who were eager to have their poison cleansed by Yuan.","\"Senior Envoy! Please take care of us after we deal with the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan!\" A young man approached Yuan and bowed to him.","Yuan silently nodded.","\"To be honest, I was skeptical about the Immortal Monarch's blood being real until I absorbed it,\" Jiao Zhenhai admitted with a stiff smile on his face. \"But now, I am really glad I accepted your offer.\"","\"Pleasure doing business with you,\" Yuan smiled.","The following day, something else happened that greatly boosted the Azure Dragon Clan's spirit and morale—reinforcement had arrived.","\"Father! Grandfather and Grandmother have returned!\" Jiao Binglan exclaimed as she hurried to his side.","\"Truly?!\" Jiao Zhenhai gasped. Before he could take a single step, two figures appeared before him—a middle-aged man and woman, both bearing the unmistakable traits of the Azure Dragon Clan.","\"Father! Mother! You made it back in time!\" Jiao Zhenhai hurried to greet them.","Although their reinforcement was only two individuals, they were both powerhouses at the God Ascension realm, and Jiao Zhenhai's parents.","\"We rushed back immediately after receiving your emergency contact. What is the situation right now?\" asked the middle-aged man.","\"The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan will arrive in less than a week,\" said Jiao Zhenhai. \"Allow me to keep you up to date for now.\"","Over the next several hours, Jiao Zhenhai recounted everything to his parents—from their fateful encounter with Yuan to how he had resolved their crisis. He made no attempt to conceal the fact that he had traded away their family heirloom in exchange for Yuan's help and the Immortal Monarch's blood.","By the time he finished, both of his parents were trembling—not from rage at the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, nor from the loss of the heirloom, but for an entirely different reason.","\"You little brat! How dare you only ask for enough Immortal Monarch's blood for your children and yourself?! What about us, your own parents?! Have you already forgotten about us in such a short time?!\" His father stood up and roared angrily.","His mother expressed similar complaints.","In other words, they were angry about being left out of a once-in-a-lifetime experience."]},{"number":1970,"title":"Chapter 1970: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion(2)","paragraphs":["When Jiao Zhenhai felt his parents' pressure bearing down on him, he quickly said, \"W-Wait! He was the one who initiated the offer! Six drops of the Immortal Monarch's blood are already a lot! If I asked for more, he would've likely refused!\"","His parents sat back down and withdrew their pressure after hearing this.","\"Do you think he'll be willing to give two more drops of the Immortal Monarch's blood—if he even has them, that is.\"","\"Why are you asking me? You should ask him instead,\" Jiao Zhenhai shrugged.","His parents immediately stood back up and began beating him.","Sometime later, Jiao Zhenhai brought his parents to Yuan.","\"Senior Envoy, do you have some time? My parents would like to speak with you.\"","\"Your parents?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow as his gaze met the two individuals standing behind Jiao Zhenhai.","\"My name is Jiao Longfei, his father.\" Jiao Longfei said as he grabbed Jiao Zhenhai's clothes and yanked him far away.","\"I'm Jiao Xuanji, his mother. If you don't mind, we'd like to have a brief conversation with you.\"","Yuan had already guessed their intentions and greeted them with a calm smile. \"You're here to ask about the Immortal Monarch's blood, aren't you?\"","The couple was stunned by his directness, caught off guard, and left momentarily speechless.","\"W-While that is part of the conversation, we mainly wanted to thank you for helping our family...\" Jiao Longfei responded in a stiff tone.","Yuan then said, \"Unfortunately, my transaction with the Clan Leader has already ended, and I am only helping the Azure Dragon Clan because you have something that I need.\"","\"That's...\"","Just as Jiao Xuanji opened her mouth, Yuan interrupted, \"However, that doesn't mean I cannot make a new transaction with you two. If you want the Immortal Monarch's blood, I still have some left.\"","\"Really?! What do you want for them?!\" Jiao Xuanji exclaimed, her voice full of excitement.","\"One—No, we'll give you two treasures from our treasury for each drop!\" Jiao Longfei said as he raised two fingers before him.","Yuan responded by showing three fingers.","\"Make it three and you'll have a deal, so six treasures in total.\"","\"D-Deal!\" Although Jiao Xuanji hesitated for a split second, he quickly made up his mind and agreed to Yuan's offer.","\"Thank you. Here you go.\"","Yuan immediately retrieved two vials and handed each of them one.","\"Since the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan will be invading soon, I'll give these to you ahead of time.\"","\"You won't regret it!\"","The couple immediately left to absorb the blood.","Three days later, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan arrived earlier than expected, before Jiao Zhenhai's parents could finish absorbing the blood.","However, since they have already started absorbing the blood, they couldn't be disturbed, so the Azure Dragon Clan had to deal with the invasion without them for now.","Meanwhile, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan came to a halt just outside the Azure Dragon Clan's underwater city, their 50,000-strong army standing tall, exuding unwavering confidence.","Amidst the sea of soldiers, a lone figure with a familiar face stepped forward and spoke in a voice so powerful it echoed through the city, reaching even the depths of the Azure Dragon Clan's living quarters.","\"Azure Dragon Clan, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan will grant you twenty-four hours to hand over the Tear of the Azure Heavens! If you do not meet our demand within the time limit, don't blame us for whatever happens afterward!\"","\"T-That's the Third Elder! So the rumors calling him a traitor were true!\"","The people of the Azure Dragon Clan were greatly shocked to see the Third Elder standing with the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","Jiao Zhenhai appeared before them and sneered coldly, \"So you'll turn around and leave if we give you the Tear of the Azure Heavens?\"","The Third Elder laughed out loud before responding, \"Of course not. If you hand over the treasure, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan will spare your lives. However, you'll have to come under our clan's name as servants!\"","\"The Azure Dragon Clan as servants? In your damn dreams!\"","Suddenly, Yuan appeared beside Jiao Zhenhai and scanned the place with a composed expression.","\"Where's the First Elder? Did he still end up dying even after you saved him?\" Yuan asked calmly.","In the very next instant, a surge of overwhelming bloodlust swept through the area as a new figure suddenly appeared.","Yuan shifted his attention to this newcomer—a handsome young man he didn't recognize.","The handsome young man then roared, \"I only lost that time because I had underestimated you and didn't use my full strength to avoid being exposed! It will not happen again! This time, I swear I will shred you to pieces!\"","\"Oh? You managed to get a new body in such short time? I'm impressed,\" Yuan said with a faint smile.","Sure enough, the striking young man before him was none other than the First Elder, who had transferred his soul into this new vessel after Yuan's poison had destroyed his original body.","However, having transferred his soul to a new body in haste, the First Elder suffered a severe backlash, and his cultivation plummeted by two full levels, diminishing him to a mere True Immortal.","\"Whether the Azure Dragon Clan hands over the treasure or not, you're dead meat, human!\"","Jiao Zhenhai then stepped forward and asked, \"Where are the rest of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan? I highly doubt they'd entrust such a massive army to you and let you come here alone.\"","The Third Elder smiled and said, \"Wouldn't you like to know? Unfortunately, I cannot tell you.\"","Jiao Zhenhai and the others frowned, feeling uneasy about the whole situation.","'What if there are more of them than the 50,000 in front of us right now?' They all considered this possibility.","After a moment of silence, Jiao Zhenhai spoke, \"Is that so? Well, I have some unfortunate news for you, too. The Tear of the Azure Heavens you bastards so desperately want is no longer in our hands. We gave it away.\"","\"YOU WHAT?!\" The First Elder and the Third Elder shouted simultaneously, their eyes growing as wide as saucers."]},{"number":1971,"title":"Chapter 1971: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion(3)","paragraphs":["\"Y-You're lying! There's no way the Azure Dragon Clan gave away its family heirloom!\" The Third Elder pointed his trembling hand at them and shouted, his voice filled with doubt and disbelief.","\"Who do you think you're fooling, Jiao Zhenhai?! We know you better than anyone here! You wouldn't dare to part with that treasure even at your deathbed!\" The First Elder laughed out loud, not believing it for a second.","Jiao Zhenhai sneered and said, \"You don't have to believe me, but you'll end up fighting a pointless war at this rate.\"","\"Pointless? Do you really think the Tear of the Azure Heavens is the only reason we're here?\" The Third Elder shook his head.","\"The Azure Dragon Clan and the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan have been at odds with each other since ancient times. Don't you think it's finally time to end it once and for all?\" The First Elder said.","\"Don't you both possess royal bloodlines? Wouldn't it cause serious complications if the two of you were to clash?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"What would you know, human? Just because we have royal bloodlines doesn't mean we're allies. If anything, it only fuels our rivalry!\" the First Elder retorted coldly.","'What should we do?' Jiao Zhenhai suddenly spoke to Yuan using voice transmission.","'It's obvious they won't back down even though we no longer have the Tear of the Azure Heavens. Should we just wait out the 24-hour limit and see what happens? This also gives my parents time to absorb the Immortal Monarch's blood.'","Yuan responded, 'While waiting may seem like the right thing to do, I have a feeling there are more of them than it appears. It's also suspicious that nobody from the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan is present. They might be planning an ambush separately. If that were the case, we should deal with those present before they can arrive.'","Jiao Zhenhai fell silent, reflecting on Yuan's words. It was definitely suspicious that the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan had only committed a fraction of their forces to what was supposed to be all-out war, and not a single true member of their clan was present. The more he thought about it, the stronger his unease grew.","'Since war is unavoidable, we need to make the first move and cripple their current forces before their reinforcements arrive!'","Having made his decision, Jiao Zhenhai summoned his weapon—a majestic blue and gold trident—leveled it at the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's army, and roared with thunderous fury, \"KILL THEM ALL!\"","\"What?!\"","The First Elder and Third Elder were stunned by Jiao Zhenhai's sudden declaration, their expressions frozen in disbelief. Behind them, the army stirred with visible confusion and hesitation. None had expected the Azure Dragon Clan to launch the first strike.","In the very next moment, nearly 80,000 experts surged out from the city like a tidal wave, swiftly encircling the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","\"The negotiation has ended! Kill everyone!\" The Third Elder roared.","And so, the Azure Dragon Clan and the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan finally clashed.","The battlefield roared with chaos as countless Divine Realm cultivators exchanged blows, shaking the depths of the sea. Among them, the Azure Dragon Clan fielded nearly 2,000 Immortals, outnumbering the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, who had barely half that number at their command.","Jiao Zhenhai lunged toward the Third Elder with unwavering resolve, while the First Elder, eyes burning with fury, pursued Yuan.","\"If you couldn't defeat me while you're at the God Ascension realm, what makes you think you'll be able to defeat me as a True Immortal?!\" Yuan remarked as he deflected the First Elder's first strike.","\"Don't you dare underestimate me! My cultivation may have lowered, but I can still use Celestial Qi!\" The First Elder roared as he unleashed his Celestial Qi.","Although it wasn't as strong as before, it was still enough to pressure Yuan, who'd increased his cultivation to the peak of Immortal Ascension.","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi has increased slightly>","With Number One Under Heaven in his grasp, Yuan fought the First Elder while constantly being suppressed by Celestial Qi. Despite the vast disparity in their cultivation, Yuan wasn't being pushed back.","'Wait a second! His cultivation is at the peak of Immortal Ascension! But it was only at the peak of Divine Emperor when I last saw him a few months ago!' The First Elder realized this amidst their fight, which shook him to the core.","'No! It's impossible that his cultivation increased that much in such a short time! This must've been his real cultivation since the very beginning!'","Even if Yuan had told him the truth, the First Elder still wouldn't believe it.","\"Hey, I've been wondering... Aren't you curious about the Second Elder's situation?\"","\"What?\" The First Elder frowned.","\"The two of you left him behind, after all.\"","\"I have no idea what you're talking about. The Second Elder has nothing to do with the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan!\"","Yuan chuckled at the First Elder's attempt to mislead him.","\"There's no point trying to play dumb. Didn't you find it weird that the Second Elder isn't present at such an important event? He's already exposed himself. As a matter of fact, he's already dead.\"","\"What?!\" The First Elder suddenly stopped fighting and backed away.","\"Impossible! The Second Elder's strength rivals even Jiao Zhenhai!\"","\"It's true. Do you want to know who killed him?\"","Yuan pointed at himself and revealed with a cold grin on his face, \"The Second Elder died to my sword.\"","\"Hahaha! You killed the Second Elder?! That's your biggest bullshit yet!\"","Yuan shook his head and elaborated, \"No, I didn't say that I killed him. I said my sword killed him.\"","\"What's the damn difference?!\"","\"I'd love to show you, but unfortunately, my sword is still asleep. Instead, why don't I show you something else?\"","Yuan stowed away Number One Under Heaven and faced the First Elder without any weapons.","\"What trick do you have up your sleeves now?\"","The First Elder immediately increased his guard, as he had already experienced Yuan's trickery several times."]},{"number":1972,"title":"Chapter 1972: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion(4)","paragraphs":["\"A trick, huh? Well, I guess it may seem like that to you.\"","After putting away his weapon, Yuan slowly approached the First Elder.","Seeing this, the First Elder hastily distanced himself from Yuan.","A profound light flickered within Yuan's eyes, and he spoke in a low but commanding tone, \"Halt.\"","\"?!?!\"","The First Elder was greatly shocked when his body suddenly stopped listening to his commands and halted all movements.","\"Get on your knees.\"","As if Yuan's words held dominion over his very soul, the First Elder dropped to his knees and knelt before him.","\"W-What is going on?! What did you—\"","\"Shut up. You will only speak when given permission.\"","\"??????\"","The First Elder tried to speak, but not a single word escaped. His lips felt as heavy as a mountain, and even the act of opening his mouth was beyond him.","He frantically darted his gaze across the battlefield, desperate to see if anyone was witnessing this humiliation. But in the midst of the blood-soaked chaos, where every cultivator fought for their life, not a single soul noticed the silent, one-sided submission playing out between Yuan and the First Elder.","'What the hell is going on?! Why isn't my body listening to me?! Did he poison me again?! But when did he do it and how?!' The First Elder believed he was poisoned again, but he'd never experienced or heard of such a powerful poison.","\"What's on your mind? Let me guess... Are you thinking that I'd poisoned you again?\" Yuan suddenly spoke.","The First Elder's eyes widened with surprise at Yuan's words.","\"So I'm right, huh? Well, fortunately for you, I didn't poison you.\"","The surprise on the First Elder's face turned to puzzlement after hearing this. If he wasn't poisoned, what could be the cause of this phenomenon?","\"Since you're going to die soon, I'll let you in on a secret.\"","Yuan moved his lips near the First Elder's ears but spoke through voice transmission just in case, \"I was lying when I said that I was Dragon Goddess Yeyou's envoy. In reality, I am the Immortal Monarch.\"","\"?!?!?!\"","The First Elder's eyes nearly popped out of their sockets from shock.","'The Immortal Monarch?! What kind of nonsense is he talking about?!'","However, as much as he wanted to deny it, it would explain why he was obeying Yuan's every command.","\"Now... die for me.\"","Yuan wasted no time and commanded the First Elder to die.","The First Elder coughed up a mouthful of blood as he subconsciously destroyed his own heart.","However, although the First Elder's physical body died, his soul was still alive, and while his cultivation had dropped to the True Immortal realm, his soul was still at the God Ascension level.","Yuan knew he couldn't kill the First Elder so easily—nor did he care to try. Instead, he calmly retrieved Dragon God's Vengeance and, with a flick of his sleeves, forcefully cast the First Elder's soul into the weapon, leaving his fate to Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","The moment the soul was sealed within, Dragon God's Vengeance trembled violently, as though roaring in fury, echoing the wrath of the goddess within.","'I'll probably have an earful later...' Yuan swallowed nervously.","The trembling stopped a few moments later, and since the First Elder's soul hadn't been ejected from the weapon, it was clear what Dragon Goddess Yeyou did to him.","This made Yuan wonder if feeding the souls of powerhouses to Dragon Goddess Yeyou would help speed up her recovery.","'Let's think about this later.'","Yuan shifted his gaze to the rest of the battlefield, where thousands of mutilated corpses lay scattered amidst bloodstained waters, most of them belonging to the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","He thought about using the Immortal Monarch's powers to assist the Azure Dragon Clan, but it'd require a tremendous amount of energy to command so many powerful beings, and there was still the possibility of enemy reinforcements.","In the end, Yuan decided to just use his own strength for the time being.","With the Dragon God's Vengeance in his grasp, Yuan began attacking every single enemy fighter in sight, targeting mostly those within the Divine Realm since they were the easiest targets and were the most abundant.","After being targeted by Yuan, the poor Divine Realm experts stood no chance as all of them were killed within a single strike.","<Dragon God's Vengeance has increased in strength after consuming the lifeforce of a dragon>","As the number of Yuan's victims increased, so did the strength of his weapon through its second unique ability.","Not only that, but he was slowly progressing his unique quest that required 100,000,000 kills. Unfortunately, he was still very far away from completing it.","After slaughtering thousands of Divine Realm experts from the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's side, Yuan's presence could no longer be ignored, and he had finally drawn the gaze of the Immortal Realm cultivators.","However, the Immortals were far too prideful to lower themselves by engaging a mere Immortal Ascension realm human, one who had yet to even set foot into true immortality.","Thus, those who were also in the Immortal Ascension realm began attacking Yuan.","\"Why don't you pick on someone that's on the same level as you instead of picking on the weak?!\"","A peak Immortal Ascension shouted as he pounced at Yuan.","Yuan gave the Immortal Ascension expert a glance before using Shadow Veil, instantly disappearing from his opponent's view.","\"What?! Where did he—\"","Before the man could even finish his sentence, Yuan had already arrived behind him like a shadow to land a critical strike.","\"Impossible...\"","The man muttered his last words as Yuan brutally yanked the Dragon God's Vengeance from his corpse and watched as it slowly sank to the ocean floor.","\"If you want to stop me, you'd better come at me with everything you've got!\" Yuan laughed out loud as he continued slaughtering the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's army.","\"S-Somebody stop him!!!\"","\"Ahhh!\"","The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's army quickly descended into chaos, their formation crumbling under the weight of fear and confusion."]},{"number":1973,"title":"Chapter 1973: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion(5)","paragraphs":["Noticing how fast their army was falling apart, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's Immortals could no longer sit still and went after Yuan.","\"About time I have some worthy opponents!\" Yuan laughed as he confronted a Bronze Immortal, and their Immortal Qi clashed.","'What?! I'm being pushed back?!'","The Bronze Immortal was utterly stunned that he was being forced back by someone still in the Immortal Ascension Realm, a human cultivator who hadn't even truly stepped into immortality.","\"How is his Immortal Qi so powerful?! He's not even an Immortal yet!\"","The other Immortals were equally shaken by the sheer intensity of Yuan's Immortal Qi, and the True Immortals there wore grim expressions, unable to hide their disbelief. Yuan's Immortal Qi rivaled their own, despite still being in Immortal Ascension, while they stood at the very peak of the Immortal Realm, on the verge of stepping into God Ascension.","In the cultivation world, one only attains true immortality after transcending the Immortal Ascension Realm and stepping into the ranks of Bronze Immortals.","Though the Immortal Realm consists of only four distinct stages—Bronze, Silver, Golden, and True Immortal—the gap between each is vast, often requiring as much time and cultivation as ascending through all nine levels of Immortal Ascension. Yet Yuan, a mere cultivator still within Immortal Ascension, had already surpassed even the True Immortals.","What would happen if Yuan were to become a Bronze Immortal, let alone a True Immortal? How terrifying would his power become then? No one present could begin to fathom it—not even the God Ascension cultivators, who already stood beyond immortality.","'We must kill that human now or he'll become a huge threat to the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan and our plans!'","The Immortals quickly exchanged voice transmissions in secret, and after a brief but heavy silence, reached a unanimous decision—to strike at Yuan together, even if it meant staining their pride and shattering their reputation.","Suddenly, the battlefield shifted dramatically. Without warning, hundreds of Immortals, even those already locked in fierce combat, abandoned their fights and turned their focus toward a single target: Yuan.","\"Senior Envoy! Watch out! They're all targeting you!\"","Members of the Azure Dragon Clan hurriedly shouted warnings to Yuan as they pursued the forces of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan going after him.","\"Oh?\"","Despite the looming threat, Yuan showed not the slightest trace of panic. In fact, a faint smile tugged at his lips.","\"To think so many mighty Immortals would band together against a mere mortal like me... I'm truly honored.\"","\"To show my gratitude,\" Yuan said calmly, his smile widening, \"allow me to face you all with my full strength.\"","\"What?!\" The Bronze Immortal fighting Yuan was shocked to hear he wasn't even fighting at his full potential.","As the Immortals closed in, a profound, chaotic, and overwhelming aura erupted from Yuan's body like a volcanic explosion, shaking the battlefield and halting even the boldest in their tracks.","\"What is that ominous energy?! It's making my soul tremble!\"","The Immortals cried out in alarm, their faces twisted with confusion and unease as they encountered Chaos Energy for the first time—its presence utterly foreign, yet instinctively terrifying.","Although Yuan's main cultivation had already surpassed that of his Chaotic Heart, he intended to use it solely to enhance his own physique. And with the unparalleled destructive force of Chaos Energy, his combat prowess rose to an unfathomable degree while his cultivation remained the same.","\"Why did you all stop?! If you won't come to me, then I'll come to you!\" Yuan laughed, his voice echoing with battlelust as he lunged toward the Bronze Immortal before him, his speed and power now magnified many times over.","Overwhelmed by Yuan's chaotic aura, the Bronze Immortal instinctively took a step back. But the moment he turned to retreat, Yuan's eyes blazed with radiant gold.","\"Where do you think you're going?!\" Yuan roared, unleashing Dragon's Gaze at full power, his voice thundering like the heavens themselves.","The Bronze Immortal instantly froze in place, his soul gripped by an overwhelming pressure that crashed down like a divine hammer.","In the very next moment, without Yuan lifting a finger, the Bronze Immortal coughed up a mouthful of blood and collapsed—his soul shattered under the weight of Dragon's Gaze.","After all the power he had gained within the Primal Expanse, especially with his dragon powers, Yuan's Dragon's Gaze had evolved to a terrifying degree. It was potent enough to shatter souls outright, especially when unleashed at full intensity.","\"D-Did he just use Dragon's Gaze?! Why does he know that technique?! I thought he was human!\"","Even though they weren't directly targeted, Yuan's Dragon's Gaze was so powerful that it sent tremors through the souls of everyone nearby, leaving them shaken to their core.","\"Not just Dragon's Gaze—he can use Dragon Awakening too! He's definitely a dragon!\"","\"We were fooled into underestimating him!\"","Snapping out of their daze, the Immortals steeled themselves and renewed their assault, launching a coordinated attack against Yuan with grim determination.","Not daring to get too close to Yuan because of his Dragon's Gaze, the Immortals attacked him from afar.","Hundreds of martial techniques rained down on Yuan all at once, yet he made no effort to dodge or defend. He simply continued to charge forward, letting the attacks crash against his body without the slightest concern.","The combined assaults from the Bronze and Silver Immortals couldn't even leave a scratch on Yuan's body, while strikes from the Golden Immortals merely allowed him to feel the sting of real pain. As for the True Immortals, their attacks were powerful enough to tear through his defense and draw blood, yet he regenerated any damage received instantly, recovering in full before the Immortals could even blink their eyes in astonishment.","\"What the fuck kind of physique does he have?!\"","The Immortals were in utter disbelief, their eyes wide with shock as they witnessed the futility of their combined assault.","Meanwhile, every time Yuan struck with Dragon God's Vengeance, it would claim a life without fail.","\"I-It must be a trick! Don't let him deceive you! Keep attacking!\"","The Immortals resumed their assault, their faces with deep, growing despair."]},{"number":1974,"title":"Chapter 1974: The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Invasion(6)","paragraphs":["As the Immortals relentlessly unleashed their martial techniques on Yuan, he continued to ignore their attacks and struck whoever was the closest to him, reducing their numbers with terrifying speed and indifference, almost as if the difference in their cultivation meant nothing in his eyes.","As time passed, Yuan's prowess only continued to increase as the Dragon God's Vengeance claimed more victims with a dragon bloodline.","\"Fuck! Why aren't our attacks working on him?!\"","\"Where did this monster come from?!\"","\"S-Scatter! Get away from him!\"","\"I can't! He's too fast—Ahh!\"","\"Damn it! How is he disappearing before our eyes, even escaping detection from our divine sense?! This doesn't make any sense!\"","Though it appeared that Yuan was merely chasing them down, he was, in truth, weaving Shadow Veil into every movement, distorting their perception and turning the battlefield into a nightmare of illusion and dread.","In the enemies' eyes, Yuan was teleporting all over the place while leaving behind clones of himself. Of course, these clones were mere illusions created using shadows with his Shadow Puppet technique.","Moreover, the Azure Dragon Clan arrived in force to support Yuan, launching a coordinated assault that both distracted the enemy and sealed off their escape route.","Witnessing their forces being decimated and thrown into disarray by a single individual, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan's God Ascension realm powerhouses could no longer stand by. They finally moved, intent on stopping Yuan themselves.","The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan initially showed up with four God Ascension realm powerhouses, but with the First Elder gone and the Third Elder occupied with Jiao Zhenhai, only two of them were available to deal with Yuan.","Meanwhile, the Azure Dragon Clan originally had seven God Ascension realm powerhouses, but with the Three Elders' betrayal, they were down to four: Jiao Zhenhai, his parents, and the commander of the Azure Dragon Clan's army.","The moment the commander of the Azure Dragon Clan's army sensed the movements of the two God Ascension realm powerhouses, he rushed to intercept, but he was only able to hold off one, leaving the other free to advance toward Yuan.","Because of their immense power and overwhelming influence, an unspoken rule existed in the cultivation world: God Ascension realm cultivators should not interfere in large-scale battles like the ongoing war between the Azure Dragon Clan and the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan unless they were the only ones standing or the situation had reached a critical point and left them no other choice.","Of course, since this was merely an unspoken rule and not a real law, it couldn't be enforced, and there were always those who disregarded it entirely, acting as they pleased even if it damaged their reputation, just like the First Elder and the Third Elder.","Once the God Ascension realm cultivator entered the fray, Yuan was forced to halt his slaughter and turn his full attention to the approaching threat.","His opponent stood at the second level of God Ascension, the same as the First Elder. Yet, he radiated a pressure and presence that made him seem incomparably more formidable, as though they existed on entirely different tiers.","Once a cultivator stepped into the God Ascension Realm, advancing even a single level could take thousands—if not millions—of years. Because of this, it was common for cultivators in their realm to be at the same level yet differ vastly in strength, comprehension, and abilities.","The First Elder had only recently stepped into the second level of the God Ascension Realm, and as a result, his strength fell far short of its true potential. In contrast, Yuan's current opponent had long since stabilized at that level, and from the aura he exuded, he seemed to be on the verge of breaking through to the third.","\"I don't know how you killed the First Elder, but you won't get to experience such a miracle for a second time,\" said the man.","\"We'll see about that.\"","Yuan suddenly used Dragon's Gaze without warning.","\"...\"","Despite being hit by Yuan's Dragon's Gaze at full force, his opponent didn't so much as flinch, as if the technique had no effect on him whatsoever.","\"It's very impressive that you've reached that level with your cultivation. However, before a real powerhouse, it's nothing but cheap tricks,\" said the man.","\"I can see that you're a little stronger than that traitor, but so what?\" Yuan spoke with a calm smile. \"In the end, you'll still end up like him.\"","\"When threatened, dogs bark in fear, which is exactly what you're doing. You can't even break through my Celestial Qi, much less touch a single hair on my body.\"","Yuan didn't need to verify the man's words to know they were true. At his current level, he stood no chance against him in a fair fight. The only reason he had managed to defeat the Second Elder, who was at the fifth level of God Ascension, was because he had caught him off guard and poisoned him. Even then, he would not have been able to kill the Second Elder without Zi Xuan's assistance.","As for his current opponent, he was very wary of Yuan and also had no openings with his entire body covered in Celestial Qi.","\"You're right.\" Yuan suddenly spoke. \"I do not have the capability to defeat you right now. However, I can definitely humiliate you.\"","\"What?\" The man frowned.","\"Put away your Celestial Qi.\"","Despite having his guard up, the man could not have anticipated Yuan using the Immortal Monarch's ability.","\"What is this?!\"","The man was bewildered when his body listened to Yuan and began withdrawing his Celestial Qi. He hastily tried to resist the command, succeeded, and managed to stop himself from removing all of his Celestial Qi. However, he'd already removed some of his Celestial Qi by then, giving Yuan enough time to strike once.","\"Don't move.\"","Yuan struck using the Dragon God's Vengeance with all of his might, driving it directly into the man's chest.","The man hastily retreated, but it was too late. By the time he managed to pull away, a gaping hole had already been torn through the center of his chest.","\"Hm? What's this? Not only did I manage to penetrate your Celestial Qi, but I even managed to put a hole in your chest!\" Yuan acted surprised, even letting out a cheeky chuckle as the man stared at the hole in silence."]},{"number":1975,"title":"Chapter 1975: Wielding Celestial Qi","paragraphs":["\"H-Ho-How dare you... a mere mortal... MOCK ME?!\"","The God Ascension expert trembled in anger as he felt a sense of humiliation he hasn’t experienced for a long, long time.","In his eyes, it was akin to an elephant being crippled by a single ant whom he could easily crush with a finger.","\"I’ll fucking skin you alive!\"","The man suddenly released a beastly roar as he abandoned his human form and grew into a massive whale that could cover the entire underwater city.","When a beast reverts to its original form, its overall strength would rise exponentially but at the cost of greatly reduced mobility, a trait many regarded as the most critical advantage in battle. For this reason, most chose to remain in their human form, even in the face of death.","However, the God Ascension expert wasn’t worried about losing his mobility since his opponent couldn’t penetrate his defenses without trickery.","\"I don’t know what trickery you used just now, but it will not work a second time!\"","Even as he stood before a colossal entity capable of swallowing an entire city with a single breath, Yuan’s expression remained unchanged with a calm smile on his face.","In the very next moment, the whale unleashed a barrage of Celestial Qi, shaped into countless thin needles, but in reality, each \"needle\" was massive, towering like skyscrapers as they rained down toward Yuan with devastating force.","Though consumed by rage, the whale had not lost his reason and remained aware of his comrades battling nearby. As such, he restrained his power, opting for these compressed, controlled attacks to avoid causing collateral damage amidst the chaos.","As for Yuan, since there was nothing he could realistically do to the Celestial Qi, he was forced to dodge the incoming strikes.","However, he purposefully didn’t completely avoid them and would allow the Celestial Qi to land on some parts of his body so he could train his comprehension.","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi has improved slightly>","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi has improved slightly>","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi has improved slightly>","\"Looks like you’re having trouble. Need some assistance?\" Yu Ning suddenly asked.","\"What do you have in mind? Unless I can get through his Celestial Qi, it won’t matter.\"","\"Only Celestial Qi can cut through Celestial Qi. Although my cultivation has dropped to Golden Immortal, I can still sense and manipulate Celestial Qi to a certain extent,\" she said.","\"Though I have never tried this before, I can theoretically help you gather Celestial Qi through your Dantian, allowing you limited use. It’s a very reckless thing to do, and I wouldn’t have even brought this up if I weren’t in your Dantian, or I think your body couldn’t handle Celestial Qi. However, it’s clear that your body is beyond common sense.\"","An excited smile appeared on Yuan’s face after hearing Yu Ning’s suggestion.","\"Let’s try it!\" He quickly said without an ounce of hesitation in his voice.","\"Okay. Give me a moment.\"","A few seconds later, Yu Ning said, \"I’m gathering Celestial Qi now.\"","Yu Ning began collecting Celestial Qi while using Yuan’s Dantian as its storage.","The very next moment, Yuan coughed up a mouthful of blood as searing pain tore through his body, feeling as if every inch of him was swelling beyond control, on the verge of bursting apart from within.","Upon witnessing this, Yu Ning was overwhelmed with fear and immediately ceased her actions, unable to bring herself to continue.","\"Keep going!\"","Yuan suddenly said.","\"B-But...\"","\"It’s only a little painful. I can handle it.\"","Despite her reluctance, Yu Ning began gathering Celestial Qi again, albeit slowly.","\"What is he...?\" The whale stopped attacking Yuan when he noticed Celestial Qi was being gathered around him.","\"No! It can’t be!\"","His voice shook when he realized what was happening.","\"He’s a mortal! Mortals cannot wield Celestial Qi! It shouldn’t be possible!\"","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi increased drastically>","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi increased drastically>","<Your understanding of Celestial Qi increased drastically>","It took some time, but Yuan eventually adapted to the Celestial Qi coursing through his body and managed to move again. Of course, the pain remained intense, but it was now bearable.","\"Ah... It’s been a while since I last felt like this...\"","In this moment, the Celestial Qi surging through Yuan made him feel nearly invincible—a sensation reminiscent of when he wielded Heaven’s Supremacy, as though nothing in the world could stand in his way.","\"You... you... WHAT THE FUCK ARE YOU?!?!?!\" The whale roared in confusion and fear as he continued bombarding Yuan with Celestial Qi.","Now that he could wield Celestial Qi, Yuan no longer avoided it. Instead, he met it head-on, clashing with it directly and without hesitation.","With the Dragon God’s Vengeance cloaked in Celestial Qi, Yuan bore through his opponent’s Celestial Qi with almost no effort.","Yu Ning swallowed nervously as she watched how skillfully Yuan wielded the Celestial Qi like it was part of his own body.","’Even though he may have wielded Celestial Qi in his previous lives, to do so in a mortal’s body is really something else...’","Yu Ning had already regarded Yuan as a monster of boundless potential, but what he was doing now defied even her wildest expectations, leaving her utterly stunned.","\"What’s wrong?! Not so confident in your Celestial Qi now, are you?!\" Yuan laughed maniacally as he shot toward the whale that loomed above like a mountain.","The sight of Yuan wielding Celestial Qi was so utterly shocking that even those locked in fierce combat froze in place, their eyes fixed on him in disbelief, needing a moment to confirm that what they were witnessing wasn’t some illusion.","\"H-He’s wielding Celestial Qi with the body of a mortal?!\" Jiao Binglan and the others from the Azure Dragon Clan were utterly speechless.","\"S-Stay away from me, you monster!\"","The whale suddenly returned to his human form and began running away in a panic.","\"How dare you run after starting this fight yourself?! Get back here, you damn coward!\" Yuan shouted as he chased after him."]},{"number":1976,"title":"Chapter 1976: Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s Reinforcement","paragraphs":["As the God Ascension expert turned to flee, Yuan immediately gave chase. However, being underwater—and with his opponent a native sea beast—Yuan quickly found himself outpaced, the distance between them widening with every passing second.","Unable to close the distance, Yuan resorted to mockery, hurling taunts laced with scorn in hopes of provoking his opponent into a reckless, rage-fueled mistake.","\"You dare call yourself a God when you’re running away from a mortal like a frightened cat?!\"","\"Your comrades are still fighting for their lives while you abandoned the battlefield! Are you not ashamed of yourself?! Even if you survive, you’ll become an object of derision!\"","\"Damn, look how fast you’re going! I can’t wait to tell my friends and the rest of the world about this!\"","The God Ascension expert trembled with a mix of rage and humiliation as Yuan’s taunts echoed from behind. He even coughed up a mouthful of blood in an effort to suppress his fury. But in the end, his fear ran deeper than his pride, leaving him powerless to turn back.","However, just as Yuan was about to give up the chase, the man abruptly came to a halt.","Yuan stopped as well, but instead of excitement, a deep frown formed on his face, sensing that something wasn’t right.","Sure enough, moments later, Yuan sensed numerous powerful auras rapidly closing in from the distance.","\"Hahahaha! They’re finally here! The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s main army has finally arrived!\" The man laughed out loud after realizing what was going on.","\"...\"","Yuan had anticipated the possibility of reinforcements arriving, but when he saw just how many powerhouses were converging upon him, he couldn’t help but let out a weary smile.","With a single glance, Yuan could tell their reinforcements numbered over 300,000. It was a massive army, far larger than the entire reported population of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan. This could only mean one thing: the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan hadn’t come alone and had arrived backed by other forces.","It didn’t take long for the others to notice the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan’s reinforcements. And when the Azure Dragon Clan realized the situation, their expressions turned grim, darkened by a growing sense of dread.","Upon seeing their reinforcements arrive, those who had been clinging to life on the battlefield felt a surge of hope, and their morale soared to its peak.","The Third Elder, who had been losing to Jiao Zhenhai, let out a booming laugh. \"Hahaha! I hope you didn’t think we were all you had to deal with because the real fun is only just beginning!\"","Jiao Zhenhai clenched his fists. He remained silent, but his eyes were filled with despair. Even if his parents showed up right now, they’d still be completely outnumbered by the reinforcements.","At the forefront of the massive army stood several figures exuding overwhelming presence—each one a God Ascension realm cultivator ranging from the first to the fourth level, their very aura weighing down the atmosphere like a crushing tide.","Leading them was a strikingly beautiful woman with silver horns curling from her head and a tail swaying behind her. Her cultivation dwarfed the rest, standing at the sixth level of God Ascension.","Some time later, the army halted before Yuan and the God Ascension realm cultivator.","\"General Zhi, where do you think you’re going?\" the woman suddenly spoke, her voice calm yet oppressive. \"Why are you heading away from the battlefield?\"","\"T-That’s...\"","General Zhi hesitated, shame flickering in his eyes. He couldn’t possibly admit to fleeing from a mere mortal—not in front of so many watchful eyes. Even if he survived today, he would be reduced to nothing but a laughing stock.","The woman spoke again, \"Is something stuck in your throat, preventing you from speaking? Or are you just too ashamed to admit that you’d run away from the battlefield—from a mortal, no less.\"","General Zhi’s entire body trembled the moment he realized the woman had witnessed everything.","\"M-My actions are inexcusable, Mystic Empress!\" he stammered, dropping to his knees. \"I am willing to accept whatever punishment you see fit!\"","\"Hmph. I will deal with you once we return. Until then, stay there and watch how it’s supposed to be done.\"","\"As you wish!\"","The woman then turned her attention to Yuan with an amused smile tugging at her lips.","After a moment of silence, she spoke, \"I have lived a long time, but this is my first time seeing a mortal wield Celestial Qi. You have my admiration and respect.\"","\"Thank you.\"","\"My name is Cang Xuanji, the head of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, and I have a proposition for you. Instead of fighting for the Azure Dragon Clan, who are destined to be destroyed soon, why don’t you join my Mystic Sea Dragon Clan?\"","\"?!?!?!\"","General Zhi expressed shock when the Mystic Empress offered Yuan to join their ranks instead of killing him, but he didn’t dare utter a sound.","\"If you serve my Mystic Sea Dragon Clan well,\" the Mystic Empress said with a faint, amused smile, \"I might even consider accepting you into my family—as a concubine.\"","Yuan couldn’t help but chuckle at her random offer.","\"A concubine, huh? Did you offer the Three Elders the same thing?\" he asked.","\"What is that bastard saying?!\" The Third Elder couldn’t believe what he was hearing.","\"The Three Elders? They’re useful, but ultimately nothing more than tools. You’re different. If you desire, I can even dispose of them for you after you join our side.\"","\"M-Mystic Empress! That wasn’t part of our agreement!\" the Third Elder blurted out in panic, his face draining of color.","The Mystic Empress’s expression darkened, her gaze turning icy as it locked onto the Third Elder.","\"To think you still have the nerve to speak of our agreement,\" she said coldly, her voice rising with each word. \"Not only have you failed to obtain the Tear of the Azure Heavens, but you’ve also forced us to abandon a plan that took many millennia to perfect—all because of your incompetence! Trash!\"","With that final word, the Mystic Empress’s voice erupted like thunder, unleashing a powerful ripple that swept across the battlefield, shaking the hearts of all who heard it."]},{"number":1977,"title":"Chapter 1977: The Mystic Empress’ Rampage","paragraphs":["After hearing the Mystic Empress’ words, the Third Elder fell silent, no longer daring to utter another word.","Instead, he glared at Yuan with a hateful gaze.","’It was all because of that bastard! If he hadn’t shown up, we wouldn’t be in this situation!’","The Third Elder blamed everything on Yuan, who showed up out of the blue and purified their poison. Unfortunately, the only thing he could do was complain about it.","After scolding the Third Elder for his incompetence, the Mystic Empress returned her attention to Yuan and spoke calmly, \"So, what do you think about my offer?\"","\"I’m flattered by it,\" he said. \"Unfortunately, I cannot join the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.\"","\"What is the reasoning behind your decision?\" The Mysic Empress asked with narrowed eyes.","\"First of all, I don’t belong to the Azure Dragon Clan.\"","\"What? Then why are you fighting for them?\"","\"They have something I want, and I am helping them to acquire it.\"","\"In that case, wouldn’t it be better to fight for us? Besides the Tear of the Azure Heavens, I can help you get whatever you want after we defeat them.\"","\"While that does make logical sense, I do not like to take things by force if I don’t have to. And while I enjoy fighting, I dislike needless bloodshed. Now allow me to tell you the second reason why I cannot join you.\"","\"The Tear of the Azure Heavens that you’re looking for... it no longer exists.\"","\"What are you talking about?\" The Mystic Empress instantly frowned.","\"It no longer exists because I took it and already absorbed it, so you wasted your time by coming here,\" Yuan said.","\"...\"","Everyone standing behind the Mystic Empress froze, dumbfounded by Yuan’s claim. A heavy silence followed as they exchanged uneasy glances with each other. If what Yuan said was true, they wasted an immense amount of time and resources.","The Mystic Empress trembled slightly before speaking in a low voice, \"Tell me that you’re joking...\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"We’ve already tried telling the Third Elder, but he didn’t want to believe us either. I’m sorry, but it’s true.\"","He extended his arm, and with a flicker of will, conjured a beautiful blue flame upon his palm.","\"This is the Heaven-Freezing Flame that I acquired from consuming the treasure. You wanted it because you knew what it really was—the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix’s heart, right?\"","When the Mystic Empress saw the flames flickering above Yuan’s palms and heard his words, she trembled again and coughed up a mouthful of blood as numerous emotions surged through her being.","\"M-Mystic Empress—!\"","\"YOU... HOW DARE YOU?!?!?\"","The Mystic Empress suddenly let out a thunderous roar as her cultivation erupted uncontrollably, surging outward like a tidal wave.","The immense force of her outburst instantly swept through the ranks behind her, sending her own army reeling, even damaging many who were unable to withstand the immense power of her uncontrolled pressure.","\"DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA WHAT YOU HAVE DONE?! WHAT I HAD TO SACRIFICE JUST TO GET HERE?!?!\"","The Mystic Empress continued to scream, her voice laced with fury and anguish as her mind began to unravel, her composure quickly rumbling under the weight of rage and frustration.","\"M-Mystic Empress! Please, you must calm yourself!\" the God Ascension cultivators with her pleaded, their voices tinged with urgency and fear.","\"CALM DOWN?!?!? CALM DOWN?!?!?!?!??!\"","However, it only enraged her even further.","Yuan swallowed nervously. He knew it would anger her, but he never anticipated such a drastic reaction from the Mystic Empress.","\"I’M GOING TO KILL YOU! I’LL KILL YOU ALL!\"","Suddenly, the Mystic Empress shot toward Yuan with blinding speed—so fast that, though his eyes followed her movement, his body couldn’t react in time.","Her hand clamped around his neck like an iron vice, and in the next instant, she dragged him down in a streak of fury, slamming him violently into the ocean floor with a thunderous crash.","\"I’ll get the Tear of the Azure Heavens even if I have to forcefully remove it from your body!\"","Even as he was pinned to the ocean floor, Yuan tried to get the Mystic Empress off him by striking her with the Dragon God’s Vengeance. However, the difference in their Celestial Qi was simply too overwhelming for Yuan’s attacks to have any effect. It was akin to trying to break down a metal door with a toothpick.","Suddenly, two figures shot toward them before working together to remove the Mystic Empress from Yuan.","\"Father! Mother!\" Jiao Zhenhai exclaimed after seeing his parents’ arrival.","\"Are you okay?\" Jiao Longfei asked Yuan.","\"Yes. Do you think you can hold her off for a minute?\"","\"A minute...? It’ll be difficult, especially when she’s like that, but we’ll try,\" said Jiao Xuanji.","The two of them were both at the fifth level of God Ascension realm, but even if they fought together, they wouldn’t be able to defeat the Mystic Empress.","\"How dare you intervene! I’ll swallow all of you!\"","In a flash of divine light, the Mystic Empress transformed into her true form—a majestic silver dragon, radiating an overbearing presence that shook the sea itself.","Not daring to underestimate her, Jiao Xuanji and Jiao Longfei responded in kind, assuming their dragon forms without hesitation.","Moments later, the three titanic beasts collided, and the sheer force of their clash unleashed violent currents in every direction, hurling nearby cultivators like leaves in a storm.","While that happened, Yuan ignored everything around him and focused his attention solely on the Dragon God’s Vengeance.","\"Yeyou, I need your help. You’re the only one who can stop her rampaging,\" he sent his voice into the Soul Weapon, speaking directly to Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","\"...\"","However, there was no response.","\"I know you’re upset, and I’m sorry, but I could really use your assistance here.\"","\"...\"","Yuan sighed and continued, \"The Nine Dragon Symbols... I remembered our promise. Although we couldn’t fulfil it last time, let’s do it properly this time. I promise.\"","Though Dragon Goddess Yeyou didn’t speak, the Dragon God’s Vengeance began to tremble in response."]},{"number":1978,"title":"Chapter 1978: Absolute Obedience","paragraphs":["\"GET OUT OF MY WAY, YOU TRASH!\" Mystic Empress’ aura exploded further.","\"At this rate, we won’t be able to block her for a single minute!\" Jiao Longfei poured all of his Celestial Qi forward, but it quickly crumbled when Mystic Empress struck back.","\"Damn! When the hell did she become so powerful?!\" Jiao Xuanji exclaimed as she struggled to keep up.","\"My treasure! My plans! My future! Ahhhhh!\"","Mystic Empress’s rampage grew so uncontrollably violent that both the Azure Dragon Clan and the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan were forced to cease fighting and retreat in a panic.","Even the stray wisps of Celestial Qi erupting from her body were potent enough to kill anyone there instantly, leaving no one willing to remain near her wrath.","Suddenly, amidst the chaos and carnage, a profound aura descended upon the ocean like a silent decree from the heavens—vast, unfathomable, and absolute. The raging tides stilled, and even Mystic Empress’ rampaging Celestial Qi were forced to disperse.","\"What is this pressure?!\"","\"This presence... A Cultivation God?!\" Jiao Longfei gasped, his voice trembling with disbelief as he instinctively turned toward the source of the overwhelming aura, eyes wide with awe and fear.","Everyone present turned to face the source of the aura, including the Mystic Empress. Though still burning with rage, she found herself unable to express it, as if her very body and instincts had seized control, suppressing her fury out of sheer, primal desperation in the presence of something far beyond her comprehension.","Their gazes landed on Yuan, who was standing on the ocean floor with the Dragon God’s Vengeance in his grasp. No... they were all staring at the Dragon God’s Vengeance.","In the very next moment, a faint light emerged from within Dragon God’s Vengeance, swiftly expanding until it took the shape of a human figure, divine and ethereal, with a beauty so transcendent it instinctively commanded reverence from all who beheld it.","Yet, despite her breathtaking beauty, it was her unfathomable presence that held everyone’s attention. Merely standing in her presence compelled all those around her to instinctively seal their cultivation and loosen their stance, as though their bodies moved on their own to show submission and that they meant no harm.","Mystic Empress was no exception. Though her heart seethed with reluctance and resistance, her body betrayed her will. Unable to defy the overwhelming pressure of the presence before her, she returned to her human form and lowered herself in submission to Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","After making an appearance, Dragon Goddess Yeyou ignored everyone and calmly approached Mystic Empress.","\"Hey,\" she called out in a nonchalant tone.","\"Y-Yes!\"","Mystic Empress trembled uncontrollably as she responded in a cracked, uneven voice strained by overwhelming fear, feeling like she had suddenly turned into a mortal.","\"I’m in a good mood right now, so I’ll spare you for your insolence. However, my patience is limited, so I’ll give you and your minions ten seconds to disappear from my sight. And don’t even think about coming back in the future.\"","\"Thank you for your mercy!\"","Without daring to utter a word in defiance, Mystic Empress turned and swiftly swam away like her life depended on it, her once-dominant aura now subdued and broken. As for the rest of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, they didn’t need any instructions to fall back.","The Azure Dragon Clan stood in stunned silence, watching their enemies retreat in haste. The scene felt surreal, like a dream too impossible to be real, leaving them to question whether their eyes were deceiving them.","Dragon Goddess Yeyou returned to Yuan’s side and asked, \"Are you satisfied? Or did you want me to kill everyone?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, this is fine.\"","He turned to look at Jiao Zhenhai and continued, \"Though they may have plotted against the Azure Dragon Clan for the Tear of the Azure Heavens, this is just the nature of the cultivation world. They were undoubtedly forceful, but so was your aggression toward the Holy Dragon Clan, regardless of your reasons. That said, it’s not like they received no punishment. Because of their greed, they lost many powerful cultivators and Immortals, greatly reducing their influence, and it’s not likely they will return since you no longer have what they want.\"","Yuan agreed to protect the Azure Dragon Clan from destruction, which he’d achieved. As for killing everyone from the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan, he never considered doing such a thing.","If he, a mere human, were to erase one of the Ten Royal Dragon Bloodlines from existence, it would undoubtedly draw even greater trouble upon him in the future than just offending the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","After a moment of silence, Jiao Zhenhai let out a heavy sigh and said, \"No, I completely understand. In the end, you’re just an outsider who was dragged into our conflict. We have no right to expect you to shoulder such a tremendous burden.\"","\"You helped us chase away the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan just like you promised, and that’s more than enough. Even if they return in the future, it’s a problem we must deal with ourselves.\"","Jiao Zhenhai turned to look at the Third Elder, who had tried to escape with the others but was forced to stay behind and continued, \"As for you... You’ll pay for betraying our family for the rest of your miserable life!\"","\"Please! I was wrong! Have mercy!\"","Yuan stopped paying attention to them and looked at Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","\"I’d love to fulfill that promise right now, but with your condition like that...\"","Dragon Goddess Yeyou interrupted, \"I know, you don’t have to say anything. Until I recover my body, we’ll put that promise on hold. However, this doesn’t mean you can dilly-dally around it.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"I’ll restore your body as soon as possible.\"","Dragon Goddess Yeyou returned to the Dragon God’s Vengeance while the rest of the Azure Dragon Clan began tending to the aftermath."]},{"number":1979,"title":"Chapter 1979: Mystic Empress’ Obsession","paragraphs":["While the Azure Dragon Clan worked hard to rebuild their destroyed underwater city, much of which was left in ruins by the invasion, Yuan focused on cleansing the lingering poison from the clan’s remaining children.","Meanwhile, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan did not stop moving at their peak speed until they escaped the water and returned to the surface.","Once outside the water, Mystic Empress halted her movements and stared at the empty space before her in silence.","The army behind didn’t dare to disturb her and patiently waited for her to snap out of it.","After a few days of complete stillness, Mystic Empress finally moved again. She took a deep breath before releasing a profound sigh.","\"The cultivation world is quite brutal...\"","As the leader of one of the Ten Dragon Clans bearing a royal bloodline, the Mystic Empress had always believed herself to stand at the very pinnacle of the world. Never had she imagined a day would come when she’d be forced to bow her head and retreat so helplessly.","Even now, she would tremble when recalling the presence she felt from Dragon Goddess Yeyou.","’Just who was that woman? I have never felt such fear before—not even when I stood before the Great One!’","With her vast influence, the Mystic Empress had crossed paths with most—if not all—of the most powerful beings in the Nine Heavens. Yet, not a single one had ever made her feel as utterly powerless as Dragon Goddess Yeyou did, and she had done so effortlessly, merely by releasing a sliver of her aura.","’There’s no way such a powerful entity isn’t known across the Nine Heavens! Somebody must know something about her!’","\"Mystic Empress... what should we do now?\"","Someone eventually asked, pulling her out of her thoughts.","The Mystic Empress turned to look at them and said, \"The Tear of the Azure Heavens is no more, so the rest of our plan no longer matters. It’s unfortunate, but this is the end of our cooperation.\"","\"If you want to blame the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan—me for our incompetence, you’re free to do so, but I will not tolerate anyone thinking of coming after my family for this incident.\"","\"We won’t blame you, Mystic Empress. That entity’s appearance was completely out of our control. Hell, even if we knew about her existence beforehand, we still wouldn’t be able to do anything about it.\"","Some time later, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan and the others went their own way.","Time flowed like a fleeting stream, and in the blink of an eye, a year had passed since the failed invasion of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan.","While everyone tried to move on and forget the incident, one individual had been living a waking nightmare ever since.","No matter how desperately she tried to bury the memory, the Mystic Empress could not escape the looming shadow of Dragon Goddess Yeyou. The goddess’s presence from that day clung to her mind like a curse, and with each passing day, the weight of that humiliation gnawed at her sanity, slowly driving her toward madness.","Boom!","A thunderous explosion echoed from the Mystic Empress’s quarters, followed by a tremor that rippled through the surrounding area. Yet, none of those nearby so much as flinched, as such disturbances had become routine ever since her return.","The Mystic Sea Dragon Clan tried seeking doctors to help her, but since this was a mental battle, there was nothing the doctors could do but suggest pills that strengthened the mind","\"I can’t believe a sixth-level God Ascension powerhouse like the Mystic Empress still has to deal with heart demons.\"","\"Heart demons are cruel and merciless. They can bring down even a Cultivation God if it gets bad enough.\"","\"What should we do? We cannot let her get to such a point. No matter how many pills we feed her, her condition hasn’t improved. If anything, it has only gotten worse.\"","\"I’ll contact the other clans to see if they have any ideas...\"","Time continued to pass.","Half a year later, several individuals from the other Ten Royal Dragon Clans arrived at the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan after hearing about the Mystic Empress’ unique situation.","\"How is the Mystic Empress?\" asked a handsome man who had the cultivation at the 7th level of God Ascension.","The members of the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan explained the situation and their incident with the Azure Dragon Clan.","\"The Mystic Empress with a heart demon...?\"","This news left them stunned, as they were all aware of how strong she was mentally.","When they went to speak with the Mystic Empress, they could hear her yelling inside her room from the halls.","\"Who is she?! I need to know!!!\"","\"...\"","The guests exchanged glances with each other.","Someone from the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan explained, \"Her fear has turned into some sort of obsession with that entity.\"","Some time later, they knocked on the door.","\"Mystic Empress, can we speak to you for a second?\"","Bang!","The doors burst open with a deafening crash, and the Mystic Empress emerged—her once-elegant appearance now disheveled, her eyes wild and unfocused, resembling more a madwoman than the regal figure she once was.","Before any of the guests could open their mouths, the Mystic Empress suddenly grabbed one of their collars and shouted, \"Do you know her?! Do you know who she is?!?!\"","\"M-Mystic Empress! Snap out of it!\"","\"It’s fine,\" said the handsome man she grabbed.","\"That woman... You want to know her identity, right? Well, I think I have an idea.\"","\"WHO?! WHO IS SHE?!\"","\"This is merely a guess,\" he said slowly, his tone laced with reverence and awe, \"but judging by the details of her appearance, I believe she was none other than Dragon Goddess Yeyou—one of the Three Dragons of Origin.\"","\"What?! Dragon Goddess Yeyou?! But I thought she died long ago!\" The others expressed shock after hearing this.","He shook his head and said, \"Her death was never confirmed. She’d only gone missing.\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou...\" Mystic Empress mumbled with a dazed look on her face."]},{"number":1980,"title":"Chapter 1980: Two Years Later","paragraphs":["The Mystic Empress became silent after learning of the identity of the entity who humiliated her.","Everything finally made sense to her. If it was one of the Dragons of Origin, it was only natural that she was hopeless before such an entity.","\"If Dragon Goddess Yeyou has truly returned, this is huge news,\" said one of the guests.","The others nodded in agreement, \"Who knows how everyone will react, especially the Great One.\"","\"The Great One will probably be shaking in excitement once he hears of her return. He’s always fancied Dragon Goddess Yeyou but never had any success because of the Immortal Monarch. Now with the Immortal Monarch gone, he’ll definitely try again.\"","\"The Nine Heavens will probably get rowdy for some time.\"","\"Mystic Empress, are you okay?\" The handsome man asked her a moment later.","\"Yes... Thank you for telling me her identity, or I would’ve been consumed by it,\" she said.","\"Please, you don’t need to thank me. It’s not guaranteed that she’s really Dragon Goddess Yeyou, either.\"","\"No, there’s no doubt that she’s definitely Dragon Goddess Yeyou,\" she said firmly. \"Aside from the Great One, I’ve never experienced such instinctive fear... not even close.\"","\"If the legends are true—that Dragon Goddess Yeyou is stronger than even the Great One, then it would make sense.\"","She turned to look at the others and said, \"I need to rest. Sorry for worrying you guys, even making you waste your time by coming here.\"","\"Since we got to see your face, it wasn’t a waste,\" laughed the handsome man.","The Mystic Empress smiled and said, \"Once I recover, I’ll invite you guys again.\"","Her guests left shortly after, and the Mystic Empress entered seclusion.","As time passed, rumors of Dragon Goddess Yeyou’s return began making their way across the Nine Heavens. However, this rumor was so far-fetched that almost nobody believed it.","After all, Dragon Goddess Yeyou has been missing since the Immortal Monarch’s Era, which ended hundreds of millions of years ago.","Eventually, this rumor reached a certain pair of ears.","\"What did you just say? I demand you repeat that.\"","The individual’s voice trembled with disbelief, and his sharp golden eyes flickered with a barely contained excitement.","\"There’s been a rumor going around claiming that Dragon Goddess Yeyou has return—\"","The man suddenly extended his arm to grasp the messenger around the neck and threatened, \"If you dare mess with me, I’ll shatter your soul.\"","\"I-It’s true! I wouldn’t dare to lie to you, Great One!\"","\"Tell me everything you know!\" The Great One roared, his body trembling in excitement.","Meanwhile, two years had quietly passed since Yuan took residence within the Azure Dragon Clan’s territory, dedicating himself to purging the remnants of the poison from their bloodline.","\"I’m done.\"","Yuan said as he lowered his arms.","\"T-Thank you...\" Jiao Binglan, who was the last to be treated, quietly thanked him.","Yuan met with Jiao Zhenhai and the others shortly afterward.","\"I have fulfilled our agreement.\"","\"I don’t even know how to thank you...\" Jiao Zhenhai sighed.","\"No need.\" Yuan shook his head before continuing, \"Now then, it’s your turn.\"","\"Of course.\"","Jiao Zhenhai retrieved a silver key from his spatial ring and offered it to Yuan.","\"This is the key we received from the Holy Dragon Clan.\"","Yuan accepted the key and tossed it into his spatial ring.","\"Then I’ll take my leave now.\"","\"Are you sure you don’t want to stay here a little longer?\" Jiao Binglan asked him. \"You should at least rest before you go...\"","Jiao Binglan’s attitude toward Yuan had undergone a profound transformation over the past two years. Once, she had wished for nothing more than his departure, but now, the mere thought of him leaving was unbearable, stirring a quiet ache that was hard to ignore.","Unfortunately, she knew they were not fated to be together.","\"Sorry, but I need to return to the Holy Dragon Clan as soon as possible.\"","\"Th-Then, at least let me escort you back!\" she said.","\"If that’s what you want.\"","Some time later, after bidding farewell to Jiao Zhenhai and the rest of the Azure Dragon Clan, Yuan began his journey back to the Holy Dragon Clan escorted by Jiao Binglan and Jiao Xuanbing.","As they made their way back, they passed through the underwater city. Two years ago, it had lain in ruins, destroyed by the invasion. Yet, in just two short years, not only had the Azure Dragon Clan rebuilt it, they had refined and improved it, crafting a city even grander than before.","Yuan gazed at the underwater city and smiled inwardly, ’Although this journey took over two years, I’d gained a lot.’","Not only did he acquire the Heaven-Chilling Ice Phoenix’s heart, which helped him complete his physique and obtain new abilities, but he’d even acquired six powerful treasures from the Azure Dragon Clan.","A month later, Yuan returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"Do you think we’ll see each other again?\" Jiao Binglan asked him as they arrived at their destination.","\"I’m sure we’ll cross paths again in the future,\" he said.","She silently nodded.","\"Welcome back, Senior Envoy.\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor greeted him at the entrance a moment later.","\"I’m back.\"","Jiao Bingland and Jiao Xuanbing returned to the Azure Dragon Clan after confirming that Yuan had safely entered the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"I’m sorry.\"","The Dragon Emperor suddenly apologized.","\"What for?\"","\"For not being there with you when the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan invaded,\" he sighed.","The Azure Dragon Clan had notified the Holy Dragon Clan of the incident after the invasion had ended, so they were aware of the situation.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Look at me. Do I look dead to you?\"","\"No...\"","\"Then there’s nothing else to talk about, especially when it happened two years ago.\"","\"I understand.\" The Dragon Emperor nodded and changed the topic.","Some time later, the Dragon Emperor brought Yuan to the training grounds to meet with Xi Meili."]},{"number":1981,"title":"Chapter 1981: Activating Dragon Spiral Mountain’s Teleportation Device","paragraphs":["When Yuan arrived at the training ground, Xi Meili was engaged in a fierce spar with one of the young dragons.","\"What happened to her? She’s improved a lot since I last saw her. Even her cultivation has soared,\" Yuan remarked as they watched from a distance.","Xi Meili’s cultivation had somehow soared to the peak of Divine Ancestor in two short years, and her aura had grown so exponentially that Yuan almost didn’t recognize her at first.","\"She’s trained with our most experienced instructors nearly every single day for the last two years. It was already apparent from the very beginning that she had tremendous potential and talent, but we’ve underestimated how much talent was dwelling within her.\"","\"After training for a year, her training progress suddenly skyrocketed toward the heavens, as if something within her bloodline awakened,\" said the Dragon Emperor.","\"Honestly, I was quite surprised when it happened,\" he added. \"Her bloodline is more powerful than I’d initially anticipated. I’m really intrigued by its origins.\"","\"She’s closely related to the Dragon Ancestor,\" Yuan said.","\"Dragon Ancestor... I wonder where he is right now.\"","Eventually, Xi Meili defeated her opponent.","\"Damn it! I lost again!\" The young dragon complained out loud.","\"It was a good fight.\" Xi Meili extended her arm toward her opponent.","The young dragon grabbed it and spoke with a defeated smile, \"You’re a monster, Senior Sister.\"","\"You only say that because you’ve never seen a real monster before,\" Xi Meili chuckled.","It was at this moment that Xi Meili noticed Yuan.","\"Speaking of the devil...\"","She leaped from the stage and landed before Yuan.","\"I didn’t realize you’d be back today! Welcome back, Yuan!\"","\"I’m back,\" he smiled.","\"I’ve been so focused on training that it doesn’t even feel that long since you left,\" she said.","\"I can tell. You’ve worked hard.\"","\"I know you just came back, but how about a spar?\"","\"Why not? I might as well stretch my body before I activate the teleportation device.\"","Yuan jumped onto the stage with Xi Meili, and the two of them began sparring immediately. However, neither was going all out in the beginning, and they chatted as they fought.","\"I heard you had to protect the Azure Dragon Clan from an invasion. How was it?\"","\"It was a good experience since I got to fight with Immortals and even a few God Ascension experts.\"","\"Hm? Wait! You’re already at the peak of Immortal Ascension?! I was going to brag about my cultivation progress, too!\" Xi Meili exclaimed after noticing his cultivation.","Though she was happy for him, Xi Meili couldn’t help but feel a little dejected since she thought she’d closed the distance between them, even if it was just slightly.","However, she quickly shook off those negative thoughts and declared, \"I’m going to train even harder!\"","\"That’s the spirit.\" Yuan laughed.","Their spar quickly increased in intensity, with both of them using Dragon Awakening at the end.","The spar lasted for thirty minutes until Xi Meili ran out of energy and forfeited.","\"I’ve defeated you before, and I won’t stop training until I can do it again!\" she said afterward.","\"I like your enthusiasm. Here, let me give you a little push.\"","Yuan suddenly retrieved a spatial ring and offered it to her.","\"What’s this?\" Xi Meili asked as she accepted it.","\"A little something I acquired from the Azure Dragon Clan. Take a look inside.\"","When Xi Meili peeked inside the spatial ring, she nearly dropped it from shock.","\"Ar-Are you sure I can have this?!\" she stuttered.","\"Of course. I got it specifically for you.\"","\"Thank you...\" Xi Meili was at a loss for words.","There were several Empyrean-grade treasures inside the spatial ring.","When Xi Meili looked inside the spatial ring again, she realized there was actually a Celestial-grade treasure in there.","\"You didn’t rob the Azure Dragon Clan, did you?\" she asked in a joking tone.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"It could be considered robbery.\"","In his eyes, he had obtained these treasures in exchange for merely two drops of his blood, making it feel less like a fair trade and more like outright robbery.","Moreover, although these treasures were powerful, they were meant for dragons. Though Yuan could wield them since he had the body of a dragon, these treasures would not replace his current treasures.","\"I’m going to activate the teleportation device now.\"","\"You’re going to return to your original world, right? Do you think I can come with you to see it?\" Xi Meili asked.","Yuan pondered for a moment before saying, \"You can visit, but since we don’t know how things will end up, let’s wait until after I regain my body.\"","\"Okay!\"","With the silver key in his possession, Yuan traveled to the peak of the teleportation device at the top of the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Meanwhile, Xi Meili, the Dragon Emperor, as well as several high-ranking members of the Holy Dragon Clan, followed as spectators.","Some time later, Yuan stood before the stone tablet with the keyhole.","Taking a deep breath, Yuan firmly pressed the silver key into the keyhole.","In an instant, the ancient symbols etched across the platform before him ignited with an ethereal glow, pulsing with a mysterious energy that seemed to awaken the very air around him.","\"Won’t this require a lot of spiritual energy to activate?\" Yuan asked.","The Dragon Emperor then spoke, \"Yes, but this device automatically collects spiritual energy, and since it hasn’t been used since the Immortal Monarch’s Era, it should have gathered enough spiritual energy for a few uses.\"","Moments later, a brilliant pillar of light erupted from the platform, shooting skyward with blinding intensity before expanding outward, tearing open the fabric of space and forming a massive, swirling portal suspended in the air.","At the same time on Earth, the Lord, who had been cultivating in silence, suddenly opened his eyes and rose to his feet, his gaze lifting sharply toward the sky, as if sensing a distant ripple that transcended worlds.","\"H-He did it! He’s finally activated the teleportation device from the other side!\" he exclaimed in excitement."]},{"number":1982,"title":"Chapter 1982: The Celestial Emperor’s Interference","paragraphs":["Though it was faint, the Lord could sense something trying to connect with the Dragon Spiral Mountain on Earth.","\"He did it! He activated the device from the other side!\"","Not daring to waste another moment, the Lord swiftly turned and rushed into the depths of his cave. There, waiting in solemn silence, stood a circular platform and an ancient stone tablet. Without hesitation, he drew forth a golden key and inserted it into the keyhole, its surface trembling faintly in response.","However, unlike the teleportation device in the Seventh Heaven, the one on Earth barely emitted any glow due to a lack of spiritual energy.","Seeing this, the Lord gritted his teeth and roared, \"Not enough spiritual energy? In that case, take my cultivation!\"","Without a hint of hesitation, the Lord channeled all of his spiritual energy into the teleportation device, even drawing directly from his Dantian to fuel its activation.","Empowered by the immense surge of energy, the device responded instantly—its symbols blazing to life as a radiant glow engulfed the chamber, humming with ancient power.","The Lord’s cultivation plummeted at a rapid rate, but he didn’t care and continued as if his life depended on it.","Eventually, the teleportation device erupted with a golden pillar of light, its brilliance so intense it pierced through the stone ceiling of the cave and shot into the heavens, tearing through clouds as if announcing its activation to the entire world.","This phenomenon shocked everyone on Earth, with some wondering if it was the beginning of an apocalypse.","\"Look at the sky! It got split apart!\"","\"What’s happening?! Is this the end of the world?!\"","The Lord looked at the sky with a relieved smile.","\"It’s done...\" he muttered as his body collapsed onto the ground.","\"Lord!!!\" Liya rushed over after seeing this.","Meanwhile, at the Seventh Heaven’s Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"I’m going to enter the portal now,\" Yuan said to them.","\"Before you go into the portal... You know that the other device must also be activated for the connection to work, right?\" Dragon Emperor said.","\"Yes, I am aware. I have someone on the other side.\"","\"If you say so... Good luck.\"","Yuan nodded and flew toward the sky, disappearing into the portal.","At the same time, somewhere in the Ninth Heaven—","\"Your Majesty, somebody activated the Dragon Spiral Mountain’s teleportation device!\"","A man draped in a majestic golden robe stood at the edge of a floating island, upon which a vast and imposing palace loomed behind him. His gaze was fixed downward, piercing through clouds and distance, as if observing the world far below with eyes that saw more than mere mortals ever could.","\"I am aware. Send the Heaven’s Mandate to investigate and shut it down,\" said the Celestial Emperor.","\"As Your Majesty commands!\"","\"Dragon Spiral Mountain... Is it just a coincidence? No, there’s no such thing as a coincidence when it comes to him...\" the Celestial Emperor muttered.","After stepping into the portal, Yuan was instantly consumed by a rushing torrent of distorted space. He hurtled through the rift at incredible speed, his body suspended in a void where time and direction lost all meaning—and he had no control over his movements.","Normally, teleportation occurred in the blink of an eye. However, the distance between the Nine Heavens and Earth was so unfathomably vast that even space-bending travel required time to traverse.","A few minutes after Yuan vanished into the portal, the skies above Dragon Spiral Mountain trembled, and a second, even larger portal tore open the heavens. From its swirling depths, an overwhelming army descended—Immortals and God Ascension experts alike, their presence shaking the land with divine pressure.","Noticing this, everyone at the Dragon Spiral Mountain halted their movements and looked toward the sky.","\"I am General Wang of Heaven’s Mandate! Under His Majesty, the Celestial Emperor’s command, we have come here to investigate your reason for activating the Dragon Spiral Mountain’s teleportation device!\"","The man leading the army, a ninth-level God Ascension powerhouse, demanded an answer.","The Holy Dragon Emperor fearlessly approached the army and spoke, \"Since when did the Celestial Emperor take interest in the affairs of our Royal Dragon Clan?\"","\"Since now.\"","\"Is that so? In that case, our reason is simple... we activated the teleportation device simply because we can. As far as I’m aware, it’s not against the law to do so.\"","\"It’s not, but the Celestial Emperor wants you to shut it down, and his words are the law in the Nine Heavens.\"","\"Perhaps that may be the case for you humans, but we’re the Holy Dragon Clan. We only follow the command of Dragon Goddess Yeyou. The Celestial Emperor should know better than to send a bunch of dogs to bark at us. Leave if you don’t want any trouble.\"","\"Insolence!\" the General roared, laced with fury and disdain. \"Even as the Dragon Emperor, you do not have the right to speak so brazenly! Shut down the teleportation device immediately!\"","In the next instant, the Dragon Emperor released his aura without restraint. A wave of immense pressure swept across the land, shaking the air itself, so heavy and oppressive that even the clouds above trembled, as if bowing to his might.","\"You dare encroach on my territory and issue commands as though you rule it?!\" the Dragon Emperor thundered, his voice sending ripples in every direction. \"The teleportation device will remain active, and that is final! If you wish to shut it down, you must do it yourself! But know this—the moment you set foot on Dragon Spiral Mountain, we will treat it as an act of invasion and we will retaliate!\"","Upon hearing the Holy Dragon Emperor’s declaration, the members of the Holy Dragon Clan unleashed their auras in unison, each one erupting like a dragon’s roar through the heavens, a clear and unified signal to Heaven’s Mandate that they were not bluffing.","\"How fucking troublesome...\" General Wang clenched his fists in frustration.","He retrieved a medallion and activated it with his spiritual energy.","\"Your Majesty, we have a situation here.\""]},{"number":1983,"title":"Chapter 1983: Heaven’s Will","paragraphs":["Following the Holy Dragon Emperor’s firm refusal to comply, General Wang was left with no choice but to contact the Celestial Emperor for further instructions. The situation had grown too delicate, and any misstep could ignite a conflict that would affect not just the Celestial Emperor but the entire Nine Heavens.","The Heaven’s Mandate certainly possessed the manpower to annihilate the Holy Dragon Clan if they so wished, but doing so would be no different than striking down a foreign diplomat protected by immunity, and they’d have to answer to the other Royal Dragon Clans.","While the Celestial Emperor stood as the single most powerful and authoritative figure in the Nine Heavens, his reach was not absolute. There existed powers beyond even his command. Most notably, the Ten Royal Dragon Clans. As dragons, they stood at the very pinnacle of the beast world, alongside the Phoenix bloodline and a handful of other ancient bloodlines. And as royals among dragons, they possessed the ability to command all lesser dragons beneath them.","If the Ten Royal Dragon Clans were ever to clash against the Celestial Emperor, it wouldn’t be a battle against ten clans alone—it would mean facing the united might of nearly all the dragons in existence, along with countless powerful beings loyal to their cause. Even for the Celestial Emperor, such a conflict would be a calamity of unimaginable scale.","Even if the Ten Royal Dragon Clans were not allies of each other and often clashed among themselves, they would never allow an outsider, especially a human, to trample upon one of their own bloodlines. In other words, internal strife was acceptable, even natural, but any external aggression was seen as an unforgivable affront to the dragon race itself.","\"What should we do, Your Majesty? The Holy Dragon Emperor refuses to cooperate and declared war if we tried to stop the teleportation device.\" General Wang explained the situation to the Celestial Emperor.","\"...\"","After a brief moment of silence, the Celestial Emperor spoke, \"Let me speak with the Dragon Emperor.\"","General Wang turned his gaze to the Dragon Emperor and spoke, \"His Majesty, the Celestial Emperor, wishes to speak with you!\"","He tossed the medallion to the Holy Dragon Emperor.","\"This is the Holy Dragon Emperor speaking.\"","\"Holy Dragon Emperor, let’s not make things difficult.\"","\"I don’t want to, but if you want me to deactivate the teleportation device, I will have to.\"","\"Is it because you’re trying to protect someone?\"","\"...That is none of your business.\"","\"No, it is my business,\" the Celestial Emperor said coldly. \"The one you’re so eager to protect... if left unchecked, he will become the very catalyst for the Nine Heavens’ collapse, and as the Celestial Emperor, it is my duty to protect this world.\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor smiled at the Celestial Emperor’s words and calmly responded, \"You have your duties just as I have my own. I’m sorry, Celestial Emperor, but you will not change my mind.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, the Celestial Emperor released a faint sigh before speaking again, \"I always thought you were one of the wiser Dragon Emperors, but it appears I have been mistaken this entire time. I really don’t want to do this, but you’ve forced my hands.\"","\"The other Royal Dragon Clans will be upset for a while, but they won’t do anything hasty while I have the Royal Phoenix Clans on my side.\"","In the next moment, an invisible ripple spread across the skies above Dragon Spiral Mountain, distorting space itself. It exuded a profound and unfathomable pressure—one so deep and divine that it felt as though Heaven itself were trying to make an appearance.","Then, the word ’execute’ blazed into existence across the heavens, etched in radiant light, vast and commanding, as if carved directly into the fabric of the sky itself, and it hung there like a divine decree.","Seeing this, General Wang smiled and declared loudly, \"Heaven has spoken! Follow the Celestial Emperor’s command and destroy the teleportation device! Execute anyone who dares to try and stop us!\"","He pointed his sword toward the Dragon Spiral Mountain and roared, \"Execute Heaven’s will!\"","\"RAAAAAH!\"","Behind him, the army erupted with a deafening war cry that shook the very heavens. With weapons drawn and killing intent surging, they descended upon Dragon Spiral Mountain like a merciless storm.","In response, the Holy Dragon Emperor unleashed a thunderous roar, his voice reverberating through every corner of Dragon Spiral Mountain like a divine command.","\"Teach these intruders the price of defiling our sacred land! Slay all who dare to stain our home with their presence!\"","\"For Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\"","Thousands of dragon roars erupted at once, shaking the heavens and the sea below. In a breathtaking surge, every member of the Holy Dragon Clan—young dragons, elders, even the humble servants—took to the skies with unwavering resolve.","\"W-What should I do?!\" Xi Meili cried out, her voice trembling with panic as the skies erupted into chaos around her. The sudden descent into all-out war left her completely overwhelmed and frozen in place.","\"This is not your fight. Find a safe place to hide until Yuan returns.\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor’s voice suddenly resounded in her head through voice transmission.","\"B-But...\"","Xi Meili hesitated following this instruction. How could she run and hide while everyone else fought? Moreover, they were fighting for Yuan.","\"No! There’s no way I can cower in a corner while everyone else fights for him!\"","Xi Meili wore all of the treasures Yuan had recently given her and joined the battle shortly later.","As for the Dragon Emperor, he also entered the battle after sending his message to Xi Meili, clashing with General Wang.","Although the Holy Dragon Clan vastly outnumbered the soldiers of Heaven’s Mandate, sheer numbers meant little in the face of overwhelming cultivation. Every member of Heaven’s Mandate was at least a Bronze Immortal, and with that power, they effortlessly suppressed the Holy Dragon Clan, pushing them back with ease despite being outnumbered.","Yet, even while being overwhelmed, the Holy Dragon Clan showed no signs of yielding and continued their relentless retaliation until their last breath."]},{"number":1984,"title":"Chapter 1984: Defend the Dragon Spiral Mountain!","paragraphs":["\"How long have I been in here?\" Yuan mumbled to himself as his body continued to travel through the space rift, feeling like it’d been ages since he entered the portal.","However, in reality, it’d only been a few minutes since he entered.","\"Wait a second... this might be an opportunity to train my Power of the Void...\"","Realizing this, Yuan stopped thinking about the passage of time and focused solely on the void around him.","<Your understanding of Power of the Void has increased slightly>","With nothing to do but train his Power of the Void, Yuan focused entirely on it, eventually forgetting that he was in a space rift and traveling back to Earth.","Only an hour had passed since Heaven’s Mandate began their invasion, yet more than half of the Holy Dragon Clan had already fallen. The majority were young dragons and servants—those without the cultivation to survive such a brutal onslaught.","\"Look around you! This is the result of your foolish defiance, Holy Dragon Emperor!\" General Wang exclaimed with a vicious smile on his face. \"Did you really think the Holy Dragon Clan could stop Heaven’s Mandate, the strongest army in the Nine Heavens?!\"","\"Of course not,\" the Dragon Emperor calmly replied.","\"Then you must’ve believed your royal bloodline would make the Celestial Emperor hesitate! Unfortunately for you, that didn’t work out either!\"","\"You won’t understand it even if I were to break it down for you.\"","\"I don’t need to understand it, nor do I want to!\"","The clash between the Dragon Emperor and General Wang—two peak God Ascension powerhouses—was so catastrophic that even the ripples from their blows carried enough force to instantly obliterate an Immortal upon contact.","To prevent their battle from decimating allies and enemies alike, they erected a barrier of Celestial Qi around themselves.","As for Xi Meili, she had managed to survive, though just barely, thanks to the protective treasures Yuan had given her. But mere survival was all she could manage. Against Immortals, her attacks were like droplets against stone, ineffective and easily brushed aside.","\"Damn it all... they’re too powerful...\" she muttered through clenched teeth, frustration burning in her chest like fire. Her hands trembled—not from fear, but from the unbearable weight of her own powerlessness.","\"If only I were a little stronger!\" Xi Meili cried out inwardly, frustration and helplessness twisting in her chest.","But before the thought could fade, a wave of killing intent crashed over her like a cold tide.","\"DIE!\"","An Immortal soldier charged straight at her, blade gleaming with killing intent. Xi Meili turned weakly toward the threat, but her body refused to move—too drained and battered. She couldn’t even lift a finger to defend herself, much less avoid it.","’Ah... Is this the end for me? I’m sorry, Yuan, but this will be the end of my journey with you... It was fun...’’","Xi Meili closed her eyes, having fully accepted her fate.","However, moments later, the death she’d anticipated did not arrive, prompting her to open her eyes again.","\"Huh? You are...\"","Just as the fatal blow was about to land, two figures appeared before Xi Meili like flashes of divine light. One stood firmly in front of her, effortlessly blocking the Immortal’s attack, while the other moved like a shadow, reappearing behind the soldier and striking him down in a single, precise motion.","These two were none other than Yin and Yang, elite members of the Evil God’s Shadow Army.","\"Sorry it took so long. We had to alert the others. Everything will be okay now. Reinforcements have arrived,\" said Yang.","In the very next moment, countless rifts tore open across the sky above Dragon Spiral Mountain, and from within them emerged several hundred figures, each cloaked in deep black robes that obscured their features. However, their aura was unmistakable and ominous, and their sudden appearance made the Heaven’s Mandate halt their advancement.","\"T-The Shadow Army! The Evil God’s Shadow Army has made an appearance!\" Someone suddenly shouted.","\"What?!\" General Wang exclaimed. He halted his fight with the Dragon Emperor to confirm it for himself.","\"Evil God’s Shadow Army...?\" The Holy Dragon Emperor frowned, unaware whether this new force was friend or foe.","Suddenly, a cold voice thundered across the battlefield, \"Shadow Army... slaughter Heaven’s Mandate and protect the Dragon Spiral Mountain!\"","Following the command, the members of the Evil God’s Shadow Army descended upon the soldiers of Heaven’s Mandate, instantly turning the tide against them.","Seeing this, General Wang retrieved another medallion and hastily activated it.","\"Y-Your Majesty! We have an emergency! The Evil God’s Shadow Army has shown up to defend the Dragon Spiral Mountain!\"","The Celestial Emperor, who had just received this news, sighed, \"As I figured, this was no coincidence.\"","Upon confirming Yuan’s involvement, the Celestial Emperor cast aside what little hesitation remained. With a swift motion, he retrieved a golden medallion etched with the words \"Heaven’s Will.\"","Raising it high, his voice boomed with divine authority, \"The Evil God’s Shadow Army has revealed itself! Heaven’s Mandate—Third Squad, assist the Seventh Squad immediately!\"","A few minutes after the Celestial Emperor’s command, the skies above Dragon Spiral Mountain split once more. More portals tore through the heavens, and from them descended the Third Squad of Heaven’s Mandate—each soldier a Golden Immortal at minimum, their auras blazing like falling stars as they rushed to reinforce the embattled Seventh Squad.","Meanwhile, Yuan’s eyes suddenly snapped open. In the vast expanse of the void ahead, a flicker of white light shimmered into view. Within moments, it expanded rapidly, growing brighter and closer as his body was irresistibly drawn toward it.","A few moments later, Yuan’s body was completely engulfed by the radiant light, his vision drowned in pure whiteness. But then, as the brilliance faded, he found himself suspended beneath a vast blue sky, surrounded by drifting clouds, and the silence of the void was gone, replaced by the gentle breath of the wind and the soft glow of sunlight.","With a smile on his face, Yuan announced out loud, \"I’m back!\""]},{"number":1985,"title":"Chapter 1985: Returning to Earth","paragraphs":["When Yuan emerged from the space rift, for a brief moment, he thought the teleportation had failed—that he was still in the Seventh Heaven. The spiritual energy in the air was simply too dense, too rich, to belong to Earth.","But he quickly realized that it was because the spiritual energy had flowed in from the Seventh Heaven.","The moment the teleportation device connected the realms, the boundless spiritual energy from the Seventh Heaven flowed into Earth. Even though it was only a fraction, for a small world like Earth, even the tiniest trickle of spiritual energy from the Seventh Heaven was enough to blanket the entire planet, saturating every corner with spiritual energy it hadn’t experienced since the Immortal Monarch’s Era.","The cultivators on Earth immediately sensed the shift. The moment the spiritual energy thickened around them, many dropped whatever they were doing and entered seclusion on the spot. Fearing it might vanish as suddenly as it appeared, they rushed to absorb as much of it as possible, eager to seize the rare opportunity to advance in cultivation while the heavens allowed it.","Since the rift opened up above the Dragon Spiral Mountain, it didn’t take long before Yuan noticed it and descended upon it.","When Yuan descended onto the peak of Dragon Spiral Mountain, his gaze was immediately drawn to two distant figures.","It was the Lord and Liya.","But something was wrong. The Lord lay motionless on the ground, seemingly unconscious, his aura faint and unstable. Beside him, Liya was transferring her spiritual energy into him.","Seeing this, Yuan rushed over and asked, \"What happened?!\"","\"He sacrificed his cultivation to activate the teleportation device,\" she revealed in a grim tone.","\"What?! Let me help!\"","Upon hearing that the Lord had sacrificed his cultivation, Yuan immediately moved to help. However, he didn’t rush to pour spiritual energy into the Lord.","With his cultivation reduced to the 2nd level of Spirit Apprentice, the Lord could only absorb what his current realm could withstand. Anything beyond that would do more harm than good.","Instead, Yuan retrieved some of his blood and fed it to the Lord.","Almost instantly, the Lord’s complexion improved significantly. Color returned to his face as the chaotic flow of his body began to stabilize. His breathing, once shallow and erratic, grew steady and calm, as if a heavy weight had been lifted from his chest.","Seeing that the Lord’s condition had stabilized, Liya slowly turned her gaze toward Yuan.","The moment her eyes met his, they widened in astonishment.","He looked completely different—taller, sharper, more refined. But it wasn’t just his appearance. His aura... it was vast, boundless, and utterly unfathomable to her.","It was as if she were staring at a stranger wearing the face of someone she once knew—someone who had soared far beyond her reach.","\"A-Are you really Yuan...?\" she couldn’t help but mutter.","\"I know it’s been a few years since we last saw each other, but I can’t have changed that much, right?\"","\"Your face hasn’t changed much. I was talking about everything else. Your scent, aura—everything.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Where are the others?\"","\"Probably still training in the Nine Heavens. They rarely return to Earth these days,\" she said.","\"Then I’ll leave for now. I’ll come back once I get back into my real body.\"","Then, he soared through the sky and returned straight to his home, landing softly on the familiar balcony just moments later.","Stepping inside, a wave of warmth washed over him. There, in the quiet of the room, lay his physical body, resting peacefully beside Chu Liuxiang.","But to his surprise, Meixiu was there as well, resting on the same bed, her expression gentle and serene.","\"So, how does this work? Do I jump inside my own body or something?\" Yuan questioned out loud.","Yu Ning then said, \"Since your soul was separated using the Soul Transference Array, we’ll likely need to undo the formation first.\"","\"Do you think you can do it?\"","\"I can try, but I’ll need some time to analyze the formation first.\"","\"Go ahead. I’ll even lend you my body,\" said Yuan.","The next moment, Yu Ning took over Yuan’s soul avatar and began examining Yuan’s real body.","\"This formation is much more complicated than I’d anticipated,\" she muttered after a single glance at the formation.","Half an hour later, Yu Ning spoke, \"I think it’s doable. Fortunately, the Soul Transference Array wasn’t created to be unbreakable and is actually quite fragile. Once I remove the formation from your real body, your soul will likely automatically return to its body.\"","\"I’ll begin on your command.\"","\"I’m ready. You can begin whenever you’re ready.\"","\"Okay, then I will begin now.\"","Yu Ning, using Yuan’s avatar, began making array symbols in the air.","About ten minutes later, she combined the array symbols into a single array and sent it directly inside Yuan’s body.","\"It’s broken,\" she said.","The very next moment, Yuan’s vision went completely blank. Yet, despite the absence of sight, he could still feel. A strange, irresistible force had gripped him, pulling at his very essence. He felt his body being pulled, as though something unseen was trying to consume his very existence.","This sensation lasted for a few seconds before everything went still.","Eventually, Yuan opened his eyes and could see the ceiling right above him.","He sat up on the bed and looked down at his body.","It worked. He’d finally returned to his true body.","\"How do you feel?\" Yu Ning asked.","\"Weak,\" he replied.","After examining his body more closely, he realized that his cultivation was no longer at the peak of Immortal Ascension but his true body’s cultivation, which was still in the Spirit Realm. However, he could sense his cultivation slowly improving.","\"I’ll probably need some time before my body and soul are fully integrated again.\"","\"That’s normal, since your soul has been split into two parts for many years.\"","Suddenly—","[Celestial Emperor’s Curse has activated]","When the Celestial Emperor’s Curse activated, an excruciating pain tore through Yuan, not in flesh or bone, but from the depths of his soul.","It was a searing agony unlike anything he’d ever known, as if his very existence was being unraveled thread by thread.","[Your soul has been damaged]","Yuan realized what was happening even without looking at the notification.","The Celestial Emperor’s Curse was trying to destroy his soul."]},{"number":1986,"title":"Chapter 1986: Unbreakable Will","paragraphs":["\"Young Master! Are you okay?!\"","Yu Ning and the others exclaimed, their voices filled with horror.","\"The Celestial Emperor’s Curse is trying to destroy my soul...\"","\"What?! Then you should hurry up and destroy the curse using the Sacred Chalice of Purification!\" Feng Yuxiang urged.","However, Yuan shocked them by shaking his head and saying, \"No, this is exactly what I have been waiting for.\"","\"That doesn’t make any sense!\"","But Yuan didn’t respond and fell silent after entering cultivation.","This left the others flabbergasted. None of them could understand why Yuan was waiting for his soul to be attacked.","If Yuan’s soul hadn’t been fortified through his many reincarnations, the Celestial Emperor’s Curse would’ve instantly shattered his soul, killing him completely.","However, because his soul has existed since the Primordial Era and has been tempered for billions of years, not even the Celestial Emperor could easily destroy it.","Moreover, Yuan has been training Heaven’s Indomitable Soul for years now, which has strengthened his soul even more.","Yet, despite this, the Celestial Emperor’s Curse was relentless and extremely powerful—one of the most powerful curses in the Nine Heavens. The curse continued to gnaw at Yuan’s soul, causing him incredible pain, and no matter how powerful his soul was, it wasn’t indestructible, especially since he hadn’t even reached the God Ascension Realm.","Slow but surely, the Celestial Emperor’s Curse was destroying his soul.","Despite his soul on the verge of being destroyed, Yuan didn’t do anything to stop it, allowing it to happen.","His puzzling actions greatly worried his companions. A destroyed soul wasn’t the same as a destroyed body, and his regeneration ability had no effect on his soul, so if it were truly to be destroyed, he’d die for sure.","Meanwhile, in the Celestial Emperor’s Palace, the Celestial Emperor could sense the activation of his curse.","’So he managed to reunite his soul with his body, huh? However, as long as my curse is on you, you will not live long enough to return to the Nine Heavens!’","Almost half an hour has passed since Yuan began resisting the Celestial Emperor’s Curse.","\"It’s time,\" he muttered in a low voice.","The very next moment, Yuan stopped resisting the curse, allowing it to complete its assault on his soul.","His soul, which was already on the verge of destruction, began to crack, causing him to cough up several mouthfuls of blood.","\"Young Master! What are you doing?!\" Feng Yuxiang cried out loud.","However, Yuan was too focused to even hear her voice.","Then—","<Your soul has been destroyed>","Yuan’s body collapsed onto the bed, and his aura completely vanished.","\"YOUNG MASTER?!\"","Feng Yuxiang and the other emerged from his Dantian.","\"H-He’s dead!\" Feng Yuxiang couldn’t believe it.","Lan Yingying clenched her fists, unsure of what to say.","\"Calm down, you dumb pigeon.\"","A calm voice suddenly resounded.","\"This voice... Dragon Goddess Yeyou?\"","\"You should have been with him for long enough to know that he wouldn’t do something like this without a reason.\"","\"That’s...\" Feng Yuxiang fell silent.","Dragon Goddess Yeyou was right. Yuan wouldn’t do something as foolish as killing himself.","Just a they began to calm down, Yuan’s body suddenly became enveloped by a golden shimmer. It was faint at first, but it eventually became so intense that it illuminated the entire room.","<You have fulfilled the hidden requirement for Heaven’s Indomitable Soul>","<Heaven’s Indomitable Soul has evolved into Heaven’s Undying Soul>","<Heaven’s Undying Soul has begun to restore your destroyed soul>","<Your will has remained firm even in the face of the destruction of your very existence>","<You have attained ’Unbreakable Will’>","A few minutes later, Yuan slowly opened his eyes.","<Your soul has been restored>","\"Young Master!\" Feng Yuxiang cried tears of happiness after seeing he’d returned.","He showed them an apologetic smile and said, \"Sorry for not warning you ahead of time.\"","\"You really scared me there for a second!\"","\"What happened, anyway?\" Lan Yingying asked.","\"I’ll answer your questions later. Right now, I have to deal with the Celestial Emperor’s Curse.\"","Though he may have restored his soul, the Celestial Emperor’s Curse continued to haunt him and attempted to destroy his soul again.","Yuan retrieved the Sacred Chalice of Purification and fed his blood to it.","<Sacred Chalice of Purification has begun cleansing the curses that bind you>","Unlike the others, whose curses were almost instantly cleansed by the Sacred Chalice of Purification, the Celestial Emperor’s Curse clung stubbornly to Yuan’s soul.","However, no matter how powerful the Celestial Emperor’s Curse was, it was ultimately eliminated by the chalice.","\"Cough!\"","In the Celestial Emperor’s Palace, the Celestial Emperor coughed up a mouthful of blood when his curse was destroyed.","\"Your Majesty!\"","The people around him panicked when they saw this.","\"I’m fine!\" he roared.","He looked at his blood on the ground and clenched his fists in frustration, ’You’re even harder to kill than a damn cockroach! Why must you continue your pointless struggle? You will never defeat them!’","<Sacred Chalice of Purification has purified ’Celestial Emperor’s Curse’ on you>","<Sacred Chalice of Purification has begun to purify the other causes>","<Progress: 1%>","After purifying the Celestial Emperor’s Curse, the Sacred Chalice of Purification began purifying the other curses that afflicted Yuan. However, these curses were much more powerful than the Celestial Emperor’s Curse.","Yuan wasn’t surprised about these curses since he had been warned about them before. In essence, most of them were natural curses that had followed him from his previous lives.","Shortly after Yuan purified the Celestial Emperor’s Curse, the surrounding spiritual energy surged toward him like a flood, consumed by his body at a terrifying rate, even though he wasn’t actively cultivating.","With the curse lifted, the seal that had silently suppressed his potential was gone. His cultivation speed, once shackled, had returned to its natural state.","\"The Celestial Emperor is definitely aware of the situation. We need to return to the Nine Heavens as soon as possible,\" he said as he jumped off the bed.","Before leaving, he looked at Chu Liuxiang and Meixiu and mumbled, \"Let’s meet again in the Seventh Heaven.\""]},{"number":1987,"title":"Chapter 1987: Leaving Earth","paragraphs":["After leaving his home, Yuan immediately made his way back to the peak of the mountain.","\"Welcome back, Young Master.\" The Lord, who was unconscious when he left, had woken up.","\"How are you feeling?\" Yuan asked.","\"Thanks to your blood, my condition was able to stabilize. However, with my cultivation like this, I am no longer able to control the formation that protects this world. Fortunately, the spiritual energy from the Nine Heavens has temporarily solved this situation.\"","\"Temporarily... so we’re not completely out of trouble yet.\"","\"No, not yet. Since the gateway between our worlds won’t remain open forever, we’ll stop receiving more spiritual energy once it closes. The spiritual energy won’t last forever, either. I don’t know how long the spiritual energy we received will last, but it should last a good while,\" said the Lord.","\"That said, as long as both Dragon Spiral Mountains remain standing, we’ll be able to activate the teleportation device again in the future.\"","\"Who will be able to activate the teleportation device now that your cultivation is gone?\" Yuan asked.","Even if the Lord were to raise his cultivation again, it’d take far too long for him to return to his original cultivation.","Yuan glanced at Liya, who quickly said, \"Don’t look at me. My cultivation won’t be enough.\"","\"I’m sure we’ll think of something. Anyway, Young Master, you shouldn’t linger here for too long. The gateway will be closing soon,\" the Lord warned him.","He nodded and said, \"Before I leave...\"","He retrieved a bunch of vials, each filled to the brim with a crimson liquid.","\"This is my blood. I don’t know when I’ll be able to return to Earth, so I’ll leave for you.\"","\"There’s so much!\" The Lord almost couldn’t believe his eyes.","\"Then, until next—\"","\"Wait.\"","The Lord suddenly stopped him.","\"What is it?\"","\"Take Liya with you.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan’s eyes widened.","\"I’d like you to take her to the Nine Heavens.\"","\"I heard you, but...\"","He turned to look at Liya, who wore a perplexed expression on her face, which surprised him, as he thought she would immediately reject such an idea.","\"Don’t give me that look. You know we’ve already talked about this.\"","\"That was before you lost your cultivation! You still want me to leave you when you’re in this condition? I cannot—\"","\"My cultivation may have declined, but I will be fine.\"","\"Who will manage the Dragon Spiral Mountain?\"","\"It can manage itself.\"","\"Then who will protect you?\"","\"I can’t even remember the last time I was attacked. And even if someone is foolish enough to invade the mountain, the Young Master’s friends will still be here.\"","\"...\"","Liya fell silent when she couldn’t think of anything else to convince the Lord.","\"Go. You’re not fated to spend the rest of your life in this small world, wasting your potential. Young Master, please drag her to the Nine Heavens if you have to.\"","\"I’ll go...\" Liya suddenly spoke in a low voice.","\"There’s nothing I can do if you don’t want me here.\"","Without a word, Liya turned skyward and soared toward the rift, which was now visibly shrinking.","\"Are you certain about this?\" Yuan asked.","The Lord nodded and replied, \"Yes. She and I have spoken of this ever since we first discussed linking the Nine Heavens with Earth.\"","\"One last thing before you go... If the Red Heaven Dragon Clan still exists in the Nine Heavens, please bring her there. However, only if they are worthy of her.\"","Yuan nodded, \"The Red Heaven Dragon Clan, right? I’ll do my best.\"","\"Until next time, Young Master.\"","\"Until next time.\"","Yuan left the Dragon Spiral Mountain and chased after Liya, who was waiting for him in front of the rift.","\"Let’s go.\"","Liya turned her head to look at the Dragon Spiral Mountain one last time before following Yuan into the rift.","Meanwhile, in the Seventh Heaven, the battle between the Holy Dragon Clan, the Evil God’s Shadow Army, and Heaven’s Mandate neared its end.","Despite the Seventh Squad’s assistance, Heaven’s Mandate found themselves still on the losing end of the battle.","The Evil God’s Shadow Army was simply too overwhelming. Moreover, Dong Ye, who had been away, joined in on the battle.","\"Kill them! These damn dogs of the Celestial Emperor—kill them all!\" Dong Ye roared as he teleported from immortal to immortal with a powerful movement technique, killing them with a single strike.","\"Fucking Evil God’s army! You should’ve remained in the shadows where you’ve lurked for eras. But now that you’ve revealed yourselves, we will come for you with the full might of our wrath!\" General Wang roared.","\"Hahaha! I’d love to see you try!\" Dong Ye laughed.","Suddenly, as if responding to Dong Ye’s provocation, the heavens above Dragon Spiral Mountain quaked, and an unfathomable pressure descended, sweeping across the battlefield like the will of an ancient god, halting everyone’s movements.","\"This feeling... don’t tell me!\" As though he realized something, Dong Ye immediately warned the others, \"The Celestial Emperor is making a move! Withdraw!\"","Without hesitation, the Evil God’s Shadow Army stopped fighting and began scattering in every direction.","In the very next moment, a colossal rift tore through the sky, and from its depths emerged the tip of an immense sword, as if the heavens themselves were being pierced.","Realizing the situation, the Holy Dragon Emperor gritted his teeth in anger.","\"That technique... Are you really going that far, Celestial Emperor?!\"","\"Holy Dragon Clan, you should also withdraw if you don’t want to die to it! This isn’t something any of us can handle!\" Dong Ye warned them.","Yet, they remained on the battlefield, unwilling to leave.","\"The Dragon Spiral Mountain is our home. We will never abandon it, even if it means we die with it,\" the Dragon Emperor declared.","\"For Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\" The others shouted.","\"These stubborn fools!\"","Dong Ye turned his attention to Xi Meili before teleporting to her.","\"We’re leaving!\" he said to her.","\"What?! We can’t leave the Holy Dragon Clan alone!\" Xi Meili exclaimed.","\"They have decided to stay even if it means they’ll die, and I have no authority to stop them! However, you’re my liege’s comrade! I cannot let you die! Sorry, but I’ll take you away even if I have to use force!\"","Before Xi Meili could contest, Dong Ye grabbed her arm and teleported them away from the battlefield, leaving the Holy Dragon Clan and Heaven’s Mandate alone."]},{"number":1988,"title":"Chapter 1988: The Celestial Emperor’s Unstoppable Attack","paragraphs":["The moment the Celestial Emperor sensed his curse destroyed by Yuan, a resolute glint flashed in his eyes. Without hesitation, he raised his hand, drawing forth his Celestial Qi.","\"Your Majesty! What are you doing?! You can’t use such a powerful technique without any warning!\" A man bearing a unique white and gold robe hastily approached the Celestial Emperor and exclaimed after seeing this. \"The results will be catastrophic, and the Celestial Council will be all over this!\"","\"I am well aware,\" he calmly responded. \"However, I cannot let him return to the Nine Heavens. Even if I receive backlash for this, I am willing to bear the responsibility.\"","The man fell silent upon hearing the unwavering composure and clear finality in the Celestial Emperor’s tone. He was certain that unless someone forcefully stopped him, the Celestial Emperor had no intention of backing out.","However, the technique the Celestial Emperor was about to unleash would not just destroy the entire Dragon Spiral Mountain, it would cause irreversible damage in the Seventh Heaven!","’Once I reduce Dragon Spiral Mountain to nothingness, his path to the Nine Heavens will be severed. And if he is already making his return... then he will be cast adrift in the boundless void of the universe—no different from death itself,’ the Celestial Emperor mused inwardly.","Meanwhile, in the Seventh Heaven, the Heaven’s Mandate began backing away from the Dragon Spiral Mountain when they saw the slit in the sky.","\"T-The Celestial Emperor is going to personally intervene! Fall back!\" General Wang shouted before hastily creating a portal for them to escape to.","Witnessing this, the Holy Dragon Emperor paid them no further heed and turned back toward Dragon Spiral Mountain, where the lifeless bodies of thousands of his fallen clansmen lay.","The members of the Holy Dragon Clan who were still alive gathered around him.","\"I never imagined that our Holy Dragon Clan would perish in such a situation,\" sighed the Dragon Emperor.","He turned to look at the others and continued, \"I won’t blame you if you wish to leave.\"","\"There’s no way we will abandon you and the Dragon Spiral Mountain!\"","\"That’s right! We have spent our entire lives here, and we will spend our last moments here!\"","The members of the clan voiced their refusal to leave.","The Holy Dragon Emperor smiled and said, \"In that case, we might as well spend our last moments trying to protect our home.\"","He turned his gaze to the colossal sword in the sky, now descended more than halfway through the rift, its presence looming like a divine judgment.","\"That is the Celestial Emperor’s ’Divine Judgment’, right? Despite being in this world for over a million years, this is actually my first time seeing it,\" one of the elders remarked.","\"The ultimate execution technique, powerful enough to kill even a 9th-level God Ascension cultivator with ease...\"","\"This will sound weird, but it feels like an honor to die to such a magnificent technique...\"","Once the Holy Dragon Clan had mentally prepared themselves, they charged toward the sky in preparation to fight against the Divine Judgment.","Meanwhile, countless eyes across the Seventh Heaven—and even those gazing down from the Eighth and Ninth Heaven—watched the unfolding scene in stunned silence. The earlier battle had already stirred the realms, but none had foreseen that the Celestial Emperor himself would take action.","\"What did the Holy Dragon Clan do to incite the Celestial Emperor’s wrath?\"","\"Who were those individuals in black? They appeared out of the blue and nearly defeated the invincible Heaven’s Mandate!\"","These people were full of questions and speculations.","Meanwhile, the other Royal Dragon Clans had already mobilized, dispatching emissaries to the Celestial Emperor’s Palace with urgent demands to cease his assault on the Holy Dragon Clan.","Unsurprisingly, the Celestial Emperor had sealed the doors to his palace and completely ignored their demands.","This enraged the Royal Dragon Clans, yet they were powerless to prevent the Celestial Emperor from obliterating Dragon Spiral Mountain. All they could do was bide their time and prepare to seek retribution once the deed was done.","At last, the Celestial Emperor completed the technique and, with unwavering authority, swept his arm downward. In that instant, the sword hanging in the heavens surged with power and plunged forth, its descent no longer gradual but swift and absolute.","The sheer pressure radiating from the sword was so overwhelming that all cultivators below the God Ascension Realm from the Holy Dragon Clan plummeted from the sky like helpless flies. Even the Dragon Spiral Mountain began to sink into the waters beneath it, crushed by the weight of its descent alone.","\"This is really too much...\" The Holy Dragon Emperor muttered as he struggled to stay in the air, much less fight it.","\"Those strong enough to withstand the pressure unleashed their most formidable techniques upon the descending sword, shaking the heavens and earth with their onslaught. Yet their efforts were in vain. The blade remained unscathed, as if they were hurling raw eggs against an immovable mountain.","The Holy Dragon Emperor suddenly charged toward it, his form erupting into that of a colossal silver dragon. With a thunderous roar, he lunged at the descending sword and sank his fangs into it, desperate to halt—or at least slow—its relentless fall.","The others followed suit, but alas, their efforts were futile against the Celestial Emperor’s overwhelming prowess.","\"Haaa...\"","Just as the sword was about to bring ruin upon Dragon Spiral Mountain, a faint sigh echoed through the heavens, soft yet boundless.","Then, the space just above the peak of the Dragon Spiral Mountain warped and twisted, and like a ghost drawn from the void, a solitary figure draped in black robes and a face veil appeared out of thin air.","This figure exuded an unfathomable presence far beyond the Holy Dragon Emperor, and just their presence alone was enough to slow down the descending sword.","\"This presence... it can’t be!\"","Gasps of shock rippled through the spectators as they beheld the sudden arrival of a figure who had reached the pinnacle of cultivation—the appearance of a Cultivation God."]},{"number":1989,"title":"Chapter 1989: The Appearance of a Cultivation God","paragraphs":["Chapter 1989: The Appearance of a Cultivation God","“A Cultivation God has appeared!”","“What?! Impossible! Why would a Cultivation God intervene, especially when the Celestial Emperor is involved?”","“Are we sure they are a Cultivation God? There are only a handful of them in the entire Nine Heavens, and I recognize everyone but this individual.”","“That presence... that aura... There’s no doubt about it. This individual is a Cultivation God.”","“Are you saying this is not just the appearance of a Cultivation God but the appearance of a new one?”","The spectators’ astonishment deepened as realization struck—this was an unfamiliar Cultivation God, one whose presence had never graced the public eye. Cultivation Gods were figures of renown, their names etched into the annals of history. For such a being to appear unrecognized could mean only two things: they had either remained hidden in the shadows for an unknown amount of time, or they had just recently reached the pinnacle of cultivation.","“Their appearance may be new, but that unfathomable aura... It’s much stronger than that one Cultivation God I saw a few years ago, so they must’ve been a Cultivation God for quite some time now.”","As the spectators racked their brains trying to figure out the Cultivation God’s identity, the Celestial Emperor wore a deep frown on his face when he realized that someone was trying to stop his Divine Judgment. In the entire Nine Heavens, only Cultivation Gods could possibly defy him, a fellow Cultivation God.","“Who are you, and why are you interfering with my work?” the Celestial Emperor spoke, his voice booming through the realms and resounding before the Cultivation God.","A slight smile tugged at the lips behind the veil, but the Cultivation God did not respond to the Celestial Emperor.","The Cultivation God raised their hand and pointed toward the colossal sword in the sky, revealing a pair of fair, jade-like hands, smooth, unblemished, and adorned with slender fingers. The graceful motion, coupled with the subtle rise of her chest beneath the robes, left little doubt that this mysterious figure was a woman.","“This new Cultivation God is definitely a woman! Looks like we will have more than one female Cultivation God now.”","With this new revelation, the spectators began narrowing down the possible identities of the mysterious Cultivation God. Their minds raced through the annals of history, recalling every female cultivator who had ascended to the peak of the God Ascension Realm within the last few million years.","“It’s hard to tell with her robes, but her figure resembles the Fairy Sword Empress.”","“No, the Fairy Sword Empress is a little shorter.”","“Why are we even using appearance details to figure out their identity? If this individual is trying to hide their identity, it’s very likely that they’re also disguised. She could be a he for all we know.”","The very next moment, the sword began being pushed toward the sky, its pressure on the Dragon Spiral Mountain weakening.","“Heavens! This Cultivation God is firm on defying the Celestial Emperor!”","While the other Cultivation Gods aren’t all on friendly terms with the Celestial Emperor, none of them have shown such obvious defiance, either. After all, nothing good comes out of offending the most influential individual in their world.","Seeing the Cultivation God’s defiance, the Celestial Emperor no longer went easy. He was aware that his actions were being spectated by powerhouses all over the Nine Heavens. If he were to lose to some unknown Cultivation God, he’d lose an immense amount of face.","The Divine Judgment began descending again with even more pressure.","“...”","Confirming that the Celestial Emperor had no intention of backing out, the Cultivation God also began pushing back seriously.","The clash between the Celestial Emperor and the mysterious Cultivation God unleashed shockwaves that tore through the Seventh Heaven, their force so great they stirred tsunamis that reached the heavens in the surrounding seas.","As for Dragon Spiral Mountain—positioned directly beneath their titanic clash—it continued to sink beneath the mounting pressure, with more than half of its once-majestic peak now swallowed by the surrounding waters.","Though countless eyes bore witness to the unfolding battle, none dared to intervene—not even those from Heaven’s Mandate. When Cultivation Gods clashed, the heavens themselves held their breath. No one below their realm could hope to endure such a storm; only another Cultivation God could survive, let alone stand a chance of interfering.","Of course, among the spectators were other Cultivation Gods. Yet their attention was not on the battle itself, but on the newcomer—an unknown deity whose sudden emergence stirred more curiosity.","“Your Majesty! The Celestial Council has arrived outside the palace, and they are demanding that you halt your actions!” someone suddenly said.","Yet, rather than relent, the Celestial Emperor surged with even greater power.","BOOM!","Follow new episodes on the \"N0vel1st.c0m\".","The Divine Judgment pulsed with such overwhelming force that fractures began to web across its radiant surface. The Cultivation God was instantly driven back, her figure forced to retreat beneath the sheer weight of the blow.","Despite being forced back, the Cultivation God smiled, her voice calm yet laced with an imperious edge as she spoke, “So this is the power of this era’s Celestial Emperor? You’re scarcely an improvement over your predecessors—perhaps even their lesser.”","The spectators gasped in disbelief at the Cultivation God’s brazen mockery—words so audacious that even other Cultivation Gods would not dare think of them.","“...”","Upon hearing those words, the Celestial Emperor, who had never felt such anger since ascending to his throne, began to tremble, his long-held composure finally fracturing.","“This son of...”","Having his most sensitive weakness poked, the Celestial Emperor instinctively unleashed an even greater surge of power, his fury fueling a force beyond restraint.","“Is the Celestial Emperor trying to bring ruin to the Seventh Heaven?!”","The spectators, once watching with idle fascination, now found their amusement replaced by growing unease and fear.","“Hmph. Your temper is as feeble as your strength.”","The Cultivation God sneered coldly, flicking her sleeve with effortless disdain.","In the very next instant, the colossal sword—its surface already veined with fractures—shattered into countless shards, cascading down upon the Sea of Dragons like a merciless rain of divine blades."]},{"number":1990,"title":"Chapter 1990: Returning to the Nine Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 1990: Returning to the Nine Heavens","“Th-The Cultivation God did it! She stopped the Celestial Emperor’s attack!”","A collective gasp swept through the spectators as they drew in a sharp breath, stunned by the unforeseen turn of events.","The moment the Divine Judgment shattered, the Celestial Emperor recoiled as if struck across the face, a searing pain radiating from it. He staggered, blood spilling from his lips, marking the second time in a single day that he had been wounded, a humiliation nearly as deep as the injury itself.","However, the Celestial Emperor swiftly regained his footing and began summoning his Celestial Qi once more—this time with even greater ferocity, his aura surging like a rising tempest that swept throughout the palace.","“Your Majesty!”","His subordinates cried out in alarm, their voices trembling with fear. Yet not one of them dared to intervene, paralyzed by the consequences of doing so.","Once again, the skies above Dragon Spiral Mountain quaked, and multiple rifts tore open in unison, splitting the heavens like wounds in the firmament.","The Cultivation God looked toward the heavens and smiled. “At least your stubbornness rivals your predecessors.”","“T-The Celestial Emperor is really going to destroy the Seventh Heaven at this rate!”","The spectators cried out loud, and some of them began preparing to escape to the other realms.","At this moment, several figures appeared around the Celestial Emperor like ghosts, and their voices rang out in unison, sharp and resolute, “Your Majesty, that is enough of your farce! If you refuse to stand down, do not blame us for taking action!”","“Farce?” The Celestial Emperor turned to face them, his gaze icy and sharp. “Do you truly believe I am acting out of amusement?”","Yet, despite the weight of his glare, the members of the Celestial Council stood firm, their expressions calm and unshaken.","“Not only did you unleash overwhelming force without warning, but you even struck at the Holy Dragon Clan! The Royal Dragon Clans have been raising hell at our gates since the moment this began! Are you truly trying to provoke war with one of the most powerful beast bloodlines in all the Nine Heavens?!” they exclaimed.","“War...?” The Celestial Emperor suddenly burst into laughter, his voice echoing with scorn and fury. “Because of your meddling and that Cultivation God’s interference, the Nine Heavens are now on the brink of a war far greater than anything you can possibly imagine!”","The Celestial Council fell into silence, though none among them seemed particularly alarmed.","“If such a war truly comes, we will face it then,” one of them said calmly. “For now, our priority lies with the rising tensions with the Royal Dragon Clans. A conference has already been arranged—you must attend and make every effort to ease the storm before it breaks. Rumor has it the Great One just emerged from his seclusion, too.”","“...”","Now, it was the Celestial Emperor’s turn to fall silent. The Ten Royal Dragon Clans were of little concern to him, but the Great One was another matter entirely. That being alone could unleash more devastation than all ten clans combined.","In time, the Celestial Emperor withdrew his aura, and the rifts torn across the skies above Dragon Spiral Mountain slowly began to mend. As the heavens healed, a hush fell over the land, and the turbulent waters gradually returned to calm.","However, the Celestial Emperor had not forgotten the Cultivation God. Fixing his gaze upon her that pierced through the realms, he spoke with cold menace, “I do not know who you are, but now that you’ve revealed yourself and declared your opposition, I will hunt you down like a rabbit in the wild.”","The Cultivation God offered no reply—only a bold, silent smile that spoke louder than words. Before departing, she cast a final glance toward the closing portal linking the Seventh Heaven and Earth, her gaze unreadable yet profound.","Elsewhere in the Seventh Heaven, Dong Ye stood in silence, his expression grave after witnessing it all.","“So... she’s finally made her move,” he murmured, a flicker of unease in his eyes.","“What happened to the Holy Dragon Clan and the Dragon Spiral Mountain?!” Xi Meili asked him, her face full of worry.","Dong Ye faced her and explained, “They are safe. A Cultivation God intervened and stopped the Celestial Emperor.”","“A Cultivation God?! Why would someone like that defy the Celestial Emperor?! Oh! Could it be the Dragon Ancestor?!”","“Uh... no, this Cultivation God is a human.”","“Is that so... Anyway, does this mean you can take me back to the Holy Dragon Clan?”","Dong Ye nodded and said, “I can take you back, but we should wait a little longer to make sure it has truly ended.”","Follow new episodes on the \"N0vel1st.c0m\".","“What about Yuan?”","“I can sense two presences within that portal, so he should be returning soon.”","“Two?” Xi Meili raised an eyebrow and wondered who that other individual could be.","Sure enough, just a few hours after the battle had ended, Yuan and Liya stepped through the portal, arriving moments before it sealed shut behind them.","Liya’s eyes widened in awe as she took in her surroundings. The spiritual energy in the air was so dense, so pure, that even her ordinary breaths caused her cultivation to surge. It was unlike anything she had ever encountered.","“Welcome to the Nine Heavens,” Yuan said with a gentle smile, watching her wide-eyed wonder, reminiscent of a child discovering the existence of sweets for the very first time.","Noticing his looks, Liya frowned, her tone sharp with indignation. “Don’t you dare treat me like some country bumpkin.”","However, Yuan remained silent, his smile fading as his expression hardened into a deep, solemn frown.","“What’s wrong?” she asked.","“I knew activating the teleportation device would invite trouble,” Yuan murmured, his gaze heavy as it fell upon Dragon Spiral Mountain. “But never did I imagine it would escalate to this extent.”","Though the mountain still stood, its once-majestic form bore the scars of devastation—broken, battered, yet barely enduring.","“Let’s go.”","Without another word, Yuan descended toward the mountain, his figure cutting silently through the air. Liya followed close behind."]},{"number":1991,"title":"Chapter 1991: Mysterious Cultivation God","paragraphs":["As Yuan landed upon Dragon Spiral Mountain, a wave of shock and sorrow washed over him. The mountain was littered with thousands of corpses, many of whom were from the Holy Dragon Clan. The rest belonged to human cultivators wearing full armor.","\"Heaven’s Mandate...\"","Despite this being his first time encountering them, he instantly recognized them purely from their armor and its unique patterns. After all, he’d had plenty of encounters with them in his previous lives.","\"Did a war happen here or something? These corpses look fresh, so it happened only recently.\" Liya remarked as she hovered slightly above the ground, not wanting to touch the corpses.","\"It was likely the Celestial Emperor’s doing. He attacked this place in an attempt to prevent me from returning to the Nine Heavens. Clearly, it didn’t work out for him.\"","\"The Celestial Emperor? Isn’t that the guy who sits above everyone in the Nine Heavens? The ruler of the Nine Heavens.\"","Though she was born on Earth, the Lord occasionally taught her about the Nine Heavens.","\"That’s right,\" he confirmed.","\"I’m impressed. How did you end up having beef with the most powerful individual in the Nine Heavens? That’s akin to offending the Lord on Earth,\" she remarked.","A bittersweet smile appeared on Yuan’s face as he said, \"It’s complicated. Although I have never seen or met this Celestial Emperor, he clearly has a problem with me. Or should I say the ’past’ me?\"","\"Is that so?\" Liya muttered.","Yuan used his divine sense to find the Dragon Emperor and went to find him.","Some time later, Yuan found the Dragon Emperor amidst the wreckage, quietly assisting in the search for fallen members of the clan.","\"Dragon Emperor!\"","The Dragon Emperor, so absorbed in his search that he hadn’t even noticed Yuan’s return, looked at him with relief in his tired gaze.","\"You made it back safely, Senior.\"","Though he maintained a calm exterior, the Dragon Emperor’s appearance told another story. His once-majestic robes were torn and stained with blood, and his breath was also somewhat weak.","While he had sustained minor injuries during his clash with General Wang, it was his attempt to block the Divine Judgment that had exacted the greatest toll, wounding not just his body, but his very soul.","\"Can you tell me what happened while I was gone? I know the Heaven’s Mandate showed up from their corpses.\"","The Dragon Emperor gave a solemn nod before recounting everything to Yuan, from the moment of his departure to the unexpected arrival of an unknown Cultivation God who had descended to defy the Celestial Emperor and save the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","While Yuan wasn’t particularly surprised to learn that the Evil God’s army had appeared, he was surprised to hear that the Celestial Emperor had personally intervened and that a mysterious Cultivation God had descended to protect them.","\"Who was this Cultivation God?\" he asked.","The Holy Dragon Emperor shook his head.","\"I don’t know. They were wearing a face veil that blocked their face. However, she had the figure of a woman. Of course, I cannot tell you if that’s their real appearance or just a disguise.\"","\"A woman wearing a face veil...\"","Yuan wondered if he had known any Cultivation Gods in the past, at least among the memories he had recovered so far. Yet, none came to mind. After all, Cultivation Gods were virtually nonexistent in those ancient days, and his memories were still returning piece by piece with each passing day.","The only Cultivation God Yuan knew was Dragon Goddess Yeyou, the Dragon Ancestor, and the Great One. Even Zi Xuan had only reached the 9th level of God Ascension. However, Dragon Goddess Yeyou was with him during the invasion, and the Great One wouldn’t do something like hide his identity.","’Could it be the Dragon Ancestor? No... he wouldn’t show up disguised as a woman, either. Maybe it was one of the Nine Divine Supremes? But they wouldn’t disappear immediately afterward. Maybe Dong Ye knows something. I’ll ask him later.’","In the end, Yuan couldn’t recall anyone who matched the description, leading him to wonder if the mysterious figure was someone from a part of his past he had yet to remember. After all, he’d only recovered most of the Evil God, Divine Paragon, Immortal Monarch, and Exalted Blacksmith’s memories.","\"By the way, where’s Xi Meili?\" Yuan asked when he couldn’t see her around.","\"You see...\" The Holy Dragon Emperor began to sweat the moment Xi Meili’s name was brought up. \"I told her to stay out of the battle, but... apparently, she ignored that and joined the fight anyway. She disappeared somewhere amidst the chaos. I haven’t seen her body, so... she’s likely still alive.\"","Yuan frowned upon hearing this, but if they didn’t find her body, she was most likely alive.","’Since the Evil God’s Shadow Army showed up, they likely took her away to protect her.’","Sure enough, just as he thought that, a familiar voice rang inside his head.","\"My liege, please don’t worry about Lady Xi. She’s currently with me. Though she’d suffered some injuries, they’re not life-threatening.\"","Dong Ye notified him.","\"Dong Ye? Where are you right now?\" he asked.","\"I am currently in hiding with the rest of the Shadow Army. Since we made an appearance with the Celestial Emperor watching, we’re likely going to be hunted for a while. By the way, you should leave the Dragon Spiral Mountain as soon as possible while the Celestial Emperor is distracted. I just received the information that he’s occupied with the Celestial Council and the Ten Royal Dragon Clans.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"I’ll leave soon. Let Xi Meili know that I have returned, and keep her safe for the time being. Let’s meet once things have calmed down.\"","\"As you command.\"","After his brief conversation with Dong Ye, Yuan said to the Holy Dragon Emperor, \"I really don’t know how to thank the Holy Dragon Clan for their sacrifice. If there’s anything you need, don’t hesitate to let me know.\""]},{"number":1992,"title":"Chapter 1992: Departing From the Dragon Spiral Mountain","paragraphs":["\"Please, don’t call it a sacrifice. We were merely defending our territory—our home,\" the Holy Dragon Emperor said solemnly.","Yuan’s expression turned awkward, guilt flickering in his eyes.","\"Even so... it’s a fact that the Celestial Emperor attacked because I activated the teleportation device. You wouldn’t have needed to do such a thing if I didn’t show up.\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor shook his head and said, \"Your appearance here, as well as the teleportation device’s activation, is Dragon Goddess Yeyou’s will, and as the Holy Dragon Clan, it’s our duty to fulfill her will, regardless of its cost. I allowed anyone who didn’t want to die a chance to leave, but nobody took the offer. That’s all I have to say on this matter.\"","Yuan fell silent to ponder.","Eventually, he said, \"Can you gather every member of the Holy Dragon Clan for me as soon as possible?\"","\"What are you trying to do?\" The Holy Dragon Emperor raised his eyebrows.","\"You’ll find out soon.\"","The Holy Dragon Emperor no longer questioned it and followed his instructions.","Shortly after, the remaining members of the Holy Dragon Clan—now reduced to a mere quarter of their former number—gathered before Yuan in solemn silence.","\"Thank you for gathering here on such short notice, and while you’re busy. However, I want to do something for you before I leave,\" said Yuan before retrieving the Dragon God’s Vengeance.","\"Yeyou, can you say something to them? If it weren’t for their efforts, I wouldn’t have been able to return to the Nine Heavens peacefully,\" he said to it.","\"D-Did he just...?\"","\"Yeah... I heard it...\"","Besides the Holy Dragon Emperor and some of their top members, nobody knew about Yuan being the Immortal Monarch or that Dragon Goddess Yeyou was resting inside the Dragon God’s Vengeance.","\"Haaa...\"","A soft sigh resounded from the spear before it emitted a profound glow.","In the very next moment, Dragon Goddess Yeyou appeared before them in her human form.","\"T-That’s—!\"","Even without needing her to introduce herself, the members of the Holy Dragon Clan immediately knew her identity.","Realizing that they were before the one and only Dragon Goddess Yeyou, everyone there kowtowed before her.","\"Our God—Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\" They all chanted in unison.","\"Ahem.\" Dragon Goddess Yeyou cleared her throat and began to speak in a somewhat stiff tone, \"My name is Yeyou, and I would like to express my gratitude to the Holy Dragon Clan for everything you’ve done so far, especially for today. Thank you. Though I can only express my gratitude with words right now, once I regain my body, I’ll return to give you a proper thank you.\"","\"For Dragon Goddess Yeyou!\" they cried, voices trembling as tears streamed down their faces.","Unless one had devoted their entire life to a single deity, they could never truly comprehend the depth of emotion surging through the Holy Dragon Clan as they stood before Dragon Goddess Yeyou—their one and only god, the eternal flame of their faith.","Dragon Goddess Yeyou spoke no further, choosing to keep her presence brief and solemn. With a single nod of approval, she returned to the Dragon God’s Vengeance. Yet, what she said was already more than enough to ensure the Holy Dragon Clan continued to worship her, perhaps even more intensely than before.","\"Though it pains me to leave you like this after all that has happened, remaining here any longer will only risk drawing the Celestial Emperor’s attention once more,\" Yuan said solemnly. \"So, I’ll be taking my leave for now. But if fate permits, I promise I’ll return to this place again. Of course, I’ll bring Dragon Goddess Yeyou with me.\"","\"We’ll await your return no matter how long it takes, Senior Envoy!\"","Yuan smiled, then turned to meet the gaze of the Holy Dragon Emperor, who responded with a silent nod of acknowledgment.","\"Until next time,\" Yuan said quietly.","And with that, he departed from Dragon Spiral Mountain with Liya quietly following behind.","\"Where are you going to go, Young Master?\" Feng Yuxiang asked shortly after Yuan left.","After a moment of silence, Yuan responded, \"I’m going to meet the others.\"","Meanwhile, in a grand hall deep within the Ninth Heaven, the Celestial Emperor and the Celestial Council sat in solemn audience before representatives of eight of the Ten Royal Dragon Clans.","The only ones who weren’t present were the Holy Dragon Clan and the Azure Dragon Clan. Despite the recent incident, the Mystic Sea Dragon Clan still made an appearance.","\"You’d best have a damn good explanation, Celestial Emperor!\" one of the representatives snapped, slamming the table with a force that echoed through the hall.","\"You didn’t just trespass into the territory of one of the Ten Royal Dragon Clans—you launched a full assault, one that claimed thousands of lives!\" another representative roared, his voice laced with outrage.","\"And not only that,\" a third representative added sharply, \"you attempted to annihilate their entire bloodline with Divine Judgment—a power reserved solely for condemning the most heinous of criminals on death row!\"","The Celestial Emperor sat beneath a storm of accusations and complaints, the voices of the Ten Royal Dragon Clans rising in fury around him, while the Celestial Council observed in heavy silence, neither defending nor intervening.","\"I did what had to be done. I hope for your understanding,\" the Celestial Emperor finally said, his voice calm and measured, as if the barrage of accusations had done little more than stir the air around him.","\"Don’t give us that nonsense! There were countless ways to handle the situation without endangering the Holy Dragon Clan—yet you chose the most brutal and direct path!\" One of them refuted.","\"Perhaps so,\" he replied calmly, \"but I was racing against time and did not have the luxury to do things gently.\"","\"I gave the Holy Dragon Clan fair warning, yet they refused to yield. I was left with no other choice. It is regrettable, but I acted as I must to protect the Nine Heavens, which is my top priority as the Celestial Emperor. I understand your anger, but if I could rewind time and redo it, I wouldn’t have done it any differently.\""]},{"number":1993,"title":"Chapter 1993: Ten Royal Dragon Clans","paragraphs":["Chapter 1993: Ten Royal Dragon Clans","“The audacity!” one of the representatives shouted, his voice trembling with fury. “Do you truly wish to wage war against the Ten Royal Dragon Clans, Celestial Emperor?!”","The Celestial Council, frowning at the escalating tension, finally stepped in.","“Let us all take a moment to calm ourselves,” one of the council members said firmly. “If the Ten Royal Dragon Clans were to truly wage war against His Majesty, the Celestial Emperor, it would result in countless deaths and destruction across the Nine Heavens.”","“All this... for the Holy Dragon Clan?” another said. “Let’s be honest. While they may hold a seat among the Ten Royal Dragon Clans, they spend most of their existence secluded within Dragon Spiral Mountain, and they’ve done little to justify that title.”","“Moreover, their bloodline only rose to the top three because of the blessing from Dragon Goddess Yeyou, one of the Three Dragons of Origin. Your clans, on the other hand, were born with that level of purity. Can their so-called ‘royal’ bloodline truly be considered authentic?”","“...”","An uneasy silence fell over the Royal Dragon Clans as the Celestial Council cast doubt on the authenticity of the Holy Dragon Clan’s bloodline, a heavily debated subject in the past.","Since the Holy Dragon Clan had not been born with an Imperial-grade bloodline, but rather received it through the blessing of Dragon Goddess Yeyou, the Royal Dragon Clans of the time fiercely debated whether they should be granted a seat among their ranks.","In the end, they chose to accept the Holy Dragon Clan—not out of consensus, but out of caution. To reject the clan would have been tantamount to rejecting Dragon Goddess Yeyou herself, a risk none were willing to take.","However, since their acceptance into the ranks of the Royal Dragon Clans, the Holy Dragon Clan had contributed little, if anything, to the collective. Reclusive and self-focused, they remained within the confines of Dragon Spiral Mountain, showing little interest in the affairs of the other clans.","The Celestial Council smiled inwardly after seeing the Royal Dragon Clan’s reaction.","“And just so you’re aware,” the Celestial Emperor said suddenly, his tone calm but edged with warning, “a war against us would not pit you against my forces alone but against the Royal Phoenix Clans as well.”","The representatives’ expressions darkened at once, frowns forming as the weight of those words sank in.","“You... are you threatening us with the Royal Phoenix Clans?”","“No,” the Celestial Emperor replied, his tone as calm as still water. “I’m merely informing you so that you may choose wisely.”","Before the Royal Dragon Clans could respond, the Celestial Emperor rose to his feet and spoke coldly:","“If all you intend to do here is bicker over this matter, then I’ll take my leave. I’ve already given my explanation—whether you accept it or not is irrelevant to me. I have more important matters to attend to.”","“Celestial Emperor—!”","Angry voices rang out behind him, but the Celestial Emperor paid them no mind, departing without so much as a glance back.","His abrupt exit left the Celestial Council in an awkward position. After all, they had aided him by sowing doubt among the Royal Dragon Clans, yet he had discarded that advantage without hesitation.","Though the Celestial Emperor had departed, the Celestial Council remained behind to continue the negotiations with the Royal Dragon Clans, stretching on for many hours.","After his departure, the Celestial Emperor did not return to the Celestial Palace. Instead, he journeyed to his personal realm. There, a mysterious device displayed a projection of an unknown location within the vast starry void. Within that projection, several indistinct entities could be seen, their forms dormant... yet far from lifeless.","“Unlike my predecessors... I will not fail you,” he murmured, a resolute flame burning in his eyes, unwavering and fierce.","Meanwhile, somewhere in the Seventh Heaven, Kelan gathered Meixiu and the others after learning about what happened at the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","“Alright, listen up. I don’t know what kind of trouble your friend, Yuan, has gotten himself into, but there was a huge war between Heaven’s Madate and the Holy Dragon Clan that dwells there.”","“Heaven’s Mandate? What’s that?” Wang Ming asked.","“They’re the Celestial Emperor’s private army.”","“The Celestial Emperor?!”","“That’s right. If I recall correctly, Yuan said something about heading to the Dragon Spiral Mountain, right? Though he was not present, there’s no way this is a coincidence.”","“Let me log off real quick and see if Yuan has returned to Earth!” Chu Liuxiang suddenly said.","“I’m going too,” said Meixiu.","They logged off at the same time.","After logging off, Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang removed the device and turned to look beside them. However, Yuan’s body, which should’ve been there, was gone.","“H-He’s gone!” Chu Liuxiang exclaimed.","“I’m going to speak with the Lord. You go back and inform the others,” Meixiu said as she swiftly rose from the bed. Without another word, she stepped onto the balcony and took flight, soaring straight toward the mountain’s peak.","Chu Liuxiang immediately returned to Cultivation Online and explained the situation to the others.","“What? Yuan’s body is gone? So he’s back on Earth?” Shi Lang said.","“Most likely, but I couldn’t sense his presence anywhere,” Chu Liuxiang responded.","“Surely, he didn’t leave Earth without a word, right?” Wang Ming said.","“Maybe he was tight on time and had to leave immediately,” Wang Bingbing commented.","“That’s probably what happened.”","While the group speculated on the situation, Meixiu met with the Lord.","“Yes, he came back.” The Lord spoke before Meixiu even got the chance to open her mouth.","“Where is he now?”","“He’s already returned to the Nine Heavens. The gateway would only stay open for so long, so he had to leave as soon as possible.”","“I see... It’s a pity that we missed him, but at least we’ll see him soon in the Seventh Heaven. By the way, your cultivation...”","“I sacrificed it to open the portal.”","“That’s...” Meixiu was speechless.","“You don’t have to worry about me. I’ll be fine. However, things might get rowdy here soon.”","“What do you mean?” Meixiu raised an eyebrow.","Join Privilege for 50 Adv Chapters! Only Available in the App!"]},{"number":1994,"title":"Chapter 1994: Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1994: Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect","“You weren’t there to see it, but it was quite the spectacle. I’m sure governments worldwide are making their way to the Dragon Spiral Mountain as we speak to investigate,” the Lord explained.","“I see... where’s Miss Liya? I’m sure she’ll handle it.”","The Lord showed a bittersweet smile and revealed, “Liya followed Yuan back to the Nine Heavens. She’s no longer with us.”","“What?!” Meixiu’s eyes widened after learning this.","“Then what should we do?” she then asked.","“Nothing,” the Lord calmly responded. “The Dragon Spiral Mountain is a unique place. They cannot enter it without my permission. Even if they do, the mountain has multiple powerful formations that can kill even Immortals. That said, I lack the spiritual energy to activate them, so I’ll be needing your help when that time comes.”","Meixiu nodded.","Some time later, she returned to Cultivation Online and relayed what the Lord told her.","“What? The manager followed Yuan to the Nine Heavens?”","The others were greatly shocked by this news since it was the last thing they expected to hear... no, they didn’t even think Liya was capable of leaving Earth and the Lord.","“Did the Lord say anything about Yuan’s next plans?” Chu Liuxiang asked.","Meixiu shook her head.","“Is that so...”","“I highly doubt he’ll be coming here anytime soon, despite already reaching the Seventh Heaven, especially when he’s got the Celestial Emperor’s attention,” remarked Kelan.","“I’m fine just knowing that he’s reunited with his body and has returned to the Nine Heavens. We’ll meet eventually,” said Li Jinxi.","“That’s right. It’s not like he’s forgotten about us or anything. Let’s continue our training so we can surprise him the next time we meet!” Wang Ming said.","Just under a year later, Yuan and Liya finally left the vast Sea of Dragons and set foot on land once more.","“I can’t believe how massive this world is. How do normal people travel?” Liya asked, feeling slightly overwhelmed by the sheer size of the Nine Heavens.","“Teleportation formations,” said Yuan.","“I’m talking about ordinary people—mortals. I doubt they can afford to use them.”","“Oh, if you’re talking about mortals, the majority of them tend to stay within their birthplace and rarely travel.”","The Nine Heavens was simply too vast for ordinary people, most of whom couldn’t afford the thousands of spirit stones required to use teleportation devices. As a result, they only traveled short distances, while long journeys were a luxury reserved for wealthy families and influential merchants.","After arriving at the teleportation device, Yuan gave his destination to the operator.","“I’d like to travel to the Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect or whatever is closest.”","Liya raised her eyebrows at such a terrible name for a sect.","“Since they have a teleportation device right in front of their sect, I can bring you to their entrance. That will cost 50,000 spirit stones per person. If you want a cheaper option, there’s a city—”","Without hesitation, Yuan handed 100,000 spirit stones to the operator before he could even finish his sentence.","“I’ll prepare the teleportation device right now.”","A few moments later, Yuan and Liya stepped through the teleportation device, disappearing from the city and emerging several million miles away.","Upon exiting the portal, they found themselves a few dozen meters from a colossal steel gate, nestled between two towering mountains. Yet, these were no ordinary peaks. Their surfaces were not carved from stone, but forged from solid metal. And if one looked closely, the contours and ridges suggested they had been shaped not by nature, but by the force of bare hands. Moreover, the name of the sect, Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect, was not simply carved, but engraved into the metal through one’s fist.","Yuan calmly ignored the peculiar name and made his way toward the gate, where a tall, muscular man stood guard.","“Welcome to the Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect. What business do you have with us today?” the disciple asked.","Yuan showed the disciple his Celestial Overlord symbol and said, “I’m here to speak with Kelan.”","“I understand. Give me a moment to contact the Sect Leader. By the way, can I have your name?”","“Xiao Yang.”","The disciple retrieved a communication jade slip and relayed a message to a sect elder, who in turn reached out to Kelan.","A few minutes later, Yuan could sense a powerful presence flying in their direction with immense speed.","Boom!","This individual landed right in front of the gates.","“This disciple greets the Sect Leader!”","However, Kelan didn’t appear too welcoming.","With a frown on his face, he spoke to Yuan using voice transmission, “Are you insane? Why would you come straight here after what happened at Dragon Spiral Mountain? Do you have any idea what kind of trouble you might bring to my sect?”","Yuan smiled and responded, “Relax, the Celestial Emperor isn’t aware of my identity yet. If he knew my identity, he would’ve come straight to me. Even if he is aware of my identity, he won’t be stupid enough to attack everyone I interact with... I hope.”","Kelan rubbed his eyes and took a deep breath before speaking, “Come with me. I’ll bring you to the others.”","Yuan and Liya followed Kelan into the sect.","As they traveled, Yuan said, “By the way, did you come up with the sect’s name?”","“Yes. It’s very unique, isn’t it?”","“It’s definitely unique in its own way.” Yuan smiled.","“How are the others?”","Kelan touched his nose in a prideful manner and said, “I’ve personally trained them for the last several years. You’ll be surprised by how much they’ve—Wait! You’ve already reached the peak of Immortal Ascension?! How is that even possible?!”","Kelan nearly fell out of the sky from shock when he finally noticed Yuan’s cultivation.","After recovering from his shock, Kelan spoke with an excited smile, “I cannot wait to have a serious spar with you later.”","Yuan chuckled and said, “Don’t be too upset if you lose.”","Join Privilege for 50 Adv Chapters! Only Available in the App!"]},{"number":1995,"title":"Chapter 1995: Sparring With Kelan","paragraphs":["Chapter 1995: Sparring With Kelan","“By the way, who’s that pretty lady? Wait! Let me guess—she’s another lover—”","“No, she’s a friend. I brought her here from my world,” Yuan hastily interrupted when he sensed Liya’s cold glare from behind.","“What? She’s from the forgotten world?” Kelan looked at Liya with interest. “Why’d you bring her to the Nine Heavens?”","“It’s a bit complicated, and it wasn’t my decision.”","“Is that so?”","Some time later, they arrived at the heart of the sect, a domain reserved only for Core Disciples and Sect Elders.","Kelan continued a little further until they reached a restricted area accessible only to the Sect Leader, meaning only he could enter. However, when they arrived, Yuan could see several figures already waiting for their arrival.","“I notified them on our way here,” Kelan said as he descended to the ground.","“Yuan! Manager!”","Chu Liuxiang and the others greeted them with bright expressions.","“Hey, everyone—”","Yuan tried to greet back, but he was interrupted when Chu Liuxiang pounced at him, giving him a tight embrace.","“I’ve missed you!”","“I missed you, too.”","Chu Liuxiang didn’t hog Yuan all to herself and released him a few seconds later so Meixiu could do the same.","“Yuan.” Meixiu wasted no time and entered his embrace.","“Sorry, I couldn’t see any of you when I returned to Earth,” Yuan said to the others a few moments later. “I had to rush back as soon as possible.”","“We figured that was the case,” Wang Ming said.","“How long has it been since then? Five years?”","“Around that, I guess. I haven’t kept track.” Yuan admitted.","“I doubt any of us kept track, either. We’re always so busy.”","Yuan looked at their cultivation and smiled, “I see you’ve all reached the Divine Realm. Congratulations.”","In just a few years, everyone increased their cultivation to Divine King, with Li Jinxi even reaching Divine Ancestor.","“What cultivation have you reached? I cannot sense it.” Shi Lang asked.","“Ninth level Immortal Ascension,” he calmly replied.","“So you’re already half a step into becoming an Immortal?!”","“At this rate, you’ll be a True Immortal by the next time we see you,” Wang Bingbing remarked.","“Let’s chat inside,” Kelan said as he opened the doors to his pavilion.","Once everyone was seated inside, Yuan recalled his experience over the last several years, from meeting the Holy Dragon Clan to visiting the Azure Dragon Clan.","“To think you’d met with not one, two, but three of the Ten Royal Dragon Clans in such a short time. You know most people go their entire lives without even meeting one of them, right?” Kelan remarked.","“I guess my fate is quite strong when it comes to dragons,” he shrugged.","“What are your plans now?” Chu Liuixang asked.","Yuan didn’t immediately respond.","After some pondering, he spoke, “There are so many things to do that I don’t know where to begin. Since it’s been a while, I’m thinking about staying here to spend some time with the rest of you while I figure out my next plan.”","“That sounds like a great plan!” Chu Liuxiang immediately said.","“You don’t mind, right?” Yuan looked at Kelan.","“I don’t mind... as long as you don’t cause any trouble.”","Yuan smiled and said, “The others won’t even know I’m here.”","Wang Xiuying suddenly asked, “Hey, where’s Xi Meili? I thought she was with you.”","“Oh, we had to split temporarily. She’ll come here soon.”","Some time later, after finishing their conversation, Yuan and the others followed Kelan to a nearby building so they could finally spar.","At a glance, the building looked unremarkable, barely larger than a standard warehouse. Yet, the moment they stepped inside, the world around them shifted, and they found themselves in a boundless white space that seemed to stretch into eternity.","“We can fight to our heart’s content on here without needing to worry about damages,” Kelan said.","“Do you need some rest before we start?”","“No, I can spar right now.”","“Then to keep things fair, I’ll suppress my cultivation to match yours,” Kelan continued.","Yuan offered no response, simply nodding in silence.","Kelan blinked in mild surprise before chuckling. “Huh. I was certain you’d say something like, ‘No need to hold back,’ or challenge me to go all out.”","Yuan smiled faintly.","“It’s easier to just show you.”","A gleam of excitement flashed across Kelan’s face. Without hesitation, he shrugged off his outer robes, revealing the training garb beneath—minimal and fitted, covering only his lower body.","“Whenever you’re ready,” he said.","“Then...”","Yuan gave a quick stretch of his arms before launching himself toward Kelan, not a trace of aura leaking from his body, relying solely on his physical strength.","“A clash of physiques first, huh? Just what I was hoping for!” Kelan laughed heartily as he charged to meet him.","“Wha—”","The moment their bodies collided, Kelan’s expression twisted in disbelief. It felt as though he had slammed into an immovable mountain, and before he could even process what had happened, his body was hurled through the air, like a man struck head-on by a truck.","Wang Ming and the others could hardly believe what they had just witnessed. After years of training alongside Kelan, they were well aware of how formidable his physique was. In fact, not once had they seen him overpowered in terms of raw strength—until now.","After the unexpected blow, Kelan quickly picked himself up. Yet rather than frustration, his face lit up with unrestrained excitement.","“I couldn’t really tell before because your body was mostly made of your soul,” he said, eyes gleaming. “But that physique... could it be the legendary Golden Immortal Physique?”","Yuan gave a simple nod.","“That’s right.”","“HAHAHA!” Kelan burst into laughter, his voice echoing through the boundless space.","“Unbelievable! I’m actually clashing with the legendary Golden Immortal Physique! This is a dream come true!”","Yuan then said calmly, “If you truly want to experience the Golden Immortal Physique... you’ll have to try a lot harder.”","Because his avatar had been composed mostly of his soul, it had barely allowed the Golden Immortal Physique to reveal even a fraction of its true power. But now that Yuan had reclaimed his physical body, the full might of the legendary physique could finally shine without restraint.","Join Privilege for 50 Adv Chapters! Only Available in the App!"]},{"number":1996,"title":"Chapter 1996: Sparring With Kelan(2)","paragraphs":["\"This is my first time fighting in my true body, so give me everything you’ve got,\" Yuan said as he beckoned Kelan.","\"Then... don’t mind if I do!\"","Kelan unleashed his cultivation, but he still kept it suppressed to the peak of Immortal Ascension.","\"Here I come!\"","With a roar of excitement, Kelan charged forward, his fists surging with immense energy.","However, Yuan didn’t so much as lift a finger to defend. He stood firm, like an immovable mountain, taking every one of Kelan’s strikes head-on with nothing but his bare body.","\"This is rather relaxing. You might have a future as a masseur,\" Yuan said calmly, a faint smile on his lips. He stood unbothered, as though Kelan’s blows were nothing despite each strike sending ripples through the air and making the very space around them tremble.","\"I refuse to believe I can’t break through your defenses!\" Kelan roared, his aura flaring violently as it shifted. Without hesitation, he began unleashing powerful martial techniques.","\"He’s already using his Ninety-Nine Divine Fists technique!\" Shi Lang exclaimed, a shiver running down his spine as memories flooded back—vivid flashes of being beaten to a pulp by that very technique.","The technique comprised a total of ninety-nine strikes, each one building in power and ferocity, much like Yuan’s own Nine Supreme Swords.","\"Fifty-Fifth Divine Fist!\" Kelan bellowed as his fist crashed forward, the air trembling from the force.","Yet, even after unleashing more than half of the technique, he felt no closer to breaching Yuan’s defenses. It was like striking a mountain of metal with a brittle wooden branch.","\"Ninty-Ninth Divine Fist!\"","Even after the final strike landed, Yuan wasn’t pushed back even slightly.","With a faintly provocative smile, Yuan turned slightly and pointed to his back.","\"Why don’t you give the back some attention too?\" he said, as if inviting a massage rather than an attack.","Kelan’s eyebrow twitched, a flicker of irritation crossing his face as his pride took a hit.","With a slightly cold edge to his voice, he muttered, \"You asked for this...\"","Suddenly, his suppressed cultivation surged, breaking through to the Bronze Immortal level.","Now wreathed in swirling Immortal Qi, Kelan launched a renewed assault on Yuan.","\"Twenty-Second Divine Fist!\"","\"...\"","\"Seventy-Fifth Divine Fist!\"","\"...\"","After going through another 99 strikes, Kelan distanced himself from Yuan before staring at him with wide eyes that flickered with disbelief.","’It’s like he doesn’t even feel my attacks! How is that possible?!’","Knowing full well that Yuan possessed powerful regenerative abilities, Kelan didn’t hold back and poured every ounce of Immortal Qi he could muster as a Bronze Immortal into his attacks.","Yet, despite his full strength, the outcome was the same as before—utterly ineffective. Moreover, Yuan was still relying solely on his bare body to endure the onslaught. This meant no techniques and no defenses—just sheer physique.","At this point, it was no exaggeration to say that he could withstand a full-powered assault from a Bronze Immortal in his sleep... and quite possibly sleep through it.","\"That wasn’t bad, but it would’ve been better if you’d used a little more strength. How about increasing your cultivation to True Immortal?\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"True Immortal...? You know this is just a spar, right?\" Kelan said.","\"And you know you won’t even be able to give me a ’warm up’ with this level of sparring, right?\" Yuan responded. \"What happened to wanting to experience the Golden Immortal Physique? You’re barely seeing the tip of its prowess right now.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Kelan took a deep breath and spoke in a serious tone, \"Don’t blame me for whatever happens next.\"","Kelan increased his cultivation to Silver Immortal, then Golden Immortal, finally stopping at True Immortal.","Yuan smiled and said, \"That’s more like it.\"","\"Here I come.\"","After giving Yuan a brief moment to ready himself, Kelan sprang into motion, soaring toward him with fists infused with Immortal Qi and just a trace of Celestial Qi.","Despite this, Yuan remained still.","Boom!","A split second later, Yuan’s body was sent hurtling into the distance from the force of the blow.","However, he swiftly regained control mid-air and landed gracefully on his feet, completely unharmed. The strike had possessed just enough power to send him flying, but it was still far from enough to break his defenses.","\"Seriously...?\" Kelan stared at Yuan, utterly dumbfounded.","He had always assumed the legends surrounding the Golden Immortal Physique were exaggerated. But after facing it firsthand, Kelan could say without the slightest doubt—if anything, the legends underplayed its true prowess.","\"So? What do you think?\" Yuan asked as he calmly walked toward Kelan. \"Satisfied yet?\"","Kelan offered a nervous smile, sweat beading at his brow.","\"I thought it’d be fun... but honestly, it was more terrifying than I expected.\"","Yuan let out a light chuckle.","\"Then what if I told you that my body still isn’t fully merged with my soul?\"","\"What?!\" Kelan blurted out, his eyes widening in disbelief.","Yuan nodded calmly. \"It’s been nearly a year since I reclaimed my true body. I thought that would be enough to fully adapt, but so far, I’ve only managed about fifty percent.\"","\"You’re telling me that you’ve only shown me about fifty percent of your true prowess?!\" Kelan exclaimed.","\"Hm? No, I haven’t even begun to show you anything yet. I’m strictly talking about my physique. If we’re talking about my prowess...\"","Yuan abruptly stopped speaking, and in the next moment, unleashed his cultivation and Immortal Qi in a sudden surge, its sheer force nearly knocking Kelan off his feet.","\"Heavens! What is that amount of Immortal Qi?! I have met many True Immortals, but none of them can come close to having that much Immortal Qi!\" Kelan exclaimed.","\"While my cultivation has fully merged and my physique is about halfway there, my bloodline and the rest of my talents have only just begun to merge. Honestly, I have no clue how powerful I will become once my true body and soul fully merge.\" Yuan calmly shrugged, leaving Kelan and the others speechless."]},{"number":1997,"title":"Chapter 1997: Sparring With Kelan(3)","paragraphs":["\"Fuck, I have never met or heard of anyone that’s even close to being as monstrous as you,\" Kelan muttered after learning that Yuan was barely showing all of his potential but was still able to make a True Immortal feel helpless while only being a mortal.","\"You know, you should join... No, I’ll tell you about it later.\"","Kelan proceeded to take a deep breath before increasing his cultivation even further, stepping into the first level of God Ascension.","\"Well? Do you think you’ll be able to handle the God Ascension realm?\" he asked Yuan with a provocative smile.","\"We won’t know until we try,\" said Yuan.","\"Then here I come!\"","Kelan made the first move, and the two of them clashed shortly later. However, despite being in the God Ascension realm, Kelan didn’t use Celestial Qi to directly attack Yuan, only using it to strengthen his own physique.","Yet, even with the power of Celestial Qi, Kelan only found himself on par with Yuan, who was still only using his physique.","\"Why don’t we fight seriously now? You can use your full cultivation, and I’ll do the same,\" Yuan suggested after thousands of exchanges.","\"Don’t blame me if anything goes wrong!\" Kelan responded as he unleashed his full cultivation at the fifth level of God Ascension realm.","Yuan also no longer held back, and his body surged with Immortal Qi.","<God of War’s Astral Arts!>","Yuan activated God of War’s Astral Arts, perfectly controlling the avatar’s size to be just slightly bigger than his own frame.","Since Kelan fought with his fists, Yuan decided not to use a weapon and continued fighting with his bare hands.","When they clashed again, the sheer force of their blows fractured the very space around them, sending cracks rippling through the air, though the rifts swiftly mended themselves.","\"HAHAHAHA!\" Kelan roared with exhilaration as he traded blows with Yuan, his eyes flickering with delight.","\"This is it! This is the kind of manly fight I’ve been craving!\"","Kelan was primarily a body refiner, having honed his physique to the extreme. Few cultivators could rival him in sheer physical prowess, making battles like the one he now faced with Yuan exceedingly rare. And even when such encounters did occur, they never left him satisfied, as his opponents would fall too quickly to offer any true challenge.","\"I never imagined I’d experience a battle like this with a mortal! You’re truly something else, Yuan! At this rate, I might really lose myself and try to kill you!\"","Yuan smiled at his words and said, \"Kill me? I’d like to see you try!\"","Yuan and Kelan’s battle raged on for nearly an entire month without pause. In the final days, Kelan unleashed everything he had, fighting with the intent to kill.","Yet no matter how hard he pushed, the most he could achieve was tearing off a few limbs—wounds that Yuan quickly recovered from.","In the end, Kelan lay sprawled on the ground, his chest rising and falling with exhaustion as he stared blankly at the endless white, his expression dazed, caught between disbelief and awe.","Yuan sat on the ground, his entire body soaked in sweat. However, his breathing was calm, and his body was still surging with strength.","While Kelan looked as if he had sprinted through a marathon, Yuan, by contrast, appeared as though he had merely taken a leisurely jog around the park.","\"Does the Golden Immortal Physique give you unlimited stamina, as well?\" Kelan suddenly asked.","\"No, that’s something else.\"","\"Something else...? Just how many secrets are contained within that small body of yours?\"","\"Who knows?\" Yuan replied with a casual shrug.","It might have come off as evasive, but in truth, he genuinely didn’t have the answer.","\"Are you two finally done?\" Wang Ming called out as he and the others approached.","None of them had left during the month-long battle—they had remained there from start to finish, eyes fixed on every clash and exchange.","And just from observing, each of them had gained insight, advancing their understanding and even strengthening their own cultivation in the process.","\"Sorry, I didn’t intend on taking up so much of your time,\" Kelan said to Yuan.","He shook his head and said, \"No, it’s fine. I needed time to adjust to my new condition, too.\"","\"You’ll be staying at the sect, right? I’ll prepare a place for you.\"","\"No need. I can just live with Meixiu or Lulu.\" He turned to them and continued, \"Are you okay with that?\"","\"Of course! In fact, I was going to make that suggestion!\" Chu Liuxiang said.","Meixiu nodded in agreement.","\"Okay...\"","Just as Kelan stood up and prepared to leave, Yuan suddenly stopped him.","\"Wait a minute.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Don’t reject this.\"","Yuan tapped his forehead, drawing forth a glowing orb of light. With a casual flick of his finger—almost as if launching a flicked booger—he sent the orb sailing through the air, striking Kelan squarely between the brows.","Kelan trusted Yuan and didn’t resist the surge of information flooding into his mind.","\"T-THIS IS?!?!?!\" he cried out, his voice trembling with shock, as if he’d just seen a ghost. His expression twisted with disbelief, eyes wide and filled with utter astonishment.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Don’t worry, it’s real. Consider it a gift for taking care of my friends for the last few years.\"","After taking a moment to process the information Yuan had shared with him, Kelan suddenly dropped to his knees and kowtowed without hesitation.","\"Please,\" he said with deep reverence, \"allow me to call you Father.\"","\"What the heck?\" Shi Lang and the others stared with wide eyes, wondering what Yuan had given Kelan for him to act like this.","\"Rejected.\" Yuan calmly refused.","\"Then, how about Young Master?!\"","\"No. I don’t want to hear that from you. Just continue treating me normally.\"","\"As you command!\" Kelan shouted before jumping to his feet.","He turned to look at Meixiu and the others and said, \"I’ll be entering seclusion for a bit. You can train yourselves in the meantime, or take a break. You all deserve it.\"","Then, like an overjoyed child with a new toy, he skipped away, grinning from ear to ear."]},{"number":1998,"title":"Chapter 1998: A Week With Meixiu","paragraphs":["Once Kelan left the sparring grounds, Yuan said, \"We will have plenty of time to catch up, so I’m going to take some time to rest for now.\"","\"Who are you going to stay with?\" Chu Liuxiang asked. \"Me or Meixiu?\"","He quickly replied, \"I was going to take turns, so I would stay with one of you for a week, then switch, and repeat.\"","\"That sounds good.\" Chu Liuxiang nodded.","She turned to look at Meixiu and continued, \"To make things fair, let’s rock-paper-scissors with our eyes closed. No divine sense, either.\"","Meixiu nodded and closed her eyes.","\"Rock... paper... scissors!\"","They opened their eyes to check the results.","\"Ugh. Looks like you win this one...\" Chu Liuxiang sighed.","Feng Yuxiang, Lan Yingying, and Yingzi decided to leave Yuan’s Dantian for some fresh air and to allow Yuan some privacy. As for Yu Ning, she simply sealed her senses and went to slumber like usual.","\"I’m going to take a look around the sect with the other two,\" said Feng Yuxiang.","\"Try not to cause any trouble...\" Yuan said.","Feng Yuxiang chuckled.","\"We’re not you, Young Master.\"","Some time later, Yuan followed Meixiu back to her living quarters.","\"I’ll go take a shower first,\" Yuan said as he approached the bathroom.","\"Wait...\" Meixiu suddenly stopped him.","\"Since it’s been a while... let’s go together.\"","In response, Yuan silently nodded with a smile on his face, and the two of them entered the bathroom together.","Inside, Meixiu helped Yuan wash his body like in the old times, but instead of just using her hands, she used her entire body.","Over the past few years, she had devoted herself not only to cultivation but also to tempering her physique, refining it until it neared perfection. Her body, though strong enough to deflect ordinary weapons with ease, retained a softness that was almost unreal. Her skin was also as smooth as silk, gliding effortlessly across Yuan’s body with a delicate, irresistible grace.","A few minutes later, Meixiu washed the soap off their body.","\"Yuan...\"","Unable to restrain herself any longer, Meixiu closed the distance between them and pressed her lips to his in a passionate, heartfelt kiss.","Though she had planned to wait until they returned to the bedroom, the longing that had simmered in her heart for years could no longer be contained, overflowing with unrestrained desire.","Yuan also didn’t realize how much he missed her presence and touch until they were alone.","Soon, their bodies intertwined in an intense cultivation session, and Meixiu’s blissful voice filled the bathroom.","Several hours later, they emerged from the bathroom, still unclothed, and made their way to the bedroom, where they continued to make up for the time they had long been apart, their bond deepening with every passing moment.","After nearly a week of uninterrupted intimacy, the two of them lay side by side in silence, their eyes fixed on the ceiling.","\"How’s your mother, Meifeng, doing nowadays?\" Yuan eventually asked.","\"She’s spending more time in the Nine Heavens since there’s not much for her to do on Earth nowadays. She even started a business as a merchant.\"","\"A merchant?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at this unexpected news.","\"Yes,\" Meixiu said. \"She started in the Lower Heavens, gradually building her influence as she ascended through each realm. Now, she’s in the Fourth Heaven, and from what I’ve heard, she’s become quite renowned.\"","\"I see... hopefully she’s not mad at me for not being around lately.\"","\"Of course not. She misses you a lot and would always ask me about you whenever we encounter each other. Oh, we visit the Myriad of Techniques once every two months to catch up with each other. Yu Rou and the others are also there.\"","\"Yu Rou... how is she?\" Yuan asked, an air of melancholy surrounding him.","\"She probably misses you the most out of all of us... and she...\"","Meixiu suddenly paused, almost as if contemplating whether to continue.","\"Nothing’s happened to her, right?\" Yuan sat up on the bed with a worried frown on his face.","Meixiu let out a quiet sigh before continuing, \"Honestly, I haven’t seen a genuine smile from her in a long time. Whenever she does smile... it always feels forced.\"","\"At first, we thought someone might be causing her trouble. But according to her close friends, Xia Jingyi and Bai Lianhua, there’s no such person. The real reason she’s been acting that way... is because she misses you.\"","Upon hearing those words, Yuan suddenly realized just how much he had been neglecting Yu Rou—something that had quietly begun the moment he first stepped into Cultivation Online and had only deepened with time.","Yuan let out a heavy sigh as he covered his face with his arm.","\"To have caused Yu Rou so much pain... I’ve failed her as a brother.\"","\"But this is mostly because of the Celestial Emperor’s—\"","\"No,\" Yuan interrupted firmly. \"I can’t blame the Celestial Emperor. While he may be the reason I haven’t been able to return to Earth these past few years... I started neglecting Yu Rou long before that. This is on me—entirely.\"","\"...\"","Meixiu became silent, and an awkward silence filled the room.","\"When’s the next meeting?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Our last meeting was a month and two weeks ago, so we’ll be meeting again in two weeks.\"","\"Alright. In the meantime, I need to think of a way to make it up to her.\"","Early on the next day, Yuan washed up before leaving Meixiu’s living quarters to head to Chu Liuxiang’s place, which was only a few steps away.","When he arrived at her doorstep, Yuan gave a gentle knock.","Almost instantly, the door swung open.","\"Welcome, darling!\" Chu Liuxiang greeted him with a playful smile, dressed in a strikingly provocative outfit that left little to the imagination.","Before Yuan could even utter a word, Chu Liuxiang seized his arm and pulled him inside, pressing her lips to his in a deep, eager kiss the moment the door closed behind them."]},{"number":1999,"title":"Chapter 1999: A Week With Chu Liuxiang","paragraphs":["Chapter 1999: A Week With Chu Liuxiang","“Relax, I won’t be going anywhere for the next week,” Yuan said with a smile after their kiss.","Chu Liuxiang then dragged him to the bedroom.","“I’ve been preparing for this moment,” she said.","“Prepare?” Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","Chu Liuxiang nodded and retrieved several manuals from her spatial ring and proudly displayed them to him.","“Those are...” Yuan’s eyes widened with surprise when he read the titles on these techniques manuals.","Chu Liuxiang chuckled when she saw Yuan’s expression.","“That’s right! Dual cultivation techniques!” she proudly declared.","During her spare time, she’d study these dual cultivation techniques to prepare for Yuan’s return.","“I haven’t had the opportunity to test it out yet, so it might not be as good. However, I’ll use this time to perfect them!”","Without waiting any time, Chu Liuxiang began testing out her newly acquired techniques on Yuan, letting him experience a new world that even his incarnations had never experienced.","A week later, Yuan and Chu Liuxiang lay beside each other on the bed, their bodies soaked in sweat and other wet substances.","“So... what do you think?” she asked.","Yuan smiled and said, “It’s hard to explain, but if I had to describe it with one word, it’d be otherworldly.”","Chu Liuxiang chuckled and said, “It was a little awkward and embarrassing at first, but I’m glad I didn’t stop and continued. I was worried that I might’ve wasted my time learning these techniques, too.”","Yuan then said, “Dual cultivation techniques, huh? I should learn a few. Did you get them from the Myriad of Techniques?”","“Yes, there’s a whole section just for them!”","Their conversation eventually drifted to family.","“Have you visited your family since what happened?” Yuan asked.","“Yes, I visit them once a year now to have dinner.” Chu Liuxiang said.","After a brief pause, she continued, “Have you heard about Yu Rou from Meixiu yet?”","“She told me. I am still trying to think of a way to make amends for being a bad brother,” he sighed.","“You’re not a bad brother...”","“...”","Some time later, Chu Liuxiang asked, “What are you going to do now?”","“I’ll spend the next week with the others, then meet up with Yu Rou at the Myriad of Techniques.”","“Alright.”","The following day, Yuan went to seek out the others, starting with Wang Ming.","“Hey, want to have a spar? I want your opinion on my current standing,” Wang Ming said after catching up on some things.","Yuan agreed, and the two of them sparred for the next three hours.","Naturally, Wang Ming lost.","“So, how much have I improved?”","“Compared to when we first fought? It’s incomparable,” said Yuan. “You’ve worked hard.”","“Thanks...” Wang Ming said with a somewhat bashful reaction.","“Take this.”","Yuan repeated what he did to Kelan, transferring some information directly inside Wang Ming’s mind.","“These are...” Wang Ming’s eyes widened after realizing what Yuan had just given him.","“Nine Supreme Swords and the Limitless Sword Domain. They’re ancient sword techniques from the Primordial Era.” Yuan explained after giving him the sword techniques he’d acquired at Han Zexian’s Tomb.","“I-I don’t know what to say...” Wang Ming muttered in a dazed voice.","“You don’t need to say anything.”","“Thank you!” Wang Ming bowed, feeling overwhelming with joy.","Yuan left Wang Ming to meet with Shi Lang next.","Just like Wang Ming, Shi Lang asked Yuan for a spar after catching up, and Yuan obliged.","After their spar, Yuan shared some of the Evil God’s spear techniques with Shi Lang.","Though they were not as powerful as the sword techniques he’d given Wang Ming, they were powerful in their own right.","After Shi Lang, Yuan continued to visit the members of the Demon Sealing Faction, and he would give them all martial techniques that suited their fighting style.","“How’s Doctor Wang these days?” Yuan asked Wang Xiuying.","“He’s getting old, but because he started cultivating, his health and energy have never been better,” she chuckled.","“You know, he asks me about you often.”","Yuan smiled and said, “It’s a pity I haven’t been able to see him for a long time now. The next time I visit Earth, I’ll definitely give him a visit.”","Some time later, Yuan retrieved a glass vial that contained a pill inside and offered it to Wang Xiuying.","“I don’t really have anything alchemy-related besides this Tier 8 pill I acquired from the Azure Dragon Clan. Take it.”","“Wow... Are you sure?” Wang Xiuying stared at the blue and green pill with excitement. This was her first time seeing a Tier 8 pill, much less having one.","“I gave the others martial techniques, but I won’t be able to give you any techniques.”","Wang Xiuying shook her head and said, “I don’t need any techniques. As an Alchemist, I only need to refine my flames and improve my knowledge, and I have acquired enough information from the Myriad of Techniques to last me many years.”","By the time Yuan visited almost everyone in the Demon Sealing Faction, a week had passed, and it was time to visit Yu Rou and the others at the Myriad of Techniques.","However, most members of the Demon Sealing Faction chose to stay behind, claiming they wished to study the techniques Yuan had shared with them. Of course, that was merely a convenient excuse—in truth, they didn’t want to intrude on his time with Yu Rou, and quietly decided to give them space.","In the end, only Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang followed Yuan to the Myriad of Techniques.","“There’s actually a Myriad of Techniques located within the sect,” Chu Liuxiang revealed as they left together.","Chu Liuxiang and Meixiu led Yuan to the Outer Court, where disciples moved about, tending to their own affairs. Nearly all of them, regardless of gender, possessed impressively muscular builds.","“Who’s that with the Untouchable Faries?”","The disciples quickly took notice of Yuan’s group, though it was Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang who drew the most attention. Their reputation within the sect had soared to incredible heights thanks to their unique status and the fact that they were personally trained by none other than Kelan, the Sect Leader himself.","Join Privilege for 50 Adv Chapters! Only Available in the App!"]},{"number":2000,"title":"Chapter 2000: Grown Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 2000: Grown Up","“Look at Fairy Chu! She has her arms linked around that man!”","The disciples quickly took notice of the intimate atmosphere around the two, which greatly shocked them.","Chu Liuxiang and the other ladies within the Demon Sealing Faction had earned a reputation for themselves throughout the year for being unobtainable because even Core Disciples were shot down without any hesitation.","“Is that why she’s rejected everyone who approached her? Cause she’s already taken?”","“That’s the only logical explanation.”","“It’s a pity, but I can see why she chose that man. He has this hard-to-describe natural charm about him.”","Yuan found himself constantly being stared at by the disciples until they reached the Myriad of Techniques.","“Wow, so this is what it looks like in the Seventh Heaven,” Yuan muttered in surprise as they stepped inside.","Unlike the compact, space-saving libraries of the lower heavens, the Myriad of Techniques here resembled a grand, traditional archive with vast halls stretching in every direction, towering shelves, and an abundance of open space.","The place was so vast that Yuan couldn’t even see the other walls—only the one behind them near the entrance. It was as if the space extended endlessly in all directions.","“Impressive, right? We were also quite shocked when we first came here,” Chu Liuxiang smiled.","Yuan nodded and glanced around. The first thing he noticed was that most of the people present weren’t disciples of the Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect. Some wore the robes of other sects, while others had no uniform at all, suggesting they were independent cultivators or unaffiliated visitors.","This suggested that regardless of which Myriad of Techniques one entered in the Seventh Heaven, they all led to the same vast, interconnected space.","Despite being filled with thousands of cultivators, the place was incredibly silent, with the only noise being the sound of pages being flipped. Since most of the cultivators there flew around when they traveled, the place lacked even the sound of footsteps.","Some time later, they arrived before a guarded teleportation device.","“Welcome back, Lady Meixiu and Lady Chu.” The guard greeted them with respect before turning to look at Yuan and asking, “Will he be accompanying you today?”","Meixiu nodded and said, “He doesn’t have a medallion, but he’s very close friends with Senior Bai.”","“Oh, I have Senior Bai’s medallion if that’s what you mean.” Yuan showed the guard the medallion.","The guard subconsciously straightened his back before bowing to Yuan, “Welcome, Esteemed Guest!”","The guard then activated the teleportation device.","Once Yuan and the others entered the device, they were teleported directly to a familiar place—Senior Bai’s world.","“When does Yu Rou and the others usually show up?” Yuan asked.","“They should show up in an hour. We came here early because we wanted to surprise Yu Rou,” said Meixiu.","“With that said, you should hide until they arrive.” Chu Liuxiang added.","Yuan nodded and completely erased his presence, dumbfounding them.","“Wow... even though I am staring right at you, I cannot sense your presence. Is this what it feels like to hallucinate?” Chu Liuxiang remarked.","Yuan smiled and said, “Want to learn it? I have given the others martial techniques, but I haven’t given the two of you anything yet. It’s a technique that hides your presence.”","Chu Liuxiang and Meixiu nodded.","Thus, Yuan transferred the Shadow Veil to them.","“This is a Celestial-rank technique?!” They exclaimed after learning of its rarity.","“Are you sure we can actually learn this?” Meixiu asked, swallowing nervously. This would be their very first Celestial-rank technique.","Yuan smiled and responded, “That’s a silly thing to ask. Of course, you can learn it. No matter how precious this technique is, it’d be useless if it could not be learned. Also, this will help you guys in case you encounter some trouble.”","“Once we return to the sect, I plan to share even more techniques with all of you,” Yuan said, his tone solemn. “What happened at Dragon Spiral Mountain reminded me—just being connected to me can put you in danger. I want to make sure you’re prepared.”","Yuan went into hiding shortly after to wait for Yu Rou and the others’ arrival.","Three hours later, several new presences appeared in Senior Bai’s world.","“Sorry, we’re late. We ran into some trouble on our way here.”","A beautiful woman with white hair spoke as she entered the place. It was Bai Lianhua, and following behind her were two women who were just as beautiful.","“Trouble? Are you guys okay?”","“Yes... Just the usual womanizers trying to hit on us,” Bai Lianhua said with a sigh, her tone a mix of irritation and resignation.","“Hm? Is it just the two of you today? What happened to the others?” Xia Jingyi asked when she could only see Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang.","Chu Liuxiang smiled and said, “Yes, it’s just us today. The others are busy with some new techniques.”","“How have you been, Yu Rou?” Meixiu asked softly, her gaze resting on the tall, graceful woman quietly standing beside Xia Jingyi.","“The same as usual, but we’re preparing to head to the Fourth Heaven,” said Yu Rou, who had matured into a graceful, poised woman over the past few years, her presence now marked by a calm, naturally aloof aura that set her apart.","However, there was a faint weariness in her face—subtle, but telling—like someone who hadn’t been sleeping well for some time.","Hanging by her hips was a beautiful fan. However, if one looked closely, it was only a Spirit-grade treasure.","“Um... have you found out anything about my brother?” Yu Rou proceeded to ask, her voice laced with worry.","It was always the first question she asked whenever they met, ever since she’d learned that Yuan had returned to Earth and reclaimed his body.","“...”","Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang remained silent.","Seeing this, Yu Rou lowered her head in a dejected manner and sighed, “The same as usual, huh?”","However, as she lowered her head, she suddenly caught sight of a pair of legs standing just behind her, startling her so much that she jumped in surprise.","“Who the hell—”","Yu Rou spun around sharply, but the rest of her words froze in her throat the moment her eyes met the familiar, handsome face standing behind her.","Though Yuan had also matured and grown even more handsome over the years, Yu Rou would have recognized his face anywhere.","“Brother...?” she whispered, her voice quivering as her eyes grew moist.","Yuan greeted with an apologetic smile, “It’s been a while, Yu Rou.”","Happy 2,000th chapter!","Join Privilege for 50 Adv Chapters! Only Available in the App!"]}]);
